
# game/end_game2.rpy:2
translate spanish end_game2_2467797a:

    # "All this talk of Drusus, of his and [mc]'s apparently fixed destinies."
    "Toda aquella conversación sobre Drusus, sobre los destinos aparentemente inmutables de él y de [mc]."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3
translate spanish end_game2_a8e38200:

    # "That decision that wolves fawned over for generations, no matter what opinion they held about Drusus himself."
    "Aquella decisión que los lobos habían venerado durante generaciones, independientemente de lo que pensaran del propio Drusus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:4
translate spanish end_game2_335bc4c2:

    # "The choice offered by the parents to either save his empire, or save his lover."
    "La elección que los Padres le ofrecieron: salvar su imperio o salvar a su amante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:5
translate spanish end_game2_1f4af96c:

    # "Icy, cold fear and dread blooms in the pit of Amicus's stomach and slowly spreads throughout the rest of his body, seeming to leak like a frigid liquid down his groin and into his legs."
    "Un miedo y un pavor helados nacen en lo más hondo del estómago de Amicus y se extienden lentamente por el resto de su cuerpo, como si un líquido glacial se filtrara por su entrepierna hasta sus piernas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:6
translate spanish end_game2_e4fe1db4:

    # "The wolf feels his limbs tremble as he pulls the human closer to his chest, lips drawing back as instinct kicks in to protect his mate."
    "El lobo siente temblar sus extremidades mientras acerca al humano a su pecho; retrae los labios cuando el instinto lo impulsa a proteger a su pareja."

# game/end_game2.rpy:7
translate spanish end_game2_1e7e6ce8:

    # "For a long while, a length of time that's hard to discern, the wolf simply stares into the abyss."
    "Durante mucho rato, un lapso difícil de precisar, el lobo se limita a mirar el abismo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:8
translate spanish end_game2_1539cf66:

    # "He looks up into the swirling stars, clouds, and planets, trying to see..."
    "Alza la vista hacia las estrellas, las nubes y los planetas que giran, intentando ver..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:9
translate spanish end_game2_4087f70d:

    # "...trying to see these things that are controlling and manipulating him and his lover."
    "...intentando ver a aquellos seres que lo controlan y manipulan a él y a su amante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:10
translate spanish end_game2_a35df207:

    # "Trembling, Amicus shakes his head, taking another step back, away, even though the presence of the parents is all-encompassing."
    "Temblando, Amicus niega con la cabeza y retrocede otro paso, alejándose, aunque la presencia de los Padres lo abarca todo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:11
translate spanish end_game2_f767c1d6:

    # a "\"N—no...\""
    a "\"N—no...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:12
translate spanish end_game2_8aa97d67:

    # "Amicus's jaw clenches, hating himself for sounding so weak and afraid."
    "Amicus aprieta la mandíbula, odiándose por sonar tan débil y asustado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:13
translate spanish end_game2_eca45a64:

    # "Remembering who he is, the wolf squares his shoulders, glaring up into space."
    "Recordando quién es, el lobo endereza los hombros y mira con furia hacia el espacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:14
translate spanish end_game2_905e84c5:

    # a "\"No! I won't make such a decision!\""
    a "\"¡No! ¡No tomaré semejante decisión!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:15
translate spanish end_game2_06583084:

    # "For once, the unseen place in which the parents reside is silent, but clearly observant; Amicus can feel the prickle of their all-seeing eyes on the nape of his neck."
    "Por una vez, el lugar invisible donde residen los Padres está en silencio, aunque claramente atento; Amicus siente en la nuca el cosquilleo de sus ojos que todo lo ven."

# game/end_game2.rpy:16
translate spanish end_game2_d5f69205:

    # a "\"Y—you hear me!? I won't do it! I'll...I'll stay here forever if I have to! You can't involve us in this foolishness!\""
    a "\"¿¡M-me oís!? ¡No lo haré! ¡Me...me quedaré aquí para siempre si hace falta! ¡No podéis meternos en esta estupidez!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:17
translate spanish end_game2_25051fcd:

    # "[mc] suddenly shifts in his grasp, his head turning awkwardly, leaning up in a strange way that seems unnatural, as if pulled up by strings."
    "[mc] se mueve de pronto entre sus brazos, girando la cabeza torpemente y alzándola de una forma extraña, antinatural, como si unos hilos tiraran de ella."

# game/end_game2.rpy:18
translate spanish end_game2_328ea982:

    # "Amicus flinches back, feeling a chill run up his spine as he tries to stop himself from dropping the human he knows so well."
    "Amicus se echa atrás, estremecido, y siente un escalofrío recorrerle la espalda mientras intenta evitar que se le caiga el humano que tan bien conoce."

# game/end_game2.rpy:19
translate spanish end_game2_a84279dd:

    # m "\"Foolishness?\""
    m "\"¿Estupidez?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:20
translate spanish end_game2_fc310673:

    # "[mc] stares at him with an expression that Amicus has never seen him make before."
    "[mc] lo mira con una expresión que Amicus nunca le había visto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:21
translate spanish end_game2_e375dbbf:

    # "It's cold and almost dismissive, an expression Amicus has never seen him make before."
    "Es fría y casi desdeñosa, una expresión que Amicus nunca le había visto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:22
translate spanish end_game2_ead3c94d:

    # m "\"How does this situation, in which the lives of a trillion sapients teeter on the brink of annihilation, call for such childish statements? Tell us, in what universe would attempts to avoid such a catastrophic outcome be considered 'foolishness'?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo justifica esta situación, en la que las vidas de un billón de Sapientes se tambalean al borde de la aniquilación, semejantes comentarios infantiles? Dinos: ¿en qué universo se considerarían 'estupidez' los intentos de evitar un desenlace tan catastrófico?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:23
translate spanish end_game2_043dc8da:

    # "The human suddenly tilts his head in an unnatural way, leaning in closer to the wolf and Amicus gasps, setting a large paw against [mc]'s face, trying to stop the strange, {i}inhuman{/i} movements."
    "El humano inclina de pronto la cabeza de una forma antinatural, acercándose al lobo; Amicus jadea y apoya una gran mano en la cara de [mc], intentando detener aquellos extraños movimientos {i}inhumanos{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:24
translate spanish end_game2_d7725d11:

    # a "\"S—stop that. Don't hurt him!\""
    a "\"D-dejad eso. ¡No le hagáis daño!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:25
translate spanish end_game2_72c20b66:

    # "The human holds the position for a moment, then seems to slowly relax back into the wolf's arms."
    "El humano mantiene la postura un momento y después parece relajarse lentamente entre los brazos del lobo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:26
translate spanish end_game2_a299c627:

    # "Amicus feels his heart pounding in his chest."
    "Amicus siente el corazón golpeándole el pecho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:27
translate spanish end_game2_07ada019:

    # "He'd provoked...well, not even anger from the parents, maybe just annoyance, yet the experience had been terrifying."
    "Había provocado...bueno, ni siquiera la ira de los Padres, quizá solo su fastidio; aun así, la experiencia había sido aterradora."

# game/end_game2.rpy:28
translate spanish end_game2_6ee7b42f:

    # "Seeing [mc] twist and contort in such a way was unnerving, sure, but the parents had meant to do it, and the wolf is beginning to realize why they're using [mc] as a puppet."
    "Ver a [mc] retorcerse de aquel modo era inquietante, sí, pero los Padres lo habían hecho deliberadamente, y el lobo empieza a comprender por qué utilizan a [mc] como marioneta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:29
translate spanish end_game2_eaf4e4bf:

    # "Anger and fear battle for control over the wolf, before the latter finally wins out, remembering what type of decision he might have to make."
    "La ira y el miedo luchan por dominar al lobo hasta que finalmente vence el segundo, al recordar qué clase de decisión podría tener que tomar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:30
translate spanish end_game2_891462ed:

    # a "\"Please, there must be another way, I can't...I can't choose between these two things!\""
    a "\"Por favor, tiene que haber otra forma; no puedo...¡no puedo elegir entre esas dos cosas!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:31
translate spanish end_game2_27c9a9f1:

    # "There's a pause in the air, and Amicus feels his knees about to give out, preparing to throw himself at the imaginary feet of these monolithic beings."
    "Se hace una pausa, y Amicus siente que las rodillas están a punto de fallarle, dispuesto a arrojarse a los pies imaginarios de aquellos seres inmensos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:32
translate spanish end_game2_53210fac:

    # "He'd beg until the end of time, wolven pride be damned."
    "Suplicaría hasta el fin de los tiempos; al diablo con el orgullo de los lobos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:33
translate spanish end_game2_e480c67c:

    # m "\"What decision do you speak of?\""
    m "\"¿De qué decisión hablas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:34
translate spanish end_game2_517931dc:

    # "Amicus glances up again at the stars."
    "Amicus vuelve a alzar la mirada hacia las estrellas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:35
translate spanish end_game2_42b81a19:

    # a "\"The—The decision presented to Drusus...the one decided for him by Meera ten millennia ago.\""
    a "\"La...la decisión que le ofrecisteis a Drusus...la que Meera tomó por él hace diez milenios.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:36
translate spanish end_game2_8341bc92:

    # "Amicus frowns, knowing that the parents already know what he's talking about, becoming further distressed that they're making him vocalize things that are so obvious."
    "Amicus frunce el ceño, consciente de que los Padres ya saben de qué habla, y cada vez más angustiado porque lo obligan a expresar cosas tan evidentes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:37
translate spanish end_game2_aa12a452:

    # m "\"Oh, Amicus. Don't you know the proclivity of your own people to twist and distort, to aggrandize and romanticize the truth?\""
    m "\"Oh, Amicus. ¿No conoces la inclinación de tu propio pueblo a retorcer y distorsionar, a engrandecer y romantizar la verdad?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:38
translate spanish end_game2_561bfe3b:

    # "Amicus is quiet, waiting, heart still hammering, simply feeling numb at this point."
    "Amicus guarda silencio, esperando, con el corazón todavía desbocado; a estas alturas simplemente se siente insensible."

# game/end_game2.rpy:39
translate spanish end_game2_d0dedb23:

    # m "\"Do not rely on wolven myth to inform you of parental intention. Only We will speak the truth to you.\""
    m "\"No te fíes de los mitos de los lobos para conocer las intenciones de los Padres. Solo Nosotros te diremos la verdad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:40
translate spanish end_game2_34ceec70:

    # "Amicus lets out a little growl, anger overcoming fear again."
    "Amicus deja escapar un pequeño gruñido: la ira vuelve a superar al miedo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:41
translate spanish end_game2_63312a87:

    # a "\"Then what is it? Why torment me like this?\""
    a "\"Entonces, ¿qué es? ¿Por qué me atormentáis así?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:42
translate spanish end_game2_8b4b8f0c:

    # "Several moments of silence pass and Amicus growls again, frustrated at the way he's being treated, how his emotions are being manipulated and sculpted like a mound of clay."
    "Pasan varios momentos de silencio y Amicus vuelve a gruñir, frustrado por el trato que recibe, por cómo manipulan y moldean sus emociones como un montón de arcilla."

# game/end_game2.rpy:43
translate spanish end_game2_13f5d1ba:

    # "This isn't what he'd been taught at all."
    "Aquello no se parece en absoluto a lo que le habían enseñado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:44
translate spanish end_game2_5937582d:

    # "Had his father known the parents to be like this?"
    "¿Su padre había sabido que los Padres eran así?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:45
translate spanish end_game2_ee14762e:

    # "His grandfather?"
    "¿Su abuelo?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:46
translate spanish end_game2_2629d638:

    # "Amicus wishes that he'd been warned, somehow."
    "Amicus desearía que lo hubieran advertido de alguna manera."

# game/end_game2.rpy:47
translate spanish end_game2_1b04cf2f:

    # "As the silence drags on, the wolf tries to deaden his emotions, to not give these entities any sort of hint as to what he might be feeling, wanting to refuse this blatant attack on his own agency."
    "Mientras se prolonga el silencio, el lobo intenta apagar sus emociones, no dar a aquellos seres ninguna pista de lo que siente, queriendo rechazar aquel ataque descarado a su autonomía."

# game/end_game2.rpy:48
translate spanish end_game2_9e280ab2:

    # "Despite how futile he knows that must be."
    "Aunque sabe lo inútil que debe de ser."

# game/end_game2.rpy:49
translate spanish end_game2_6a1b2344:

    # m "\"You can bring back your lover. At this very moment time stands nearly still on your plane. [mc]'s body and mind are still salvageable.\""
    m "\"Puedes recuperar a tu amante. Ahora mismo el tiempo está casi detenido en vuestro plano. El cuerpo y la mente de [mc] todavía se pueden salvar.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:50
translate spanish end_game2_f332a517:

    # "Amicus's heart feels as though it might leap from his mouth, his hold on [mc] tightening."
    "Amicus siente que el corazón podría saltarle por la boca y estrecha con más fuerza a [mc]."

# game/end_game2.rpy:51
translate spanish end_game2_c4a19054:

    # a "\"How—\""
    a "\"Cómo—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:52
translate spanish end_game2_016a1b5c:

    # m "\"But only if you submit yourself to the benevolent will of the parents...\""
    m "\"Pero solo si te sometes a la voluntad benevolente de los Padres...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:53
translate spanish end_game2_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:54
translate spanish end_game2_8c4b036f:

    # m "\"Will you?\""
    m "\"¿Lo harás?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:55
translate spanish end_game2_5225d3d2:

    # "Amicus furrows his brow in confusion, unsure of what this all could mean."
    "Amicus frunce el ceño, confundido, sin saber qué puede significar todo aquello."

# game/end_game2.rpy:56
translate spanish end_game2_fd8888da:

    # a "\"But...I've already done so, ever since I was a pup we've been told to—\""
    a "\"Pero...ya lo he hecho; desde que era un cachorro nos han dicho que—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:57
translate spanish end_game2_02d144ef:

    # m "\"After this experience your mind will waver. You're unsure as to what our intentions truly are. There will be moments in which you will want to question, to doubt our will...\""
    m "\"Después de esta experiencia, tu mente vacilará. No estás seguro de cuáles son nuestras verdaderas intenciones. Habrá momentos en los que querrás cuestionar nuestra voluntad, dudar de ella...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:58
translate spanish end_game2_6c89b81e:

    # m "\"You must overcome such moments. Our will is what is best for the {i}Galaxias{/i} and the universe as a whole.\""
    m "\"Debes superar esos momentos. Nuestra voluntad es lo mejor para el {i}Galaxias{/i} y para el universo en su conjunto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:59
translate spanish end_game2_9c07d739:

    # "Amicus stares for a moment."
    "Amicus se queda mirando un momento."

# game/end_game2.rpy:60
translate spanish end_game2_b815baed:

    # a "\"And if I don't agree?\""
    a "\"¿Y si no estoy de acuerdo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:61
translate spanish end_game2_1d2d8418:

    # m "\"Then we shall let the human pass on as he naturally should, and we shall wait for a future emperor to take your place.\""
    m "\"Entonces dejaremos que el humano muera, como naturalmente le corresponde, y esperaremos a que un futuro emperador ocupe tu lugar.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:62
translate spanish end_game2_5f8f905b:

    # "Amicus shakes his head, not wanting to believe this is true, that this is the way that the leaders of the {i}Galaxias{/i} function."
    "Amicus niega con la cabeza, sin querer creer que aquello sea cierto, que así actúen los dirigentes del {i}Galaxias{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:63
translate spanish end_game2_1d9bfc12:

    # m "\"It must be done.\""
    m "\"Debe hacerse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:64
translate spanish end_game2_27015f58:

    # "The wolf is quiet, for once wishing that he isn't in such a position, wishing that he could hide away in the quiet countryside with his human, to live a normal life..."
    "El lobo guarda silencio, deseando por una vez no encontrarse en aquella posición, deseando poder esconderse en la tranquilidad del campo con su humano y llevar una vida normal..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:65
translate spanish end_game2_9b523202:

    # m "\"That is not your calling. It never was.\""
    m "\"Esa no es tu vocación. Nunca lo fue.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:66
translate spanish end_game2_f27c8d9c:

    # a "\"I know.\""
    a "\"Lo sé.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:67
translate spanish end_game2_5c77094a:

    # "Amicus whispers, more to himself than the parents."
    "Amicus susurra, más para sí mismo que para los Padres."

# game/end_game2.rpy:69
translate spanish end_game2_3fd21820:

    # "There's a long moment of silence in which Amicus simply stares into space, contemplating what it means to give up any true freedom, to submit himself to the absolute authority of the galaxy."
    "Hay un largo silencio durante el cual Amicus se limita a mirar el espacio, reflexionando sobre lo que significa renunciar a toda libertad verdadera y someterse a la autoridad absoluta de la galaxia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:70
translate spanish end_game2_92277ed2:

    # m "\"Will you submit?\""
    m "\"¿Te someterás?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:71
translate spanish end_game2_ce194e6b:

    # "Amicus takes a deep breath."
    "Amicus respira hondo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:72
translate spanish end_game2_ffa29b58:

    # a "\"Will...will my decision affect [mc]'s free will? You said you have plans for him as well.\""
    a "\"¿Mi...mi decisión afectará al libre albedrío de [mc]? Dijisteis que también teníais planes para él.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:73
translate spanish end_game2_f5abd5c4:

    # m "\"He will be allowed to make his own decision. We will tell you of his mission once you make {i}your{/i} decision.\""
    m "\"Se le permitirá tomar su propia decisión. Te contaremos su misión cuando tomes {i}tu{/i} decisión.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:74
translate spanish end_game2_e5353eb2:

    # "Amicus stifles another growl, hating that his human is being forced into this as well."
    "Amicus reprime otro gruñido, odiando que también obliguen a su humano a meterse en aquello."

# game/end_game2.rpy:75
translate spanish end_game2_92277ed2_1:

    # m "\"Will you submit?\""
    m "\"¿Te someterás?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:76
translate spanish end_game2_0f59256a:

    # "Amicus closes his eyes, feeling his anger and resilience slowly drain away."
    "Amicus cierra los ojos y siente cómo se desvanecen lentamente su ira y su resistencia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:77
translate spanish end_game2_a3246673:

    # "Then he opens them."
    "Después los abre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:78
translate spanish end_game2_b580cbaa:

    # a "\"I submit.\""
    a "\"Me someto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:82
translate spanish end_game2_d86a984c:

    # "Blue light swirls in front of my eyes in intricate, spiraling tendrils."
    "Una luz azul gira ante mis ojos en complicados filamentos en espiral."

# game/end_game2.rpy:83
translate spanish end_game2_149b8d27:

    # "It's beautiful, and as I begin to focus, I see a blurry, gray shape in the middle of it all."
    "Es hermosa, y cuando empiezo a enfocar la vista veo una figura gris y borrosa en el centro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:84
translate spanish end_game2_21acfdb7:

    # "Even before I'm fully able to see him, I know it's my wolf."
    "Incluso antes de poder verlo bien, sé que es mi lobo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:85
translate spanish end_game2_2842c249:

    # "I smile and reach up, cupping at the warm, furry form."
    "Sonrío y alzo la mano, acariciando aquella figura cálida y peluda."

# game/end_game2.rpy:86
translate spanish end_game2_9142b0c2:

    # "At some point along this little journey, I've stopped caring about whether the things I see are real or not."
    "En algún momento de este pequeño viaje he dejado de preocuparme por si lo que veo es real o no."

# game/end_game2.rpy:87
translate spanish end_game2_20ca0388:

    # "I'm just happy that I'm seeing him."
    "Simplemente estoy feliz de verlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:88
translate spanish end_game2_29d00675:

    # "He smiles down at me."
    "Me sonríe desde arriba."

# game/end_game2.rpy:91
translate spanish end_game2_4b87ac29:

    # a "\"Hey.\""
    a "\"Eh.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:92
translate spanish end_game2_568a6418:

    # m "\"...Hey.\""
    m "\"...Hola.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:93
translate spanish end_game2_03866667:

    # "I lie quietly in his arms for a while, just enjoying the comforting, blue glow."
    "Permanezco un rato en silencio entre sus brazos, disfrutando del reconfortante resplandor azul."

# game/end_game2.rpy:94
translate spanish end_game2_af0313a4:

    # "I'm reminded of when I first met Amicus, when our ship stalled out in the blue dust cloud, when he'd finally revealed to me his botched plan."
    "Recuerdo cuando conocí a Amicus, cuando nuestra nave se quedó detenida en la nube de polvo azul y finalmente me reveló su plan fallido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:95
translate spanish end_game2_718880a5:

    # "That feels so distant now, like it was years ago, rather than just months."
    "Ahora aquello parece tan lejano, como si hubiera ocurrido hace años en lugar de unos pocos meses."

# game/end_game2.rpy:96
translate spanish end_game2_2acfa737:

    # "I take a deep breath, and something about it feels strange, almost like something mechanical is moving in my neck."
    "Respiro hondo y noto algo extraño, casi como si algo mecánico se moviera en mi cuello."

# game/end_game2.rpy:97
translate spanish end_game2_f5ca74ae:

    # "I reach up, touching my fingers to my throat, and for a moment they brush against something that feels like a thin line of flesh."
    "Alzo la mano y me toco la garganta con los dedos; por un momento rozan algo que parece una fina línea de carne."

# game/end_game2.rpy:98
translate spanish end_game2_f296fa8a:

    # "But Amicus reaches down to move my hand away, pressing it to my chest instead."
    "Pero Amicus baja la mano para apartar la mía y la apoya en mi pecho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:99
translate spanish end_game2_a9ff0949:

    # a "\"You're alright. You're gonna be fine now.\""
    a "\"Estás bien. Ahora vas a ponerte bien.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:100
translate spanish end_game2_cc5a0746:

    # m "\"What...\""
    m "\"Qué...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:101
translate spanish end_game2_7607027c:

    # "That's when I also realize that my voice sounds strange."
    "Entonces también me doy cuenta de que mi voz suena extraña."

# game/end_game2.rpy:102
translate spanish end_game2_d712c9e5:

    # "It still sounds like me, but there's something slightly off about it, like it's a little higher, maybe even just a little robotic."
    "Sigue sonando como yo, pero hay algo ligeramente distinto, como si fuera un poco más aguda, quizá incluso algo robótica."

# game/end_game2.rpy:103
translate spanish end_game2_e499761a:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:104
translate spanish end_game2_1a78d38c:

    # "Amicus presses against my chest firmly, comfortingly."
    "Amicus me presiona el pecho con firmeza, de una forma tranquilizadora."

# game/end_game2.rpy:106
translate spanish end_game2_1983067b:

    # a "\"It's okay, I know it might feel a bit strange, but you won't even notice it after a few days.\""
    a "\"No pasa nada; sé que puede sentirse algo extraño, pero dentro de unos días ni lo notarás.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:107
translate spanish end_game2_f1e1cb15:

    # "What is he talking about?"
    "¿De qué habla?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:108
translate spanish end_game2_ddf54f3a:

    # "Again, I lay quietly in his arms as I gather my thoughts."
    "Vuelvo a permanecer en silencio entre sus brazos mientras ordeno mis pensamientos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:109
translate spanish end_game2_a7a17747:

    # "The fight, the dagger, the darkness, the parents, then..."
    "La pelea, el puñal, la oscuridad, los Padres, después..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:110
translate spanish end_game2_3a90705a:

    # "I look up at Amicus in question."
    "Miro a Amicus interrogativamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:111
translate spanish end_game2_6a322264:

    # m "\"What...what happened?\""
    m "\"Qué...¿qué ha pasado?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:112
translate spanish end_game2_9629233f:

    # "I try to ignore the strange, soundless, mechanical clicking feeling in my throat, while also trying to get used to my voice."
    "Intento ignorar aquella extraña sensación de clics mecánicos y silenciosos en la garganta, mientras trato de acostumbrarme a mi voz."

# game/end_game2.rpy:113
translate spanish end_game2_1cf02a06:

    # "It's like hearing myself in a recording; just not quite right."
    "Es como oírme en una grabación: algo no encaja del todo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:115
translate spanish end_game2_f4566769:

    # "Amicus chuckles, sounding exhausted, relieved, and maybe even a little sad at the same time."
    "Amicus ríe suavemente; suena agotado, aliviado y quizá también un poco triste."

# game/end_game2.rpy:117
translate spanish end_game2_77478e3c:

    # a "\"Quite a bit happened, [mc].\""
    a "\"Han pasado bastantes cosas, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:118
translate spanish end_game2_22894267:

    # m "\"But the parents. I thought they wanted us to meet them?\""
    m "\"Pero los Padres...¿no querían que nos reuniéramos con ellos?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:119
translate spanish end_game2_8281fee3:

    # "Amicus's gentle smile wavers for a moment."
    "La sonrisa suave de Amicus vacila un momento."

# game/end_game2.rpy:121
translate spanish end_game2_25b74959:

    # a "\"Well...they did. I met them.\""
    a "\"Bueno...sí. Yo me reuní con ellos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:122
translate spanish end_game2_dec0fd59:

    # m "\"What? I don't remember...\""
    m "\"¿Qué? No recuerdo...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:123
translate spanish end_game2_82e82f92:

    # "I rack my memory, but nothing comes to mind."
    "Rebusco en mi memoria, pero no me viene nada a la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:124
translate spanish end_game2_a38ca5d4:

    # a "\"You, uh, you lost consciousness when it happened.\""
    a "\"Tú, eh...perdiste el conocimiento cuando ocurrió.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:125
translate spanish end_game2_c848da58:

    # "I frown at that, wondering why that would happen, but Amicus doesn't offer an explanation."
    "Frunzo el ceño, preguntándome por qué habría sucedido, pero Amicus no me da ninguna explicación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:126
translate spanish end_game2_9ec8853f:

    # "I look down at my chest, and instead of the coating of blood I expect to see, I'm clean and bare, aside from a few, small wet spots on my chest."
    "Miro mi pecho: en lugar de la capa de sangre que esperaba ver, estoy limpio y desnudo, salvo por unas pequeñas manchas húmedas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:127
translate spanish end_game2_c5cf3b2b:

    # "I suppose Amicus had been a bit more emotional before I'd woken up."
    "Supongo que Amicus había estado algo más emocionado antes de que despertara."

# game/end_game2.rpy:128
translate spanish end_game2_52e9ad1f:

    # "I look back at him, then press my face against his body, and he responds by hugging me close to his chest for a moment."
    "Lo miro de nuevo y después apoyo la cara en su cuerpo; él responde estrechándome un momento contra su pecho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:130
translate spanish end_game2_5e7c3f80:

    # m "\"So it's over? They decided to bring me back?\""
    m "\"¿Así que ha terminado? ¿Decidieron devolverme la vida?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:131
translate spanish end_game2_56b22d0a:

    # "My voice is muffled against his fur."
    "Mi voz suena amortiguada contra su pelo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:132
translate spanish end_game2_1056e810:

    # "My strange, not-quite-right voice."
    "Mi voz extraña, que no encaja del todo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:133
translate spanish end_game2_0e4c4746:

    # "Amicus loosens his hold on me, allowing me to look back up at his face."
    "Amicus afloja el abrazo, permitiéndome volver a mirar su cara."

# game/end_game2.rpy:135
translate spanish end_game2_3a8de6fd:

    # a "\"Yes. It's over.\""
    a "\"Sí. Ha terminado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:136
translate spanish end_game2_5f711d93:

    # "The tension that I'd held in my chest ever since I arrived, ever since being abducted from my bedroom in Italy, it all releases slowly."
    "La tensión que llevaba en el pecho desde que llegué, desde que me secuestraron de mi habitación en Italia, va desapareciendo lentamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:137
translate spanish end_game2_6370b32e:

    # "For once, I feel light and free, and I sag in the wolf's arms, sighing deeply."
    "Por una vez me siento ligero y libre, y me dejo caer entre los brazos del lobo, suspirando profundamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:138
translate spanish end_game2_38f7a6c4:

    # "Even now, I'm starting to get used to the new feelings in my throat."
    "Incluso ahora empiezo a acostumbrarme a las nuevas sensaciones de mi garganta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:140
translate spanish end_game2_891ef0b0:

    # a "\"I love you.\""
    a "\"Te amo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:141
translate spanish end_game2_58124b9d:

    # m "\"I love you, too.\""
    m "\"Yo también te amo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:142
translate spanish end_game2_13eb866a:

    # "I smile up at him, and despite everything being over, I can't help but notice that he seems a bit sad, too."
    "Le sonrío desde abajo y, aunque todo ha terminado, no puedo evitar notar que también parece algo triste."

# game/end_game2.rpy:143
translate spanish end_game2_f7872598:

    # "I rest a hand against his chest."
    "Apoyo una mano en su pecho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:144
translate spanish end_game2_702cfbe4:

    # m "\"You alright?\""
    m "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:146
translate spanish end_game2_459ce3ce:

    # "Amicus laughs loudly, shaking my entire body."
    "Amicus ríe con fuerza, haciendo temblar todo mi cuerpo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:147
translate spanish end_game2_61356971:

    # a "\"Aside from nearly losing everything I hold dear, I suppose I'm alright, yes.\""
    a "\"Aparte de haber estado a punto de perder todo lo que quiero, supongo que estoy bien, sí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:148
translate spanish end_game2_d8fe3f13:

    # "I try to sit up, but Amicus keeps me reclined gently, but firmly."
    "Intento incorporarme, pero Amicus me mantiene reclinado con suavidad y firmeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:149
translate spanish end_game2_b466649c:

    # m "\"You sure? You seem upset.\""
    m "\"¿Seguro? Pareces alterado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:150
translate spanish end_game2_01ee7781:

    # "The big wolf sighs deeply, and I feel his torso puff out against my side and shoulder."
    "El gran lobo suspira profundamente y noto cómo su torso se hincha contra mi costado y mi hombro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:152
translate spanish end_game2_929f0d2f:

    # a "\"There are...things I must tell you, but later. It's not important right now.\""
    a "\"Hay...cosas que debo contarte, pero más tarde. Ahora no es importante.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:153
translate spanish end_game2_bd610d62:

    # "That tension that had been so mercifully loosened in my chest suddenly appears again, albeit in a much smaller way."
    "La tensión que tan misericordiosamente había desaparecido de mi pecho vuelve de pronto, aunque mucho menor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:154
translate spanish end_game2_f617c002:

    # "I want to ask more, but for now I just want to rest."
    "Quiero preguntar más, pero de momento solo quiero descansar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:155
translate spanish end_game2_fc8f316e:

    # m "\"Well...as long as I'm not gonna pass out and wake up completely confused again. I feel like that's all I've been doing the past month.\""
    m "\"Bueno...mientras no vuelva a desmayarme y despertar completamente confundido. Parece que es lo único que he hecho este último mes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:156
translate spanish end_game2_ff03efe4:

    # "Amicus huffs in amusement."
    "Amicus resopla divertido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:158
translate spanish end_game2_a553d900:

    # a "\"Yes, you do have a knack for such things.\""
    a "\"Sí, tienes un talento especial para esas cosas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:159
translate spanish end_game2_fb26df1a:

    # "We go quiet again, and it's a nice kind of quiet."
    "Volvemos a quedarnos en silencio, y es un silencio agradable."

# game/end_game2.rpy:160
translate spanish end_game2_30fee3c2:

    # "We're both just basking in the peaceful aftermath of our months-long struggle."
    "Ambos disfrutamos de la paz que ha dejado nuestra lucha de meses."

# game/end_game2.rpy:161
translate spanish end_game2_989320a7:

    # "After a while though, my wolf meets my eyes again."
    "Pero, al cabo de un rato, mi lobo vuelve a mirarme a los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:163
translate spanish end_game2_804cd142:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"¿[mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:164
translate spanish end_game2_9e2f24e6:

    # m "\"Yes, Amicus?\""
    m "\"¿Sí, Amicus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:165
translate spanish end_game2_89304c5a:

    # a "\"I'm sorry.\""
    a "\"Lo siento.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:166
translate spanish end_game2_6bc83ed5:

    # m "\"Sorry?\""
    m "\"¿Lo sientes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:167
translate spanish end_game2_862faa9a:

    # a "\"For everything, for taking you from your planet, for involving you in Adastran politics, for acting as if I knew better. Even if it was part of the parents' plan, it doesn't make it right...and I'm sorry.\""
    a "\"Por todo: por sacarte de tu planeta, por meterte en la política de Adastra, por actuar como si yo supiera más. Aunque formara parte del plan de los Padres, eso no lo hace correcto...y lo siento.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:168
translate spanish end_game2_15f3bc9d:

    # m "\"Plan?\""
    m "\"¿Planear?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:171
translate spanish end_game2_f7d47520:

    # "Amicus lets out a small, tired laugh, shaking his head."
    "Amicus suelta una pequeña risa cansada y niega con la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:172
translate spanish end_game2_633780a5:

    # a "\"Again, I'll tell you later. Let's just be together for now.\""
    a "\"Como te he dicho, te lo contaré luego. De momento, simplemente estemos juntos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:173
translate spanish end_game2_e6ac4855:

    # "I nod in agreement, ignoring the clicks in my neck, clinging to my wolf, happy to be in this quiet little corner of the universe, undisturbed by politics, mad emperors, or monolithic space entities."
    "Asiento, ignorando los clics de mi cuello, aferrado a mi lobo y feliz de estar en aquel pequeño rincón tranquilo del universo, sin política, emperadores locos ni inmensos seres espaciales que nos molesten."

# game/end_game2.rpy:177
translate spanish end_game2_5b142e94:

    # "The following days are...strange, to say the least."
    "Los días siguientes son...extraños, por decirlo suavemente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:178
translate spanish end_game2_5558e129:

    # "After what happened in the amphitheater, the wolven population has seemingly taken great interest in me."
    "Tras lo ocurrido en el anfiteatro, la población de los lobos parece haberse interesado mucho por mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:179
translate spanish end_game2_da160f73:

    # "I guess I'm sort of a celebrity at this point."
    "Supongo que, a estas alturas, soy una especie de famoso."

# game/end_game2.rpy:180
translate spanish end_game2_052c3cdc:

    # "I got my first taste of this while lounging in the dining room, only half-paying attention to the screens when I realize that it's a reenactment of the Trial by Combat between Amicus and Cato."
    "Lo descubrí por primera vez mientras descansaba en el comedor, prestando solo media atención a las pantallas, cuando comprendí que estaban recreando el juicio por combate entre Amicus y Cato."

# game/end_game2.rpy:181
translate spanish end_game2_23b55aff:

    # "My character, portrayed by a small wolf wearing a rather uncanny human mask, jumps in at the last second to plunge the dagger into Cato's back."
    "Mi personaje, interpretado por un lobo pequeño con una inquietante máscara humana, se lanza al combate en el último segundo para hundirle el puñal a Cato en la espalda."

# game/end_game2.rpy:182
translate spanish end_game2_32adedf0:

    # "He's then stabbed directly in the throat by Cato (instead of slashed) and stands for several seconds, clutching his neck while \"Amicus\" tears out Cato's throat, then arrives just in time to catch \"me\" as he swoons back."
    "Después Cato le clava el puñal directamente en la garganta, en lugar de cortársela, y él permanece de pie varios segundos, sujetándose el cuello mientras \"Amicus\" le arranca la garganta a Cato; luego llega justo a tiempo para recogerme cuando \"yo\" caigo desmayado hacia atrás."

# game/end_game2.rpy:183
translate spanish end_game2_07c0610a:

    # "I have to stop watching at this point, the memories of what happened too fresh and traumatizing for me to see played out, even if it's terribly acted out."
    "En ese punto tengo que dejar de mirar; los recuerdos son demasiado recientes y traumáticos para verlos representados, aunque la actuación sea pésima."

# game/end_game2.rpy:184
translate spanish end_game2_76e8ae8b:

    # "While I suppose it's nice to be liked by the general population, I can't help but feel it's for the wrong reasons."
    "Aunque supongo que está bien caerle bien a la población, no puedo evitar sentir que es por razones equivocadas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:185
translate spanish end_game2_0d6c0aa9:

    # "I'm definitely being portrayed as a noble savage of sorts; so in love with my \"master\" that I broke the rules to save him...or I just didn't understand the rules well enough to abide by them."
    "Sin duda me presentan como una especie de noble salvaje: tan enamorado de mi \"amo\" que rompí las reglas para salvarlo...o simplemente no las entendí lo suficiente para obedecerlas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:186
translate spanish end_game2_78d3caba:

    # "Either way, it makes me feel kind of uncomfortable."
    "Sea como sea, me hace sentir algo incómodo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:187
translate spanish end_game2_4097fcdc:

    # "Meanwhile, Amicus is kept busy, of course."
    "Mientras tanto, Amicus está ocupado, por supuesto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:188
translate spanish end_game2_0ab29e31:

    # "The quiet moment I'd had with him in the archives is actually the last really long moment alone I've had with him since."
    "El momento tranquilo que compartimos en los archivos es, de hecho, el último rato realmente largo que hemos pasado a solas desde entonces."

# game/end_game2.rpy:189
translate spanish end_game2_4580f3ad:

    # "Almost immediately after, Amicus is whisked away to various ceremonies and meetings as everything becomes official."
    "Casi inmediatamente después se llevan a Amicus de una ceremonia a una reunión mientras todo se hace oficial."

# game/end_game2.rpy:190
translate spanish end_game2_c0bc43bb:

    # "Amicus is the emperor now, and he seems to be taking to it rather well, especially after the incredibly stressful events preceding it."
    "Ahora Amicus es el emperador y parece adaptarse bastante bien, sobre todo después de los sucesos tan estresantes que lo precedieron."

# game/end_game2.rpy:191
translate spanish end_game2_7b3d39fe:

    # "His personality has always been silly, and a bit immature, but after taking the throne, he's taken on a persona of a cool, calm, leader."
    "Siempre ha sido bromista y un poco inmaduro, pero desde que tomó el trono ha adoptado la imagen de un dirigente sereno y tranquilo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:192
translate spanish end_game2_71cecf8d:

    # "It's a side of him that I've seen occasional flashes of, and while I'm happy to see him fitting the role so well, I can't help but feel a bit sad that he has to quash that playful, outgoing side of himself."
    "Es una faceta que he visto de vez en cuando y, aunque me alegra que encaje tan bien en el papel, me entristece un poco que deba reprimir su lado juguetón y extrovertido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:193
translate spanish end_game2_eaca2af0:

    # "I suppose it's one of those parts of having to grow up."
    "Supongo que es una de esas cosas que implica hacerse mayor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:195
translate spanish end_game2_2e5b2e26:

    # "I try to stay out of his way for now, knowing he has so much to do, but on the second day after the trial, I'm told by Com that Amicus wants to speak with me."
    "De momento intento no estorbarle, sabiendo cuánto tiene que hacer, pero el segundo día después del juicio Com me dice que Amicus quiere hablar conmigo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:199
translate spanish end_game2_140cf5d8:

    # "I open the door and immediately hear Virginia's voice, raised slightly in annoyance."
    "Abro la puerta y enseguida oigo la voz de Virginia, algo elevada por el fastidio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:201
translate spanish end_game2_c98e81d4:

    # v "\"No! Lux is the city in desperate need of funds right now. {i}Lex{/i} is doing very well.\""
    v "\"¡No! Lux es la ciudad que necesita fondos desesperadamente ahora mismo. A {i}Lex{/i} le va muy bien.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:203
translate spanish end_game2_684e8187:

    # a "\"Well, I'm sorry, but the names are rather similar, are they not? I meant Lux anyway.\""
    a "\"Bueno, lo siento, pero los nombres son bastante parecidos, ¿no? De todas formas, quería decir Lux.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:205
translate spanish end_game2_300ab33e:

    # v "\"Even if you meant it that way, I can guarantee you the triumvirates won't be pleased hearing you mistakenly refer to which city they are from!\""
    v "\"¡Aunque quisieras decir eso, te garantizo que a los triunviros no les hará gracia oír que te equivocas al decir de qué ciudad son!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:207
translate spanish end_game2_8fc0d3a9:

    # a "\"Alright, alright! Calm down. I'll be sure to remember that...and don't yell at me in front of the triumvirates, please. You'll only give my critics more weaponry if I'm seen allowing my own sister to treat me in such a way.\""
    a "\"¡Está bien, está bien! Cálmate. Me aseguraré de recordarlo...y no me grites delante de los triunviros, por favor. Solo darás más armas a mis críticos si ven que dejo que mi propia hermana me trate así.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:209
translate spanish end_game2_fcd6d352:

    # v "\"All the more reason not to make mistakes then.\""
    v "\"Una razón más para no cometer errores.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:213
translate spanish end_game2_1750e977:

    # "The two seem to realize that I'm there finally, and cease their argument."
    "Los dos parecen darse cuenta por fin de que estoy ahí y dejan de discutir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:214
translate spanish end_game2_5302c0b8:

    # a "\"[mc]! We were just finishing our conversation.\""
    a "\"¡[mc]! Ya estábamos terminando la conversación.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:216
translate spanish end_game2_ce912c72:

    # v "\"Were we? I'm going to drill you on all of this again on our flight to the city.\""
    v "\"¿Ah, sí? Volveré a examinarte de todo esto durante el vuelo a la ciudad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:217
translate spanish end_game2_7c63dec8:

    # "Virginia makes her way past me, pausing to rest a paw on my shoulder."
    "Virginia pasa junto a mí y se detiene para apoyarme una mano en el hombro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:219
translate spanish end_game2_6f2225cb:

    # v "\"Maybe I should put you in charge of my brother's studies. At least he listens to you.\""
    v "\"Quizá debería ponerte al frente de los estudios de mi hermano. Al menos a ti te escucha.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:221
translate spanish end_game2_4acccd60:

    # "The she-wolf rolls her eyes before disappearing through the door, leaving us in silence so that Amicus's big, heavy sigh seems to resonate through the entire room."
    "La loba pone los ojos en blanco antes de desaparecer por la puerta, dejándonos en silencio; el gran suspiro de Amicus parece resonar por toda la habitación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:224
translate spanish end_game2_195ce336:

    # a "\"Gods, she's relentless.\""
    a "\"Dioses, es implacable.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:225
translate spanish end_game2_7baa46b0:

    # m "\"Isn't that a good thing?\""
    m "\"¿Eso no es bueno?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:227
translate spanish end_game2_03f4f62a:

    # a "\"I suppose, but it doesn't make it any easier to deal with.\""
    a "\"Supongo, pero no hace que sea más fácil soportarlo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:228
translate spanish end_game2_60a11631:

    # "Amicus is walking towards me and immediately takes me up into a deep hug, followed by a kiss."
    "Amicus se acerca y enseguida me da un abrazo profundo, seguido de un beso."

# game/end_game2.rpy:229
translate spanish end_game2_68e88f56:

    # "I kiss back, feeling Amicus's tense body relax against mine, and I feel happy at the idea that I might be able to relieve his stress so easily."
    "Le devuelvo el beso, sintiendo que su cuerpo tenso se relaja contra el mío, y me alegra pensar que quizá pueda aliviar su estrés con tanta facilidad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:230
translate spanish end_game2_889a5bc2:

    # "He finally draws back, smiling as he does."
    "Finalmente se aparta, sonriendo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:232
translate spanish end_game2_cc2b86c4:

    # a "\"How have you been? I know I've been rather absent lately, but—\""
    a "\"¿Cómo has estado? Sé que últimamente he estado bastante ausente, pero—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:233
translate spanish end_game2_c4c4146f:

    # m "\"I know, official business and everything. I've been okay. Just trying to adjust to the all the new.\""
    m "\"Lo sé: asuntos oficiales y todo eso. He estado bien. Solo intento adaptarme a todas las novedades.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:234
translate spanish end_game2_54dc3ddd:

    # "I sweep a hand around me, then hesitantly bring it to my neck, the wound that the parents had somehow healed, my trachea and vocal cords having been replaced and repaired with...something."
    "Hago un gesto con la mano a mi alrededor y después la llevo vacilante al cuello, a la herida que los Padres habían curado de algún modo; mi tráquea y mis cuerdas vocales han sido sustituidas y reparadas con...algo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:235
translate spanish end_game2_f1ed5b06:

    # "I try not to think about it, and I've gotten used to it for the most part."
    "Intento no pensar en ello y, en gran parte, ya me he acostumbrado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:237
translate spanish end_game2_208a9f72:

    # a "\"Well, I hope you've been adjusting smoothly, then.\""
    a "\"Bueno, espero que te estés adaptando sin problemas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:238
translate spanish end_game2_ab0c9975:

    # "Amicus brushes a paw through my hair, looking me over."
    "Amicus me pasa una mano por el pelo mientras me examina."

# game/end_game2.rpy:239
translate spanish end_game2_0854bb69:

    # m "\"What was it you wanted to talk about?\""
    m "\"¿De qué querías hablar?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:241
translate spanish end_game2_69296fb0:

    # "Amicus pulls his paw back, and the look on his face starts to worry me."
    "Amicus retira la mano, y la expresión de su cara empieza a preocuparme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:242
translate spanish end_game2_625b4e4e:

    # m "\"Is it about what happened with the parents?\""
    m "\"¿Es por lo que pasó con los Padres?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:243
translate spanish end_game2_9f5a71ab:

    # "At this point in time, I know that something involving me happened while I'd been unconscious."
    "A estas alturas sé que ocurrió algo relacionado conmigo mientras estaba inconsciente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:244
translate spanish end_game2_20547be1:

    # "For whatever reason, I'd been kept unaware of the conversation that happened between Amicus and the parents."
    "Por algún motivo me han mantenido al margen de la conversación entre Amicus y los Padres."

# game/end_game2.rpy:245
translate spanish end_game2_7dc5874e:

    # "Amicus nods, rubbing an arm awkwardly."
    "Amicus asiente, frotándose un brazo con torpeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:246
translate spanish end_game2_8aa00ae3:

    # a "\"Er, yes. It's rather complicated, so it may take a moment for me to explain it all.\""
    a "\"Eh, sí. Es bastante complicado, así que puede que tarde un rato en explicarlo todo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:249
translate spanish end_game2_cb7f4c3e:

    # "The wolf guides me to the sofa, and we sit side-by-side as Amicus drapes an arm around my shoulder."
    "El lobo me guía hasta el sofá; nos sentamos uno junto al otro y Amicus me rodea el hombro con un brazo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:250
translate spanish end_game2_a1c2b5fe:

    # "Over the next few minutes, he tells me of the deal he made with the parents, that he'd submit himself to their will, if only to bring me back to life."
    "Durante los minutos siguientes me cuenta el trato que hizo con los Padres: someterse a su voluntad, aunque solo fuera para devolverme la vida."

# game/end_game2.rpy:251
translate spanish end_game2_e49a1b1a:

    # "It's a similar decision that I had to make, and I shake my head."
    "Es una decisión parecida a la que tuve que tomar yo, y niego con la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:253
translate spanish end_game2_623eee90:

    # m "\"I don't like that. Why are they doing this to us?\""
    m "\"No me gusta. ¿Por qué nos hacen esto?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:254
translate spanish end_game2_bbfe0ab5:

    # "Amicus shrugs loosely against me, shaking his head as well."
    "Amicus se encoge ligeramente de hombros contra mí y también niega con la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:256
translate spanish end_game2_2c75f809:

    # a "\"I honestly don't know, but I can tell you that my view of them has changed quite a bit since what happened.\""
    a "\"Sinceramente no lo sé, pero puedo decirte que mi opinión de ellos ha cambiado bastante desde lo ocurrido.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:257
translate spanish end_game2_adb7a868:

    # m "\"So what, now you have to do whatever they say or...something bad happens to me?\""
    m "\"¿Así que ahora debes hacer todo lo que digan o...me pasará algo malo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:258
translate spanish end_game2_508ac204:

    # "Again, my hand drifts up to my neck, wondering if there's something more to the mechanics in my throat."
    "Mi mano vuelve a subir hasta el cuello y me pregunto si los mecanismos de mi garganta ocultan algo más."

# game/end_game2.rpy:259
translate spanish end_game2_685b0624:

    # "An irrational part of my mind wonders if maybe there's some type of self-destruct mechanism built into it."
    "Una parte irracional de mi mente se pregunta si quizá hayan incorporado algún mecanismo de autodestrucción."

# game/end_game2.rpy:260
translate spanish end_game2_94c4a329:

    # "I shudder at the thought of my throat suddenly exploding."
    "Me estremezco al imaginar que mi garganta explota de repente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:261
translate spanish end_game2_b0954df3:

    # a "\"I...doubt that, but I feel that maybe they would make it difficult for us to stay together if I did. Our meeting together...it was planned by the parents.\""
    a "\"Yo...lo dudo, pero creo que quizá nos pondrían difícil seguir juntos si no obedeciera. Nuestro encuentro...lo planearon los Padres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:262
translate spanish end_game2_6dcf1164:

    # "This was something I'd sort of assumed on my own, but I still bristle nonetheless."
    "Era algo que yo ya había supuesto, pero aun así me irrita."

# game/end_game2.rpy:263
translate spanish end_game2_c3316598:

    # m "\"See? They're using our love against us. This is...this is just fucked up.\""
    m "\"¿Ves? Usan nuestro amor en nuestra contra. Esto...esto es una puta mierda.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:264
translate spanish end_game2_087bbabf:

    # "Amicus just nods quietly, but draws me closer with his arm around my shoulders."
    "Amicus se limita a asentir en silencio, pero me acerca más con el brazo que me rodea los hombros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:265
translate spanish end_game2_fb0ec738:

    # m "\"So they just...draw us together. I was like, the most compatible human to you so now they can make sure we do as we're told so we can stay together?\""
    m "\"Así que simplemente...nos juntan. Yo era el humano más compatible contigo, y ahora pueden asegurarse de que obedecemos para poder seguir juntos, ¿no?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:266
translate spanish end_game2_ffa26087:

    # "Again, Amicus is quiet, just holding me."
    "Amicus vuelve a guardar silencio, limitándose a abrazarme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:267
translate spanish end_game2_fdf3931c:

    # m "\"I don't like this.\""
    m "\"No me gusta esto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:268
translate spanish end_game2_df975ad7:

    # a "\"Neither do I.\""
    a "\"A mí tampoco.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:269
translate spanish end_game2_dcb0476f:

    # m "\"So if your job is to bring the {i}Galaxias{/i} together...what's my job?\""
    m "\"Si tu trabajo es unir el {i}Galaxias{/i}...¿cuál es el mío?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:271
translate spanish end_game2_0ca3b69b:

    # "Amicus takes another slow, deep breath, which only spikes my anxiety."
    "Amicus vuelve a respirar lenta y profundamente, y eso no hace más que aumentar mi ansiedad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:272
translate spanish end_game2_c8f0254b:

    # "I realize that the release I felt in the archive room was only temporary."
    "Me doy cuenta de que el alivio que sentí en la sala del archivo fue temporal."

# game/end_game2.rpy:273
translate spanish end_game2_63032193:

    # "In retrospect, I suppose it was a bit silly that I thought everything would be fine after Amicus became emperor."
    "Ahora que lo pienso, supongo que fue un poco ingenuo creer que todo estaría bien cuando Amicus se convirtiera en emperador."

# game/end_game2.rpy:274
translate spanish end_game2_3b442f9e:

    # "This is only the beginning."
    "Esto es solo el principio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:275
translate spanish end_game2_255dcea5:

    # a "\"Well, this is what I wanted to talk to you about.\""
    a "\"Bueno, de eso quería hablar contigo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:276
translate spanish end_game2_06599db0:

    # "I wait, feeling Amicus steel himself for what he's about to say, and I feel my anxiety grow."
    "Espero, notando cómo Amicus reúne fuerzas para lo que va a decir, y siento crecer mi ansiedad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:277
translate spanish end_game2_12395018:

    # "How bad could this actually be?"
    "¿Qué tan malo puede ser?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:278
translate spanish end_game2_5668dd01:

    # "Then, he lets out the breath with a rush of words, seemingly trying to get the explanation out all at once."
    "Después suelta el aire junto con un torrente de palabras, como si intentara dar toda la explicación de una vez."

# game/end_game2.rpy:279
translate spanish end_game2_032f46e1:

    # a "\"The parents told me that your mission is to begin the process of integrating humans into the {i}Galaxias{/i}.\""
    a "\"Los Padres me dijeron que tu misión es iniciar el proceso de integrar a los humanos en el {i}Galaxias{/i}.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:280
translate spanish end_game2_9b699855:

    # "I'm only starting to absorb that when Amicus takes another breath and starts another slew of words."
    "Apenas empiezo a asimilarlo cuando Amicus toma otra bocanada de aire y suelta otra tanda de palabras."

# game/end_game2.rpy:281
translate spanish end_game2_78cddaf2:

    # a "\"They want you to return to Earth and complete a series of steps to begin the integration process, a process that will take...\""
    a "\"Quieren que vuelvas a la Tierra y completes una serie de pasos para iniciar el proceso de integración, un proceso que tardará...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:283
translate spanish end_game2_baf58a2f:

    # "Amicus suddenly winces, as though the words themselves hurt."
    "Amicus hace una mueca de pronto, como si las propias palabras le dolieran."

# game/end_game2.rpy:284
translate spanish end_game2_6b27817c:

    # a "\"...that will take around eight years to complete.\""
    a "\"...que tardará unos ocho años en completarse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:285
translate spanish end_game2_a239cbde:

    # "That last bit takes the longest for me to comprehend."
    "Esa última parte es la que más me cuesta comprender."

# game/end_game2.rpy:286
translate spanish end_game2_0a09e71f:

    # "Eight years?"
    "¿Ocho años?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:287
translate spanish end_game2_dd72dbf2:

    # m "\"Eight years? Like, I'll have to go to Earth for eight years and...do a bunch of crap to bring my planet into the {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""
    m "\"¿Ocho años? ¿O sea que tengo que ir a la Tierra durante ocho años y...hacer un montón de cosas para meter a mi planeta en el {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:288
translate spanish end_game2_4f30f690:

    # "Amicus nods, and I see the deep sadness on his face."
    "Amicus asiente y veo la profunda tristeza en su cara."

# game/end_game2.rpy:289
translate spanish end_game2_141bd4b4:

    # "This explains why he wasn't exactly happy after we'd escaped the parental dimension."
    "Eso explica por qué no estaba precisamente feliz después de que escapáramos de la dimensión de los Padres."

# game/end_game2.rpy:290
translate spanish end_game2_e2f10517:

    # "I find myself at a loss for words, even though there's so much I want to ask."
    "Me quedo sin palabras, aunque tengo tanto que preguntar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:291
translate spanish end_game2_cf35e122:

    # "Amicus tries to fill the silence:"
    "Amicus intenta llenar el silencio:"

# game/end_game2.rpy:293
translate spanish end_game2_71db4670:

    # a "\"Your planet won't be...conquered, or anything. Rather you're already on a sibling-like level. You're unique in that you aren't exactly a sibling species, but you won't be under the control of another civilization, if that makes sense.\""
    a "\"Tu planeta no será...conquistado ni nada parecido. En realidad, ya estáis a un nivel parecido al de los Hermanos. Sois distintos porque no sois exactamente una especie Hermana, pero no estaréis bajo el control de otra civilización, si se entiende lo que digo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:295
translate spanish end_game2_0f929c9f:

    # a "\"Aside from the parents, of course.\""
    a "\"Aparte de los Padres, claro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:296
translate spanish end_game2_48b2b80d:

    # "That's a relief, I suppose."
    "Eso es un alivio, supongo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:297
translate spanish end_game2_f138af9d:

    # "Though the more I learn about the parents, the more I'm unsure about any of this."
    "Aunque cuanto más aprendo sobre los Padres, menos seguro estoy de todo esto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:298
translate spanish end_game2_a84f6935:

    # "While I'd once worried about the wolves invading Earth, I'm not sure I'd want the parents to be doing the same."
    "Antes me preocupaba que los lobos invadieran la Tierra, pero no sé si querría que los Padres hicieran lo mismo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:299
translate spanish end_game2_b9e1adf3:

    # "The way we're being...{i}used{/i} like this, like we're just a pair of tools."
    "La forma en que nos están...{i}usando{/i} así, como si no fuéramos más que un par de herramientas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:300
translate spanish end_game2_2e2b5c5d:

    # "It makes my skin crawl."
    "Me da escalofríos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:301
translate spanish end_game2_76d07600:

    # m "\"And the eight years? Will I just...will I be able to see you?\""
    m "\"¿Y los ocho años? ¿Solo...podré verte?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:303
translate spanish end_game2_7d4ff00a:

    # "I see the corners of Amicus's muzzle dip down deeply into a frown before stubbornly pulling back up, the way they often did when he was trying not to tear up."
    "Veo cómo las comisuras del hocico de Amicus bajan profundamente en un gesto triste antes de volver a subir obstinadamente, como suelen hacer cuando intenta no llorar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:305
translate spanish end_game2_735dbcbe:

    # a "\"No, but I discussed with them those supplements that we take to extend our lifespans. You'll be able to take them, to make those eight years seem more negligible.\""
    a "\"No, pero hablé con ellos de los suplementos que tomamos para alargar la vida. Podrás tomarlos, para que esos ocho años parezcan menos importantes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:306
translate spanish end_game2_01846b83:

    # "The way Amicus is talking; fast-paced and upbeat tells me that he's trying to make this sound like it isn't a huge deal at all...but it is."
    "La forma rápida y animada en que habla Amicus me dice que intenta hacer que parezca algo sin demasiada importancia...pero la tiene."

# game/end_game2.rpy:307
translate spanish end_game2_a561f874:

    # m "\"Eight years...\""
    m "\"Ocho años...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:309
translate spanish end_game2_60465660:

    # "The arm around my shoulder brings me into a full-on hug now, pressing my face against his chest."
    "El brazo que me rodea el hombro se convierte en un abrazo completo y me presiona la cara contra su pecho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:310
translate spanish end_game2_408873dd:

    # a "\"I know. It seems like a long time, and it is, but after that...we'll be free.\""
    a "\"Lo sé. Parece mucho tiempo, y lo es, pero después...seremos libres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:311
translate spanish end_game2_73c0528c:

    # "Amicus's voice is strained, like there's a heavy weight on his chest."
    "La voz de Amicus suena tensa, como si tuviera un gran peso sobre el pecho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:312
translate spanish end_game2_c09655a0:

    # "We both know we won't."
    "Ambos sabemos que no lo seremos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:313
translate spanish end_game2_d48ac3ae:

    # m "\"And I'm gonna have to do all of that alone? Couldn't you come help me?\""
    m "\"¿Y tendré que hacer todo eso solo? ¿No podrías venir a ayudarme?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:314
translate spanish end_game2_625f102c:

    # "Now I sound like a child."
    "Ahora sueno como un niño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:315
translate spanish end_game2_f5407cc7:

    # "I can see Amicus's eyes glistening, but he stubbornly continues to smile."
    "Veo brillar los ojos de Amicus, pero él sigue sonriendo obstinadamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:317
translate spanish end_game2_dfa727db:

    # a "\"You won't need my help. You're fully capable on your own. Besides, we'll see each other again as soon as your series of planned steps are completed.\""
    a "\"No necesitarás mi ayuda. Eres perfectamente capaz de hacerlo solo. Además, volveremos a vernos en cuanto completes la serie de pasos planeados.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:318
translate spanish end_game2_750be4be:

    # "Over the course of eight years."
    "A lo largo de ocho años."

# game/end_game2.rpy:320
translate spanish end_game2_6b9038c7:

    # a "\"And once we reach that point, we'll be able to finally relax and—\""
    a "\"Y una vez que lleguemos a ese punto, por fin podremos relajarnos y...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:321
translate spanish end_game2_97670b48:

    # m "\"But will we?\""
    m "\"¿Pero podremos?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:322
translate spanish end_game2_4be4d5de:

    # "I'm still trying to absorb the idea of a years-long mission, a mission that involves introducing all of Earth to the idea of sapient life beyond our planet."
    "Todavía intento asimilar la idea de una misión de años, una misión que implica presentar a toda la Tierra la existencia de vida sapiente fuera de nuestro planeta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:323
translate spanish end_game2_eb272b36:

    # "That idea is harrowing enough, but after being strung along by the parents like this, I have to wonder..."
    "Esa idea ya es bastante angustiosa, pero después de que los Padres nos hayan llevado de un lado a otro así, no puedo evitar preguntarme..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:324
translate spanish end_game2_981d7d93:

    # m "\"It seems like after we accomplish every step, there's a bigger one right after.\""
    m "\"Parece que, cada vez que completamos un paso, hay otro mayor justo después.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:325
translate spanish end_game2_a898dd3f:

    # "I feel my heart rate pick up, but rather than becoming angry, I'm feeling kind of desperate."
    "Siento acelerarse mi corazón, pero en lugar de enfadarme me siento algo desesperado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:326
translate spanish end_game2_9aa60d66:

    # m "\"How much more are they gonna ask from us? This whole thing is just...puppeteering. We're not in control of anything at all!\""
    m "\"¿Cuánto más van a pedirnos? Todo esto es...tratarnos como marionetas. ¡No controlamos absolutamente nada!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:328
translate spanish end_game2_9e17ba4d:

    # a "\"[mc]...\""
    a "\"[mc]...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:329
translate spanish end_game2_e82ff981:

    # "Amicus reaches out to me as I stand up."
    "Amicus extiende una mano hacia mí cuando me levanto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:330
translate spanish end_game2_9125143f:

    # a "\"Please, I know this is hard. I've been trying to figure out a way not to drag you into this, but the parents seem intent—\""
    a "\"Por favor, sé que es difícil. He intentado encontrar una forma de no meterte en esto, pero los Padres parecen decididos—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:331
translate spanish end_game2_8aa4a3a0:

    # m "\"This isn't fair, though! We paid our dues...I fucking DIED!\""
    m "\"¡Pero no es justo! Hemos pagado nuestra parte...¡Joder, yo MORÍ!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:332
translate spanish end_game2_9f3987e1:

    # "Again, I sound like a little kid."
    "Vuelvo a sonar como un niño pequeño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:333
translate spanish end_game2_65bd5da1:

    # "I can't help myself."
    "No puedo evitarlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:334
translate spanish end_game2_556a477b:

    # "This really isn't fair at all."
    "Esto no es justo en absoluto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:335
translate spanish end_game2_be4f33bc:

    # "I didn't ask for any of this."
    "Yo no pedí nada de esto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:336
translate spanish end_game2_0958e2d5:

    # "Originally, I had Amicus to blame."
    "Al principio podía culpar a Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:337
translate spanish end_game2_f5d26e5a:

    # "He was the one that brought me here in the first place."
    "Él fue quien me trajo aquí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:338
translate spanish end_game2_fed64c3c:

    # "Now though, knowing that everything was planned and orchestrated by the parents...I feel powerless, like I didn't have any choice from the very beginning."
    "Pero ahora, sabiendo que los Padres lo planearon y organizaron todo...me siento impotente, como si nunca hubiera podido elegir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:339
translate spanish end_game2_81558108:

    # m "\"I don't even have a say in this...\""
    m "\"Ni siquiera tengo voz en esto...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:341
translate spanish end_game2_357acd82:

    # a "\"But you do! I haven't gotten to that part yet.\""
    a "\"¡Sí que la tienes! Todavía no he llegado a esa parte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:342
translate spanish end_game2_628def40:

    # "Amicus has his paws raised, and I can see that he's still trying to hold back tears."
    "Amicus tiene las manos levantadas y veo que sigue intentando contener las lágrimas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:343
translate spanish end_game2_a760ebeb:

    # "I want to lash out at something, but I know this isn't his fault, especially now, so I try to calm myself, taking a few deep breaths and swallowing hard."
    "Quiero desquitarme con algo, pero sé que no es culpa suya, sobre todo ahora, así que intento calmarme, respirando hondo varias veces y tragando saliva con dificultad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:345
translate spanish end_game2_bce3d6e6:

    # a "\"They told me that you can make a decision, just as I made mine.\""
    a "\"Me dijeron que puedes tomar una decisión, igual que yo tomé la mía.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:346
translate spanish end_game2_a7f00c9c:

    # "I'm quiet for a moment, still breathing heavily."
    "Guardo silencio un momento, todavía respirando con fuerza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:347
translate spanish end_game2_753ece1c:

    # a "\"You can choose not to accept the mission. They will not force you to do it. We have around nine months before the mission begins.\""
    a "\"Puedes decidir no aceptar la misión. No te obligarán a hacerla. Tenemos unos nueve meses antes de que empiece.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:348
translate spanish end_game2_210a946a:

    # "I stare at the wolf, letting those words sink in."
    "Miro al lobo y dejo que esas palabras calen en mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:349
translate spanish end_game2_5a1d1c0a:

    # m "\"And...and if I don't accept? What are the consequences?\""
    m "\"Y...¿y si no acepto? ¿Cuáles son las consecuencias?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:350
translate spanish end_game2_fde41635:

    # "That deep frown returns to Amicus's face."
    "La profunda expresión triste vuelve al rostro de Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:352
translate spanish end_game2_1e607857:

    # a "\"Well...they won't provide transport back to Earth. Of course, I'll likely be able to set it up for you now, but considering that the integration will be delayed...I would be disallowed from returning to see you.\""
    a "\"Bueno...no proporcionarán transporte a la Tierra. Claro que ahora probablemente pueda organizarlo yo, pero, como la integración se retrasaría...me prohibirían volver a verte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:353
translate spanish end_game2_0b79c47e:

    # "More manipulation."
    "Más manipulación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:354
translate spanish end_game2_12215d3d:

    # "I clench my hands into fists, willing the parents, wherever the fuck they are, to feel my anger toward them for doing this to us."
    "Aprieto las manos en puños, deseando que los Padres, estén donde coño estén, sientan mi ira contra ellos por hacernos esto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:355
translate spanish end_game2_763230a1:

    # "I half-expect my throat to just explode right then and there and send a shower of blood over Amicus who's still sitting in front of me."
    "Casi espero que la garganta me explote allí mismo y salpique de sangre a Amicus, que sigue sentado delante de mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:356
translate spanish end_game2_403db639:

    # m "\"So either I do what they say, or I never see you again?\""
    m "\"¿Así que hago lo que dicen o no vuelvo a verte nunca?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:358
translate spanish end_game2_9c746b8d:

    # a "\"Well...you could choose not to return to Earth. I am not suggesting that be your decision, but it is one of the possibilities.\""
    a "\"Bueno...podrías decidir no volver a la Tierra. No te estoy sugiriendo que lo hagas, pero es una de las posibilidades.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:359
translate spanish end_game2_599a4f50:

    # "I look away, never having been so unsure of what to do in my life."
    "Aparto la mirada; nunca en mi vida he estado tan inseguro sobre qué hacer."

# game/end_game2.rpy:360
translate spanish end_game2_e4c2de1d:

    # "This all feels so wrong."
    "Todo esto se siente tan mal."

# game/end_game2.rpy:361
translate spanish end_game2_e40573ca:

    # "I'd always felt wrong about the parents, but I'd never suspected {i}this{/i}."
    "Siempre había sentido que algo no iba bien con los Padres, pero nunca había sospechado {i}esto{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:363
translate spanish end_game2_4c30ac82:

    # m "\"I—I need to go think about this.\""
    m "\"Y-yo necesito ir a pensar en esto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:365
translate spanish end_game2_acddb55b:

    # "I'm starting to turn away when Amicus abruptly stands up."
    "Empiezo a darme la vuelta cuando Amicus se levanta de golpe."

# game/end_game2.rpy:366
translate spanish end_game2_2a69a45f:

    # "I think he's going to come after me, maybe wrap me up in another hug."
    "Creo que va a seguirme, quizá a envolverme en otro abrazo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:367
translate spanish end_game2_144064f4:

    # "Instead, he keeps his paws behind his back, looking at me with an expression of stoic duty."
    "Pero mantiene las manos detrás de la espalda y me mira con una expresión de deber impasible."

# game/end_game2.rpy:369
translate spanish end_game2_bbde8ffd:

    # a "\"Alright, I'll be heading out to the city for part of the day to visit with a triumvirate...and whatever you choose, [mc], I will fully support you.\""
    a "\"Está bien. Iré a la ciudad parte del día para reunirme con un triunviro...y, decidas lo que decidas, [mc], te apoyaré por completo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:370
translate spanish end_game2_9618a47a:

    # "It takes me a moment to realize that Amicus is using his \"official\" face right now, and it's strange to have him use it on me."
    "Tardo un momento en darme cuenta de que Amicus está usando su expresión \"oficial\", y resulta extraño que la use conmigo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:371
translate spanish end_game2_99b83ef7:

    # "Even though I know he's doing it to make things easier for me, to not sway my decision based on his emotions, I hate that he has to do it."
    "Aunque sé que lo hace para facilitármelo, para que sus emociones no influyan en mi decisión, odio que tenga que hacerlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:372
translate spanish end_game2_7216cec5:

    # "I shake my head and turn away, walking out of the room even as I hear Amicus make a strangled noise as he cuts himself off and holds back from saying whatever he was going to say."
    "Niego con la cabeza y salgo de la habitación, incluso mientras oigo a Amicus emitir un sonido ahogado, interrumpiéndose y conteniéndose para no decir lo que iba a decir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:376
translate spanish end_game2_6d989b06:

    # "I walk briskly through the hallways, trying to gather my thoughts."
    "Camino deprisa por los pasillos, intentando ordenar mis pensamientos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:377
translate spanish end_game2_b42ad93b:

    # "I just...want to spend time with Amicus, go back to Earth, see my family, come back to Adastra..."
    "Solo...quiero pasar tiempo con Amicus, volver a la Tierra, ver a mi familia, regresar a Adastra..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:378
translate spanish end_game2_794d043e:

    # "But no, these parents are meddling with my life, seemingly rendering every choice I make meaningless."
    "Pero no: estos Padres se entrometen en mi vida y parecen quitarle todo sentido a cada elección que hago."

# game/end_game2.rpy:379
translate spanish end_game2_09d75d61:

    # "If they can do all and see all, why are they messing with me and Amicus like this?"
    "Si pueden hacerlo y verlo todo, ¿por qué nos tratan así a Amicus y a mí?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:380
translate spanish end_game2_65623900:

    # "I feel another hot flash of anger toward them as I turn a corner and run smack into something soft, furry, and white."
    "Siento otro fogonazo de ira contra ellos al doblar una esquina y chocar de lleno con algo blando, peludo y blanco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:383
translate spanish end_game2_a237968c:

    # unk "\"Oof! What in the name of the gods!?\""
    unk "\"¡Uf! ¿¡Qué, en nombre de los dioses!?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:384
translate spanish end_game2_7d866cf4:

    # "It takes me a moment to recognize the voice, probably because of how disoriented I am from running into him."
    "Tardo un momento en reconocer la voz, seguramente por lo desorientado que me ha dejado el choque."

# game/end_game2.rpy:385
translate spanish end_game2_d86fad64:

    # m "\"Sorry...Cassius.\""
    m "\"Lo siento...Cassius.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:386
translate spanish end_game2_70528eec:

    # "I finally focus on the indignant wolf as he angrily smooths down his fur."
    "Finalmente enfoco la mirada en el lobo indignado, que se alisa el pelo con enfado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:388
translate spanish end_game2_2a0e22d9:

    # c "\"Watch where you're going! You could have knocked me to the floor. You know what a catastrophe that could result in!\""
    c "\"¡Mira por dónde vas! Podrías haberme tirado al suelo. ¡Sabes la catástrofe que eso podría causar!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:389
translate spanish end_game2_4eb5cc91:

    # "Despite his outrage, I'm actually kind of happy to see Cassius back to his old self."
    "A pesar de su indignación, me alegra un poco ver a Cassius otra vez como siempre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:390
translate spanish end_game2_9ca4a036:

    # "Just two days ago he was bed-ridden, though recovering."
    "Hace solo dos días estaba postrado en cama, aunque recuperándose."

# game/end_game2.rpy:391
translate spanish end_game2_361a3f9c:

    # "A combination of Virginia inducing him to vomit and a quick delivery of an antidote left Cassius in a position to fully recover."
    "Virginia lo hizo vomitar y un antídoto llegó rápidamente; la combinación permitió que Cassius pudiera recuperarse por completo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:392
translate spanish end_game2_b297e991:

    # m "\"Hello to you too, Cass.\""
    m "\"Hola a ti también, Cass.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:393
translate spanish end_game2_f32b5277:

    # "Cassius fixes me with a narrow-eyed glare."
    "Cassius me clava una mirada entrecerrada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:395
translate spanish end_game2_d9b06f11:

    # c "\"Since when did I give you permission to use my shortened name, human?\""
    c "\"¿Desde cuándo te he dado permiso para abreviar mi nombre, humano?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:396
translate spanish end_game2_0a23efe4:

    # "I shrug, simply adjusting my robe after having it disheveled from the collision."
    "Me encojo de hombros y simplemente me arreglo la túnica, descolocada por el choque."

# game/end_game2.rpy:397
translate spanish end_game2_36eb5885:

    # m "\"How are you feeling?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo te encuentras?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:399
translate spanish end_game2_07b191f7:

    # c "\"Changing the subject, I see. Well never mind. I'm feeling fine, thank you. I can at least eat solid foods now without retching, though I doubt I'll ever be able to drink wine again without doing so.\""
    c "\"Cambiando de tema, ya veo. Bueno, da igual. Me encuentro bien, gracias. Al menos ya puedo comer alimentos sólidos sin arcadas, aunque dudo que vuelva a poder beber vino sin tenerlas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:400
translate spanish end_game2_623e858c:

    # m "\"I'm sorry to hear that.\""
    m "\"Siento oír eso.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:402
translate spanish end_game2_c389f91d:

    # c "\"I'm sure you are.\""
    c "\"Estoy seguro de que sí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:403
translate spanish end_game2_4f6bc2a8:

    # "I shake my head, wondering why the wolf has to be so sour all the time."
    "Niego con la cabeza, preguntándome por qué el lobo tiene que estar siempre tan amargado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:404
translate spanish end_game2_f364dae6:

    # "Maybe it's a side-effect of always being second-in-line for everything."
    "Quizá sea un efecto de ser siempre el segundo en todo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:405
translate spanish end_game2_f62e233b:

    # "I see something similar in Neferu, they just go about handling it differently."
    "Veo algo parecido en Neferu; simplemente lo afrontan de otra manera."

# game/end_game2.rpy:406
translate spanish end_game2_4f387644:

    # "Maybe it's also because of his illness, always seen as weak and needing help, and he reacted by being a dick."
    "Quizá también sea por su enfermedad: siempre lo consideran débil y necesitado de ayuda, y él reaccionó comportándose como un capullo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:407
translate spanish end_game2_75512a28:

    # "Then again, it could just be because he {i}is{/i} a dick."
    "Aunque también podría ser simplemente porque {i}es{/i} un capullo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:408
translate spanish end_game2_c1f695ab:

    # m "\"So, uh, what are your plans now that—\""
    m "\"Entonces, eh, ¿cuáles son tus planes ahora que—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:410
translate spanish end_game2_c59ee696:

    # c "\"—Now that I've abdicated the throne and am leaving in disgrace?\""
    c "\"—Ahora que he abdicado y me marcho deshonrado?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:411
translate spanish end_game2_cd210691:

    # m "\"You're not leaving in disgrace, I think the people are going to be really—\""
    m "\"No te marchas deshonrado; creo que la gente va a estar muy—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:412
translate spanish end_game2_3d85ed27:

    # c "\"I'm already being made fun of for being one of the shortest serving emperors in the history of the empire. I'm the main topic in all of the comedies at the moment.\""
    c "\"Ya se burlan de mí por ser uno de los emperadores de reinado más corto de la historia del imperio. Ahora soy el tema principal de todas las comedias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:413
translate spanish end_game2_d1171c7d:

    # m "\"Ah.\""
    m "\"Ah.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:415
translate spanish end_game2_07f0be09:

    # "Cassius takes in a deep breath, closing his eyes."
    "Cassius respira hondo y cierra los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:417
translate spanish end_game2_cbf85703:

    # c "\"Anyway, [mc], I wanted to thank you.\""
    c "\"En fin, [mc], quería darte las gracias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:418
translate spanish end_game2_34dd85e0:

    # "I almost get whiplash from the sudden change in tone and topic."
    "El cambio tan brusco de tono y de tema casi me da un latigazo cervical."

# game/end_game2.rpy:419
translate spanish end_game2_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:421
translate spanish end_game2_f14c34eb:

    # c "\"Oh, don't make me say it again. I'm simply thankful for you putting the empire on a course that is...somewhat tolerable, at least.\""
    c "\"Oh, no me hagas repetirlo. Simplemente te agradezco que hayas puesto al imperio en un rumbo...algo tolerable, al menos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:422
translate spanish end_game2_6251f340:

    # m "\"As opposed to being ruled by Cato?\""
    m "\"¿En lugar de que lo gobernara Cato?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:424
translate spanish end_game2_e064fbf4:

    # c "\"Yes. While I might not believe that my brother is what is best for the empire, at least he cares for it, and I suppose that's all that I can hope for.\""
    c "\"Sí. Aunque quizá no crea que mi hermano sea lo mejor para el imperio, al menos se preocupa por él, y supongo que eso es todo lo que puedo esperar.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:425
translate spanish end_game2_22a21ada:

    # m "\"Weren't you negotiating a position with Amicus?\""
    m "\"¿No estabas negociando un cargo con Amicus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:427
translate spanish end_game2_e4b3eda3:

    # "Cassius looks at me suspiciously, though I have no idea why."
    "Cassius me mira con desconfianza, aunque no tengo ni idea de por qué."

# game/end_game2.rpy:428
translate spanish end_game2_2352acfd:

    # "I suppose having almost being assassinated and also being sabotaged by everyone in the palace has made him a bit wary."
    "Supongo que haber estado a punto de ser asesinado y que todos en el palacio hayan intentado sabotearlo lo ha vuelto algo desconfiado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:429
translate spanish end_game2_f62f0546:

    # c "\"I suppose he'll tell you anyway, so yes, I'm looking to become the Chief of Social Affairs.\""
    c "\"Supongo que te lo contará de todas formas, así que sí: aspiro a ser el director de Asuntos Sociales.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:430
translate spanish end_game2_9244ed78:

    # "He rolls his eyes at my lack of reaction."
    "Pone los ojos en blanco ante mi falta de reacción."

# game/end_game2.rpy:432
translate spanish end_game2_37fe3af9:

    # c "\"In other words, I will be making sure that Adastra's most vulnerable are taken care of, that all will someday receive the financial, social, and especially medical care that they need.\""
    c "\"En otras palabras, me aseguraré de que se cuide a los más vulnerables de Adastra, de que algún día todos reciban la ayuda económica, social y, sobre todo, médica que necesitan.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:433
translate spanish end_game2_6e10c4fe:

    # "I perk up."
    "Me animo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:434
translate spanish end_game2_bda8bda6:

    # m "\"Oh good! That's kind of what you were all about with your campaigning, right?\""
    m "\"¡Oh, bien! Eso era más o menos lo que defendías durante tu campaña, ¿no?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:436
translate spanish end_game2_36f90952:

    # c "\"Yes, it will be nice to focus all my energy on that rather than the bothersome politics that come with being emperor. I don't envy Amicus.\""
    c "\"Sí, será agradable centrar toda mi energía en eso en lugar de en la molesta política que conlleva ser emperador. No envidio a Amicus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:437
translate spanish end_game2_fae1d549:

    # "He eyes me closely."
    "Me observa detenidamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:439
translate spanish end_game2_55a29d8c:

    # c "\"I know you're very close with him, so please, if I must ask anything of you, it's to make sure that he does not forget those outside the Triumvir Cities.\""
    c "\"Sé que estás muy unido a él, así que, por favor, si debo pedirte algo, es que te asegures de que no olvide a quienes viven fuera de las Ciudades de los Triunviros.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:440
translate spanish end_game2_d0113423:

    # c "\"Their situation is desperate, and if we are truly going to reap fortune from an alliance, then they should be the first to benefit, not the Adastran elites.\""
    c "\"Su situación es desesperada, y si de verdad vamos a obtener prosperidad de una alianza, ellos deben ser los primeros beneficiados, no las élites de Adastra.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:441
translate spanish end_game2_39d5b9db:

    # "It's one of those rare moments that Cassius is being completely genuine with me, so I nod earnestly."
    "Es uno de esos raros momentos en que Cassius es completamente sincero conmigo, así que asiento con seriedad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:442
translate spanish end_game2_83b24450:

    # m "\"Of course.\""
    m "\"Por supuesto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:443
translate spanish end_game2_0be0c35c:

    # "I also plan on making sure that Amicus remembers the wolven children, and to right the wrongs of what the past rulers had done to them."
    "También pienso asegurarme de que Amicus recuerde a los Hijos de los lobos y corrija las injusticias que les hicieron los gobernantes anteriores."

# game/end_game2.rpy:445
translate spanish end_game2_89bcea3a:

    # "There's a lull in the conversation, and I try to think of something to say, to thank Cassius for in return."
    "La conversación se detiene, e intento pensar en algo que decir, algo que agradecerle a Cassius a cambio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:446
translate spanish end_game2_123574dc:

    # m "\"And, um, thank you for understanding our position, for deciding to step down when we asked.\""
    m "\"Y, eh, gracias por entender nuestra postura y por decidir abdicar cuando te lo pedimos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:448
translate spanish end_game2_7741584b:

    # c "\"You threatened me with outright humiliation if I did not.\""
    c "\"Me amenazasteis con una humillación absoluta si no lo hacía.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:449
translate spanish end_game2_6c538681:

    # "I try to hold in a sigh of my own at the wolf's frustrating attitude, even if my attempt at some form of diplomacy with him was clumsy."
    "Intento contener mi propio suspiro ante la frustrante actitud del lobo, aunque mi intento de hacer algo de diplomacia con él fuera torpe."

# game/end_game2.rpy:450
translate spanish end_game2_3bf5aa36:

    # m "\"Yeah, well, thanks anyway.\""
    m "\"Sí, bueno, gracias de todos modos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:452
translate spanish end_game2_276a9304:

    # "Cassius grunts noncommittally, then looks past me."
    "Cassius gruñe sin comprometerse y después mira más allá de mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:453
translate spanish end_game2_1f2153c9:

    # c "\"Anyway, I must be going to the city. I have an appointment.\""
    c "\"En fin, debo ir a la ciudad. Tengo una cita.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:454
translate spanish end_game2_0a95e931:

    # "That's when I remember Alex."
    "Entonces recuerdo a Alex."

# game/end_game2.rpy:455
translate spanish end_game2_de606041:

    # "I never did see Cassius's reaction to finding out about the cat's treachery."
    "Nunca llegué a ver cómo reaccionó Cassius al descubrir la traición del gato."

# game/end_game2.rpy:456
translate spanish end_game2_2a2a54a1:

    # "Amicus had been furious when I told him, and I'd practically had to hold him back from marching out into the gardens and strangling the cat himself."
    "Amicus se enfureció cuando se lo conté; prácticamente tuve que sujetarlo para impedir que fuera a los jardines a estrangular al gato él mismo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:457
translate spanish end_game2_ea4b358e:

    # "He was especially furious when I told him that I'd made a deal with Alex to keep him from facing the consequences of sabotaging the entire empire."
    "Se enfureció sobre todo al saber que había hecho un trato con Alex para evitar que afrontara las consecuencias de sabotear al imperio entero."

# game/end_game2.rpy:458
translate spanish end_game2_a40b1901:

    # "Amicus had settled on banishing Alexios from the palace, to some high-security apartments in the center of Adastra City."
    "Amicus decidió expulsar a Alexios del palacio y enviarlo a unos apartamentos de alta seguridad en el centro de la ciudad de Adastra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:459
translate spanish end_game2_9b0b067a:

    # "Cassius has been visiting him there ever since."
    "Cassius lo visita allí desde entonces."

# game/end_game2.rpy:460
translate spanish end_game2_843caba9:

    # "While I don't know what the state of their relationship is, I suppose even high treason isn't enough to stop Cassius from seeing the cat again."
    "Aunque no sé en qué estado está su relación, supongo que ni la alta traición basta para impedir que Cassius vuelva a ver al gato."

# game/end_game2.rpy:461
translate spanish end_game2_f5473994:

    # "They must be pretty close, even closer than I'd initially thought."
    "Deben de estar muy unidos, incluso más de lo que había pensado al principio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:462
translate spanish end_game2_66edc6d8:

    # "I'm curious, but stop myself from asking, as I know that would only lead to more glares and sneers from the wolf."
    "Tengo curiosidad, pero me contengo de preguntar porque sé que solo provocaría más miradas de desprecio del lobo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:464
translate spanish end_game2_0745edb7:

    # "So instead I bow and step aside, a bit surprised when Cassius bows in return, even if it's mostly just a half-hearted nod."
    "Así que, en lugar de eso, hago una reverencia y me aparto, algo sorprendido cuando Cassius me la devuelve, aunque sea sobre todo un gesto de cabeza sin entusiasmo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:466
translate spanish end_game2_600c20fe:

    # "I watch the white wolf disappear out through the main entrance, and I wait a few moments before taking the same route out into the gardens."
    "Veo al lobo blanco desaparecer por la entrada principal y espero unos momentos antes de tomar el mismo camino hacia los jardines."

# game/end_game2.rpy:470
translate spanish end_game2_c2f8da65:

    # "While the conversation with Cassius had distracted me for a bit, my mind wanders back to what Amicus had just told me."
    "Aunque la conversación con Cassius me distrajo un rato, mi mente vuelve a lo que acaba de contarme Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:471
translate spanish end_game2_3bff8ca6:

    # "I can't stop the feeling of constriction that seems to wrap around me, bound to the will of these supposedly all-knowing creatures."
    "No puedo detener la sensación de opresión que parece rodearme, atado a la voluntad de aquellos seres supuestamente omniscientes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:472
translate spanish end_game2_c575c8ee:

    # "I sit for a while on a bench, contemplating everything while my hand absently caresses my repaired neck."
    "Me siento un rato en un banco a reflexionar sobre todo, mientras mi mano acaricia distraídamente mi cuello reparado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:473
translate spanish end_game2_e7938bcb:

    # "I'd pressed a bit harder against the skin a few times, and didn't like the unfamiliar shapes and edges that I felt."
    "Había presionado la piel algo más fuerte varias veces y no me gustaron las formas y bordes desconocidos que noté."

# game/end_game2.rpy:474
translate spanish end_game2_511ea7b4:

    # "I'd asked Amicus how the parents had done it, how they had the time to place the machinery in my neck, and also make me start breathing again."
    "Le pregunté a Amicus cómo lo habían hecho los Padres, cómo habían tenido tiempo de colocar los mecanismos en mi cuello y hacer que volviera a respirar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:475
translate spanish end_game2_47731c6b:

    # "But it turns out it's one of those parental-tech things that no one really understands."
    "Pero resulta que es una de esas cosas de la tecnología de los Padres que nadie entiende de verdad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:476
translate spanish end_game2_f2015377:

    # "It seemed to have happened instantaneously, as if I'd been whisked away somewhere else to have surgery before being placed back in the archives."
    "Parecía haber ocurrido al instante, como si me hubieran llevado a otro lugar para operarme antes de devolverme a los archivos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:477
translate spanish end_game2_b85396ef:

    # "Apparently when Amicus's father had asked the parents to restore Cato's sight, it had just happened overnight, the old wolf surprising everyone when he walked into the dining room with his brand new visor."
    "Al parecer, cuando el padre de Amicus les pidió a los Padres que devolvieran la vista a Cato, sucedió de la noche a la mañana: el viejo lobo sorprendió a todos al entrar en el comedor con su visor nuevo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:478
translate spanish end_game2_91b8c6f2:

    # "That had been over a decade ago."
    "Eso había ocurrido hacía más de una década."

# game/end_game2.rpy:479
translate spanish end_game2_4397a5a3:

    # "And that gets me wondering why the parents did that if they knew Cato would go on to do the things he did."
    "Y eso me hace preguntarme por qué lo hicieron si sabían lo que Cato acabaría haciendo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:480
translate spanish end_game2_1354e0f2:

    # "He blatantly got in the way of their plans."
    "Se interpuso descaradamente en sus planes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:481
translate spanish end_game2_022bac52:

    # "Why would they let him hold such an influential position in the empire, let alone restore his vision?"
    "¿Por qué le permitirían ocupar un puesto tan influyente en el imperio, y mucho menos devolverle la vista?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:482
translate spanish end_game2_b4ba0485:

    # "{i}Interference is to be kept to a minimum{/i} — I can practically hear the monitor say."
    "{i}La intervención debe mantenerse al mínimo{/i} —casi puedo oír decir al Monitor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:483
translate spanish end_game2_f749c0de:

    # "I sigh, just sort of wishing that the parents didn't exist at all, that this {i}Other{/i} wasn't eating at the edges of our universe, which is apparently the root of all of this."
    "Suspiro, deseando simplemente que los Padres no existieran en absoluto y que este {i}Otro{/i} no estuviera devorando los bordes de nuestro universo, lo que al parecer es la raíz de todo esto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:484
translate spanish end_game2_984fc457:

    # "That's something else that I don't understand."
    "Eso es otra cosa que no entiendo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:485
translate spanish end_game2_d87ad4f1:

    # "From what I gathered, the {i}Galaxias{/i} had already known about the Other, just vaguely."
    "Por lo que he podido averiguar, la {i}Galaxias{/i} ya sabía del Otro, aunque vagamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:486
translate spanish end_game2_be0c3486:

    # "Amicus had almost described it to me when I first arrived here and had been told that all life originated from the same source...except for the Other."
    "Amicus estuvo a punto de describírmelo cuando llegué y me dijeron que toda la vida se originó en la misma fuente...salvo el Otro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:487
translate spanish end_game2_2d9e80af:

    # "A different type of life, so different from {i}us{/i} that we can barely understand {i}them{/i}."
    "Un tipo de vida distinto, tan diferente de {i}nosotros{/i} que apenas podemos comprender a {i}ellos{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:488
translate spanish end_game2_ec56416a:

    # "But now we know that they're out to get us, or something."
    "Pero ahora sabemos que vienen a por nosotros, o algo parecido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:489
translate spanish end_game2_5158943f:

    # "I just can't help but feel so distant from all of this, the result of the struggle between us and them being millennia away."
    "No puedo evitar sentirme muy distante de todo esto: el resultado de la lucha entre nosotros y ellos está a milenios de distancia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:490
translate spanish end_game2_7e92c690:

    # "We don't even know {i}how{/i} many millennia."
    "Ni siquiera sabemos {i}cuántos{/i} milenios."

# game/end_game2.rpy:491
translate spanish end_game2_663a3569:

    # "As I'm becoming more and more depressed over all of this, I hear footsteps on the path."
    "Mientras todo esto me deprime cada vez más, oigo pasos en el sendero."

# game/end_game2.rpy:492
translate spanish end_game2_ccef79e2:

    # "I look up, half-expecting to see Alex, even as I remember he's been banished from the palace."
    "Alzo la vista, esperando casi ver a Alex, incluso mientras recuerdo que lo han expulsado del palacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:493
translate spanish end_game2_0b3d1b17:

    # "It's Neferu, and he's strolling along the pathways, paws behind his back with his usual suave smile plastered on his muzzle."
    "Es Neferu: pasea por los senderos con las manos detrás de la espalda y su habitual sonrisa elegante en el hocico."

# game/end_game2.rpy:494
translate spanish end_game2_9ace4164:

    # "I have to wonder how he keeps that expression on all the time, as it's clear he doesn't see me until he comes a bit closer."
    "Me pregunto cómo mantiene siempre esa expresión, porque está claro que no me ve hasta acercarse un poco más."

# game/end_game2.rpy:495
translate spanish end_game2_5ae1c4e2:

    # "When he does spot me, his ears flick up and I get a glimpse of white teeth as his smile broadens."
    "Cuando me descubre, sus orejas se alzan y veo un destello de dientes blancos al ensancharse su sonrisa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:496
translate spanish end_game2_6e9a8576:

    # "I smile back, even though I'm not in the best mood to chat at the moment."
    "Le devuelvo la sonrisa, aunque ahora no estoy de demasiado buen humor para charlar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:497
translate spanish end_game2_2c6e8da1:

    # "Still, I scoot over to make room on the bench, and Neferu greets me with a bow along with a \"Ahhotep be with you\" before he sits next to me, crossing one leg over the other."
    "Aun así me aparto para hacerle sitio en el banco; Neferu me saluda con una reverencia y un \"Que Ahhotep te acompañe\" antes de sentarse a mi lado, cruzando una pierna sobre la otra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:499
translate spanish end_game2_0a432623:

    # n "\"Beautiful day.\""
    n "\"Un día hermoso.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:500
translate spanish end_game2_6e7dcc8a:

    # "He says it wistfully, and I just nod in agreement."
    "Lo dice con aire soñador, y yo simplemente asiento."

# game/end_game2.rpy:502
translate spanish end_game2_4f0c5f4c:

    # n "\"Though I can see that you're not enjoying it as much as I am. Is everything alright, [mc]?\""
    n "\"Aunque veo que no lo disfrutas tanto como yo. ¿Está todo bien, [mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:503
translate spanish end_game2_5d1f8647:

    # "I'm about to give him a generic answer before I sigh, leaning back on the bench."
    "Estoy a punto de darle una respuesta genérica, pero suspiro y me recuesto en el banco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:504
translate spanish end_game2_54015def:

    # m "\"No...no, not really, Neferu.\""
    m "\"No...no del todo, Neferu.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:506
translate spanish end_game2_bf3db091:

    # n "\"Ah, I find that a bit surprising considering the way things have gone the past few days.\""
    n "\"Ah, me sorprende un poco, teniendo en cuenta cómo han ido las cosas estos últimos días.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:507
translate spanish end_game2_8619f2c6:

    # "I shrug."
    "Me encojo de hombros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:508
translate spanish end_game2_d2976e4a:

    # m "\"I mean, aside from almost dying, I guess everything here is good, but out there—\""
    m "\"Quiero decir, aparte de que casi me muero, supongo que aquí todo está bien, pero ahí fuera—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:509
translate spanish end_game2_0b8d64ac:

    # "I nod up at the sky, at space."
    "Señalo con la cabeza el cielo, el espacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:510
translate spanish end_game2_a0c62d5e:

    # m "\"I just don't know what to do.\""
    m "\"Simplemente no sé qué hacer.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:512
translate spanish end_game2_8420473b:

    # n "\"Perhaps I could offer some advice?\""
    n "\"¿Quizá pueda darte algún consejo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:513
translate spanish end_game2_fe10ab79:

    # m "\"Uh...\""
    m "\"Eh...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:514
translate spanish end_game2_c985aa82:

    # "I remember that Amicus had told me to keep the revelations about human civilization a secret, at least until the parents give further instruction."
    "Recuerdo que Amicus me dijo que mantuviera en secreto las revelaciones sobre la civilización humana, al menos hasta que los Padres dieran más instrucciones."

# game/end_game2.rpy:515
translate spanish end_game2_a35ef469:

    # m "\"I don't know. I think I'm just stressed about going home, about how I'm gonna do it, ya know?\""
    m "\"No sé. Creo que me estresa volver a casa, cómo voy a hacerlo, ¿sabes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:517
translate spanish end_game2_2c01e597:

    # n "\"Ah, I definitely understand, for I am in a similar boat. Unfortunately, I have little advice on that particular matter.\""
    n "\"Ah, lo entiendo perfectamente; estoy en una situación parecida. Por desgracia, tengo pocos consejos sobre ese asunto concreto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:518
translate spanish end_game2_65e307a9:

    # "I glance over at him, watching as he rhythmically bounces a black foot about, wiggling the toes and claws."
    "Lo miro, observando cómo mueve rítmicamente un pie negro, agitando los dedos y las garras."

# game/end_game2.rpy:519
translate spanish end_game2_bfb739ef:

    # m "\"Is Khemia still pissed about what happened?\""
    m "\"¿Khemia sigue cabreada por lo que pasó?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:521
translate spanish end_game2_ef902cd9:

    # n "\"Oh yes, furious. They're still threatening to cut all diplomatic relations with Adastra if Amicus doesn't make things right somehow.\""
    n "\"Oh, sí, furiosa. Siguen amenazando con romper todas las relaciones diplomáticas con Adastra si Amicus no arregla las cosas de alguna manera.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:522
translate spanish end_game2_77f4659f:

    # m "\"Make things right?\""
    m "\"¿Arreglar las cosas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:524
translate spanish end_game2_40c090ab:

    # n "\"Yes, despite the fact that my family very nearly despises me, they actually despise that our name has been sullied by wolven disrespect.\""
    n "\"Sí. Aunque mi familia casi me desprecia, lo que realmente desprecia es que la falta de respeto de los lobos haya manchado nuestro nombre.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:525
translate spanish end_game2_e5f5675c:

    # m "\"How you were almost executed?\""
    m "\"¿Porque casi te ejecutaron?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:527
translate spanish end_game2_7b51d250:

    # n "\"That, and also the fact that Cato released the footage of his attack on my person before the scheduled execution. It's been in heavy rotation on the news channels ever since.\""
    n "\"Eso, y también que Cato difundió las imágenes de su ataque contra mí antes de la ejecución prevista. Desde entonces no dejan de repetirlas en los canales de noticias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:528
translate spanish end_game2_89357ba6:

    # m "\"Oh...\""
    m "\"Ah...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:529
translate spanish end_game2_ab47f2cb:

    # "I haven't watched much Adastran TV after seeing the reenactments of my own death, so I guess I've been missing Neferu getting kicked in the balls over and over again."
    "No he visto mucha televisión de Adastra desde las recreaciones de mi muerte, así que supongo que me he perdido a Neferu recibiendo patadas en los huevos una y otra vez."

# game/end_game2.rpy:530
translate spanish end_game2_90beb000:

    # m "\"Uh...well, you know wolves. They just like any sort of drama.\""
    m "\"Eh...bueno, ya conoces a los lobos. Les encanta cualquier drama.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:532
translate spanish end_game2_ea693e66:

    # n "\"It's been spread across the entire {i}Galaxias{/i}. I suppose seeing a Khemian in such a position is rather amusing to everyone, siblings and children alike.\""
    n "\"Se ha difundido por todo el {i}Galaxias{/i}. Supongo que ver a un Khemiano en semejante posición les resulta bastante divertido a todos, tanto Hermanos como Hijos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:533
translate spanish end_game2_70b8d467:

    # "I look over at Neferu again, but his light, care-free demeanor continues as he simply seems to be soaking in the scenery."
    "Vuelvo a mirar a Neferu, pero mantiene su aire ligero y despreocupado; parece limitarse a disfrutar del paisaje."

# game/end_game2.rpy:534
translate spanish end_game2_aaaf2aef:

    # m "\"Are you doing alright?\""
    m "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:536
translate spanish end_game2_a5f89165:

    # "Neferu looks at me then, smile becoming a bit more warm."
    "Neferu me mira entonces, con una sonrisa algo más cálida."

# game/end_game2.rpy:538
translate spanish end_game2_d577863d:

    # n "\"I am fine, [mc], but if I'm being truthful, I {i}am{/i} embarrassed, but that's nothing new for me.\""
    n "\"Estoy bien, [mc], pero, si soy sincero, {i}sí{/i} estoy avergonzado; aunque eso no es nada nuevo para mí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:539
translate spanish end_game2_e499761a_1:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:540
translate spanish end_game2_f9eefcb4:

    # m "\"I can count the number of times I've seen you embarrassed on one hand, Neferu. You're downright shameless.\""
    m "\"Puedo contar con una mano las veces que te he visto avergonzado, Neferu. No tienes ninguna vergüenza.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:541
translate spanish end_game2_4012b079:

    # "I smile to lighten the words, and Neferu just chuckles."
    "Sonrío para suavizar las palabras, y Neferu simplemente ríe."

# game/end_game2.rpy:543
translate spanish end_game2_5172f9fb:

    # n "\"You probably know by this point that I'm not often genuine. It comes with being a diplomat and the Pharaoh's son.\""
    n "\"Seguramente ya sabes que no suelo ser sincero. Viene con ser diplomático e hijo del Faraón.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:545
translate spanish end_game2_92e8d4a1:

    # "There's a lull in the conversation as we both just watch the gardens, listening to the birds and watching the bees hover from flower to flower."
    "La conversación se detiene mientras ambos contemplamos los jardines, escuchamos a los pájaros y vemos a las abejas volar de flor en flor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:546
translate spanish end_game2_20c75519:

    # "That's when I'm reminded of something."
    "Entonces recuerdo algo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:547
translate spanish end_game2_f0b86e3b:

    # m "\"So...what made the Khemians want to start an alliance? Isn't it pretty groundbreaking for siblings to work together. Like isn't that against the purpose of the {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""
    m "\"Entonces...¿qué hizo que los Khemianos quisieran iniciar una alianza? ¿No es bastante revolucionario que los Hermanos colaboren? ¿No va contra el propósito del {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:548
translate spanish end_game2_1232547c:

    # "I play dumb, like I don't already know it isn't."
    "Me hago el tonto, como si no supiera ya que no es así."

# game/end_game2.rpy:549
translate spanish end_game2_d9d3c2b9:

    # "Neferu quirks an eyebrow at me."
    "Neferu alza una ceja."

# game/end_game2.rpy:551
translate spanish end_game2_eb9e8fab:

    # n "\"That's a surprising question. Well, to put it simply, we studied the earliest histories of the {i}Galaxias{/i} and came to the conclusion that it was never the intent of the parents for us to be competitors.\""
    n "\"Es una pregunta sorprendente. Bueno, dicho sencillamente: estudiamos las primeras historias del {i}Galaxias{/i} y llegamos a la conclusión de que los Padres nunca quisieron que compitiéramos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:552
translate spanish end_game2_e66e99bf:

    # n "\"If you don't know, the goal of a sibling race and its children is to achieve parental status. To do that we must be able to achieve intergalactic travel.\""
    n "\"Por si no lo sabes, el objetivo de una raza Hermana y de sus Hijos es alcanzar la condición de Padres. Para eso debemos lograr viajar entre galaxias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:553
translate spanish end_game2_1f82f7b4:

    # n "\"We're...slowly realizing that this may not be possible without the cooperation of all sapient life in the Galaxy.\""
    n "\"Estamos...comprendiendo poco a poco que quizá no sea posible sin la cooperación de toda la vida sapiente de la galaxia.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:554
translate spanish end_game2_076d574a:

    # "I nod in understanding."
    "Asiento, comprendiéndolo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:555
translate spanish end_game2_0d6df9c5:

    # "So it seems like the Khemians were already hip to this grand plan, either by actually figuring it out themselves, or with the help of their own parent."
    "Así que parece que los Khemianos ya conocían este gran plan, ya fuera porque lo descubrieron por su cuenta o con ayuda de su propio Padre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:556
translate spanish end_game2_f722b24f:

    # "This makes me wonder if they might know more about the thing lingering on the edges of the universe."
    "Eso me hace preguntarme si sabrán más sobre aquello que acecha en los bordes del universo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:557
translate spanish end_game2_3283e36f:

    # m "\"Do you know much about the Other?\""
    m "\"¿Sabes mucho sobre el Otro?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:558
translate spanish end_game2_79d2a3a9:

    # "Now Neferu turns on the bench to really look at me, furrowing his brows."
    "Ahora Neferu se gira en el banco para mirarme de verdad, frunciendo el ceño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:560
translate spanish end_game2_17c1aa78:

    # n "\"Another interesting question. Did you have some sort of experience with the parents when they healed your wounds?\""
    n "\"Otra pregunta interesante. ¿Tuviste alguna experiencia con los Padres cuando curaron tus heridas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:561
translate spanish end_game2_b5dbb0ef:

    # m "\"Uh, yeah, kind of. Just really vague stuff, so I'm just curious about it is all.\""
    m "\"Eh, sí, más o menos. Cosas muy vagas; simplemente tengo curiosidad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:562
translate spanish end_game2_977229b4:

    # "I try to make it sound like it's not a big deal."
    "Intento hacer que suene poco importante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:565
translate spanish end_game2_703661ec:

    # n "\"Hmm...well, it is an...entity that spreads through the universe every few billion years. It originated from somewhere other than the original source of life, the source from which we all came.\""
    n "\"Hmm...bueno, es una...entidad que se extiende por el universo cada pocos miles de millones de años. Se originó en algún lugar distinto de la fuente original de vida, de la que todos procedemos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:566
translate spanish end_game2_0e4ddfa6:

    # "His choice of words is confusing me."
    "Su elección de palabras me confunde."

# game/end_game2.rpy:567
translate spanish end_game2_dc20acbf:

    # m "\"Is it like, alive?\""
    m "\"¿Está, como...vivo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:569
translate spanish end_game2_700f6858:

    # n "\"Is it alive like you and I? No, not really. It is more of a...machine, I suppose. On the edge of life, but it needs sapient life to exist.\""
    n "\"¿Está vivo como tú y yo? No, no exactamente. Es más bien una...máquina, supongo. Está al límite de la vida, pero necesita vida sapiente para existir.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:570
translate spanish end_game2_e350fc39:

    # m "\"Oh, like a virus?\""
    m "\"Oh, ¿como un virus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:572
translate spanish end_game2_8b173763:

    # n "\"Yes, though even viruses originated from the original source. The Other is truly something different.\""
    n "\"Sí, aunque incluso los virus proceden de la fuente original. El Otro es algo verdaderamente distinto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:573
translate spanish end_game2_47275cb7:

    # m "\"And it feeds on life? Our life, I mean?\""
    m "\"¿Y se alimenta de vida? De nuestra vida, quiero decir.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:575
translate spanish end_game2_972a9b6a:

    # n "\"First I should say that what we know about it is very, very limited, and the majority of that information is likely wrong; really just ghost stories.\""
    n "\"Primero debo decir que lo que sabemos es muy, muy limitado, y que probablemente la mayor parte de esa información sea errónea: en realidad, cuentos de fantasmas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:576
translate spanish end_game2_a1e6df79:

    # m "\"Well, what are these ghost stories?\""
    m "\"Bueno, ¿cuáles son esos cuentos de fantasmas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:578
translate spanish end_game2_0d30241f:

    # "Neferu sighs and I realize that he's not exactly interested in this topic."
    "Neferu suspira y me doy cuenta de que no le interesa mucho el tema."

# game/end_game2.rpy:579
translate spanish end_game2_2f6b2350:

    # n "\"How to put it...well, it's thought that in the half dozen or so times that the Other has spread through our part of the universe, it has left behind small, patchy portions of itself.\""
    n "\"Cómo decirlo...bueno, se cree que, en la media docena de ocasiones, más o menos, en que el Otro se extendió por nuestra parte del universo, dejó pequeños fragmentos dispersos de sí mismo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:580
translate spanish end_game2_58235895:

    # n "\"It is technically all around us, but very weak, though it is thought that highly concentrated portions of it attach to tangible things, or occasionally pass through us.\""
    n "\"Técnicamente está a nuestro alrededor, aunque muy debilitado; se cree que sus partes muy concentradas se adhieren a objetos tangibles o, a veces, pasan a través de nosotros.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:581
translate spanish end_game2_5346a6ed:

    # "I feel a little tingle down my spine."
    "Siento un pequeño escalofrío por la espalda."

# game/end_game2.rpy:582
translate spanish end_game2_3ac21f16:

    # m "\"And what does it do?\""
    m "\"¿Y qué hace?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:583
translate spanish end_game2_aafda3e6:

    # "Neferu shakes his head."
    "Neferu niega con la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:585
translate spanish end_game2_5b5ca65a:

    # n "\"I'm sure your people have stories of phenomena that are unexplainable? Perhaps an abandoned building that is inhabited by malicious spirits? Possibly a creature that defies all logical explanation, yet sporadically appears in a particular forest?\""
    n "\"Estoy seguro de que tu gente cuenta historias de fenómenos inexplicables. ¿Quizá un edificio abandonado habitado por espíritus malignos? ¿Tal vez una criatura que desafía toda explicación lógica y aparece de vez en cuando en un bosque concreto?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:586
translate spanish end_game2_703ac1f3:

    # m "\"Wait, like supernatural stuff?\""
    m "\"Espera, ¿cosas sobrenaturales?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:587
translate spanish end_game2_0a855e13:

    # "I give the jackal an incredulous look, and he shrugs and laughs."
    "Miro al chacal con incredulidad; él se encoge de hombros y ríe."

# game/end_game2.rpy:589
translate spanish end_game2_bb9119e6:

    # n "\"So the stories say.\""
    n "\"Eso dicen las historias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:590
translate spanish end_game2_8501494f:

    # n "\"They also say that sapient consciousness is used by the Other to project these manifestations, and that the sapient's reaction to these projections feeds the entity.\""
    n "\"También dicen que el Otro utiliza la conciencia sapiente para proyectar esas manifestaciones, y que la reacción del Sapiente a esas proyecciones alimenta a la entidad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:592
translate spanish end_game2_b954020a:

    # n "\"Personally, I feel that the legends surrounding the Other are simply a catch-all for anything that is feared, or poorly understood...or just the product of a bored society.\""
    n "\"Personalmente, creo que las leyendas sobre el Otro son un cajón de sastre para todo lo temido o mal comprendido...o simplemente el producto de una sociedad aburrida.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:593
translate spanish end_game2_fbed8d77:

    # "I think back to what little I know about ghosts, monsters...even aliens or UFOs, and immediately, the idea is too ridiculous for me to accept."
    "Pienso en lo poco que sé sobre fantasmas, monstruos...incluso extraterrestres u ovnis, y enseguida la idea me parece demasiado ridícula para aceptarla."

# game/end_game2.rpy:594
translate spanish end_game2_73d153b6:

    # m "\"Why haven't I heard of this while I've been here?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué no he oído hablar de esto desde que estoy aquí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:596
translate spanish end_game2_dda1de9f:

    # n "\"You probably have, but just didn't understand the topic at the time. Either way, it's never a serious worry on anyone's mind considering how rarely this entity makes contact with our side of the universe.\""
    n "\"Seguramente sí, pero no comprendiste el tema entonces. En cualquier caso, nadie se preocupa seriamente por ello, teniendo en cuenta lo raro que es que esa entidad entre en contacto con nuestra parte del universo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:598
translate spanish end_game2_ba12d96d:

    # "I just stare at the ground, not really sure of what to say."
    "Me limito a mirar el suelo, sin saber muy bien qué decir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:599
translate spanish end_game2_ae49887e:

    # "Like Neferu, I find myself not very interested in the topic anymore, and our discussion moves on."
    "Como Neferu, descubro que el tema ya no me interesa mucho, y nuestra conversación cambia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:600
translate spanish end_game2_aba5ed15:

    # "We talk of Neferu's plans; when he might return home, and how I might help him secure the alliance."
    "Hablamos de los planes de Neferu: cuándo podría volver a casa y cómo podría ayudarlo a asegurar la alianza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:601
translate spanish end_game2_2375d7f2:

    # "Eventually, he gets up to return to his room for a nap, leaving me to sit on the bench in silence."
    "Al final se levanta para volver a su habitación y dormir una siesta, dejándome sentado en el banco en silencio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:603
translate spanish end_game2_1f2b8b9c:

    # "If I'm being honest, the conversation has left me feeling even less convinced by this intergalactic war the parents are apparently getting ready for."
    "Si soy sincero, la conversación me ha dejado todavía menos convencido de esta guerra intergaláctica para la que al parecer se están preparando los Padres."

# game/end_game2.rpy:604
translate spanish end_game2_c182a8b3:

    # "It sounds more like we're getting ready to fight off an army of space ghosts rather than anything real."
    "Suena más a que nos preparamos para repeler un ejército de fantasmas espaciales que algo real."

# game/end_game2.rpy:605
translate spanish end_game2_1b360c0c:

    # "I sit there for a long while, opening my mind a bit, kind of hoping that the Monitor will swing by and dump a little more information on me that I can work with, even though I know that's not really in his nature."
    "Me quedo allí mucho rato, abriendo un poco mi mente, esperando que el Monitor pase y me dé más información con la que pueda hacer algo, aunque sé que no es su costumbre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:606
translate spanish end_game2_a7cb6344:

    # "Things stay predictably quiet, and as I'm thinking about heading back to Amicus's room to see if he's returned, Com's voice makes me jump."
    "Todo sigue tan tranquilo como era de esperar; mientras pienso en volver a la habitación de Amicus para ver si ha regresado, la voz de Com me sobresalta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:607
translate spanish end_game2_5b8599ca:

    # com "\"Amicus would like to let you know that he is currently in the bath, and if you would like to, you can join him. However, he wants to make it explicitly clear that it is your choice and that if you need more time—\""
    com "\"Amicus quiere informarte de que está en el baño y de que, si quieres, puedes acompañarlo. Sin embargo, quiere dejar absolutamente claro que es tu decisión y que, si necesitas más tiempo—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:608
translate spanish end_game2_bd81624d:

    # m "\"Thanks Com, I'll head there now.\""
    m "\"Gracias, Com. Voy para allá.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:609
translate spanish end_game2_520b085c:

    # com "\"Yes, [mc].\""
    com "\"Sí, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:614
translate spanish end_game2_98df30cf:

    # "I immediately spot Amicus as the door slides open, and I see the wolf jolt up from leaning back against the edge of the pool before quickly leaning back again, raising a paw casually."
    "Veo enseguida a Amicus cuando la puerta se desliza; el lobo se incorpora de golpe desde el borde de la piscina y luego vuelve a reclinarse, levantando una mano con aire casual."

# game/end_game2.rpy:615
translate spanish end_game2_bb8aede0:

    # "I walk through the steamy air to stand behind Amicus, next to the bench and he looks back at me with a gentle smile."
    "Cruzo el aire lleno de vapor hasta situarme detrás de Amicus, junto al banco, y él se vuelve con una sonrisa suave."

# game/end_game2.rpy:617
translate spanish end_game2_9b769784:

    # a "\"Soak with me?\""
    a "\"¿Te bañas conmigo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:618
translate spanish end_game2_de155dd5:

    # "I nod wordlessly and slip out of my robes and underwear before walking to the edge of the pool."
    "Asiento en silencio y me quito la túnica y la ropa interior antes de acercarme al borde de la piscina."

# game/end_game2.rpy:619
translate spanish end_game2_f353b0d0:

    # "With a little hop, I dip in quietly all at once, mostly used to the scalding temperature at this point."
    "Con un pequeño salto me sumerjo de una vez, sin hacer ruido, ya bastante acostumbrado a la temperatura abrasadora."

# game/end_game2.rpy:620
translate spanish end_game2_d1fbdbb5:

    # "As I come up, Amicus reaches out to me and I press up next to him, fitting against the curve of his chest in that familiar, easy way."
    "Cuando emerjo, Amicus extiende una mano hacia mí y me acomodo a su lado, contra la curva de su pecho, de aquella forma familiar y fácil."

# game/end_game2.rpy:621
translate spanish end_game2_c5f40fc4:

    # m "\"How was the meeting with the triumvirates?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo fue la reunión con los triunviros?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:623
translate spanish end_game2_6c5c9964:

    # a "\"Good, good. Lots of seemingly pointless talk and etiquette, but as you and I know, it's necessary.\""
    a "\"Bien, bien. Muchas conversaciones y formalidades aparentemente inútiles, pero, como sabemos tú y yo, son necesarias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:624
translate spanish end_game2_5fc9fc28:

    # m "\"As long as there aren't any riots.\""
    m "\"Mientras no haya disturbios.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:625
translate spanish end_game2_c653a8ed:

    # a "\"Yes, as long as there aren't any of those.\""
    a "\"Sí, mientras no haya nada de eso.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:626
translate spanish end_game2_8369e5f5:

    # "We sit in the hot water for a while, and I enjoy the way it makes my worries seem so far away, locked behind the doors to the bath."
    "Permanecemos un rato en el agua caliente y disfruto de cómo hace que mis preocupaciones parezcan tan lejanas, encerradas tras las puertas del baño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:627
translate spanish end_game2_a7540760:

    # "I should do this more often."
    "Debería hacerlo más a menudo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:628
translate spanish end_game2_c2120147:

    # "But, of course, it's the main thing on Amicus's mind right now."
    "Pero, claro, ahora es lo principal que preocupa a Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:629
translate spanish end_game2_e1c69ba5:

    # "He clears his throat nervously."
    "Se aclara la garganta nervioso."

# game/end_game2.rpy:631
translate spanish end_game2_3a8cb532:

    # a "\"Um...how did thinking about, uh...I mean, did you make your deci—no, sorry...\""
    a "\"Eh...¿qué tal fue pensar en, eh...quiero decir, tomaste tu deci—no, perdón...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:632
translate spanish end_game2_14574e09:

    # "Amicus trails off in the most awkward way possible, and I laugh a little bit, though it's more of a sad laugh."
    "Amicus se interrumpe de la forma más torpe posible y yo río un poco, aunque es una risa más bien triste."

# game/end_game2.rpy:633
translate spanish end_game2_7e4308ed:

    # m "\"A little, but...I really don't know, Amicus. I just...\""
    m "\"Un poco, pero...de verdad no lo sé, Amicus. Es que...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:635
translate spanish end_game2_ac29148e:

    # a "\"Do what you feel is right—\""
    a "\"Haz lo que sientas que es correcto...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:636
translate spanish end_game2_27b25bb8:

    # m "\"The whole reason we met is because of this purpose they've given me, and I really don't want to cause delays, or drag some other human into this, but something feels really off about this.\""
    m "\"La única razón por la que nos conocimos es esta misión que me han dado, y de verdad no quiero causar retrasos ni arrastrar a otro humano a esto, pero hay algo que me parece muy extraño.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:637
translate spanish end_game2_7b6e451a:

    # "Amicus nods."
    "Amicus asiente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:639
translate spanish end_game2_3a32041d:

    # a "\"Well, I don't believe that you should be forced to take on duties that were thrust upon you without your consent. It's cruel, and I want you to choose what you feel is right.\""
    a "\"Bueno, no creo que deban obligarte a asumir deberes que te impusieron sin tu consentimiento. Es cruel, y quiero que elijas lo que sientas correcto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:640
translate spanish end_game2_9be73704:

    # "I give Amicus a look."
    "Miro a Amicus de una forma significativa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:641
translate spanish end_game2_bb0ee4d7:

    # m "\"Hasn't that been {i}your{/i} whole life?\""
    m "\"¿No ha sido eso toda {i}tu{/i} vida?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:643
translate spanish end_game2_76ce095d:

    # a "\"Well...yes, but I'm talking about {i}you{/i}.\""
    a "\"Bueno...sí, pero hablo de {i}ti{/i}.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:644
translate spanish end_game2_393dd690:

    # "I smirk."
    "Sonrío de lado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:645
translate spanish end_game2_78b01f05:

    # m "\"Oh, I see. The silly, dumb ape who can't handle big boy responsibilities.\""
    m "\"Oh, ya veo. El mono tonto e ingenuo que no puede asumir responsabilidades de adulto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:647
translate spanish end_game2_f1ee0ee8:

    # "Amicus's reaction to my teasing is instant and visceral."
    "La reacción de Amicus a mi burla es inmediata y visceral."

# game/end_game2.rpy:649
translate spanish end_game2_21f03b97:

    # a "\"No! I would never—\""
    a "\"¡No! Yo nunca—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:650
translate spanish end_game2_73548c05:

    # m "\"Sorry! I was just kidding. I shouldn't make fun about that.\""
    m "\"¡Perdón! Solo bromeaba. No debería burlarme de eso.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:651
translate spanish end_game2_423fbd29:

    # "Amicus settles back again, still looking concerned."
    "Amicus vuelve a recostarse, todavía preocupado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:653
translate spanish end_game2_0935d879:

    # a "\"It's alright. I just don't want you to ever feel that way again.\""
    a "\"No pasa nada. Solo quiero que nunca vuelvas a sentirte así.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:654
translate spanish end_game2_6d85daed:

    # "Amicus sighs deeply."
    "Amicus suspira profundamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:656
translate spanish end_game2_bd018e14:

    # a "\"Also, I do believe we would have met somehow even without the parents intervening.\""
    a "\"Además, creo de verdad que nos habríamos conocido de algún modo incluso sin la intervención de los Padres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:657
translate spanish end_game2_1e36bee6:

    # "Now I really give Amicus a look."
    "Ahora sí que miro a Amicus con incredulidad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:658
translate spanish end_game2_1cdd7b14:

    # m "\"Seriously?\""
    m "\"¿En serio?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:660
translate spanish end_game2_a1bc440b:

    # a "\"Of course. Something this special can't be stopped by the likes of time and space.\""
    a "\"Por supuesto. Algo tan especial no puede detenerlo algo como el tiempo y el espacio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:661
translate spanish end_game2_1e5e40d3:

    # "Amicus starts pulling me into his body, nuzzling me."
    "Amicus empieza a atraerme hacia su cuerpo, acariciándome con el hocico."

# game/end_game2.rpy:662
translate spanish end_game2_2cd4a0df:

    # m "\"Anyway, I'm not completely sure yet. I need time to think about it, and we do have nine months.\""
    m "\"En fin, todavía no estoy del todo seguro. Necesito tiempo para pensarlo, y tenemos nueve meses.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:663
translate spanish end_game2_0677976a:

    # a "\"Take your time, but...but on the off chance that you do choose to go, you must promise me one thing.\""
    a "\"Tómate tu tiempo, pero...pero si por casualidad decides irte, tienes que prometerme una cosa.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:664
translate spanish end_game2_4db4f382:

    # "I feel a little apprehension at that."
    "Eso me produce un poco de inquietud."

# game/end_game2.rpy:665
translate spanish end_game2_e2d30ef3:

    # m "\"Yes?\""
    m "\"¿Sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:667
translate spanish end_game2_8e130891:

    # a "\"Well, eight years is quite a while for a human lifespan so, I know you rejected them initially, but please start taking the life-extension medication.\""
    a "\"Bueno, ocho años son bastante en una vida humana; sé que al principio los rechazaste, pero, por favor, empieza a tomar los medicamentos para alargar la vida.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:669
translate spanish end_game2_56d57b96:

    # a "\"There is a formula especially for primates. I need you around for as long as I am, [mc].\""
    a "\"Hay una fórmula especial para primates. Necesito que sigas aquí tanto tiempo como yo, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:670
translate spanish end_game2_13a1cd4d:

    # "I realize then how well Amicus is taking this whole 'eight years' thing, and I have to wonder if he's just trying to make it sound less bad than it actually is."
    "Entonces me doy cuenta de lo bien que Amicus se toma todo esto de los 'ocho años', y me pregunto si solo intenta hacer que parezca menos malo de lo que es."

# game/end_game2.rpy:671
translate spanish end_game2_1b87042f:

    # "Eight years is a long time, whether you're a human or a wolf."
    "Ocho años son mucho tiempo, seas humano o lobo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:672
translate spanish end_game2_e69073d0:

    # "I'd actually forgotten about the lifespan-extending medication after Amicus had told me about it."
    "De hecho, había olvidado la medicación para alargar la vida desde que Amicus me habló de ella."

# game/end_game2.rpy:673
translate spanish end_game2_f545b6bb:

    # "For whatever reason, extending my life by decades, even hundreds of years didn't really appeal to me."
    "Por algún motivo, alargar mi vida décadas, incluso cientos de años, no me atraía demasiado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:675
translate spanish end_game2_0d644fea:

    # "Even now it doesn't really, especially after what I experienced in the Greater Intelligence, but if it makes Amicus happy..."
    "Ni siquiera ahora me atrae, especialmente después de lo que viví en la Inteligencia Mayor, pero si hace feliz a Amicus..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:676
translate spanish end_game2_83b24450_1:

    # m "\"Of course.\""
    m "\"Por supuesto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:680
translate spanish end_game2_c0933825:

    # "And yet time seems to move faster than ever."
    "Y, aun así, el tiempo parece avanzar más deprisa que nunca."

# game/end_game2.rpy:681
translate spanish end_game2_c9f681ca:

    # "This is on top of the fact that nine months is quite a few more days here on Adastra than it would be on Earth."
    "Eso se suma a que nueve meses aquí en Adastra son bastantes más días que en la Tierra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:682
translate spanish end_game2_d9bfbd12:

    # "Still, the days fly by, and I think it mostly has to do with my life not being in peril anymore."
    "Aun así, los días vuelan, y creo que se debe sobre todo a que mi vida ya no corre peligro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:683
translate spanish end_game2_7026886a:

    # "I'm not dreading a trial, or fight that will determine my future."
    "Ya no temo un juicio o una pelea que vaya a determinar mi futuro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:684
translate spanish end_game2_03e1bf44:

    # "Now it's more of a slow burn that just blends together."
    "Ahora es más bien un desgaste lento en el que todo se mezcla."

# game/end_game2.rpy:685
translate spanish end_game2_e3ffe38c:

    # "Life in the palace becomes routine again."
    "La vida en el palacio vuelve a ser rutinaria."

# game/end_game2.rpy:686
translate spanish end_game2_dd7c912a:

    # "I have my own little schedule that involves gardening, and watching certain programs on Adastran TV that I've actually grown to tolerate."
    "Tengo mi pequeño horario, que incluye cuidar el jardín y ver ciertos programas de la televisión de Adastra que he aprendido a tolerar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:688
translate spanish end_game2_15f691f0:

    # "I start to study, using Com as my teacher to learn as much as I can about Adastran and {i}Galaxias{i} history."
    "Empiezo a estudiar con Com como profesor para aprender todo lo posible sobre la historia de Adastra y del {i}Galaxias{i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:689
translate spanish end_game2_eb26c8f4:

    # "I even have enough time to start learning the Language."
    "Incluso tengo tiempo para empezar a aprender la Lengua."

# game/end_game2.rpy:690
translate spanish end_game2_4524baa5:

    # "Apparently they never bothered to name their own language, which is a very wolven thing to do."
    "Al parecer nunca se molestaron en ponerle nombre a su idioma, algo muy propio de los lobos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:691
translate spanish end_game2_091ee84b:

    # "But as I'd noticed when I first arrived, it's nearly identical to Latin back on Earth."
    "Pero, como noté al llegar, es casi idéntico al latín de la Tierra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:692
translate spanish end_game2_58e765c9:

    # "This makes it fairly easy to pick up considering I studied some Latin back in school, and I learned a good deal of Italian before my trip."
    "Eso hace que sea bastante fácil aprenderlo, porque estudié algo de latín en la escuela y aprendí bastante italiano antes del viaje."

# game/end_game2.rpy:693
translate spanish end_game2_b72d709a:

    # "Amicus thinks it's a bit odd I want to learn, considering I have the lingua."
    "Amicus encuentra algo raro que quiera aprenderlo, teniendo la Lingua."

# game/end_game2.rpy:694
translate spanish end_game2_d78afae1:

    # "And while I've become used to life in what's basically a dubbed film, I can't help but feel like it's a filter of some kind."
    "Y, aunque me he acostumbrado a vivir en lo que básicamente es una película doblada, no puedo evitar sentir que es una especie de filtro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:695
translate spanish end_game2_a7d970a7:

    # "I'd like to get past that, hear Amicus and the others as they are."
    "Quisiera superar esa barrera, oír a Amicus y a los demás tal como son."

# game/end_game2.rpy:697
translate spanish end_game2_26745d29:

    # "And if I'm going to spend most of my life here..."
    "Y si voy a pasar aquí la mayor parte de mi vida..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:698
translate spanish end_game2_bce61006:

    # "I've already started taking the supplements to extend my lifespan, which means I could be alive for a lot longer than I'd ever imagined."
    "Ya he empezado a tomar los suplementos para alargarla, así que podría vivir mucho más de lo que jamás imaginé."

# game/end_game2.rpy:699
translate spanish end_game2_27279348:

    # "Though, Felix says that, at most, I might get about 100 extra years out of the treatment, rather than the 200 years or so that the wolves get because I started taking them when I was already an adult."
    "Aunque Felix dice que, como empecé a tomarlos siendo ya adulto, el tratamiento quizá me dé como máximo unos cien años más, en lugar de los doscientos que obtienen los lobos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:700
translate spanish end_game2_179db9f1:

    # "Still, it's a lot, and while I'm sure most people on Earth would be desperate for this supplement, I strangely feel a bit exhausted by the idea."
    "Aun así, es mucho, y aunque seguramente la mayoría de la gente en la Tierra desearía desesperadamente estos suplementos, a mí la idea me agota un poco, curiosamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:701
translate spanish end_game2_72797534:

    # "Living 150 to 200 years really changes one's perspective on time."
    "Vivir entre ciento cincuenta y doscientos años cambia mucho la perspectiva del tiempo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:702
translate spanish end_game2_15952d6f:

    # "Maybe that's one of the factors that makes it seem as if the days are going by so fast."
    "Quizá sea uno de los factores que hacen que los días parezcan pasar tan deprisa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:703
translate spanish end_game2_22229787:

    # "The worst part about it is that I don't get to spend very much of it with Amicus."
    "Lo peor es que no puedo pasar mucho de ese tiempo con Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:704
translate spanish end_game2_043330e9:

    # "It's something I had expected, anticipated, even."
    "Era algo que esperaba, que incluso había previsto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:705
translate spanish end_game2_f7590c92:

    # "But I can't help but feel a little depressed that I only see him for a second in the morning when he kisses me goodbye, then late at night to have dinner with me, exhausted by his imperial duties."
    "Pero me deprime un poco verlo solo un segundo por la mañana cuando me besa para despedirse, y después a última hora de la noche para cenar conmigo, agotado por sus deberes imperiales."

# game/end_game2.rpy:706
translate spanish end_game2_9c785ed4:

    # "While Cassius mainly lounged around during his short rule, I also know now that Cato was doing nearly all the work behind the scenes."
    "Aunque Cassius descansaba casi todo el tiempo durante su breve reinado, ahora sé que Cato hacía prácticamente todo el trabajo entre bastidores."

# game/end_game2.rpy:707
translate spanish end_game2_7ea3b01d:

    # "And while Virginia would be more than happy to do the same, Amicus isn't the type to be lazy like that."
    "Y, aunque Virginia estaría encantada de hacer lo mismo, Amicus no es tan perezoso."

# game/end_game2.rpy:708
translate spanish end_game2_2bcae931:

    # "Speaking of which, it's not just Amicus; while his absence would be bearable if I had at least {i}someone{/i} to talk to that isn't Com, everyone else seems to have become just as busy."
    "Por cierto, no es solo Amicus: su ausencia sería soportable si tuviera al menos a {i}alguien{/i} con quien hablar que no fuera Com, pero todos los demás parecen haberse vuelto igual de ocupados."

# game/end_game2.rpy:710
translate spanish end_game2_49f32b0c:

    # "Neferu, my only real friend on this moon aside from Amicus, is usually off doing diplomatic stuff in the city, his mission to secure an alliance now fully in motion."
    "Neferu, mi único amigo verdadero en esta luna aparte de Amicus, suele estar haciendo cosas diplomáticas en la ciudad, con su misión de asegurar una alianza ya en plena marcha."

# game/end_game2.rpy:711
translate spanish end_game2_ca7b510c:

    # "Virginia is always by Amicus's side, especially now that the populace has grown used to the idea of a woman in a chief advisor role."
    "Virginia siempre está junto a Amicus, sobre todo ahora que la población se ha acostumbrado a tener a una mujer como asesora principal."

# game/end_game2.rpy:712
translate spanish end_game2_8f908d02:

    # "And while I've never really connected with her, it would still be nice to have some kind of company."
    "Aunque nunca he conectado mucho con ella, sería agradable tener algo de compañía."

# game/end_game2.rpy:713
translate spanish end_game2_d40ab3da:

    # "I mean, even Cassius would be a welcome distraction, but the white wolf left a few months back to tour the more impoverished regions of Adastra so that resources might be better allocated."
    "Incluso Cassius sería una distracción bienvenida, pero el lobo blanco se marchó hace unos meses a recorrer las regiones más pobres de Adastra para poder distribuir mejor los recursos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:714
translate spanish end_game2_007735f1:

    # "And it also turns out that he left with my former best Adastra friend, Alexios."
    "Y resulta que se fue con mi antiguo mejor amigo de Adastra, Alexios."

# game/end_game2.rpy:715
translate spanish end_game2_5357c49a:

    # "Cassius left us all somewhat stunned when he did this; doing important social work while a known spy and saboteur, one that could be blamed for a lot of damage to Adastran society, is by his side."
    "Cassius nos dejó a todos algo sorprendidos: hace un importante trabajo social con un espía y saboteador conocido a su lado, al que se puede culpar de mucho daño a la sociedad de Adastra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:716
translate spanish end_game2_e2afe305:

    # "Amicus was adamant on deporting Alexios on the first ship back to Omorofa, but Cassius talked with him, and I guess he'd been convincing."
    "Amicus estaba decidido a deportar a Alexios en la primera nave de vuelta a Omorofa, pero Cassius habló con él y supongo que logró convencerlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:717
translate spanish end_game2_f4baa531:

    # "Amicus simply sent a few extra guards to keep a close eye on Alex."
    "Amicus simplemente envió unos guardias más para vigilar de cerca a Alex."

# game/end_game2.rpy:718
translate spanish end_game2_e5f17d7c:

    # "When I'd asked about this, Amicus only told me that the cat is powerless now, unable to connect with his homeworld due to all communication with Omorfa having been blocked after the scandal—"
    "Cuando pregunté por ello, Amicus solo me dijo que ahora el gato no tiene poder y no puede comunicarse con su mundo natal, porque bloquearon toda comunicación con Omorfa después del escándalo—"

# game/end_game2.rpy:719
translate spanish end_game2_95e3ae8b:

    # "—one that involved many more actors than just Alex."
    "—uno en el que participaron muchos más que Alex."

# game/end_game2.rpy:721
translate spanish end_game2_36362789:

    # "It doesn't sit right with me though, the idea that Alex caused so much pain for so many people, yet he's facing no consequences."
    "Pero no me parece bien que Alex causara tanto dolor a tantas personas y no afronte ninguna consecuencia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:722
translate spanish end_game2_4cf95691:

    # "Sure, I'd made that \"deal\" with him to free Amicus, but he really shouldn't still be here."
    "Sí, yo hice aquel \"trato\" con él para liberar a Amicus, pero no debería seguir aquí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:723
translate spanish end_game2_2f6883bf:

    # "I already know though, that it has more to do with Cassius's relationship with the cat, and I don't doubt that the white wolf had compared their situation to ours so that he could better convince Amicus."
    "Aunque ya sé que tiene más que ver con la relación de Cassius con el gato, y no dudo que el lobo blanco comparara su situación con la nuestra para convencer mejor a Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:724
translate spanish end_game2_4fccff82:

    # "Even if it was incomparable."
    "Aunque no fueran comparables."

# game/end_game2.rpy:725
translate spanish end_game2_d6458dd0:

    # "So now even Alex has something to do, a role to fill, and I'm the one that's left feeling useless and alone in the palace."
    "Así que ahora hasta Alex tiene algo que hacer, un papel que cumplir, y soy yo quien se siente inútil y solo en el palacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:726
translate spanish end_game2_56069bd2:

    # "While I know I'll have a special position once I start my own mission, I'm supposed to keep a low profile until then."
    "Aunque sé que tendré un puesto especial al comenzar mi misión, hasta entonces debo pasar desapercibido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:727
translate spanish end_game2_5e92ded5:

    # "The only job I have right now, over the course of the entire nine months, is to decide whether or not I'm going to play the role the parents want me to."
    "Mi único trabajo durante los nueve meses enteros es decidir si voy a cumplir el papel que quieren los Padres."

# game/end_game2.rpy:728
translate spanish end_game2_cd9b72df:

    # "And while that's well and good, as it's a decision that will affect the rest of my life, I also sort of expected to be given more information over the course of my waiting period."
    "Y, aunque está bien porque afectará al resto de mi vida, también esperaba que me dieran más información durante la espera."

# game/end_game2.rpy:730
translate spanish end_game2_f5f1314c:

    # "But no, infinite space remains quiet, and the monitor isn't breaking in through my consciousness to give me tips on what to expect."
    "Pero no: el espacio infinito permanece en silencio y el Monitor no entra en mi conciencia para aconsejarme sobre lo que debo esperar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:731
translate spanish end_game2_aa469221:

    # "So I'm left pulling the endless weeds in the gardens, waiting, wondering, as unsure of my future as I've ever been..."
    "Así que me limito a arrancar las interminables malas hierbas de los jardines, esperando, preguntándome cosas y tan inseguro de mi futuro como siempre..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:734
translate spanish end_game2_a96cfcab:

    # a "\"[mc].\""
    a "\"[mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:735
translate spanish end_game2_72a6ea31:

    # "I crack open my eyes, seeing the large silhouette of Amicus in the dimmed lighting of the bedroom."
    "Entreabro los ojos y veo la gran silueta de Amicus en la luz tenue del dormitorio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:738
translate spanish end_game2_0554e7f9:

    # a "\"Good morning.\""
    a "\"Buenos días.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:739
translate spanish end_game2_81d82868:

    # "I smile and reach out my hands, expecting the usual hug and kiss before he's off for the day."
    "Sonrío y extiendo las manos, esperando el abrazo y el beso de siempre antes de que se marche a trabajar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:741
translate spanish end_game2_f0fdf9c2:

    # "Instead though, he sits on the bed next to me, running a paw through my hair gently, pushing it back away from my forehead."
    "Pero se sienta a mi lado en la cama y me pasa suavemente una mano por el pelo, apartándomelo de la frente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:742
translate spanish end_game2_ba4da02b:

    # a "\"Your fur is a mess.\""
    a "\"Tienes el pelo hecho un desastre.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:743
translate spanish end_game2_d7b23592:

    # m "\"I mean, I did just wake up.\""
    m "\"Bueno, acabo de despertarme.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:745
translate spanish end_game2_ca10941c:

    # a "\"Mmmh...It's cute.\""
    a "\"Mmm...Es adorable.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:746
translate spanish end_game2_016389c0:

    # "Amicus continues to brush his fingers and claws through my hair."
    "Amicus sigue pasándome los dedos y las garras por el pelo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:747
translate spanish end_game2_36ac07c4:

    # "I watch him for a moment, a bit confused."
    "Lo observo un momento, algo confundido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:748
translate spanish end_game2_702cfbe4_1:

    # m "\"You alright?\""
    m "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:749
translate spanish end_game2_dccb9457:

    # a "\"Very much so.\""
    a "\"Muchísimo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:750
translate spanish end_game2_658e967d:

    # "I look over at the curtains, seeing the soft light of dawn creeping around the edges."
    "Miro las cortinas y veo la suave luz del amanecer filtrándose por los bordes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:751
translate spanish end_game2_80a04599:

    # m "\"Don't you have to go to the city?\""
    m "\"¿No tienes que ir a la ciudad?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:752
translate spanish end_game2_6b6ab49e:

    # a "\"Nope.\""
    a "\"No.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:753
translate spanish end_game2_9454d6dd:

    # m "\"Okay...do you have the day off? You're acting a little odd.\""
    m "\"Vale...¿tienes el día libre? Estás actuando un poco raro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:755
translate spanish end_game2_a105cc88:

    # a "\"Ah, so you don't know.\""
    a "\"Ah, así que no lo sabes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:756
translate spanish end_game2_53ab1b83:

    # m "\"Know what?\""
    m "\"¿Saber qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:757
translate spanish end_game2_39908655:

    # "An irrational part of me begins to wonder if the nine months is already up, even though the last time I'd calculated it out, I still had four months left."
    "Una parte irracional de mí empieza a preguntarse si los nueve meses ya han terminado, aunque la última vez que hice las cuentas todavía me quedaban cuatro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:759
translate spanish end_game2_d5f6f593:

    # a "\"I'm honestly glad you don't. I was hoping to surprise you.\""
    a "\"Sinceramente, me alegra que no lo sepas. Esperaba sorprenderte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:760
translate spanish end_game2_b7fcc9fd:

    # "I close my eyes in only the slightest amount of frustration."
    "Cierro los ojos con apenas un poco de frustración."

# game/end_game2.rpy:761
translate spanish end_game2_a769dc94:

    # m "\"Amicus, please just tell me. You know I don't like—\""
    m "\"Amicus, por favor, dímelo. Sabes que no me gusta—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:762
translate spanish end_game2_98186c02:

    # "I hear rustling from the wolf in front of me, and I open my eyes to the sight of a bouquet of flowers being held out to me."
    "Oigo un crujido frente a mí y abro los ojos para ver que el lobo me ofrece un ramo de flores."

# game/end_game2.rpy:763
translate spanish end_game2_4b06e26c:

    # "Like last time, it's dominated by lavender and its smell surrounds me, a smell that my brain has exclusively tied to my wolf."
    "Como la última vez, predomina la lavanda, y me rodea su olor, uno que mi cerebro ha asociado exclusivamente con mi lobo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:764
translate spanish end_game2_b6d59d09:

    # "Meanwhile, white and pink flowers along the edges compliment the purple."
    "Las flores blancas y rosas de los bordes complementan el morado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:765
translate spanish end_game2_4d47254f:

    # "I stare at it in surprise, unsure of what to think or say."
    "Lo miro sorprendido, sin saber qué pensar o decir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:766
translate spanish end_game2_7d66fc27:

    # "Amicus fills the silence."
    "Amicus rompe el silencio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:768
translate spanish end_game2_10be5100:

    # a "\"Happy Lover's Day, [mc].\""
    a "\"Feliz Día de los Enamorados, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:769
translate spanish end_game2_375dc2f3:

    # "The wolf continues to hold out the bouquet insistently, so I finally reach up and take it, noticing that it looks much nicer this time versus Amicus's first bouquet."
    "El lobo sigue ofreciéndome el ramo con insistencia; finalmente lo tomo y noto que esta vez tiene mucho mejor aspecto que su primer ramo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:770
translate spanish end_game2_981e234c:

    # m "\"O—Oh! Thank you.\""
    m "\"¡O-oh! Gracias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:772
translate spanish end_game2_d102f978:

    # a "\"You're welcome!\""
    a "\"¡De nada!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:773
translate spanish end_game2_1aec7524:

    # "I sit there holding the bouquet awkwardly for a few seconds, noticing the stems dripping slightly on the blanket, so I hold them out over the edge."
    "Me quedo unos segundos sosteniendo el ramo torpemente; al ver que los tallos gotean un poco sobre la manta, los saco por el borde."

# game/end_game2.rpy:774
translate spanish end_game2_ed658f2f:

    # m "\"So is this, uh, some kind of Adastran holiday?\""
    m "\"Entonces, eh, ¿es una fiesta de Adastra?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:776
translate spanish end_game2_3eb52eef:

    # a "\"Indeed! To celebrate those who you love and cherish, and for me, that is you, [mc]. I love you.\""
    a "\"¡Así es! Para celebrar a quienes amas y aprecias; para mí eres tú, [mc]. Te amo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:777
translate spanish end_game2_9021dd00:

    # "Though I'm still feeling a bit dazed at the unexpectedness of it all, I manage to smile."
    "Aunque todavía estoy un poco aturdido por lo inesperado de todo, consigo sonreír."

# game/end_game2.rpy:778
translate spanish end_game2_4e869cdd:

    # m "\"You too, Amicus. Um, I kind of wish I'd known...I didn't get you anything.\""
    m "\"Yo también, Amicus. Eh, ojalá lo hubiera sabido...no te he comprado nada.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:779
translate spanish end_game2_fa09bf9b:

    # "Amicus waves his paw dismissively in the air."
    "Amicus agita una mano en el aire, quitándole importancia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:781
translate spanish end_game2_cf5245cb:

    # a "\"Pff, the flowers are simply a human touch that I knew you'd appreciate. Besides, this isn't a gift-giving occasion, it's a go-out-and-enjoy-yourself occasion!\""
    a "\"Bah, las flores son solo un toque humano que sabía que apreciarías. Además, no es una ocasión para regalar cosas, sino para salir y disfrutar.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:782
translate spanish end_game2_74882566:

    # "Amicus stands suddenly, reaching out his paw to me."
    "Amicus se levanta de pronto y me extiende la mano."

# game/end_game2.rpy:784
translate spanish end_game2_36d26951:

    # a "\"Come! I have the entire day planned out, just you and I. No Triumvirs, diplomats, or advisors to bother us.\""
    a "\"¡Ven! Tengo todo el día planeado, tú y yo solos. Sin triunviros, diplomáticos ni asesores que nos molesten.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:785
translate spanish end_game2_182d054c:

    # "I take his paw, smiling as I realize how this has seemingly come just in time for me."
    "Tomo su mano, sonriendo al comprender que esto parece haber llegado justo a tiempo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:786
translate spanish end_game2_6ad449e4:

    # "I've been feeling so lonely and bored in the palace, this is exactly what I need."
    "Me he sentido tan solo y aburrido en el palacio; esto es exactamente lo que necesito."

# game/end_game2.rpy:787
translate spanish end_game2_ba9a2354:

    # "I hold the flowers to my chest, smelling them, not caring anymore that they're all wet."
    "Aprieto las flores contra el pecho y las huelo, sin importarme ya que estén mojadas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:788
translate spanish end_game2_f6059224:

    # m "\"What do you have planned?\""
    m "\"¿Qué tienes planeado?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:790
translate spanish end_game2_5cbfe535:

    # a "\"Ah! That's also a surprise. I'd like to leave in the next few minutes though, so get dressed, and don't worry about showering.\""
    a "\"¡Ah! Eso también es una sorpresa. Pero me gustaría salir en unos minutos; vístete y no te preocupes por ducharte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:791
translate spanish end_game2_6f19d038:

    # m "\"Alright.\""
    m "\"Está bien.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:792
translate spanish end_game2_d1bd88f0:

    # "I move toward the dresser to grab my robes, but as I'm doing so, there's a loud knock at the door."
    "Me acerco a la cómoda para coger mi túnica, pero mientras lo hago suena un fuerte golpe en la puerta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:795
translate spanish end_game2_cbb2797c:

    # "Amicus's cheery mood drops for a moment as he lets out a frustrated sigh."
    "El buen humor de Amicus cae un momento y suelta un suspiro frustrado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:797
translate spanish end_game2_a351bc32:

    # a "\"Com, who's at my door?\""
    a "\"Com, ¿quién está en mi puerta?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:798
translate spanish end_game2_c21a3f7e:

    # com "\"Neferu is at your bedroom door, Amicus.\""
    com "\"Neferu está en la puerta de tu dormitorio, Amicus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:799
translate spanish end_game2_6ef293ca:

    # "Amicus closes his eyes for a second, then opens them again, smiling at me."
    "Amicus cierra los ojos un segundo, vuelve a abrirlos y me sonríe."

# game/end_game2.rpy:801
translate spanish end_game2_15f2194c:

    # a "\"One moment, probably just wants to wish us a good Lover's Day...\""
    a "\"Un momento; seguramente solo quiere desearnos un buen Día de los Enamorados...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:803
translate spanish end_game2_db256d30:

    # a "\"...or something.\""
    a "\"...o algo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:804
translate spanish end_game2_ebf05380:

    # "Amicus strides over to the door while I quickly pull out a clean robe, pulling it over my body as the door opens."
    "Amicus se acerca a la puerta mientras saco rápidamente una túnica limpia y me la pongo al abrirse la puerta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:807
translate spanish end_game2_79ccbab6:

    # a "\"Neferu. Did you need something?\""
    a "\"Neferu. ¿Necesitabas algo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:809
translate spanish end_game2_9dcdc9a8:

    # n "\"Hello Amicus...and Ahhotep be with you, [mc].\""
    n "\"Hola, Amicus...y que Ahhotep te acompañe, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:810
translate spanish end_game2_3ec08fd8:

    # "Neferu pokes his head around Amicus's bulk which the wolf is clearly trying to use to shield me from view, even though I'm already in the process of tying my robe on."
    "Neferu asoma la cabeza por un lado del cuerpo de Amicus, que el lobo intenta usar para ocultarme, aunque ya estoy atándome la túnica."

# game/end_game2.rpy:811
translate spanish end_game2_97495df2:

    # m "\"Ahhotep be with you.\""
    m "\"Que Ahhotep te acompañe.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:812
translate spanish end_game2_da7e5a22:

    # "I mumble back, nodding in the jackal's direction."
    "Respondo entre dientes y asiento hacia el chacal."

# game/end_game2.rpy:813
translate spanish end_game2_a115a5c1:

    # a "\"What was it you needed?\""
    a "\"¿Qué necesitabas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:815
translate spanish end_game2_adb6c019:

    # n "\"Well, {i}you{/i} are needed by the council. The Khemian ambassador and Vizier arrived an hour ago, and they requested we begin our meeting at once.\""
    n "\"Bueno, el consejo te necesita a {i}ti{/i}. El embajador y el visir Khemianos llegaron hace una hora y pidieron que empezáramos la reunión de inmediato.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:818
translate spanish end_game2_66fadc00:

    # a "\"Wha—No!\""
    a "\"¡Qué—No!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:820
translate spanish end_game2_c0aa9175:

    # "Amicus lets out a groan of frustration, leaning his head back and tilting his muzzle toward the ceiling."
    "Amicus deja escapar un gemido frustrado, echando la cabeza hacia atrás y orientando el hocico al techo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:822
translate spanish end_game2_fa24d455:

    # n "\"Didn't Com notify you? I've been waiting in the carriage for fifteen minutes. Virginia's already there.\""
    n "\"¿Com no te avisó? Llevo quince minutos esperando en el carruaje. Virginia ya está allí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:823
translate spanish end_game2_cce5e850:

    # "Neferu leans sideways slightly to look at me again."
    "Neferu se inclina un poco hacia un lado para volver a mirarme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:825
translate spanish end_game2_5728cb81:

    # n "\"Am I interrupting something?\""
    n "\"¿Interrumpo algo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:827
translate spanish end_game2_03e09a9a:

    # a "\"It's Lover's Day! I cleared my schedule weeks in advance for this!\""
    a "\"¡Es el Día de los Enamorados! ¡Despejé mi agenda con semanas de antelación!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:829
translate spanish end_game2_7ac93770:

    # n "\"Oh, is it? Hm, well, I suppose I would have no reason to know, eh?\""
    n "\"Oh, ¿lo es? Hmm, bueno, supongo que yo no tendría por qué saberlo, ¿eh?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:831
translate spanish end_game2_40610a1d:

    # "Neferu winks."
    "Neferu guiña un ojo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:833
translate spanish end_game2_fd18d516:

    # n "\"Anyway, you know how poorly schedules match up when the stretch drive is used. Simply bad luck.\""
    n "\"En fin, ya sabes lo mal que coinciden los horarios cuando se usa la Propulsión Dilatatoria. Simple mala suerte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:834
translate spanish end_game2_1c801bd8:

    # a "\"Bad luck, indeed.\""
    a "\"Mala suerte, desde luego.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:835
translate spanish end_game2_0fafde95:

    # "All the while, I feel the slight sinking sensation of disappointment."
    "Mientras tanto, siento una leve punzada de decepción."

# game/end_game2.rpy:836
translate spanish end_game2_db2a2941:

    # "I can't really say I've been looking forward to this considering I didn't even know it was a thing, but in the couple of minutes I knew about it, I was really looking forward to it."
    "No puedo decir que llevara tiempo esperando esto, porque ni sabía que existía, pero durante los dos minutos en que lo supe me hizo mucha ilusión."

# game/end_game2.rpy:837
translate spanish end_game2_0e2d1fea:

    # "Amicus turns then, gaze softening as he spots me standing in my disheveled, half-tied-on robe."
    "Entonces Amicus se gira, suavizando la mirada al verme con la túnica descolocada y medio atada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:839
translate spanish end_game2_e940ac88:

    # a "\"I, uh...\""
    a "\"Yo, eh...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:840
translate spanish end_game2_50658592:

    # "I shrug in what I hope looks like a nonchalant manner."
    "Me encojo de hombros, intentando parecer despreocupado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:841
translate spanish end_game2_c5729f35:

    # m "\"It's alright, I understand. We can do something any other time.\""
    m "\"No pasa nada, lo entiendo. Podemos hacer algo en otro momento.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:842
translate spanish end_game2_9e17ba4d_1:

    # a "\"[mc]...\""
    a "\"[mc]...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:843
translate spanish end_game2_2ce4682e:

    # "I suppose I'm not doing a very good job of not looking just a little upset."
    "Supongo que no consigo disimular demasiado bien que estoy un poco disgustado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:844
translate spanish end_game2_a582d1a4:

    # m "\"I mean, I'm happy with just this—\""
    m "\"Quiero decir que solo con esto ya estoy contento—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:845
translate spanish end_game2_6ef88d1d:

    # "I pick up the bouquet of flowers I'd set on the dresser, inhaling the scent again."
    "Recojo el ramo que había dejado en la cómoda y vuelvo a inhalar su aroma."

# game/end_game2.rpy:846
translate spanish end_game2_e62c0ac6:

    # m "\"The fact that you did all this in the first place means a lot to me.\""
    m "\"Que hayas hecho todo esto significa mucho para mí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:847
translate spanish end_game2_ac92827b:

    # "Amicus goes on frowning at me, clearly not buying it."
    "Amicus sigue mirándome con el ceño fruncido, claramente sin creérselo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:848
translate spanish end_game2_c0faedef:

    # "Then he snarls."
    "Después gruñe."

# game/end_game2.rpy:850
translate spanish end_game2_f07d449b:

    # a "\"Fuck!\""
    a "\"¡Joder!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:851
translate spanish end_game2_b7ab907c:

    # "Neferu raises a brow."
    "Neferu alza una ceja."

# game/end_game2.rpy:853
translate spanish end_game2_bd18281a:

    # n "\"Poor language for an emperor, Amicus.\""
    n "\"Un lenguaje poco digno de un emperador, Amicus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:854
translate spanish end_game2_30ef2bcb:

    # "Amicus ignores the jackal, keeping his eyes on me."
    "Amicus ignora al chacal y mantiene los ojos en mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:856
translate spanish end_game2_5823aa1f:

    # a "\"This is the only meeting I'll have all day. It shouldn't last too long, and then we'll still be able to do most of what I planned.\""
    a "\"Es la única reunión que tendré hoy. No debería durar demasiado y después aún podremos hacer casi todo lo que planeé.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:857
translate spanish end_game2_99a2ae02:

    # n "\"I wouldn't plan on that. This is a very important—\""
    n "\"Yo no contaría con eso. Es una reunión muy importante—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:859
translate spanish end_game2_089a5cd5:

    # a "\"I know, ja—Neferu, but it won't last all day. Anyway, [mc], come with me. That way, as soon as the meeting is finished, we can immediately go to our private dinner.\""
    a "\"Lo sé, cha—Neferu, pero no durará todo el día. En fin, [mc], ven conmigo. Así, en cuanto acabe, podremos ir directamente a nuestra cena privada.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:861
translate spanish end_game2_376ce14a:

    # n "\"You're bringing [mc]? Didn't you say we should be keeping his profile low?\""
    n "\"¿Vas a llevar a [mc]? ¿No dijiste que debía pasar desapercibido?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:863
translate spanish end_game2_1bbb3109:

    # a "\"It's Lover's Day. No one will be at the university.\""
    a "\"Es el Día de los Enamorados. No habrá nadie en la universidad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:864
translate spanish end_game2_ab563c0b:

    # "I raise my hands."
    "Levanto las manos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:865
translate spanish end_game2_9b3ebf15:

    # m "\"I don't want to cause any problems. I can just wait for you here—\""
    m "\"No quiero causar problemas. Puedo esperarte aquí—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:867
translate spanish end_game2_59e8271f:

    # a "\"You are causing no problems. You will be accompanying me to the city. As my lover you should be at my side during Lover's Day.\""
    a "\"No causas ningún problema. Me acompañarás a la ciudad. Como mi amante, debes estar a mi lado el Día de los Enamorados.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:869
translate spanish end_game2_fc2c577d:

    # a "\"Erm, if you so choose.\""
    a "\"Eh, si así lo decides.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:870
translate spanish end_game2_cb6c14a8:

    # "At this point, anything sounds better than staying in the palace, so the decision is pretty easy."
    "Ahora cualquier cosa suena mejor que quedarme en el palacio, así que la decisión es bastante fácil."

# game/end_game2.rpy:871
translate spanish end_game2_c870cb7d:

    # m "\"Alright, yeah, let's go.\""
    m "\"Vale, sí, vamos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:874
translate spanish end_game2_367a2694:

    # "Amicus looks somewhat relieved, letting out a breath before reaching out to take my hand, walking us out into the hallway while Neferu follows behind."
    "Amicus parece algo aliviado; suelta el aire antes de tomarme la mano y llevarme al pasillo, con Neferu detrás."

# game/end_game2.rpy:878
translate spanish end_game2_6798d7c9:

    # a "\"I promise it will be quick, and I'm sorry. Sometimes it's just hard to...\""
    a "\"Te prometo que será rápido, y lo siento. A veces es difícil...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:879
translate spanish end_game2_b991b2bc:

    # "Amicus seems to struggle to find his words."
    "Amicus parece buscar las palabras."

# game/end_game2.rpy:880
translate spanish end_game2_0d75efcc:

    # m "\"I understand. You're the emperor. Besides, it's not fair for me to be upset because my boyfriend is spending more time on his emperor duties than me.\""
    m "\"Lo entiendo. Eres el emperador. Además, no sería justo enfadarme porque mi novio dedique más tiempo a sus deberes imperiales que a mí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:881
translate spanish end_game2_10c5b863:

    # a "\"I would understand if you were.\""
    a "\"Lo entendería si te enfadaras.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:882
translate spanish end_game2_f343ae12:

    # m "\"I just hope it won't be like this forever.\""
    m "\"Solo espero que no sea así siempre.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:884
translate spanish end_game2_e0f7d9a4:

    # a "\"It won't be. We're simply at a turning point in Adastran history. When...When you return, and when everything settles, we will have much more time to ourselves.\""
    a "\"No lo será. Estamos en un momento decisivo de la historia de Adastra. Cuando...cuando vuelvas y todo se calme, tendremos mucho más tiempo para nosotros.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:885
translate spanish end_game2_51e9e7c0:

    # "My stomach lurches slightly at being reminded that I have my own job to do, one that I'm not looking forward to."
    "Mi estómago se encoge un poco al recordar que yo también tengo un trabajo que hacer, uno que no me apetece."

# game/end_game2.rpy:886
translate spanish end_game2_1b63bf56:

    # "I glance back at Neferu, wondering if he should be hearing any of this, but the jackal seems to not be paying attention to anything, his expression distant as his lips move silently."
    "Miro atrás hacia Neferu, preguntándome si debería oír esto, pero el chacal parece no prestar atención a nada; tiene una expresión distante y mueve los labios en silencio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:887
translate spanish end_game2_467a580a:

    # "It looks like he's reciting something."
    "Parece recitar algo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:889
translate spanish end_game2_745964ae:

    # "I look forward again, leaning against Amicus as we head outside toward the carriage."
    "Vuelvo a mirar hacia delante, apoyándome en Amicus mientras salimos hacia el carruaje."

# game/end_game2.rpy:893
translate spanish end_game2_8b3ecb46:

    # "I already start feeling a lot better as our mechanical carriage creaks through the forest, the peaceful, eerie green calming any irritation I might have felt with the whole situation."
    "Ya empiezo a sentirme mucho mejor mientras nuestro carruaje mecánico cruje por el bosque; el verde tranquilo e inquietante calma cualquier irritación que me produjera la situación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:895
translate spanish end_game2_0f526070:

    # "Amicus has me pulled against his right side, fitting me in that familiar way as I rest my head against his shoulder."
    "Amicus me estrecha contra su costado derecho, acomodándome de la forma familiar mientras apoyo la cabeza en su hombro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:897
translate spanish end_game2_b18bceea:

    # "To Amicus's left, Neferu sits with his legs crossed, an elbow on his knee and his chin in his paw."
    "A la izquierda de Amicus, Neferu está sentado con las piernas cruzadas, un codo sobre la rodilla y la barbilla en la mano."

# game/end_game2.rpy:898
translate spanish end_game2_6c39cffe:

    # "I notice Neferu and Amicus not attempting to make conversation with each other, not even glancing at one another."
    "Noto que Neferu y Amicus no intentan conversar, ni siquiera se miran."

# game/end_game2.rpy:899
translate spanish end_game2_8a2af303:

    # "I think it's pretty clear at this point that Amicus and Neferu just don't really mesh well, their personalities too different."
    "A estas alturas está bastante claro que no encajan demasiado bien: sus personalidades son muy distintas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:900
translate spanish end_game2_e785baf0:

    # "Which I guess is fine, as long as they're not fighting anymore."
    "Supongo que está bien, siempre que ya no se peleen."

# game/end_game2.rpy:901
translate spanish end_game2_c8fd0293:

    # "Neferu seems to have stopped his silent chanting, so I take the opportunity to ask him a question, leaning forward to look around Amicus's front."
    "Neferu parece haber dejado de recitar en silencio, así que aprovecho para preguntarle algo, inclinándome hacia delante para mirar por delante de Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:902
translate spanish end_game2_ed88ebf9:

    # m "\"So what's going on with this Khemian ambassador and, uh, the other thing you mentioned? If you can tell me, that is.\""
    m "\"Entonces, ¿qué pasa con ese embajador Khemiano y, eh, lo otro que mencionaste? Si puedes contármelo, claro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:903
translate spanish end_game2_5173caab:

    # "The jackal glances at me before shifting into a position that more directly faces me."
    "El chacal me mira y después se coloca más de frente a mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:905
translate spanish end_game2_71683cec:

    # n "\"The vizier? He's the highest official serving under the pharaoh. As for the ambassador, Adastra hasn't had a Khemian ambassador since the war.\""
    n "\"¿El visir? Es el funcionario de mayor rango al servicio del Faraón. En cuanto al embajador, Adastra no ha tenido uno Khemiano desde la guerra.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:906
translate spanish end_game2_9d8e02e9:

    # "Amicus grunts."
    "Amicus gruñe."

# game/end_game2.rpy:908
translate spanish end_game2_548e1830:

    # a "\"I'll point out that Khemia was the first to expel the ambassador.\""
    a "\"Quiero señalar que Khemia fue la primera en expulsar al embajador.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:909
translate spanish end_game2_ea3c8fd3:

    # "Neferu maintains a straight face."
    "Neferu mantiene el rostro impasible."

# game/end_game2.rpy:910
translate spanish end_game2_da7fb6f1:

    # n "\"And we are the first to reestablish one.\""
    n "\"Y somos los primeros en volver a establecer uno.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:912
translate spanish end_game2_e4621826:

    # a "\"As it should go.\""
    a "\"Como debe ser.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:913
translate spanish end_game2_b30ff7c3:

    # m "\"Well that's good.\""
    m "\"Bueno, eso está bien.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:914
translate spanish end_game2_89537544:

    # "I talk a little louder than usual, trying to stop an argument before it can happen."
    "Hablo algo más alto de lo normal, intentando detener una discusión antes de que empiece."

# game/end_game2.rpy:915
translate spanish end_game2_7183e978:

    # m "\"So are they going to help establish an alliance?\""
    m "\"¿Así que ayudarán a establecer una alianza?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:916
translate spanish end_game2_12c61f42:

    # a "\"Yes, along with smoothing over Adastra-Khemia relations in general. The ambassador will be here for the long-term. The vizier—\""
    a "\"Sí, además de mejorar las relaciones generales entre Adastra y Khemia. El embajador se quedará a largo plazo. El visir—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:917
translate spanish end_game2_32fc55b4:

    # "Amicus glances at Neferu, but the jackal simply leans back, looking out at the forest again."
    "Amicus mira a Neferu, pero el chacal simplemente se recuesta y vuelve a contemplar el bosque."

# game/end_game2.rpy:918
translate spanish end_game2_fa7dfc31:

    # n "\"—the vizier will depart back to Khemia within a week, which is why negations must begin at once.\""
    n "\"—el visir volverá a Khemia dentro de una semana, por eso las negociaciones deben empezar de inmediato.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:919
translate spanish end_game2_6b58867d:

    # m "\"And you said this is taking place at a university?\""
    m "\"¿Y dijiste que esto será en una universidad?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:920
translate spanish end_game2_460acdcd:

    # a "\"Yes, there are a few Khemia experts there...and I suppose Khemians find places of learning more comfortable to negotiate in.\""
    a "\"Sí, allí hay algunos expertos en Khemia...y supongo que los Khemianos se sienten más cómodos negociando en lugares de estudio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:921
translate spanish end_game2_ce57594b:

    # "Amicus glances at Neferu for confirmation."
    "Amicus mira a Neferu en busca de confirmación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:923
translate spanish end_game2_e050513a:

    # n "\"I believe it has more to do with Adastran academia being a more friendly entity compared to the political departments, or palace.\""
    n "\"Creo que tiene más que ver con que el mundo académico de Adastra es más amistoso que los departamentos políticos o el palacio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:924
translate spanish end_game2_84d141c7:

    # "Amicus smirks."
    "Amicus sonríe con malicia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:926
translate spanish end_game2_1c48b7e6:

    # a "\"Indeed, the last bastion of Khemaphiles.\""
    a "\"Así es: el último bastión de los khemiófilos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:927
translate spanish end_game2_b492a58c:

    # "Neferu rolls his eyes before they settle on me again."
    "Neferu pone los ojos en blanco antes de volver a fijarlos en mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:929
translate spanish end_game2_2deca85b:

    # n "\"Oh, and remember our conversation about the Other? This university is famous for supposedly being absolutely infested.\""
    n "\"Oh, ¿recuerdas nuestra conversación sobre el Otro? Esta universidad es famosa por estar, supuestamente, completamente infestada.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:930
translate spanish end_game2_09722dcb:

    # "I raise an eyebrow."
    "Alzo una ceja."

# game/end_game2.rpy:931
translate spanish end_game2_b4ec0074:

    # m "\"So it's haunted?\""
    m "\"¿Así que está encantada?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:932
translate spanish end_game2_e0a11c00:

    # "Amicus frowns."
    "Amicus frunce el ceño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:934
translate spanish end_game2_0eaa559a:

    # a "\"Are you serious? Have you been filling his head with the ghost stories of students, Neferu?\""
    a "\"¿Hablas en serio? ¿Le has llenado la cabeza con cuentos de fantasmas de estudiantes, Neferu?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:935
translate spanish end_game2_fcd949e3:

    # n "\"I have.\""
    n "\"Sí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:936
translate spanish end_game2_8801b4a2:

    # m "\"Don't worry, I don't really believe it.\""
    m "\"No te preocupes, no me lo creo de verdad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:937
translate spanish end_game2_78acc33b:

    # "I lean back against Amicus, deciding that we can't really have a conversation without the two canines butting heads."
    "Vuelvo a apoyarme en Amicus, concluyendo que no podemos conversar sin que estos dos caninos choquen."

# game/end_game2.rpy:939
translate spanish end_game2_d7d52ab7:

    # "The university is in a secluded area outside the city, mostly surrounded by forest."
    "La universidad está en una zona apartada fuera de la ciudad, rodeada sobre todo de bosque."

# game/end_game2.rpy:940
translate spanish end_game2_1937c683:

    # "The gardens and paths are well taken care of, and it reminds me of a more classical-looking version of the palace."
    "Los jardines y senderos están bien cuidados; me recuerda a una versión del palacio de aspecto más clásico."

# game/end_game2.rpy:941
translate spanish end_game2_8abb33be:

    # "Amicus was right; I don't see a single person on the campus."
    "Amicus tenía razón: no veo ni una persona en el recinto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:942
translate spanish end_game2_f2909c56:

    # "Our carriage rides up the main path to the largest-looking building that's front and center."
    "Nuestro carruaje sube por el sendero principal hasta el edificio que parece más grande, justo en el centro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:943
translate spanish end_game2_717256f9:

    # "We park in front of the building next to a few small aircraft before getting out and heading inside."
    "Aparcamos delante, junto a unas pequeñas aeronaves, y después bajamos y entramos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:945
translate spanish end_game2_e2a8490e:

    # "For a moment, I'm in awe at the size and architecture surrounding me, especially the amount of sculptures spread throughout the halls."
    "Por un momento me asombran el tamaño y la arquitectura que me rodean, especialmente la cantidad de esculturas repartidas por los pasillos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:946
translate spanish end_game2_8023371f:

    # "Amicus immediately begins talking to me though."
    "Pero Amicus empieza a hablarme enseguida."

# game/end_game2.rpy:948
translate spanish end_game2_5a6489e0:

    # a "\"Go ahead and make yourself comfortable. There should be screens in most of the rooms, and down those stairs, you can find games of amusement—\""
    a "\"Ponte cómodo. Debería haber pantallas en casi todas las salas; bajando esas escaleras encontrarás juegos—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:949
translate spanish end_game2_aae04b86:

    # v "\"Amicus!\""
    v "\"¡Amicus!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:952
translate spanish end_game2_cb547aeb:

    # "Amicus jerks his head away from me, looking up as Virginia's familiar voice in a very familiar tone echoes around the marble hallways."
    "Amicus aparta la cabeza de golpe y alza la vista cuando la voz familiar de Virginia, con un tono también muy familiar, resuena por los pasillos de mármol."

# game/end_game2.rpy:954
translate spanish end_game2_90196a65:

    # a "\"Gods...\""
    a "\"Dioses...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:955
translate spanish end_game2_2b60bb93:

    # "Amicus mumbles under his breath as Virginia, her face a mask of fury, approaches."
    "Amicus murmura mientras Virginia se acerca, con la cara convertida en una máscara de furia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:956
translate spanish end_game2_e69800dd:

    # "She spares me a glance for a single second before focusing back on Amicus."
    "Me dedica una mirada de un segundo antes de volver a centrarse en Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:958
translate spanish end_game2_ef8e17d2:

    # v "\"You are an hour late.\""
    v "\"Llegas una hora tarde.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:959
translate spanish end_game2_f22e0ee5:

    # a "\"Am I?\""
    a "\"¿Ah, sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:960
translate spanish end_game2_a1e7e69f:

    # v "\"Yes! I've tolerated your tardiness since, well, since you were a child, but you've kept the {i}vizier{/i} waiting...{i}how could you!{/i}\""
    v "\"¡Sí! He tolerado tus retrasos desde...bueno, desde que eras niño, pero has hecho esperar al {i}visir{/i}...¡{i}cómo has podido{/i}!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:961
translate spanish end_game2_095eed4a:

    # "The wolf whisper-screams through her teeth, eyes practically bulging from her head."
    "La loba grita en un susurro entre dientes, con los ojos casi saliéndosele de las órbitas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:962
translate spanish end_game2_b247db10:

    # "I've never seen Virginia so angry before."
    "Nunca había visto a Virginia tan enfadada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:963
translate spanish end_game2_c74e5986:

    # "Amicus shifts uncomfortably."
    "Amicus se mueve incómodo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:964
translate spanish end_game2_ed260570:

    # a "\"Well, it's a holiday, so I disabled notifications—\""
    a "\"Bueno, es festivo, así que desactivé las notificaciones—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:965
translate spanish end_game2_6046a2d0:

    # v "\"Are you {i}joking{/i}? Emperors do not get holidays. EVER.\""
    v "\"¿Estás {i}bromeando{/i}? Los emperadores no tienen festivos. NUNCA.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:967
translate spanish end_game2_f6f98990:

    # a "\"Well, consider it strategic.\""
    a "\"Bueno, considéralo una estrategia.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:969
translate spanish end_game2_37fb03a1:

    # v "\"What?\""
    v "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:971
translate spanish end_game2_ae02419c:

    # a "\"I am simply letting him know who holds the power here. It will be an advantageous start to our negotiations.\""
    a "\"Solo le hago saber quién tiene el poder aquí. Será un comienzo ventajoso para nuestras negociaciones.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:972
translate spanish end_game2_f75d4eea:

    # "Virginia looks at her brother with borderline disgust."
    "Virginia mira a su hermano casi con asco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:973
translate spanish end_game2_5af08f3a:

    # v "\"Well, at least you can make even the most extreme stupidity sound....not quite so stupid. I hope you're not planning on bringing your mate in?\""
    v "\"Bueno, al menos puedes hacer que hasta la mayor estupidez suene...algo menos estúpida. Espero que no pienses llevar a tu pareja dentro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:975
translate spanish end_game2_d3259ce5:

    # "For a moment I don't realize that she's referring to me."
    "Por un momento no comprendo que se refiere a mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:977
translate spanish end_game2_8d74b9ce:

    # a "\"Of course not. He's waiting out here.\""
    a "\"Por supuesto que no. Esperará aquí fuera.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:978
translate spanish end_game2_76bd8262:

    # "Virginia looks at me again."
    "Virginia vuelve a mirarme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:980
translate spanish end_game2_867d2111:

    # v "\"My apologies. I hope my brother learns to treat you with more respect in the future. If not, then I'm sure you'll have no trouble finding someone better.\""
    v "\"Mis disculpas. Espero que mi hermano aprenda a tratarte con más respeto. Si no, estoy segura de que no te costará encontrar a alguien mejor.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:982
translate spanish end_game2_2e20aa42:

    # a "\"Wha—If you're so worried about wasting time, why are we doing just that?\""
    a "\"Qué—Si tanto te preocupa perder tiempo, ¿por qué estamos haciendo precisamente eso?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:985
translate spanish end_game2_d681505c:

    # v "\"Teacher Veteris is entertaining them on a tour. You'd better think of a good excuse before they return...actually, just pretend it didn't happen.\""
    v "\"El profesor Veteris los entretiene con una visita. Más te vale pensar en una buena excusa antes de que vuelvan...en realidad, finge que no ha pasado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:987
translate spanish end_game2_ffb95151:

    # a "\"Oh? That sounds like something you wouldn't want me to do.\""
    a "\"¿Oh? Eso suena a algo que no querrías que hiciera.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:989
translate spanish end_game2_c54a6d08:

    # v "\"Khemians are different. I suggest you not try to trick them. Let's go in for now, I think I hear them.\""
    v "\"Los Khemianos son distintos. Te sugiero que no intentes engañarlos. Entremos de momento; creo que los oigo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:990
translate spanish end_game2_d893a456:

    # "Sure enough, I hear echoing voices up the hallways."
    "En efecto, oigo voces que resuenan por los pasillos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:994
translate spanish end_game2_50b7999e:

    # "Amicus turns to me, giving me a quick hug, again reassuring me that he won't be long before following Virginia up the hall and disappearing behind a sliding door."
    "Amicus se vuelve y me da un abrazo rápido, vuelve a asegurarme que no tardará y sigue a Virginia por el pasillo hasta desaparecer tras una puerta corredera."

# game/end_game2.rpy:995
translate spanish end_game2_6947fead:

    # "Neferu, who I had completely forgotten about, walks past me, heading for the room as well."
    "Neferu, al que había olvidado por completo, pasa junto a mí y también se dirige a la sala."

# game/end_game2.rpy:996
translate spanish end_game2_d82f6709:

    # "I frown, noting the dull look on his face, the one he'd been wearing since the carriage ride."
    "Frunzo el ceño al notar la expresión apagada que lleva desde el viaje en carruaje."

# game/end_game2.rpy:997
translate spanish end_game2_702cfbe4_2:

    # m "\"You alright?\""
    m "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:998
translate spanish end_game2_9a956c45:

    # "I ask him just as he passes me."
    "Le pregunto justo cuando pasa a mi lado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:999
translate spanish end_game2_ca970397:

    # "He glances toward me."
    "Me mira."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1001
translate spanish end_game2_589a1f8c:

    # n "\"Of course.\""
    n "\"Por supuesto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1002
translate spanish end_game2_86f2fd8e:

    # "He doesn't even make an effort to make it look like that's the case before walking through the door as well."
    "Ni siquiera se esfuerza por aparentarlo antes de cruzar también la puerta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1004
translate spanish end_game2_e80df5ff:

    # "The voices get closer, coming from a bend in the hallway up ahead."
    "Las voces se acercan desde una curva del pasillo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1005
translate spanish end_game2_9fe3bc6d:

    # "Not really wanting to be seen, I move back toward the sculptures, hiding myself amongst them."
    "Como no quiero que me vean, retrocedo hacia las esculturas y me escondo entre ellas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1006
translate spanish end_game2_b016ef3a:

    # "Technically all of Adastra City knows who I am, my face having been shown on the giant screens in the city, on loop, for months."
    "Técnicamente, toda la ciudad de Adastra sabe quién soy; mi cara lleva meses repitiéndose en las pantallas gigantes de la ciudad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1007
translate spanish end_game2_0130da93:

    # "Still, I'm odd enough that I feel like it would just cause more trouble than it would be worth if I'm seen."
    "Aun así, soy lo bastante extraño para sentir que, si me ven, causaré más problemas de los que merecería la pena."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1008
translate spanish end_game2_f850826d:

    # "So I peer around a statue wolf's waist, feeling like a stalker as I watch the small crowd approaching the door that Amicus, Virginia, and Neferu walked through."
    "Así que asomo la cabeza por la cintura de una estatua de lobo, sintiéndome como un acosador mientras observo al pequeño grupo acercarse a la puerta por la que entraron Amicus, Virginia y Neferu."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1009
translate spanish end_game2_41c13eb1:

    # "A very short, old wolf leads the way, followed by only the second jackal I've ever seen in person."
    "Un lobo muy bajo y viejo va delante, seguido por el segundo chacal que he visto en persona."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1010
translate spanish end_game2_4ad6f3e4:

    # "He's taller and thinner than Neferu, and there's an icy-cold expression on his face."
    "Es más alto y delgado que Neferu y tiene una expresión helada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1011
translate spanish end_game2_9bb7a261:

    # "I imagine him to be the vizier, and next to him walks a rather broad-shouldered creature that vaguely looks like a wolverine."
    "Imagino que es el visir; junto a él camina una criatura de hombros anchos que recuerda vagamente a un glotón."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1012
translate spanish end_game2_fbc109f9:

    # "His clothing and the paint on his fur is definitely Khemian, so I assume him to be the ambassador."
    "Su ropa y la pintura de su pelo son claramente Khemianas, así que supongo que es el embajador."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1013
translate spanish end_game2_fbf094d4:

    # "Finally, a younger wolf brings up the rear, one that has longer fur on his neck which he he's styled into a braid."
    "Por último va un lobo más joven, con el pelo más largo del cuello peinado en una trenza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1014
translate spanish end_game2_8d29d7e0:

    # "I'd heard about wolves with manes at some point in my studies, a trait that had been cultivated amongst Adastra's more influential families, a status symbol of the elite."
    "Durante mis estudios oí hablar de lobos con melenas, un rasgo cultivado entre las familias más influyentes de Adastra y un símbolo del estatus de la élite."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1015
translate spanish end_game2_4c35db63:

    # "The braided wolf starts to look in my direction, and that's when I pull back quickly, hiding myself behind the marble and waiting until I hear the door slide shut again."
    "El lobo de la trenza empieza a mirar hacia mí; me aparto rápidamente, me oculto tras el mármol y espero hasta oír que la puerta vuelve a cerrarse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1016
translate spanish end_game2_5593e621:

    # "I'm left alone, standing amongst the quiet, spotless marble of the expansive university."
    "Me quedo solo, rodeado por el mármol silencioso e impecable de la enorme universidad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1017
translate spanish end_game2_eb7fe493:

    # "At first, I sit on a bench, quietly taking in the architecture, thinking about how cool it would be if I could come here to study instead."
    "Al principio me siento en un banco a contemplar la arquitectura, pensando en lo genial que sería poder venir a estudiar aquí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1018
translate spanish end_game2_f4fa9e94:

    # "Though, now I know that this is the most prestigious university in Adastra, having seen the giant name carved into the face of the building on the way in."
    "Aunque ahora sé que es la universidad más prestigiosa de Adastra, tras ver el gran nombre tallado en la fachada al entrar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1019
translate spanish end_game2_a189263a:

    # "Varro's University."
    "La Universidad de Varro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1020
translate spanish end_game2_adb20125:

    # "Or just Varro."
    "O simplemente Varro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1021
translate spanish end_game2_888b6e2a:

    # "Only the smartest young wolves study here along with wolves from the richest families in Adastra."
    "Aquí solo estudian los jóvenes lobos más inteligentes y los de las familias más ricas de Adastra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1022
translate spanish end_game2_224926fc:

    # "However, from the handful of times that it came up in Com's ramblings, it sounded like it was one of the most progressive places on the moon."
    "Sin embargo, las pocas veces que Com la mencionó en sus explicaciones, parecía uno de los lugares más progresistas de la luna."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1023
translate spanish end_game2_4d594602:

    # "It was one of the first elite universities to allow women to study inside the school, rather than having to sit in a separate, cheaper building on the outskirts of campus."
    "Fue una de las primeras universidades de élite que permitió estudiar a las mujeres dentro de la escuela, en lugar de sentarse en un edificio separado y más barato en las afueras del recinto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1024
translate spanish end_game2_c51fea56:

    # "That was just fifty years ago, finally allowed under the rule of Amicus's father."
    "Fue hace solo cincuenta años, cuando finalmente se permitió durante el reinado del padre de Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1025
translate spanish end_game2_c91b88fc:

    # "Eventually, I grow bored with just sitting there and start to walk around, looking at the sculptures and plaques."
    "Al final me aburro de estar sentado y empiezo a pasear, mirando las esculturas y las placas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1026
translate spanish end_game2_7bccdc9e:

    # "They give short descriptions of the various wolves the sculptures depict, and I try to piece together what I can with my limited written Language knowledge."
    "Dan breves descripciones de los lobos representados, e intento comprender lo que puedo con mis limitados conocimientos de la Lengua escrita."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1027
translate spanish end_game2_b08e75a1:

    # "Notable is the one in the middle, Varro, the university's namesake."
    "Destaca la del centro: Varro, que da nombre a la universidad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1028
translate spanish end_game2_90fc5a55:

    # "He apparently studied the education system on Omorfa before implementing that system on Adastra."
    "Al parecer estudió el sistema educativo de Omorfa antes de implantarlo en Adastra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1029
translate spanish end_game2_613a9ea1:

    # "This alone shows how different this university is from the rest of Adastra."
    "Eso solo ya muestra lo distinta que es esta universidad del resto de Adastra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1030
translate spanish end_game2_88924269:

    # "The wolves, especially the politicians, would {i}never{/i} admit to borrowing anything from the cats, even though they borrowed plenty."
    "Los lobos, especialmente los políticos, {i}jamás{/i} admitirían haber tomado nada de los gatos, aunque tomaron muchas cosas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1031
translate spanish end_game2_63d5fb6c:

    # "But...even here, there are only sculptures of wolves."
    "Pero...incluso aquí solo hay esculturas de lobos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1032
translate spanish end_game2_ddf208bb:

    # "No siblings, no children, nothing."
    "Ningún Hermano, ningún Hijo, nada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1033
translate spanish end_game2_fef5d58c:

    # "It reminds me of one of the biggest issues I've been wrestling with the past few months...how separate I feel from this society."
    "Me recuerda uno de los mayores problemas con los que he luchado estos últimos meses: lo apartado que me siento de esta sociedad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1034
translate spanish end_game2_8001c494:

    # "It's to be expected."
    "Es de esperar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1035
translate spanish end_game2_f2f72512:

    # "I'm on an alien world after all."
    "Al fin y al cabo, estoy en un mundo alienígena."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1036
translate spanish end_game2_1ecbed71:

    # "But it's a world of many different creatures and cultures, yet the wolves seem to be doing their best to ignore that."
    "Pero es un mundo de muchas criaturas y culturas distintas, y los lobos parecen esforzarse por ignorarlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1037
translate spanish end_game2_0652606e:

    # "I realize that I will never be part of this society, even if humans are successfully integrated into the {i}Galaxias{/i}."
    "Comprendo que nunca formaré parte de esta sociedad, aunque los humanos se integren con éxito en el {i}Galaxias{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1038
translate spanish end_game2_7048201d:

    # "In fact, I already know what the wolven reaction to human society will be:"
    "De hecho, ya sé cómo reaccionarán los lobos a la sociedad humana:"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1039
translate spanish end_game2_a5d53513:

    # "Suspicion, condescension, and overall jealousy at the idea of a race that seemingly uplifted itself, a species assigned a role that's different than all the rest."
    "Con desconfianza, condescendencia y celos ante una raza que aparentemente elevó por sí misma su civilización, una especie con un papel distinto de todas las demás."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1040
translate spanish end_game2_66df781f:

    # "It doesn't matter that I'm liked by them now."
    "No importa que ahora les caiga bien."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1041
translate spanish end_game2_959d393f:

    # "It's only because I'm a seemingly dumb, parent-less, ape."
    "Es solo porque parezco un mono tonto sin Padres."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1042
translate spanish end_game2_109a5622:

    # "They will come to despise me just as they despise the Khemians."
    "Llegarán a despreciarme igual que desprecian a los Khemianos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1043
translate spanish end_game2_6c2c7cda:

    # "Is it worth it to deal with all that, only to be with Amicus?"
    "¿Merece la pena afrontar todo eso solo para estar con Amicus?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1044
translate spanish end_game2_86f5af5d:

    # "I know the answer, but I still contemplate."
    "Sé la respuesta, pero sigo reflexionando."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1045
translate spanish end_game2_fa81bc1d:

    # "As my thought process spirals, I even think for a moment that maybe Alex had the right idea...but no, thoughts like that always bring me back down."
    "Mientras mis pensamientos se enredan, por un momento incluso creo que quizá Alex tenía razón...pero no: esas ideas siempre me hacen volver a la realidad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1046
translate spanish end_game2_e0155605:

    # "It reminds me that humans, wolves, and all the rest of the {i}Galaxias{/i} aren't so different in the end."
    "Me recuerdan que los humanos, los lobos y el resto del {i}Galaxias{/i} no somos tan distintos al final."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1047
translate spanish end_game2_8dec85f6:

    # "Which means I have to hope that the parents {i}are{/i} different, because I don't think I can trust gods that act like I do."
    "Así que debo esperar que los Padres {i}sí{/i} sean distintos, porque no creo poder confiar en dioses que actúen como yo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1048
translate spanish end_game2_6ae01a40:

    # "I try to distract myself, walking around the big marble halls, looking into different rooms, and reading any inscriptions I can find."
    "Intento distraerme paseando por los grandes pasillos de mármol, mirando distintas salas y leyendo las inscripciones que encuentro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1049
translate spanish end_game2_63e323a7:

    # "The \"game room\" in the basement is just a series of tables with various board games that I've never learned to play."
    "La \"sala de juegos\" del sótano es solo una serie de mesas con diversos juegos de tablero que nunca aprendí a jugar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1050
translate spanish end_game2_edf254cc:

    # "After a while, it becomes clear that this isn't going to be a quick meeting."
    "Al cabo de un rato queda claro que no será una reunión rápida."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1052
translate spanish end_game2_ec23975d:

    # "The hours go by slowly, and while I would usually be pretty ticked off at Amicus at this point, I'm mostly just sad."
    "Las horas pasan lentamente y, aunque normalmente estaría bastante enfadado con Amicus, ahora estoy sobre todo triste."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1053
translate spanish end_game2_c70714e2:

    # "Being alone amongst towering, marble pillars isn't so different from the palace, and still, this is actually a nice change of pace."
    "Estar solo entre enormes columnas de mármol no es muy distinto del palacio, pero aun así es un agradable cambio de ambiente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1054
translate spanish end_game2_9de5a081:

    # "I just wish I could be spending more time with Amicus."
    "Solo desearía pasar más tiempo con Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1055
translate spanish end_game2_9988bc7b:

    # "Eventually, I find a bunch of folded red cloth piled on a table, looking like banners for what could be the school flag, or colors, or something."
    "Finalmente encuentro telas rojas dobladas sobre una mesa, como banderolas de la escuela o de sus colores, o algo parecido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1056
translate spanish end_game2_37bcbe6d:

    # "I grab a couple of these before scouting out a marble bench hidden in the corner of the main room, behind the statues and out of sight of the door."
    "Cojo un par y busco un banco de mármol oculto en una esquina de la sala principal, detrás de las estatuas y fuera de la vista de la puerta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1057
translate spanish end_game2_12c40c9f:

    # "I lie down on the bench, flat on my back, laying the cloth under my head."
    "Me tumbo boca arriba en el banco, colocando la tela bajo la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1058
translate spanish end_game2_9cdbfa8d:

    # "I'm tired after being woken up so much earlier than I'm used to, and it's not long before I'm drifting off to sleep..."
    "Estoy cansado por haberme despertado mucho antes de lo habitual, y no tardo en quedarme dormido..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1062
translate spanish end_game2_dd7fa190:

    # "Space stretches and twists into the distance, the infinite dark blue broken here and there with planets, stars, and dust clouds."
    "El espacio se extiende y retuerce hacia la distancia, con su azul oscuro infinito interrumpido aquí y allá por planetas, estrellas y nubes de polvo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1063
translate spanish end_game2_f296672d:

    # "It's endless, monolithic, passionless..."
    "Es interminable, inmenso, impasible..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1064
translate spanish end_game2_1bff11b5:

    # "Except there."
    "Salvo ahí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1065
translate spanish end_game2_8b7829bb:

    # "Its mark is clear on the universe, like a stain, a blemish on the glittering patchwork of stars."
    "Su huella es clara en el universo, como una mancha, una imperfección en el mosaico brillante de estrellas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1066
translate spanish end_game2_d8c6c497:

    # "The planets die, the stars shrivel, the dust scatters."
    "Los planetas mueren, las estrellas se marchitan, el polvo se dispersa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1067
translate spanish end_game2_277592d0:

    # "It's all tainted."
    "Todo está contaminado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1068
translate spanish end_game2_61ff649b:

    # "The mark is old."
    "La huella es vieja."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1069
translate spanish end_game2_8bf4761b:

    # "It's ancient."
    "Es antiquísima."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1070
translate spanish end_game2_5c1b5cc5:

    # "It existed before life."
    "Existía antes de la vida."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1071
translate spanish end_game2_9c83a385:

    # "{i}Our{/i} life."
    "De {i}nuestra{/i} vida."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1072
translate spanish end_game2_e3a6d777:

    # "It touches every life form from the youngest child to the oldest sibling."
    "Toca a todas las formas de vida, desde el Hijo más joven hasta el Hermano más viejo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1073
translate spanish end_game2_b49f6069:

    # "It convulses before your eyes in the dark."
    "Se retuerce ante tus ojos en la oscuridad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1074
translate spanish end_game2_b3af052a:

    # "It whispers in your ear while you sleep."
    "Te susurra al oído mientras duermes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1075
translate spanish end_game2_0168ccc8:

    # "It brushes your neck when you don't see."
    "Te roza el cuello cuando no miras."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1076
translate spanish end_game2_f872b3f0:

    # "We all feel it."
    "Todos lo sentimos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1077
translate spanish end_game2_cf68f8c1:

    # "We all know it."
    "Todos lo conocemos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1078
translate spanish end_game2_d7a27e2c:

    # "It transcends all, it touches all, it {i}becomes{/i} all."
    "Lo trasciende todo, lo toca todo, {i}se convierte{/i} en todo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1079
translate spanish end_game2_f43fd1f4:

    # "\"{cps=22}{i}I see you...{/i}\""
    "\"{cps=22}{i}Te veo...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1080
translate spanish end_game2_f6a4dda9:

    # "The black tendrils of its reach already infect everything around you."
    "Los filamentos negros de su alcance ya infectan todo lo que te rodea."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1081
translate spanish end_game2_95cf7678:

    # "\"{cps=22}{i}They're going to kill you...They're going to kill him...Your purpose is doomed...{/i}\""
    "\"{cps=22}{i}Te van a matar...Lo van a matar...Tu propósito está condenado...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1082
translate spanish end_game2_71246463:

    # "And yet, you know that this is only the beginning, that soon it will blanket everything."
    "Y, aun así, sabes que esto es solo el principio, que pronto lo cubrirá todo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1083
translate spanish end_game2_4cab159b:

    # "\"{cps=22}{i}You will die...He will die...Trapped in the amalgamation forever...apart...{/i}\""
    "\"{cps=22}{i}Morirás...Él morirá...Atrapados en la amalgama para siempre...separados...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1084
translate spanish end_game2_03b7467d:

    # "And that's when it won't hide in the dark anymore..."
    "Y entonces ya no se esconderá en la oscuridad..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1087
translate spanish end_game2_b641b5fd:

    # "I gasp loudly, sitting up on the bench, feeling like something had been sitting on my chest."
    "Jadeo con fuerza, incorporándome en el banco, sintiendo como si algo se hubiera sentado sobre mi pecho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1088
translate spanish end_game2_16e18701:

    # "I feel like I've been holding my breath...or something had pushed it out."
    "Siento que he estado conteniendo la respiración...o que algo me la ha expulsado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1089
translate spanish end_game2_2a3fcf2b:

    # "\"{cps=22}{i}..die...{/i}\""
    "\"{cps=22}{i}..morirás...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1090
translate spanish end_game2_c068a429:

    # "A faint whisper to my left, and when I look, just for the briefest of moments, it seems as if the crouched wolf statue is contorted."
    "Un débil susurro a mi izquierda; cuando miro, por un brevísimo instante parece que la estatua del lobo agachado está retorcida."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1091
translate spanish end_game2_ac203bb0:

    # "Its neck is broken, staring straight back at me."
    "Tiene el cuello roto y me mira directamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1092
translate spanish end_game2_ea37f14f:

    # "I jump, leaning back as I stare at the grotesquely twisted wolf, but it's not twisted, it's like it always was..."
    "Me sobresalto y me echo atrás, mirando al lobo grotescamente retorcido, pero no está retorcido: está como siempre..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1094
translate spanish end_game2_faf6cd3f:

    # "And then I'm falling off the bench, landing hard on my ass and sending a jolt of pain through my tail bone."
    "Después caigo del banco, aterrizando con fuerza sobre el culo y sintiendo una descarga de dolor en el coxis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1097
translate spanish end_game2_99f2c6f1:

    # "I can't help the involuntary yelp that comes out of my mouth."
    "No puedo evitar el chillido involuntario que me sale de la boca."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1098
translate spanish end_game2_804cd142_1:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"¿[mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1099
translate spanish end_game2_b3d55b08:

    # "Amicus's voice echoes through halls, making me scramble to my feet, suddenly embarrassed about what had just happened."
    "La voz de Amicus resuena por los pasillos y me hace levantarme a toda prisa, avergonzado de lo ocurrido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1100
translate spanish end_game2_220eb1e7:

    # "I clear my throat in a way that sounds casual."
    "Me aclaro la garganta intentando sonar despreocupado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1101
translate spanish end_game2_c5f7a6a9:

    # m "\"I'm over here.\""
    m "\"Estoy aquí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1102
translate spanish end_game2_f45fb9c1:

    # "I move out from behind the statues, glancing one last time at the crouched wolf, neck in its proper position."
    "Salgo de detrás de las estatuas, mirando una última vez al lobo agachado, con el cuello en su posición correcta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1103
translate spanish end_game2_867d38f9:

    # "{i}It whispers in your ear while you sleep...{/i}"
    "{i}Te susurra al oído mientras duermes...{/i}"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1104
translate spanish end_game2_437280fc:

    # "When my back is to it, the nape of my neck prickles, and I hurry out from my hiding spot."
    "Cuando le doy la espalda, me hormiguea la nuca y me apresuro a salir de mi escondite."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1105
translate spanish end_game2_3ac44e5b:

    # "As I move out into the brightly lit main room, I realize that it's already dark."
    "Al entrar en la sala principal bien iluminada, me doy cuenta de que ya es de noche."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1106
translate spanish end_game2_14e56174:

    # "I've been here all day."
    "He pasado aquí todo el día."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1107
translate spanish end_game2_d086ee83:

    # a "\"Where?\""
    a "\"¿Dónde?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1108
translate spanish end_game2_15639431:

    # "Amicus's voice seems to come from further away, up the hall."
    "La voz de Amicus parece venir de más lejos, por el pasillo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1109
translate spanish end_game2_ddda9d21:

    # m "\"Here!\""
    m "\"¡Aquí!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1110
translate spanish end_game2_a6babd6e:

    # "I just want him to come get me."
    "Solo quiero que venga a buscarme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1111
translate spanish end_game2_99f92f03:

    # "I had a nightmare, or something, but it had felt so cold, dark...and real."
    "Tuve una pesadilla, o algo parecido, pero se sintió tan fría, oscura...y real."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1112
translate spanish end_game2_aa072113:

    # "I hear some footsteps padding up the hall, and I turn to see Amicus come around the corner, his paws clasped together."
    "Oigo pasos suaves por el pasillo y me vuelvo para ver a Amicus doblar la esquina con las manos juntas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1115
translate spanish end_game2_acb86774:

    # a "\"[mc]? I am so, so, so sorry. They wouldn't agree on anything, and I couldn't excuse myself to come see you because that would make it look as if I—\""
    a "\"¿[mc]? Lo siento muchísimo. No se ponían de acuerdo en nada y no podía excusarme para venir a verte porque parecería que yo—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1117
translate spanish end_game2_4eebb6b7:

    # "I cut Amicus off by hugging him, just wanting to feel his presence for now."
    "Interrumpo a Amicus abrazándolo; de momento solo quiero sentir su presencia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1118
translate spanish end_game2_15fe9223:

    # "The depressing thoughts I'd had all day, on top of that awful nightmare...at least what I hope was a nightmare, has left me feeling like complete shit."
    "Los pensamientos deprimentes de todo el día, junto con aquella horrible pesadilla...al menos espero que fuera una pesadilla, me han dejado hecho una mierda."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1119
translate spanish end_game2_012c0fd7:

    # a "\"Are you alright?\""
    a "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1120
translate spanish end_game2_fe09af0d:

    # "I'm quiet for a moment, wondering if I should tell Amicus anything about what I was thinking, what I saw...then decide against it, at least for now."
    "Guardo silencio un momento, preguntándome si debería contarle lo que pensaba, lo que vi...pero decido no hacerlo, al menos de momento."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1121
translate spanish end_game2_ecc028a1:

    # m "\"I'm just happy to see you.\""
    m "\"Simplemente me alegro de verte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1123
translate spanish end_game2_caa0de5c:

    # a "\"Really? Even after suffering through my complete incompetence all day long?\""
    a "\"¿De verdad? ¿Incluso después de sufrir mi absoluta incompetencia todo el día?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1124
translate spanish end_game2_6763a3dd:

    # "I'm about to scold Amicus for saying that about himself, but then I just end up nodding."
    "Estoy a punto de regañar a Amicus por hablar así de sí mismo, pero termino asintiendo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1125
translate spanish end_game2_62565fa2:

    # m "\"Yeah...We all have days like that. Did everyone leave?\""
    m "\"Sí...Todos tenemos días así. ¿Se ha ido todo el mundo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1126
translate spanish end_game2_79b4bae6:

    # a "\"Yes, the meeting concluded about ten minutes ago. I had worried you'd left the university for whatever reason.\""
    a "\"Sí, la reunión terminó hace unos diez minutos. Me preocupaba que hubieras salido de la universidad por algún motivo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1127
translate spanish end_game2_96c48d19:

    # m "\"Sorry.\""
    m "\"Perdón.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1129
translate spanish end_game2_aeb0979f:

    # a "\"Don't be. Were you sleeping?\""
    a "\"No te disculpes. ¿Estabas durmiendo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1130
translate spanish end_game2_c806ebc0:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Sí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1132
translate spanish end_game2_7eb761af:

    # a "\"Well, that's good, because I'm hoping...even after how poorly the day went, that you might join me for a late night Lover's Day celebration?\""
    a "\"Bueno, me alegro, porque esperaba...aunque el día haya ido tan mal, que quisieras acompañarme a una celebración nocturna del Día de los Enamorados.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1134
translate spanish end_game2_7ddcaa1a:

    # "He never gives up, and I do love that about him."
    "Nunca se rinde, y eso me encanta de él."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1135
translate spanish end_game2_ad10a89a:

    # "I smile."
    "Sonrío."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1136
translate spanish end_game2_65ef732e:

    # m "\"That sounds great, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Suena genial, Amicus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1139
translate spanish end_game2_8b3939f4:

    # "We walk down the steps from the main building into an empty courtyard, all of the vehicles gone."
    "Bajamos las escaleras del edificio principal hacia un patio vacío; todos los vehículos se han ido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1140
translate spanish end_game2_e499761a_2:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1141
translate spanish end_game2_eec9377f:

    # m "\"They just left us without any transportation?\""
    m "\"¿Nos han dejado sin transporte?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1143
translate spanish end_game2_90ba4167:

    # a "\"Oh yes, I told them to go on ahead.\""
    a "\"Oh, sí, les dije que se adelantaran.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1144
translate spanish end_game2_62a5f071:

    # m "\"Oh, why?\""
    m "\"Oh, ¿por qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1146
translate spanish end_game2_3174351e:

    # a "\"Do you not wish to walk?\""
    a "\"¿No quieres caminar?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1147
translate spanish end_game2_b6161ada:

    # m "\"Isn't it a little far to walk?\""
    m "\"¿No está un poco lejos para ir andando?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1148
translate spanish end_game2_649935a5:

    # "I follow Amicus down the steps and through the university's gardens before we're back in the forest, walking in the direction away from the palace."
    "Sigo a Amicus por las escaleras y los jardines de la universidad hasta volver al bosque, caminando en dirección contraria al palacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1150
translate spanish end_game2_45d2986b:

    # a "\"Not really. The city and palace are within reasonable walking distance.\""
    a "\"No mucho. La ciudad y el palacio están a una distancia razonable a pie.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1151
translate spanish end_game2_4c814a29:

    # "I walk alongside the wolf, feeling myself relax again as we're surrounded by the quiet forest."
    "Camino junto al lobo y siento que vuelvo a relajarme, rodeado por el bosque silencioso."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1154
translate spanish end_game2_fef5c314:

    # m "\"Huh, guess I just assumed it was far since we're always using the carriage.\""
    m "\"Ah, supongo que creía que estaba lejos porque siempre usamos el carruaje.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1155
translate spanish end_game2_257e85d1:

    # a "\"We tend to be lazy. That, and it's expected by the citizens as it's seen as more...dignified, I suppose.\""
    a "\"Solemos ser perezosos. Además, los ciudadanos lo esperan porque lo consideran más...digno, supongo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1156
translate spanish end_game2_32706b74:

    # m "\"Hmm, what about security? Shouldn't you have some protection as emperor?\""
    m "\"Hmm, ¿y la seguridad? ¿No deberías tener protección como emperador?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1157
translate spanish end_game2_c5351760:

    # "I look around, feeling almost vulnerable out here in the open with Amicus, used to always having the protection of the palace walls around us."
    "Miro alrededor, casi sintiéndome vulnerable al aire libre con Amicus, acostumbrado a la protección de las paredes del palacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1159
translate spanish end_game2_4331b431:

    # "Amicus glances up, and I follow his gaze, immediately spotting the blinking lights of drones above us."
    "Amicus alza la vista y sigo su mirada, viendo enseguida las luces parpadeantes de los drones sobre nosotros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1160
translate spanish end_game2_ec0ba95d:

    # a "\"Drones are far better than any sapient when it comes to security.\""
    a "\"Los drones son mucho mejores que cualquier Sapiente en asuntos de seguridad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1161
translate spanish end_game2_b55b53cc:

    # "Amicus looks over at me."
    "Amicus me mira."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1163
translate spanish end_game2_cd2819b7:

    # a "\"I suppose you haven't been outside the palace very often at all, have you?\""
    a "\"Supongo que no has salido mucho del palacio, ¿verdad?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1164
translate spanish end_game2_3a1f371a:

    # m "\"Not really.\""
    m "\"La verdad es que no.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1165
translate spanish end_game2_34b22650:

    # "The wolf grimaces."
    "El lobo hace una mueca."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1167
translate spanish end_game2_aacf9463:

    # a "\"I apologize for that. I know it seems like you should be more free to travel after what happened, but the people are...\""
    a "\"Me disculpo por ello. Sé que después de lo ocurrido parece que deberías tener más libertad para viajar, pero la gente está...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1168
translate spanish end_game2_59409490:

    # "Amicus takes a moment to find his words."
    "Amicus tarda un momento en encontrar las palabras."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1170
translate spanish end_game2_daeb0b09:

    # a "\"...very curious about you. It would be difficult to keep them from crowding.\""
    a "\"...muy interesada en ti. Sería difícil impedir que se aglomeraran.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1171
translate spanish end_game2_63478cee:

    # "I raise an eyebrow as I see lights in the distance, twinkling through the tree branches."
    "Alzo una ceja al ver luces a lo lejos, brillando entre las ramas de los árboles."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1172
translate spanish end_game2_59648285:

    # m "\"But we're heading to the city right now, aren't we?\""
    m "\"Pero ahora vamos a la ciudad, ¿no?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1173
translate spanish end_game2_21493a8f:

    # "I don't think I can deal with crowds, at least not now when I'm not really prepared for it."
    "No creo poder enfrentarme a multitudes, al menos ahora, que no estoy preparado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1174
translate spanish end_game2_3756d470:

    # a "\"Well, I cleared the district for our arrival, though that was supposed to be...I'd say five hours ago.\""
    a "\"Bueno, despejé el distrito para nuestra llegada, aunque eso debía haber sido...hace unas cinco horas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1176
translate spanish end_game2_0d9d8caf:

    # a "\"But still, it's late enough that the streets should be mostly empty.\""
    a "\"Pero es lo bastante tarde para que las calles estén casi vacías.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1177
translate spanish end_game2_2d6ee573:

    # m "\"Oh.\""
    m "\"Ah.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1178
translate spanish end_game2_757d7f2d:

    # "I draw closer to Amicus."
    "Me acerco más a Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1179
translate spanish end_game2_3b69c6f6:

    # m "\"Where are we going?\""
    m "\"¿Adónde vamos?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1181
translate spanish end_game2_47cd483a:

    # a "\"You'll see.\""
    a "\"Ya verás.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1182
translate spanish end_game2_3b3a7923:

    # "There's a sly smile on the wolf's face as we trudge along the path, walking in comfortable silence."
    "El lobo lleva una sonrisa pícara mientras avanzamos por el sendero en un silencio agradable."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1184
translate spanish end_game2_544175c0:

    # "Eventually, we break through the trees and into the small, quaint street that I'd been on before."
    "Finalmente salimos de entre los árboles a la pequeña calle pintoresca en la que ya había estado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1185
translate spanish end_game2_669f89da:

    # "Sure enough, it's completely empty aside from one or two figures moving up the sidewalk or standing in a doorway."
    "En efecto, está completamente vacía, salvo una o dos figuras que caminan por la acera o están en una puerta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1186
translate spanish end_game2_4cb8e272:

    # "I notice then that Amicus is becoming more excited, and it shows in his widening strides, and I have to hurry to keep up."
    "Noto que Amicus está cada vez más emocionado: alarga las zancadas y debo apresurarme para seguirlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1187
translate spanish end_game2_03b61350:

    # "I try to think of where he could possibly be taking me."
    "Intento imaginar adónde puede llevarme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1188
translate spanish end_game2_2e87079d:

    # m "\"Amicus?\""
    m "\"¿Amicus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1189
translate spanish end_game2_7c86d643:

    # "The wolf pauses, waiting for me to catch up, then places his paw against the small of my back, and I'm suddenly thrust forward at his speed, forced along in a stumbling gait."
    "El lobo se detiene para esperarme, me apoya una mano en la zona lumbar y de pronto me impulsa hacia delante a su velocidad, obligándome a avanzar a trompicones."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1190
translate spanish end_game2_ea49018d:

    # m "\"Whoa!\""
    m "\"¡Eh!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1192
translate spanish end_game2_9dcaf365:

    # a "\"Come on, it's right here.\""
    a "\"Vamos, está aquí mismo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1193
translate spanish end_game2_f9788974:

    # "The wolf sweeps me under a dark archway."
    "El lobo me lleva bajo un arco oscuro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1194
translate spanish end_game2_b4646299:

    # "There's a door in front of us, the soft glow of light barely showing through the frosted glass framing the door."
    "Tenemos una puerta delante; un suave resplandor apenas atraviesa el vidrio esmerilado que la enmarca."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1195
translate spanish end_game2_7e608399:

    # "It looks like it's closed, and I look up at Amicus in question, but the wolf doesn't seem bothered, and simply knocks on the door."
    "Parece cerrado y miro a Amicus interrogativamente, pero al lobo no le preocupa y simplemente llama a la puerta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1198
translate spanish end_game2_d803b403:

    # "We wait a few moments, then Amicus leans in toward the crack, talking loudly through it."
    "Esperamos unos momentos; después Amicus se inclina hacia la rendija y habla por ella en voz alta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1200
translate spanish end_game2_92008127:

    # a "\"Helooooo, Gaius?\""
    a "\"Holaaaa, ¿Gaius?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1201
translate spanish end_game2_aed55d51:

    # "Something beyond the door blots out the light, and Amicus steps back before suddenly drawing me to his side, as if preparing to introduce me to someone."
    "Algo al otro lado tapa la luz y Amicus retrocede; después me atrae de pronto a su lado, como si fuera a presentarme a alguien."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1202
translate spanish end_game2_e84baeda:

    # "I stand there awkwardly, trying to prepare myself for whatever this is."
    "Me quedo allí incómodo, intentando prepararme para lo que sea."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1204
translate spanish end_game2_735b217d:

    # "When the door opens, it's not what I expect at all:"
    "Cuando se abre la puerta, no es en absoluto lo que esperaba:"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1205
translate spanish end_game2_b34fc509:

    # "An old she-wolf in an apron and with a cloth tied over the top of her head peers around the door, cracked open just enough so that her muzzle can fit through."
    "Una loba anciana, con un delantal y un paño atado sobre la cabeza, se asoma por la puerta, abierta solo lo suficiente para pasar el hocico."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1206
translate spanish end_game2_39b41e13:

    # "I feel Amicus shift next to me, and he forces his smile even bigger."
    "Siento que Amicus se mueve a mi lado y fuerza una sonrisa aún más grande."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1208
translate spanish end_game2_59361f3b:

    # a "\"Hello.\""
    a "\"Hola.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1209
translate spanish end_game2_d32b8a47:

    # "The old woman squints."
    "La anciana entrecierra los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1210
translate spanish end_game2_3218a2bf:

    # "Old She-wolf" "\"Hello?\""
    "Old She-wolf" "\"¿Hola?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1212
translate spanish end_game2_5512288a:

    # "Amicus is quiet for a moment, clearly taken aback by the other wolf's lack of reaction."
    "Amicus guarda silencio un momento, claramente desconcertado por la falta de reacción de la otra loba."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1213
translate spanish end_game2_03e8da50:

    # "He clears his throat."
    "Se aclara la garganta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1215
translate spanish end_game2_fdebb96d:

    # a "\"I am Amicus, your emperor, and this is [mc], my...companion.\""
    a "\"Soy Amicus, vuestro emperador, y este es [mc], mi...compañero.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1216
translate spanish end_game2_631756ef:

    # "That's a new title."
    "Es un título nuevo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1217
translate spanish end_game2_f9e2a1b7:

    # "I look up at the wolf in question, but he goes on staring at the she-wolf who only continues to stare back at him."
    "Miro al lobo interrogativamente, pero él sigue mirando a la loba, que simplemente le devuelve la mirada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1219
translate spanish end_game2_fbb21ad9:

    # a "\"Maybe you are familiar?\""
    a "\"¿Quizá os resulto familiar?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1220
translate spanish end_game2_5d94e76f:

    # "Old She-wolf" "\"Hmm...no, no, I don't think so.\""
    "Old She-wolf" "\"Hmm...no, no, no lo creo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1223
translate spanish end_game2_f00433d3:

    # "Amicus stares, his mouth gaping open while the woman starts to close the door."
    "Amicus se queda mirando con la boca abierta mientras la mujer empieza a cerrar la puerta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1224
translate spanish end_game2_58f0f6b0:

    # "Quickly, Amicus lets go of me to reach out, stopping the door from closing just by an inch."
    "Rápidamente me suelta y extiende una mano, impidiendo por muy poco que se cierre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1226
translate spanish end_game2_589fc791:

    # a "\"Uh, excuse me please, but could you summon Gaius? He will know who I am.\""
    a "\"Eh, disculpadme, por favor, pero ¿podríais llamar a Gaius? Él sabrá quién soy.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1227
translate spanish end_game2_520b41a5:

    # "The old wolf sticks her muzzle back through the crack, glaring now."
    "La loba anciana vuelve a sacar el hocico por la rendija, ahora con una mirada furiosa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1228
translate spanish end_game2_564443d9:

    # "Old She-wolf" "\"Gaius was relieved of his shift three hours ago. You know it's the second hour?\""
    "Old She-wolf" "\"El turno de Gaius terminó hace tres horas. ¿Sabes que es la segunda hora?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1229
translate spanish end_game2_836d43cd:

    # a "\"I—I had suspected, though I had hoped he would have waited for me—\""
    a "\"Y-yo lo sospechaba, aunque esperaba que me hubiera aguardado—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1230
translate spanish end_game2_df68772d:

    # "Old She-wolf" "\"You thought wrong, dear.\""
    "Old She-wolf" "\"Pues pensaste mal, querido.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1231
translate spanish end_game2_2fa4382b:

    # "Amicus bristles."
    "Amicus se eriza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1233
translate spanish end_game2_62c32856:

    # a "\"E—Excuse me, but you realize you are speaking to your emperor, woman?\""
    a "\"D-disculpa, pero ¿te das cuenta de que hablas con tu emperador, mujer?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1234
translate spanish end_game2_713d8312:

    # "Now I bristle."
    "Ahora me irrito yo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1235
translate spanish end_game2_9c6d4631:

    # "Even though I don't know what's going on, exactly, I do feel a surge of disappointment at seeing my lover use the \"do you know who I am?\" line."
    "Aunque no sé exactamente qué pasa, me invade la decepción al ver a mi amante recurrir al \"¿sabes quién soy?\"."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1236
translate spanish end_game2_6ae30550:

    # m "\"Amicus...\""
    m "\"Amicus...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1237
translate spanish end_game2_0d50df5d:

    # "I try to say it under my breath so the other wolf doesn't hear."
    "Intento decirlo en voz baja para que la otra loba no lo oiga."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1239
translate spanish end_game2_e07a6585:

    # a "\"What? I'm just trying—\""
    a "\"¿Qué? Solo intento—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1240
translate spanish end_game2_f9798fb1:

    # "The door starts to close again, and Amicus quickly reaches out, but this time, the old woman is ready."
    "La puerta vuelve a cerrarse y Amicus extiende rápidamente una mano, pero esta vez la anciana está preparada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1241
translate spanish end_game2_adf1eba1:

    # "She reaches out to smack his paw hard, making Amicus gasp in surprise before the door slams shut."
    "Le golpea con fuerza la mano, haciendo que Amicus jadee sorprendido antes de que la puerta se cierre de golpe."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1243
translate spanish end_game2_59ee7e3f:

    # a "\"How dare...\""
    a "\"Cómo se atreve...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1245
translate spanish end_game2_c9cb7cb4:

    # "Amicus looks at loss for a moment, as if he's never experienced something like this before and doesn't know what to do, then he tries to open the door, but it's locked."
    "Amicus parece perdido un momento, como si nunca hubiera vivido algo así y no supiera qué hacer; después intenta abrir la puerta, pero está cerrada con llave."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1246
translate spanish end_game2_0f4537e5:

    # "He then resorts to pounding on the door with a heavy fist, lips drawn back to show his teeth."
    "Entonces la golpea con un puño pesado, retrayendo los labios para mostrar los dientes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1248
translate spanish end_game2_99397d82:

    # a "\"Open the damned door! I was promised a special banquet in the human's honor! Do you hear me, woman!?\""
    a "\"¡Abre la maldita puerta! ¡Me prometieron un banquete especial en honor del humano! ¿¡Me oyes, mujer!?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1249
translate spanish end_game2_94288fb7:

    # "I reach out, pushing a hand against Amicus's chest."
    "Extiendo una mano y la presiono contra el pecho de Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1250
translate spanish end_game2_ab22b33b:

    # m "\"Holy shit, Amicus, stop!\""
    m "\"¡Joder, Amicus, basta!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1251
translate spanish end_game2_4965e01e:

    # "I hiss at him under my breath, looking around, not having expected to be embarrassed at Amicus's behavior."
    "Le siseo en voz baja, mirando alrededor; no esperaba avergonzarme por su comportamiento."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1252
translate spanish end_game2_a70a4fdd:

    # "I'm so used to embarrassing myself."
    "Estoy tan acostumbrado a avergonzarme yo solo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1255
translate spanish end_game2_3c8805f7:

    # a "\"What?\""
    a "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1256
translate spanish end_game2_7929d7b1:

    # m "\"Do you hear yourself?\""
    m "\"¿Te estás escuchando?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1257
translate spanish end_game2_a2bdea04:

    # a "\"What do you mean? I paid for their services and had everything planned—\""
    a "\"¿Qué quieres decir? Pagué por sus servicios y lo tenía todo planeado—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1258
translate spanish end_game2_1df6f853:

    # m "\"We're five hours late!\""
    m "\"¡Llegamos cinco horas tarde!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1261
translate spanish end_game2_696efafc:

    # a "\"But I'm the emperor, and you are my guest, and that woman—\""
    a "\"Pero soy el emperador, tú eres mi invitado y esa mujer—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1263
translate spanish end_game2_74e3dfd5:

    # "I step closer, cutting Amicus off even as I lower my voice, surprised at the sudden surge of anger I'm feeling."
    "Me acerco e interrumpo a Amicus mientras bajo la voz, sorprendido por la súbita oleada de ira que siento."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1264
translate spanish end_game2_fa3da4d8:

    # m "\"Amicus, you're acting like a spoiled brat right now, just like Cassius...and stop calling her woman.\""
    m "\"Amicus, ahora te comportas como un mocoso consentido, igual que Cassius...y deja de llamarla mujer.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1265
translate spanish end_game2_810b5b47:

    # "Amicus's indignant demeanor seems to deflate a little bit at that."
    "La indignación de Amicus parece desinflarse un poco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1267
translate spanish end_game2_78371e4e:

    # a "\"I—I'm not acting like him at all. And what else should I call her? She is a woman.\""
    a "\"Y-yo no me comporto como él en absoluto. ¿Y cómo debo llamarla? Es una mujer.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1268
translate spanish end_game2_9f5bb5fe:

    # m "\"It's the {i}way{/i} you're saying it, and I dunno, maybe ma'am could be a good start?\""
    m "\"Es la {i}forma{/i} en que lo dices. No sé, quizá señora sea un buen comienzo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1269
translate spanish end_game2_d8e9495f:

    # a "\"Well, she's certainly not acting like a madam.\""
    a "\"Bueno, desde luego no se comporta como una señora.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1270
translate spanish end_game2_4e3fb928:

    # m "\"Is this how you act when you don't get your way?\""
    m "\"¿Así actúas cuando no te sales con la tuya?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1271
translate spanish end_game2_2e930e9c:

    # "Amicus has always had an entitled streak."
    "Amicus siempre ha tenido cierta tendencia a creer que todo le corresponde."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1272
translate spanish end_game2_e505db53:

    # "I mean, it's kind of what got me in this situation in the first place, but I thought he'd have changed a bit after everything we'd been through."
    "De hecho, por eso acabé en esta situación, pero creía que habría cambiado un poco después de todo lo vivido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1273
translate spanish end_game2_d0d096f2:

    # "Especially over something as small as this."
    "Especialmente por algo tan pequeño como esto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1274
translate spanish end_game2_ea9fbc5a:

    # "Amicus must see the disappointment in my face, because he deflates further, blowing out a big breath that ruffles back my hair and smells vaguely of lavender."
    "Amicus debe de ver la decepción en mi cara, porque se desinfla aún más y suelta una gran bocanada que me despeina y huele vagamente a lavanda."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1276
translate spanish end_game2_36636428:

    # a "\"No...no, I don't, I promise. It's just that I had something very special planned, and—\""
    a "\"No...no, no actúo así, te lo prometo. Es que tenía algo muy especial planeado y—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1277
translate spanish end_game2_a58d07c7:

    # "Amicus looks back at the door, trying to see through the frosted glass, as if whoever he's looking for will magically appear."
    "Amicus vuelve a mirar la puerta, intentando ver a través del cristal esmerilado, como si la persona que busca fuera a aparecer por arte de magia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1278
translate spanish end_game2_53f73b25:

    # m "\"Amicus, you can't expect anyone to wait five hours for you, whether you're emperor, or not.\""
    m "\"Amicus, no puedes esperar que nadie te aguarde cinco horas, seas emperador o no.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1279
translate spanish end_game2_a5ed7e8b:

    # "I think."
    "Reflexiono."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1280
translate spanish end_game2_68025071:

    # m "\"Except me, of course.\""
    m "\"Excepto yo, claro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1282
translate spanish end_game2_a61ebafe:

    # a "\"Yeah...\""
    a "\"Sí...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1283
translate spanish end_game2_ea79be36:

    # "I see the moment Amicus gives up on his grand plan, whatever it was, as his deflation completes in a slouch, and suddenly he looks very, very tired."
    "Veo el momento en que Amicus renuncia a su gran plan, fuera el que fuera: se encorva por completo y, de pronto, parece muy, muy cansado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1284
translate spanish end_game2_97e2c3a3:

    # m "\"...You okay?\""
    m "\"...¿Estás bien?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1286
translate spanish end_game2_ec08fe3e:

    # a "\"Yes, I'm fine. Let's...let's just head back to the palace.\""
    a "\"Sí, estoy bien. Volvamos...volvamos al palacio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1287
translate spanish end_game2_23c61366:

    # m "\"Maybe we could go someplace else? I wouldn't mind finding a hole-in-the wall that's open late.\""
    m "\"¿Quizá podríamos ir a otro sitio? No me importaría encontrar un local pequeño que abra hasta tarde.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1289
translate spanish end_game2_764ce9c7:

    # "But Amicus is already walking back up the road toward the forest, shaking his head."
    "Pero Amicus ya camina de vuelta hacia el bosque, negando con la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1290
translate spanish end_game2_14064fb9:

    # a "\"I would rather we reserve the location ahead of time so that I can ensure your safety. It's too late for that tonight.\""
    a "\"Preferiría reservar el lugar antes para garantizar tu seguridad. Esta noche ya es demasiado tarde.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1291
translate spanish end_game2_991c429c:

    # "I follow Amicus at a slight distance, feeling generally disappointed and baffled over what had just happened."
    "Sigo a Amicus a poca distancia, decepcionado y desconcertado por lo ocurrido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1292
translate spanish end_game2_cec40b39:

    # "While I'm still feeling somewhat stunned by Amicus's behavior, I also feel bad because it's clear that he'd really wanted to make tonight special, and to see him so defeated..."
    "Aunque su comportamiento todavía me tiene algo aturdido, también me siento mal porque está claro que quería que esta noche fuera especial, y verlo tan derrotado..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1294
translate spanish end_game2_c6a96811:

    # "I catch up to him and walk alongside the wolf just as we pass under the cover of the many branches, our path lit by the firefly-like insects floating around us."
    "Lo alcanzo y camino a su lado al pasar bajo las ramas; los insectos semejantes a luciérnagas que flotan alrededor iluminan el sendero."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1295
translate spanish end_game2_95bb049b:

    # m "\"Well, we could do something at the palace. Maybe have a picnic?\""
    m "\"Bueno, podríamos hacer algo en el palacio. ¿Quizá una comida al aire libre?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1296
translate spanish end_game2_fa573af8:

    # "Amicus heaves a heavy sigh."
    "Amicus suelta un gran suspiro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1298
translate spanish end_game2_48483942:

    # a "\"Honestly, [mc], I'm a bit tired...and it's not even Lover's Day anymore anyway.\""
    a "\"Sinceramente, [mc], estoy algo cansado...y, de todas formas, ya ni es el Día de los Enamorados.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1299
translate spanish end_game2_3e46b371:

    # "The wolf says the last bit so quietly that I barely catch it."
    "El lobo dice lo último tan bajo que apenas lo oigo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1300
translate spanish end_game2_48ff5cf6:

    # "And just like that, my attempts to keep my own mood light give in and I sour instantly."
    "Y así, sin más, mis intentos de mantener el buen humor se derrumban y me amargo al instante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1303
translate spanish end_game2_b1fe8fa5:

    # m "\"Well...if your goal is to ruin the rest of the night, you're doing a damn good job of it.\""
    m "\"Bueno...si quieres arruinar el resto de la noche, lo estás haciendo de puta madre.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1304
translate spanish end_game2_e29cdb3e:

    # "Suddenly, we're having one of our old fights again, the way we would feed off of each other's negativity and spiral into a shared mood of sulk."
    "De pronto volvemos a una de nuestras antiguas peleas, alimentándonos de la negatividad del otro hasta compartir el mal humor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1305
translate spanish end_game2_11ee6ea9:

    # "Usually, I'd be the one to start it, but this time I feel like Amicus is the clear culprit."
    "Normalmente era yo quien empezaba, pero esta vez siento que Amicus es claramente el culpable."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1306
translate spanish end_game2_e7f31b97:

    # "I stare at the ground, frowning even though I feel Amicus's eyes on me."
    "Miro al suelo, frunciendo el ceño aunque siento los ojos de Amicus sobre mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1307
translate spanish end_game2_34b79e1c:

    # "Then it takes me a few moments to realize he's stopped walking."
    "Tardo unos momentos en comprender que ha dejado de caminar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1308
translate spanish end_game2_f990b9d4:

    # "I stop too, then turn around to look back at him."
    "También me detengo y me vuelvo para mirarlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1310
translate spanish end_game2_07cd6598:

    # "We regard each other for a moment, then Amicus takes a deep breath."
    "Nos miramos un momento y después Amicus respira hondo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1311
translate spanish end_game2_a0613b69:

    # a "\"I...realize that I am acting like a spoiled pup, and I apologize. I do not want this to ruin the rest of the night, even though there is not much left of it.\""
    a "\"Me...doy cuenta de que actúo como un cachorro consentido, y me disculpo. No quiero que esto arruine el resto de la noche, aunque quede poco.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1312
translate spanish end_game2_acca654e:

    # "I stand there, not saying anything because it looks like Amicus wants to say more."
    "Me quedo sin decir nada, porque parece que Amicus quiere añadir algo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1313
translate spanish end_game2_f00496e7:

    # a "\"I promise you, I do not often act in such a way in front of my subjects.\""
    a "\"Te prometo que no suelo actuar así delante de mis súbditos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1315
translate spanish end_game2_010c82f5:

    # a "\"I just so desperately wanted for something to go right after everything that happened...\""
    a "\"Solo deseaba desesperadamente que algo saliera bien después de todo lo ocurrido...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1316
translate spanish end_game2_aa616c93:

    # m "\"Not often?\""
    m "\"¿No sueles?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1317
translate spanish end_game2_aa2b8676:

    # "I raise an eyebrow, but smirk at the same time, wanting to show Amicus that I'm willing to lighten up as well."
    "Alzo una ceja, pero también sonrío de lado, queriendo mostrarle que yo también estoy dispuesto a relajarme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1319
translate spanish end_game2_35e382bd:

    # a "\"I mean, never, really. I've never used such words to get my way during all of my emperorship, and it was only because it was for {i}you{/i}.\""
    a "\"Quiero decir que nunca, en realidad. No he usado esas palabras para salirme con la mía durante todo mi reinado; solo lo hice porque era por {i}ti{/i}.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1320
translate spanish end_game2_3f739ce1:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1321
translate spanish end_game2_186c5628:

    # m "\"Well...please don't ever feel the need to act that way on my behalf again. Especially when you're yelling at an old lady and calling her {i}woman{/i}.\""
    m "\"Bueno...por favor, no vuelvas a sentir que debes actuar así por mí. Especialmente cuando gritas a una anciana y la llamas {i}mujer{/i}.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1323
translate spanish end_game2_dd898edc:

    # a "\"I still do not see the problem with that. She {i}is{/i} a woman.\""
    a "\"Sigo sin ver el problema. {i}Es{/i} una mujer.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1324
translate spanish end_game2_5a613a6f:

    # "Amicus starts walking again, and I walk alongside him."
    "Amicus vuelve a caminar y voy a su lado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1325
translate spanish end_game2_b00236c7:

    # m "\"And like I said, it's the way you were saying it, like it was an insult, somehow.\""
    m "\"Como dije, es la forma en que lo decías, como si fuera un insulto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1326
translate spanish end_game2_e8943bf3:

    # a "\"I did not mean it that way.\""
    a "\"No quería decirlo así.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1327
translate spanish end_game2_3f481890:

    # m "\"I mean, I kind of feel like you did. But I get it, you were raised in this society of—\""
    m "\"Pues creo un poco que sí. Pero lo entiendo: creciste en esta sociedad de—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1328
translate spanish end_game2_eb6d22ec:

    # "Amicus huffs out a sigh."
    "Amicus resopla un suspiro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1329
translate spanish end_game2_7384a961:

    # a "\"Yes, I know. But I've been doing a lot to progress the rights of women in this society.\""
    a "\"Sí, lo sé. Pero he hecho mucho por avanzar los derechos de las mujeres en esta sociedad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1330
translate spanish end_game2_321851e1:

    # a "\"Just yesterday I put into motion legislation that will allow females to request a divorce before a court.\""
    a "\"Precisamente ayer puse en marcha una ley que permitirá a las mujeres solicitar el divorcio ante un tribunal.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1331
translate spanish end_game2_55cc15e7:

    # m "\"And they couldn't before?\""
    m "\"¿Y antes no podían?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1333
translate spanish end_game2_85cc914b:

    # a "\"Well, no, the husband had to.\""
    a "\"Bueno, no; tenía que hacerlo el marido.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1334
translate spanish end_game2_93bd3770:

    # m "\"Wow...\""
    m "\"Vaya...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1336
translate spanish end_game2_baa7287f:

    # a "\"Gods, are you humans going to be like the Khemians? Shocked and disgusted by every aspect of our society?\""
    a "\"Dioses, ¿vais a ser los humanos como los Khemianos? ¿Escandalizados y asqueados por cada aspecto de nuestra sociedad?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1337
translate spanish end_game2_8619f2c6_1:

    # "I shrug."
    "Me encojo de hombros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1338
translate spanish end_game2_7c79f747:

    # m "\"I mean, some definitely will be.\""
    m "\"Bueno, algunos lo estarán, sin duda.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1339
translate spanish end_game2_7f83ae76:

    # a "\"Do you not have your own problems?\""
    a "\"¿No tenéis vuestros propios problemas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1340
translate spanish end_game2_e33f02ef:

    # "I laugh."
    "Me río."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1341
translate spanish end_game2_f1e8ef67:

    # m "\"Oh yeah, we do, we {i}definitely{/i} do. I'm sure you'll be beyond shocked by some of the things we've done to ourselves.\""
    m "\"Oh, sí, los tenemos; {i}sin duda{/i} los tenemos. Algunas de las cosas que nos hemos hecho te dejarán más que escandalizado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1342
translate spanish end_game2_7929dd14:

    # a "\"Like?\""
    a "\"¿Como cuáles?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1343
translate spanish end_game2_2c5a22b3:

    # "I close my eyes, shaking my head."
    "Cierro los ojos y niego con la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1344
translate spanish end_game2_d81c6c67:

    # m "\"I'll let the diplomats reveal that to you, but yeah, most places on Earth still have problems when it comes to equality, a lot of problems.\""
    m "\"Dejaré que te lo cuenten los diplomáticos, pero sí: la mayoría de los lugares de la Tierra todavía tienen problemas de igualdad, muchos problemas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1346
translate spanish end_game2_9eaa2441:

    # a "\"Then why do you judge me so harshly?\""
    a "\"Entonces, ¿por qué me juzgas tan duramente?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1347
translate spanish end_game2_dcf666eb:

    # m "\"Because I know you can do better, and I know you have the power to create immediate change.\""
    m "\"Porque sé que puedes hacerlo mejor y que tienes el poder de cambiar las cosas de inmediato.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1349
translate spanish end_game2_e1239223:

    # a "\"Technically, but realistically—\""
    a "\"Técnicamente, pero en la práctica—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1350
translate spanish end_game2_c436e109:

    # m "\"I know, it's a slow process.\""
    m "\"Lo sé: es un proceso lento.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1351
translate spanish end_game2_a6721f33:

    # m "\"But you know, where you found me, Italy, it's doing alright with equality, and a lot of Europe is doing great, so I know Adastra can be better.\""
    m "\"Pero, donde me encontraste, Italia, la igualdad va bastante bien, y en gran parte de Europa va muy bien; así que sé que Adastra puede mejorar.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1352
translate spanish end_game2_cb7e8690:

    # "Things go quiet for a moment, that tangent feeling a little strange, like there's more to it than just gender equality."
    "Nos quedamos un momento en silencio; esa digresión resulta algo extraña, como si hubiera algo más que igualdad de género."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1353
translate spanish end_game2_eda81ff3:

    # "Amicus senses it too, of course:"
    "Amicus también lo siente, claro:"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1355
translate spanish end_game2_226c9be0:

    # a "\"While I know that the parents, through whatever space wizardry they possess, brought us together due to perfect compatibility—\""
    a "\"Aunque sé que los Padres, con la magia espacial que tengan, nos juntaron por nuestra perfecta compatibilidad—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1357
translate spanish end_game2_e8b8ff0f:

    # a "\"—sometimes I wonder about their measurements, because in some instances, we do feel worlds apart.\""
    a "\"—a veces me pregunto cómo hicieron sus cálculos, porque en algunos casos sí que parecemos vivir en mundos distintos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1358
translate spanish end_game2_0e65f65d:

    # "I look at Amicus, the statement making me feel a little sad."
    "Miro a Amicus; la afirmación me entristece un poco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1359
translate spanish end_game2_9a59bc78:

    # m "\"Well, I guess we really are.\""
    m "\"Bueno, supongo que realmente es así.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1360
translate spanish end_game2_bcf07b7b:

    # a "\"But...I love it, I love that about you. You open my eyes, you surprise me, and I've accepted the fact that you come from a better functioning society.\""
    a "\"Pero...me encanta; me encanta eso de ti. Me abres los ojos, me sorprendes y he aceptado que vienes de una sociedad que funciona mejor.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1361
translate spanish end_game2_1f13d0f9:

    # a "\"I'm willing to learn.\""
    a "\"Estoy dispuesto a aprender.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1362
translate spanish end_game2_39d9857f:

    # "I look down, feeling a little embarrassed."
    "Miro hacia abajo, sintiéndome un poco avergonzado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1363
translate spanish end_game2_28b1048c:

    # m "\"Well, humans have a {i}lot{/i} to learn too. We're kind of a disaster, too.\""
    m "\"Bueno, los humanos también tenemos {i}mucho{/i} que aprender. También somos un poco desastrosos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1364
translate spanish end_game2_7f62752d:

    # a "\"Then let us learn together.\""
    a "\"Entonces aprendamos juntos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1366
translate spanish end_game2_084220c4:

    # a "\"But back to what I was saying previously: [mc], we're...we're running out of time, and I {i}need{/i} to do something with you. I feel like I missed that tonight.\""
    a "\"Pero, volviendo a lo que decía antes: [mc], nos...nos estamos quedando sin tiempo, y {i}necesito{/i} hacer algo contigo. Siento que esta noche no lo hemos conseguido.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1367
translate spanish end_game2_104e5611:

    # "I feel my chest twinge a bit at that."
    "Siento una pequeña punzada en el pecho al oírlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1368
translate spanish end_game2_80ea9d91:

    # m "\"We still have time.\""
    m "\"Todavía tenemos tiempo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1370
translate spanish end_game2_d93452b8:

    # a "\"I suppose.\""
    a "\"Supongo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1371
translate spanish end_game2_77f498ce:

    # "It's quiet again, and though things aren't fully relaxed again, most of the tension has left the air."
    "Vuelve el silencio y, aunque aún no estamos completamente relajados, casi toda la tensión se ha disipado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1372
translate spanish end_game2_2dc4ace5:

    # "After a few more minutes of walking, simply enjoying the cool, night air, I clear my throat."
    "Tras unos minutos más caminando, disfrutando simplemente del fresco aire nocturno, me aclaro la garganta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1373
translate spanish end_game2_6edfbf00:

    # m "\"So, uh, what was that whole restaurant thing about?\""
    m "\"Entonces, eh, ¿a qué venía todo eso del restaurante?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1375
translate spanish end_game2_f62564dd:

    # "Amicus chuckles, kicking a rock with a big foot paw, sending it tumbling up the path to clack loudly against the roots of a tree."
    "Amicus se ríe y le da una patada a una piedra con su enorme pata, haciéndola rodar por el sendero hasta que choca ruidosamente con las raíces de un árbol."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1376
translate spanish end_game2_87da4fb6:

    # a "\"I had, uh, decided to get a head start on human integration into the {i}Galaxias{/i}, even though the citizens won't know it.\""
    a "\"Había decidido, eh, adelantarme a la integración humana en el {i}Galaxias{/i}, aunque los ciudadanos no lo sabrán.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1377
translate spanish end_game2_707d2a10:

    # m "\"How so?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1378
translate spanish end_game2_18e4babd:

    # a "\"Well, a cultural staple for all species is often times their food.\""
    a "\"Bueno, la comida suele ser un elemento fundamental de la cultura de cualquier especie.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1379
translate spanish end_game2_9b78ca0f:

    # m "\"Yeah?\""
    m "\"¿Sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1380
translate spanish end_game2_20e5cd12:

    # "I have an idea of where this is going, but I don't know how it's possible."
    "Me hago una idea de adónde quiere llegar, pero no sé cómo es posible."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1381
translate spanish end_game2_27ef6f27:

    # a "\"So, I've established a human cuisine restaurant.\""
    a "\"Así que he fundado un restaurante de cocina humana.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1382
translate spanish end_game2_6c6c25c1:

    # m "\"Oh really?\""
    m "\"¿Ah, sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1384
translate spanish end_game2_bcc81977:

    # a "\"Yes.\""
    a "\"Sí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1385
translate spanish end_game2_cced5b15:

    # m "\"But, uh, how?\""
    m "\"Pero, eh, ¿cómo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1386
translate spanish end_game2_2435df10:

    # a "\"Com analyzed and stored a fragment of the data from your Nexus back on Earth.\""
    a "\"Com analizó y almacenó una parte de los datos de vuestro Nexus en la Tierra.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1387
translate spanish end_game2_d87dd849:

    # a "\"Though not all ingredients are the same, we substituted as best we could and developed food that is, in my opinion, rather authentic.\""
    a "\"Aunque no todos los ingredientes son iguales, los sustituimos lo mejor que pudimos y elaboramos comida que, en mi opinión, es bastante auténtica.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1388
translate spanish end_game2_fefe1069:

    # m "\"Huh...you know there's a lot of food from different cultures on Earth, so a lot of different types of food.\""
    m "\"Vaya...sabes que en la Tierra hay comida de muchas culturas diferentes, así que hay muchos tipos de comida.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1390
translate spanish end_game2_93eb0ea7:

    # a "\"Oh, I kept it all in Italy, at least for now. In fact, our first item was {i}Nea-poli-tan pi-zza{/i}.\""
    a "\"Oh, lo limité todo a Italia, al menos por ahora. De hecho, nuestro primer plato fue {i}pi-zza na-po-li-ta-na{/i}.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1391
translate spanish end_game2_317e26bd:

    # "Amicus's suddenly heavily accented voice startles me a bit, as it always does, the wolf chewing around the words like he's actually eating it."
    "La voz de Amicus, de repente cargada de acento, me sobresalta un poco, como siempre; el lobo mastica las palabras como si de verdad estuviera comiéndoselas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1392
translate spanish end_game2_8c4e5c77:

    # m "\"Wow.\""
    m "\"Vaya.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1394
translate spanish end_game2_e05b3600:

    # a "\"So, as you would expect, I wanted you to try all of the items to let us know how we did.\""
    a "\"Así que, como imaginarás, quería que probaras todos los platos para decirnos qué tal nos habían salido.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1395
translate spanish end_game2_1b161588:

    # "Amicus is talking about all of this like the restaurant was his own project, something he's been working on for a long time."
    "Amicus habla de todo esto como si el restaurante fuera su propio proyecto, algo en lo que lleva mucho tiempo trabajando."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1397
translate spanish end_game2_33e91dac:

    # a "\"I thought it would be a fun distraction for you, but as you know, things did not go as planned.\""
    a "\"Pensé que sería una distracción divertida para ti, pero, como sabes, las cosas no salieron según lo previsto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1398
translate spanish end_game2_c289b373:

    # "It would have been fun, and I am disappointed that we didn't get to do it together, but the thought alone of what Amicus had planned for me is enough to warm my chest, and I lean against him."
    "Habría sido divertido, y me decepciona que no pudiéramos hacerlo juntos, pero solo pensar en lo que Amicus había preparado para mí basta para darme calor en el pecho, y me apoyo en él."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1399
translate spanish end_game2_bbc62048:

    # m "\"Well, thank you anyway, and I mean it.\""
    m "\"Bueno, gracias de todas formas, y lo digo en serio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1400
translate spanish end_game2_bf1d179e:

    # "Amicus huffs and slides his arm around my side, rubbing my shoulder vigorously."
    "Amicus resopla y me rodea con el brazo, frotándome el hombro con energía."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1402
translate spanish end_game2_4c84e59d:

    # a "\"Well, we'll do it some time soon. Can't open it without you giving your approval first.\""
    a "\"Bueno, lo haremos pronto. No puedo abrirlo sin que antes des tu aprobación.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1403
translate spanish end_game2_29ed04c5:

    # m "\"Oh, I didn't know it would all depend on me.\""
    m "\"Oh, no sabía que todo dependería de mí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1405
translate spanish end_game2_65bd2d52:

    # a "\"Of course! The restaurant is named in your honor, after all.\""
    a "\"¡Por supuesto! El restaurante lleva tu nombre en tu honor, después de todo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1406
translate spanish end_game2_816fbc29:

    # m "\"Oh god, really?\""
    m "\"Dios mío, ¿en serio?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1408
translate spanish end_game2_daf6e5de:

    # a "\"Really.\""
    a "\"En serio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1409
translate spanish end_game2_f8bb492a:

    # "I feel myself blushing at the thought of my name on a restaurant."
    "Noto que me sonrojo al pensar en mi nombre en un restaurante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1410
translate spanish end_game2_b12d9d21:

    # "It's embarrassing for some reason, but also incredibly sweet."
    "Por algún motivo me da vergüenza, pero también es un detalle increíblemente tierno."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1412
translate spanish end_game2_82331c67:

    # a "\"And I think we should have that picnic. Nothing like a third hour dinner in the moonlight."
    a "\"Y creo que deberíamos hacer ese pícnic. Nada como una cena a la tercera hora bajo la luz de la luna."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1413
translate spanish end_game2_1d745154:

    # m "\"You sure? You look pretty tired.\""
    m "\"¿Seguro? Pareces bastante cansado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1414
translate spanish end_game2_6ebf043a:

    # a "\"I'll live.\""
    a "\"Sobreviviré.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1416
translate spanish end_game2_e28827af:

    # "Amicus lets me go after a moment, and as he does, I slide my hand down against his paw, taking hold of it."
    "Amicus me suelta al cabo de un momento, y aprovecho para deslizar mi mano hasta su pata y agarrarla."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1417
translate spanish end_game2_9ea9469d:

    # "We don't hold hands often, mainly because it's something the wolves just don't really do."
    "No solemos ir de la mano, principalmente porque es algo que los lobos no acostumbran hacer."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1418
translate spanish end_game2_efe0dfbc:

    # "But nothing about it feels strange or out of place as we walk down the path, hand-in-paw, with only the glow of the moon and the firebugs to guide us."
    "Pero no tiene nada de extraño ni de fuera de lugar mientras recorremos el sendero, mano con pata, guiados únicamente por el resplandor de la luna y los insectos luminosos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1419
translate spanish end_game2_42fa939b:

    # "There's an eerie edge to it all, and while I might have been a little nervous if I were alone, I don't feel any of that with Amicus."
    "Todo tiene un aire inquietante y, aunque quizá estaría un poco nervioso si estuviera solo, con Amicus no siento nada de eso."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1420
translate spanish end_game2_01ca3ed7:

    # "It does make me think back though, of what happened in the university."
    "Aunque sí me hace recordar lo que ocurrió en la universidad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1421
translate spanish end_game2_2e87079d_1:

    # m "\"Amicus?\""
    m "\"¿Amicus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1423
translate spanish end_game2_3a0221e6:

    # a "\"Hmm?\""
    a "\"¿Hmm?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1424
translate spanish end_game2_003a724f:

    # m "\"What do you know about the Other?\""
    m "\"¿Qué sabes del Otro?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1426
translate spanish end_game2_3c8391b0:

    # a "\"Why do you ask about that?\""
    a "\"¿Por qué preguntas por eso?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1427
translate spanish end_game2_8619f2c6_2:

    # "I shrug."
    "Me encojo de hombros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1428
translate spanish end_game2_7e1ce96b:

    # m "\"I dunno. I've had it explained to me a few times, but I still don't really understand it.\""
    m "\"No sé. Me lo han explicado unas cuantas veces, pero sigo sin entenderlo del todo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1429
translate spanish end_game2_75aadd1c:

    # a "\"You don't need to worry about it.\""
    a "\"No tienes que preocuparte por ello.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1430
translate spanish end_game2_60187d91:

    # "I look up at Amicus, glaring."
    "Alzo la mirada hacia Amicus, fulminándolo con los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1431
translate spanish end_game2_f2e06b22:

    # m "\"Are you seriou—\""
    m "\"¿Lo dices en se—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1433
translate spanish end_game2_b103b352:

    # a "\"I'm not saying that to exclude you—\""
    a "\"No lo digo para excluirte—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1435
translate spanish end_game2_53633d06:

    # a "\"It is honestly something you do not need to fret over. It's thousands of years away, something you will never see.\""
    a "\"De verdad que no necesitas angustiarte por ello. Faltan miles de años; es algo que jamás verás.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1436
translate spanish end_game2_527ed176:

    # "I look back down at the ground, frowning."
    "Vuelvo a mirar al suelo, frunciendo el ceño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1438
translate spanish end_game2_012c0fd7_1:

    # a "\"Are you alright?\""
    a "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1439
translate spanish end_game2_642df38a:

    # m "\"I don't know...doesn't it already sort of have a presence around us?\""
    m "\"No sé...¿no está ya presente a nuestro alrededor, de algún modo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1441
translate spanish end_game2_602fbe3c:

    # a "\"How much has that jackal been telling you? I swear—\""
    a "\"¿Cuánto te ha contado ese chacal? Te juro que—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1442
translate spanish end_game2_916a36bd:

    # m "\"Hey, he's the only one that's been telling me anything about it. What else do I have to go on?\""
    m "\"Oye, es el único que me ha contado algo sobre ello. ¿En qué otra cosa puedo basarme?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1444
translate spanish end_game2_6b39c7dc:

    # a "\"Listen, [mc], all that is known for certain is that it exists and that it is a threat. The rest are stories and pseudoscience.\""
    a "\"Escucha, [mc], lo único que se sabe con certeza es que existe y que es una amenaza. Lo demás son historias y pseudociencia.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1445
translate spanish end_game2_b460865a:

    # m "\"Amicus, when I was in the university, I heard voices, telling me what might happen to us...\""
    m "\"Amicus, cuando estaba en la universidad oí voces que me decían lo que podría pasarnos...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1447
translate spanish end_game2_3c8805f7_1:

    # a "\"What?\""
    a "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1448
translate spanish end_game2_2cb45f02:

    # "I take a deep breath, deciding that I trust Amicus enough to tell him this, no matter how crazy it is."
    "Respiro hondo y decido que confío lo suficiente en Amicus para contárselo, por disparatado que sea."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1449
translate spanish end_game2_34f977c8:

    # "When I finish, Amicus is quiet for a moment."
    "Cuando termino, Amicus guarda silencio un momento."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1451
translate spanish end_game2_a67d2c17:

    # m "\"So...am I just crazy?\""
    m "\"Entonces...¿simplemente estoy loco?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1452
translate spanish end_game2_1412d42e:

    # a "\"No, and I don't doubt you at all. Would you be offended if I offer the idea that it could very well have been a dream?\""
    a "\"No, y no dudo de ti en absoluto. ¿Te ofenderías si sugiero que bien podría haber sido un sueño?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1453
translate spanish end_game2_d56e3228:

    # m "\"No, it probably was. It just worried me.\""
    m "\"No, seguramente lo fue. Solo que me preocupó.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1455
translate spanish end_game2_d70253ea:

    # a "\"As it should have. It sounds frightening.\""
    a "\"Como era de esperar. Suena aterrador.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1456
translate spanish end_game2_be87cbf2:

    # "Amicus pulls me against his side again."
    "Amicus vuelve a atraerme contra su costado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1457
translate spanish end_game2_a1c64716:

    # a "\"But I'm very happy you told me, and I hope you'll tell me if you experience anything else. After what we have been through, I think we should be open to all possibilities.\""
    a "\"Pero me alegro muchísimo de que me lo hayas contado, y espero que me lo digas si experimentas algo más. Después de todo lo que hemos vivido, creo que debemos estar abiertos a cualquier posibilidad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1458
translate spanish end_game2_bf023949:

    # m "\"Yeah...\""
    m "\"Sí...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1459
translate spanish end_game2_e2da8d3c:

    # "Just being able to talk to Amicus about it has made me feel better, that Amicus is taking this seriously even though it very likely was a dream."
    "El simple hecho de poder hablarlo con Amicus me ha hecho sentir mejor: se lo está tomando en serio, aunque muy probablemente fuera un sueño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1461
translate spanish end_game2_b5044dd6:

    # a "\"But, in the very, very unlikely event that it was the Other, then the stories would indicate that it doesn't think on its own and simply works with what it has in your mind.\""
    a "\"Pero, en el caso muy, muy improbable de que fuera el Otro, las historias indicarían que no piensa por sí mismo y solo utiliza lo que encuentra en tu mente.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1463
translate spanish end_game2_4a1fba19:

    # a "\"It projects your own worries into your reality. But even then, it can't hurt you in such a weak state...and that's assuming that its remnants really do exist in the first place.\""
    a "\"Proyecta tus propias preocupaciones en tu realidad. Pero ni siquiera entonces puede hacerte daño en un estado tan débil...y eso suponiendo que sus restos realmente existan.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1464
translate spanish end_game2_50e6278d:

    # m "\"Hmm, well, I'm glad the palace isn't haunted.\""
    m "\"Hmm, bueno, me alegro de que el palacio no esté embrujado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1465
translate spanish end_game2_62e89a4b:

    # a "\"Heh, well, having lived there all my life, I can guarantee you that is the case. I've never seen anything unexplainable there. This forest on the other hand...\""
    a "\"Je, bueno, habiendo vivido allí toda mi vida, puedo garantizarte que no lo está. Nunca he visto nada inexplicable allí. Este bosque, en cambio...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1466
translate spanish end_game2_df8ec4bc_1:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1467
translate spanish end_game2_0e0f2ec4:

    # a "\"Well, some say a creature called the {i}Simiarbor{/i} lives within the forests surrounding the city.\""
    a "\"Bueno, algunos dicen que una criatura llamada {i}Simiarbor{/i} vive en los bosques que rodean la ciudad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1468
translate spanish end_game2_73453da0:

    # m "\"Oh yeah?\""
    m "\"Ah, ¿sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1470
translate spanish end_game2_e1e9ed40:

    # "Amicus sees my smile."
    "Amicus ve mi sonrisa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1471
translate spanish end_game2_b27eeec6:

    # a "\"Oh yes, it's actually thought to be a primate of some sort, and climbs and jumps from tree to tree.\""
    a "\"Oh, sí; de hecho, se cree que es una especie de primate, y trepa y salta de árbol en árbol.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1472
translate spanish end_game2_33ffb7ed:

    # a "\"It's completely black, and its face is on the opposite side of its head so that its red, glowing eyes can stare at you while it clings to the branches.\""
    a "\"Es completamente negro, y tiene la cara en el lado opuesto de la cabeza, de modo que sus ojos rojos y brillantes pueden mirarte mientras se aferra a las ramas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1473
translate spanish end_game2_c46aa755:

    # "I can tell Amicus is trying to scare me, and even though I feel a little creeped out, his own presence makes it almost impossible to feel scared."
    "Me doy cuenta de que Amicus intenta asustarme y, aunque me produce un poco de inquietud, su presencia hace casi imposible sentir miedo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1474
translate spanish end_game2_d9dd9b20:

    # m "\"Yeah? And you've seen it?\""
    m "\"¿Ah, sí? ¿Y lo has visto?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1476
translate spanish end_game2_c2464ee1:

    # a "\"I've heard strange noises and maybe movement in the trees while out hunting before.\""
    a "\"He oído ruidos extraños y quizá movimientos en los árboles cuando he salido a cazar.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1477
translate spanish end_game2_15c5dfb2:

    # m "\"Yeah, alright.\""
    m "\"Sí, claro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1478
translate spanish end_game2_f22f1d8b:

    # "Amicus smirks at me as we continue walking, and even though I know he's teasing me, I still feel that prickle of paranoia on the back of my neck."
    "Amicus me sonríe con picardía mientras seguimos caminando y, aunque sé que está bromeando, sigo sintiendo ese cosquilleo de paranoia en la nuca."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1480
translate spanish end_game2_f6d35083:

    # "I distract myself by telling Amicus about our own primate cryptids back on Earth."
    "Me distraigo contándole a Amicus sobre nuestros propios primates críptidos de la Tierra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1481
translate spanish end_game2_972ba884:

    # "Despite the bad start to our Lover's Day, I find myself happy, just being able to have this strange conversation with my wolf."
    "A pesar del mal comienzo de nuestro Día de los Enamorados, me siento feliz por el simple hecho de poder mantener esta extraña conversación con mi lobo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1485
translate spanish end_game2_209eb206:

    # "Com sends our food, mostly leftovers from the dinner that we'd missed, out to us in a floating basket as Amicus prepares the sightseer."
    "Com nos envía la comida en una cesta flotante, principalmente las sobras de la cena que nos perdimos, mientras Amicus prepara la Observadora."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1486
translate spanish end_game2_ce0df67f:

    # "We board and soon enough we're heading out toward the island, the one that I haven't been to since I followed Alex there with Neferu."
    "Subimos a bordo y enseguida ponemos rumbo a la isla, esa a la que no he vuelto desde que seguí a Alex hasta allí con Neferu."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1487
translate spanish end_game2_76c33344:

    # "Being so late at night, or rather early in the morning, was refreshing compared to the humid mornings and afternoons."
    "Estar fuera tan tarde por la noche, o más bien tan temprano por la mañana, resultaba refrescante en comparación con las húmedas mañanas y tardes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1488
translate spanish end_game2_70fca207:

    # "Amicus is clearly enjoying it, his elbows on the railing of our craft, leaning back, head tilted up toward the sky, a slight smile on his face."
    "Amicus lo está disfrutando claramente, apoyado de espaldas con los codos en la barandilla de nuestra embarcación, la cabeza inclinada hacia el cielo y una leve sonrisa en el rostro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1489
translate spanish end_game2_34e8d1d5:

    # "His fur whips around gently on his face and torso, and that single fang that always pokes out under his lip glints softly under the light of the celestial bodies above us."
    "El pelo de su cara y su torso ondea suavemente, y ese colmillo que siempre asoma bajo su labio brilla tenuemente a la luz de los cuerpos celestes sobre nosotros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1490
translate spanish end_game2_7e202672:

    # "He looks so peaceful, something he deserves more than anything."
    "Parece tan tranquilo, algo que merece más que nada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1491
translate spanish end_game2_f24922b1:

    # "So I savor the moment, trying to capture this image perfectly in my mind, knowing that not so long from now, I'll want to be able to look back on this when I'm out on my own."
    "Así que saboreo el momento, intentando capturar esta imagen a la perfección en mi mente, sabiendo que dentro de poco querré recordarla cuando esté solo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1492
translate spanish end_game2_49a262c7:

    # "I bite my lip and blink back the small threat of tears just in time before Amicus's eyes open again."
    "Me muerdo el labio y parpadeo para contener las incipientes lágrimas justo antes de que Amicus vuelva a abrir los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1494
translate spanish end_game2_cb31ac03:

    # a "\"Despite everything seemingly getting in our way, we WILL have to travel for a few weeks together before you might leave.\""
    a "\"Aunque todo parezca interponerse en nuestro camino, SÍ tendremos que viajar juntos unas semanas antes de que puedas marcharte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1495
translate spanish end_game2_78d2b33b:

    # m "\"Oh, for what?\""
    m "\"Ah, ¿para qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1496
translate spanish end_game2_e5c6895a:

    # a "\"For you to tour the moon, and also for us to pick up Cassius from the final city in his destination. It will give you an opportunity to see most of Adastra so that you better understand the moon.\""
    a "\"Para que recorras la luna, y también para recoger a Cassius en la última ciudad de su itinerario. Te dará la oportunidad de ver casi toda Adastra y comprender mejor la luna.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1497
translate spanish end_game2_a990038f:

    # "Amicus winks."
    "Amicus guiña un ojo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1499
translate spanish end_game2_891d24be:

    # a "\"And it has been decreed by the parents, so there's no getting out of it.\""
    a "\"Y lo han decretado los Padres, así que no hay forma de evitarlo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1500
translate spanish end_game2_40f89502:

    # m "\"Don't I know it.\""
    m "\"Ya lo sé.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1501
translate spanish end_game2_34d286aa:

    # "I feel both happiness at the idea of having some guaranteed time with Amicus, while also feeling that pang of resentment at the thought of the parents making it happen."
    "Me alegra pensar que tengo asegurado un tiempo con Amicus, aunque también siento esa punzada de resentimiento al pensar que los Padres lo han dispuesto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1504
translate spanish end_game2_80b5aec8:

    # "Our craft pushes up onto the beach, and Amicus hops out before reaching out a paw to help me down onto the sand, even though he doesn't have to."
    "Nuestra embarcación se desliza hasta la playa, y Amicus salta fuera antes de tenderme una pata para ayudarme a bajar a la arena, aunque no le hace falta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1505
translate spanish end_game2_2a3f8d1c:

    # "I bring the blanket while Amicus carries the basket, and we set things out in roughly the same spot we did all those months ago in my first weeks here."
    "Yo llevo la manta y Amicus la cesta, y lo colocamos todo más o menos en el mismo sitio que hace tantos meses, durante mis primeras semanas aquí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1506
translate spanish end_game2_8617fae0:

    # "Only months..."
    "Solo unos meses..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1507
translate spanish end_game2_c26635c9:

    # "It feels like years."
    "Parecen años."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1509
translate spanish end_game2_476eccad:

    # "As we set out the food, I do kind of wish we had Neapolitan pizza as I see the usual bread, cheese, olives, and poultry, along with various vegetables I've never been able to identify."
    "Mientras ponemos la comida, casi desearía que tuviéramos pizza napolitana al ver el pan, el queso, las aceitunas y la carne de ave de siempre, junto con varias verduras que nunca he sabido identificar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1510
translate spanish end_game2_baee54f7:

    # "Still, it's good enough, and I'm just happy to lounge next to Amicus while we eat."
    "Aun así, está bastante bien, y me alegra simplemente descansar junto a Amicus mientras comemos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1511
translate spanish end_game2_2ea7b961:

    # "Again, it's in that comfortable silence that I always enjoy with my wolf."
    "De nuevo, en ese silencio cómodo que siempre disfruto con mi lobo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1512
translate spanish end_game2_8261cb74:

    # "Silence that doesn't have to be filled with anything except the sounds of chewing, which mostly come from Amicus."
    "Un silencio que no necesita llenarse con nada salvo los sonidos al masticar, que proceden sobre todo de Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1513
translate spanish end_game2_21a09370:

    # "After a while though, he breaks the silence with something that almost makes me choke on my {i}virdi{/i}."
    "Sin embargo, al cabo de un rato rompe el silencio con algo que casi me hace atragantarme con mi {i}virdi{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1515
translate spanish end_game2_e657b7aa:

    # a "\"So...how do humans get married? You present a ring, correct?\""
    a "\"Entonces...¿cómo se casan los humanos? Entregáis un anillo, ¿correcto?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1516
translate spanish end_game2_9f19e41d:

    # "I cough loudly for a second while Amicus stares."
    "Toso con fuerza un segundo mientras Amicus me mira."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1518
translate spanish end_game2_012c0fd7_2:

    # a "\"Are you alright?\""
    a "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1519
translate spanish end_game2_23096c79:

    # m "\"What do you mean by that?\""
    m "\"¿Qué quieres decir con eso?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1520
translate spanish end_game2_35bf4bbb:

    # "I stare at Amicus, then look around, trying to spot something that might tell me what the wolf is up to."
    "Miro fijamente a Amicus y luego a mi alrededor, intentando encontrar algo que me indique qué trama el lobo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1521
translate spanish end_game2_78905d47:

    # a "\"I am just curious.\""
    a "\"Solo tengo curiosidad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1522
translate spanish end_game2_a0a343ae:

    # m "\"That's what you said when you asked about dating.\""
    m "\"Eso dijiste cuando preguntaste por las citas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1524
translate spanish end_game2_d6acf0dd:

    # a "\"Oh yes...\""
    a "\"Oh, sí...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1526
translate spanish end_game2_9c5ad23a:

    # a "\"Are you suspecting that I might ask for your paw in marriage?\""
    a "\"¿Sospechas que podría pedir tu pata en matrimonio?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1527
translate spanish end_game2_c1fda584:

    # "Even though Amicus is grinning teasingly, I can tell that he's blushing even under the moonlight."
    "Aunque Amicus sonríe con picardía, puedo notar que se está sonrojando, incluso bajo la luz de la luna."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1528
translate spanish end_game2_5ec998ca:

    # m "\"You didn't think asking something like that would make me suspicious?\""
    m "\"¿No pensaste que preguntar algo así me haría sospechar?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1530
translate spanish end_game2_6f5698ee:

    # a "\"Well, I don't know. It's an interesting topic that has never been brought up. Two males cannot be married anyway, let alone ones from different species.\""
    a "\"Bueno, no sé. Es un tema interesante que nunca hemos tratado. Dos varones no pueden casarse de todos modos, y mucho menos si son de especies distintas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1531
translate spanish end_game2_c7bbc0d8:

    # "I feel myself calm down a little, not sure how I would have reacted if Amicus had just whipped out a ring then and there."
    "Noto que me tranquilizo un poco, sin saber cómo habría reaccionado si Amicus hubiera sacado un anillo allí mismo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1532
translate spanish end_game2_49920ada:

    # "Amicus is still looking at me, expecting an answer."
    "Amicus sigue mirándome, esperando una respuesta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1533
translate spanish end_game2_75a82a59:

    # "I swallow, then think."
    "Trago saliva y pienso."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1534
translate spanish end_game2_79c386fa:

    # m "\"I guess you just propose to the person you wanna marry, then you go to the courthouse and sign some papers and it's official...I think. I don't know, I've never been married.\""
    m "\"Supongo que le pides matrimonio a la persona con la que quieres casarte, luego vas al juzgado, firmas unos papeles y ya es oficial...creo. No sé, nunca me he casado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1536
translate spanish end_game2_bf925b1c:

    # a "\"And in some places, males can marry other males, right?\""
    a "\"Y en algunos sitios los varones pueden casarse con otros varones, ¿verdad?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1537
translate spanish end_game2_0cd535bd:

    # "I narrow my eyes."
    "Entrecierro los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1538
translate spanish end_game2_db2aa9d8:

    # m "\"How would you know that?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo lo sabes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1539
translate spanish end_game2_18a18f5f:

    # a "\"Again, I've spent some time with your Nexus. It's only fair I do, considering you've been spending so much of your own time learning about Adastra.\""
    a "\"Como decía, he pasado algún tiempo con vuestro Nexus. Es lo justo, teniendo en cuenta que tú has dedicado tanto tiempo a aprender sobre Adastra.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1540
translate spanish end_game2_1f0acfbe:

    # "I'm starting to see why Amicus might have been so busy these past months, starting up his own restaurant and learning human culture."
    "Empiezo a comprender por qué Amicus ha estado tan ocupado estos últimos meses, fundando su propio restaurante y aprendiendo sobre la cultura humana."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1541
translate spanish end_game2_0193b426:

    # m "\"Well you're right, there are a lot of places on Earth where you can marry the same sex.\""
    m "\"Bueno, tienes razón. En muchos lugares de la Tierra puedes casarte con alguien de tu mismo sexo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1542
translate spanish end_game2_f7870847:

    # "Amicus looks off into the lake."
    "Amicus mira hacia el lago."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1544
translate spanish end_game2_d15f5134:

    # a "\"That does sound rather nice...What about Italy?\""
    a "\"Eso suena bastante agradable...¿Y en Italia?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1545
translate spanish end_game2_7ef092de:

    # "I glance at Amicus, noticing the interest he's been taking in the country he abducted me from."
    "Miro a Amicus y reparo en el interés que se está tomando por el país del que me secuestró."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1546
translate spanish end_game2_cce3ffd3:

    # "I suppose it's a place for him to look to for inspiration, a vision of what Adastra {i}could{/i} be, which makes sense."
    "Supongo que es un lugar en el que buscar inspiración, una visión de lo que Adastra {i}podría{/i} ser, lo cual tiene sentido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1547
translate spanish end_game2_97813f07:

    # "It's the location of the uplift, of course, but it also has a turbulent history, and politics that have always been raucous and unpredictable."
    "Es donde ocurrió la elevación, por supuesto, pero también tiene una historia turbulenta y una política que siempre ha sido agitada e imprevisible."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1548
translate spanish end_game2_83421d9b:

    # "But considering where the country started, and where it is now, Amicus wouldn't be wrong to find inspiration there."
    "Pero, teniendo en cuenta de dónde partió el país y dónde está ahora, Amicus no se equivoca al buscar inspiración allí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1549
translate spanish end_game2_e5c292b5:

    # "Again, Amicus is waiting for his answer, and I have to think back to what little I researched about the topic."
    "De nuevo, Amicus espera su respuesta, y tengo que recordar lo poco que investigué sobre el tema."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1550
translate spanish end_game2_4e892e3c:

    # m "\"Soooort of, I think civil unions are a thing, which is pretty close to marriage, but not really. I think if you marry someone from an EU country, you can—\""
    m "\"Maaás o menos. Creo que existen las uniones civiles, que se parecen bastante al matrimonio, pero no son lo mismo. Creo que si te casas con alguien de un país de la UE puedes—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1551
translate spanish end_game2_05117008:

    # "I realize how Amicus might have no idea what I'm talking about, even though he seems to be listening intently."
    "Me doy cuenta de que Amicus quizá no tenga idea de qué estoy hablando, aunque parece escuchar con atención."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1552
translate spanish end_game2_08d8a66f:

    # m "\"Anyway, yeah, sort of, civil unions. Mostly marriage, but not really marriage. I think it'll happen there soon, though.\""
    m "\"En fin, sí, más o menos, uniones civiles. Casi un matrimonio, pero no un matrimonio de verdad. Aunque creo que allí lo permitirán pronto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1554
translate spanish end_game2_192cd3df:

    # a "\"Hmm, sounds complicated.\""
    a "\"Hmm, suena complicado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1555
translate spanish end_game2_62f54373:

    # m "\"Yeah, it gets really complicated.\""
    m "\"Sí, puede llegar a ser muy complicado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1556
translate spanish end_game2_7cbc33a7:

    # "Amicus is still looking out at the lake."
    "Amicus sigue mirando hacia el lago."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1558
translate spanish end_game2_986c1cb7:

    # a "\"You want to swim?\""
    a "\"¿Quieres nadar?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1559
translate spanish end_game2_2cc7b95a:

    # "I blink."
    "Parpadeo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1560
translate spanish end_game2_0efff087:

    # m "\"No, the water will be freezing.\""
    m "\"No, el agua estará helada.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1561
translate spanish end_game2_88fdf521:

    # a "\"So?\""
    a "\"¿Bueno?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1562
translate spanish end_game2_13713d12:

    # m "\"So I don't want to die of hypothermia?\""
    m "\"Así que, ¿no quiero morir de hipotermia?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1563
translate spanish end_game2_82aabc2c:

    # "Amicus guffaws."
    "Amicus suelta una carcajada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1564
translate spanish end_game2_37b639f9:

    # a "\"You really are a pup. It's not {i}that{/i} cold.\""
    a "\"De verdad que eres un cachorro. No está {i}tan{/i} fría.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1565
translate spanish end_game2_cec1cbb6:

    # "I roll my eyes, feeling a little whiplash from the sudden change in conversation."
    "Pongo los ojos en blanco, algo desconcertado por el brusco cambio de conversación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1567
translate spanish end_game2_5d1b2f3a:

    # "Then I yelp in surprise as I feel myself get swooped up from the ground, easily held up in Amicus's strong paws."
    "Entonces grito de sorpresa al sentir que me levantan del suelo, sostenido sin esfuerzo por las fuertes patas de Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1568
translate spanish end_game2_ef84a8b4:

    # m "\"Hey!\""
    m "\"¡Eh!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1569
translate spanish end_game2_30b2bb74:

    # a "\"I'll show you.\""
    a "\"Te lo demostraré.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1570
translate spanish end_game2_486a0250:

    # m "\"What!?\""
    m "\"¡¿Qué?!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1571
translate spanish end_game2_ba8d6a2a:

    # "I struggle in the wolf's grasp, very much not in the mood to be dunked in freezing cold water."
    "Forcejeo entre los brazos del lobo; no tengo ninguna gana de que me sumerjan en agua helada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1572
translate spanish end_game2_4225ed6a:

    # "Amicus's strength can't be matched by me though, and the waves get louder as the wolf walks closer to the water's edge."
    "Pero no puedo competir con la fuerza de Amicus, y las olas suenan cada vez más fuerte mientras el lobo se acerca a la orilla."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1574
translate spanish end_game2_9ccec687:

    # m "\"Amicus, my robe!\""
    m "\"¡Amicus, mi túnica!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1575
translate spanish end_game2_a5fab8cf:

    # "Realizing that a dip in the lake is inevitable, I start to try and struggle out of my garments, but at that moment, I'm suddenly set back down on my feet."
    "Al darme cuenta de que el chapuzón es inevitable, intento librarme de la ropa, pero justo entonces me deja de nuevo sobre mis pies."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1576
translate spanish end_game2_e95410ed:

    # "Dazed, I stumble."
    "Aturdido, doy un traspié."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1577
translate spanish end_game2_d3f9a3b5:

    # "We're right at the water's edge where the waves are crawling up the sand just a few inches from my feet."
    "Estamos justo en la orilla, donde las olas se arrastran por la arena a pocos centímetros de mis pies."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1578
translate spanish end_game2_07a8f48a:

    # "The lake stretches out to my right, dark and expansive, the blackness broken by the shimmers of silver light reflecting off the rippling water."
    "El lago se extiende a mi derecha, oscuro e inmenso, con la negrura interrumpida por destellos plateados reflejados en las ondulaciones del agua."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1579
translate spanish end_game2_4e137279:

    # "It takes me a while to finally focus on Amicus."
    "Tardo un momento en centrarme por fin en Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1580
translate spanish end_game2_bf16cc91:

    # "That's because he's kneeling on the beach, reaching up toward me with both paws, and I see what is definitely a ring held between the pads of his fingers."
    "Es porque está arrodillado en la playa, tendiendo ambas patas hacia mí, y veo lo que sin duda es un anillo entre las almohadillas de sus dedos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1581
translate spanish end_game2_61f958ee:

    # "I stare."
    "Me quedo mirándolo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1583
translate spanish end_game2_0e8b0adb:

    # "Amicus clears his throat, his bravado from just a minute ago having quickly faded, replaced by a look he'd once worn when he offered me a bouquet of flowers in the gardens."
    "Amicus se aclara la garganta; su bravuconería de hace apenas un minuto ha desaparecido rápidamente, sustituida por aquella expresión que tenía cuando me ofreció un ramo de flores en los jardines."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1586
translate spanish end_game2_968b7b82:

    # a "\"Will you...be my husband?\""
    a "\"¿Quieres...ser mi esposo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1587
translate spanish end_game2_d087309d:

    # "I continue to stare."
    "Sigo mirándolo fijamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1589
translate spanish end_game2_0a3e6b05:

    # "Amicus stares back, clearly trying to keep a confident look on his face, but after a few more seconds, it fails."
    "Amicus me devuelve la mirada, intentando claramente mantener una expresión segura, pero al cabo de unos segundos no lo consigue."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1591
translate spanish end_game2_ca41d15d:

    # a "\"I—I know what I'm doing this time. I was sure to research it. I know what this means.\""
    a "\"Yo—yo sé lo que hago esta vez. Me aseguré de investigarlo. Sé lo que significa.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1592
translate spanish end_game2_5ce0c9bc:

    # "He stubbornly holds up the ring."
    "Sostiene el anillo con obstinación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1593
translate spanish end_game2_5ade2ac9:

    # "Now I get a good look at it, and I'm not sure if it's just reflecting the sky, but the ring appears to be a dark, dark blue, with tiny speckles of sparkling stones dotting the rim, just like the stars above."
    "Ahora puedo verlo bien y no sé si solo está reflejando el cielo, pero parece de un azul muy, muy oscuro, con diminutas motas de piedras brillantes alrededor del borde, como las estrellas de arriba."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1594
translate spanish end_game2_78aff621:

    # "A thin, stripe of silver wraps all the way around the band, straight down the middle."
    "Una fina franja plateada rodea todo el aro, justo por el centro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1595
translate spanish end_game2_3680c037:

    # m "\"But you said males couldn't marry each other.\""
    m "\"Pero dijiste que los varones no podían casarse entre sí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1596
translate spanish end_game2_0a76482c:

    # "I mumble that out stupidly, not sure why it's the first thing that comes to mind."
    "Lo murmuro estúpidamente, sin saber por qué es lo primero que se me ocurre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1597
translate spanish end_game2_480a1737:

    # "Amicus ducks his head slightly."
    "Amicus baja un poco la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1598
translate spanish end_game2_c1983afa:

    # a "\"No...but I am emperor, and I know that might sound bad after what happened earlier, but I want this, so I will have it.\""
    a "\"No...pero soy el emperador, y sé que eso puede sonar mal después de lo que ocurrió antes, pero quiero esto, así que lo tendré.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1599
translate spanish end_game2_41a673f1:

    # "Amicus looks back up at me with a determined expression."
    "Amicus vuelve a mirarme con determinación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1601
translate spanish end_game2_6eb7c0cd:

    # a "\"That is, if you will have it as well.\""
    a "\"Eso si tú también lo quieres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1602
translate spanish end_game2_b29989a1:

    # "I'm frozen, and that determined expression melts away once again as Amicus looks like he's about to panic."
    "Estoy paralizado, y esa expresión decidida vuelve a desvanecerse cuando Amicus parece a punto de entrar en pánico."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1604
translate spanish end_game2_fa11abf8:

    # a "\"E—eight years, [mc]. That is too long. I—We need something to bind us together, to always remember, to have something when we reunite.\""
    a "\"O—ocho años, [mc]. Es demasiado tiempo. Yo—necesitamos algo que nos una, que siempre recordemos, tener algo cuando nos reunamos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1605
translate spanish end_game2_88d2c1f3:

    # "A few more moments of silence."
    "Pasan unos momentos más de silencio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1606
translate spanish end_game2_198b10c7:

    # "I see Amicus's paws faltering, starting to pull back, and that's what finally gets my stupid brain to force me to move, reaching down to gently touch the ring."
    "Veo que las patas de Amicus vacilan y empiezan a retirarse, y eso por fin hace que mi estúpido cerebro me obligue a moverme, bajando la mano para tocar suavemente el anillo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1607
translate spanish end_game2_44986a21:

    # m "\"I—I...Yes, of course.\""
    m "\"Yo—yo...Sí, por supuesto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1608
translate spanish end_game2_903fa19d:

    # "Amicus's ears perk up."
    "Las orejas de Amicus se levantan."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1609
translate spanish end_game2_8ca1d22f:

    # a "\"Yes?\""
    a "\"¿Sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1610
translate spanish end_game2_5fac3114:

    # m "\"I will marry you, of course.\""
    m "\"Me casaré contigo, por supuesto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1611
translate spanish end_game2_3bc21e1d:

    # "I laugh through the last words, not even sure what I'm doing right now."
    "Me río al pronunciar las últimas palabras, sin saber siquiera qué estoy haciendo ahora mismo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1613
translate spanish end_game2_4c188844:

    # a "\"YES!\""
    a "\"¡SÍ!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1614
translate spanish end_game2_84521b2c:

    # "Amicus hops to his feet, fist in the air, as if he's just won kind of sports competition."
    "Amicus se pone de pie de un salto, con el puño en alto, como si acabara de ganar alguna competición deportiva."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1616
translate spanish end_game2_b33634e5:

    # "Before I can say anything else, he's crushing the air from my lungs with the force of the hug he pulls me into, pressing his muzzle against my lips."
    "Antes de que pueda decir nada más, me expulsa el aire de los pulmones con la fuerza del abrazo al que me arrastra, presionando su hocico contra mis labios."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1617
translate spanish end_game2_95592b15:

    # "Then when he pulls back, he adds another kiss, this one a canine-style lick up the side of my face."
    "Después, cuando se aparta, añade otro beso: esta vez una lamida canina por un lado de mi cara."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1618
translate spanish end_game2_b842c2b8:

    # m "\"Ah!\""
    m "\"¡Ah!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1619
translate spanish end_game2_80cd62ee:

    # "I flinch back, surprised by the gesture."
    "Me aparto sobresaltado, sorprendido por el gesto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1620
translate spanish end_game2_c1265acd:

    # "It's a juvenile show of affection, something a pup would do, and something Amicus has never done to me before."
    "Es una muestra juvenil de cariño, algo que haría un cachorro y que Amicus nunca me había hecho antes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1622
translate spanish end_game2_d4fb7f7d:

    # "He looks happier than I've seen him in months."
    "Parece más feliz de lo que lo he visto en meses."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1624
translate spanish end_game2_1bc71ad9:

    # a "\"[mc], I'm going to be the best husband there ever was. I love you.\""
    a "\"[mc], voy a ser el mejor esposo que haya existido jamás. Te amo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1625
translate spanish end_game2_e800380d:

    # "He pulls me against his body again, more gently this time, looking into my eyes."
    "Me atrae de nuevo contra su cuerpo, esta vez con más delicadeza, mirándome a los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1627
translate spanish end_game2_57015d45:

    # "Though I know that marriages on Adastra are more pragmatic, it seems that Amicus has, for the most part, educated himself on the more emotional, romantic meaning it holds on Earth."
    "Aunque sé que los matrimonios en Adastra son más pragmáticos, parece que Amicus se ha informado bastante sobre el significado más emocional y romántico que tienen en la Tierra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1628
translate spanish end_game2_945f5153:

    # "The wolf takes my hand in his much bigger paw, drawing it up between us so that he can slide the ring on."
    "El lobo toma mi mano en su pata mucho más grande y la levanta entre nosotros para deslizar el anillo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1629
translate spanish end_game2_4564995a:

    # "Amicus chuckles as it's clear that it's much, much too big, at least twice the width of my finger."
    "Amicus se ríe al comprobar que es demasiado, demasiado grande: al menos el doble de ancho que mi dedo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1630
translate spanish end_game2_fa003755:

    # a "\"I'll have to have it fitted, of course. I simply wanted it to be a complete surprise.\""
    a "\"Tendré que mandar ajustarlo, claro. Solo quería que fuera una sorpresa completa.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1631
translate spanish end_game2_38098330:

    # m "\"It worked.\""
    m "\"Lo has conseguido.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1632
translate spanish end_game2_47b3bb70:

    # a "\"I was worried when you didn't assume the usual position I examined in the images Com showed me of a human proposal.\""
    a "\"Me preocupó que no adoptaras la postura habitual que estudié en las imágenes de una petición humana de matrimonio que me enseñó Com.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1633
translate spanish end_game2_6f50a16d:

    # m "\"Position?\""
    m "\"¿Postura?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1634
translate spanish end_game2_9d69ab64:

    # a "\"The male is on one knee, and the female does this—\""
    a "\"El varón se arrodilla sobre una rodilla, y la mujer hace esto—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1636
translate spanish end_game2_553f78c0:

    # "Amicus assumes a look of surprise, both paws up to his muzzle."
    "Amicus pone cara de sorpresa y lleva ambas patas a su hocico."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1637
translate spanish end_game2_28cd8433:

    # "I'm laughing as I hold up the ring to the moonlight, examining the tiny speckles of sparkling stone embedded in the dark blue metal."
    "Me río mientras alzo el anillo hacia la luz de la luna y examino las diminutas motas de piedra brillante incrustadas en el metal azul oscuro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1639
translate spanish end_game2_237cb2f8:

    # a "\"I also thought a stretch ring would be most appropriate.\""
    a "\"También pensé que un anillo de dilatación sería lo más apropiado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1640
translate spanish end_game2_af122e99:

    # m "\"Stretch ring?\""
    m "\"¿Anillo de dilatación?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1641
translate spanish end_game2_79351576:

    # "Amicus reaches out, taking the ring from my fingers to hold it up between us."
    "Amicus extiende una pata y toma el anillo de mis dedos para levantarlo entre nosotros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1642
translate spanish end_game2_4183bd21:

    # a "\"It symbolizes space and the stars, of course, but this—\""
    a "\"Simboliza el espacio y las estrellas, por supuesto, pero esto—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1643
translate spanish end_game2_8c8526cc:

    # "Amicus points a blunt claw at the thin strip of silver running around the middle of the band."
    "Amicus señala con una garra roma la fina banda plateada que recorre el centro del aro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1644
translate spanish end_game2_a322d22b:

    # a "\"This symbolizes connection between those who are long distances apart.\""
    a "\"Esto simboliza la conexión entre quienes están separados por grandes distancias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1645
translate spanish end_game2_9b78ca0f_1:

    # m "\"Yeah?\""
    m "\"¿Sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1646
translate spanish end_game2_dd5d7275:

    # a "\"Yes, some believe that the shape of our universe is spherical, and that it sort of folds in upon itself.\""
    a "\"Sí, algunos creen que nuestro universo tiene forma esférica y que, de algún modo, se pliega sobre sí mismo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1647
translate spanish end_game2_da144e1e:

    # "Amicus sees my furrowed brows."
    "Amicus ve que frunzo el ceño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1649
translate spanish end_game2_d844df27:

    # a "\"Think of it like this; if I walk in that direction—\""
    a "\"Piénsalo así: si camino en esa dirección—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1650
translate spanish end_game2_9e8101d6:

    # "Amicus points out across the lake."
    "Amicus señala al otro lado del lago."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1651
translate spanish end_game2_8fb79485:

    # a "\"—in a straight line for...many months, eventually, I will end up right back here, next to you.\""
    a "\"—en línea recta durante...muchos meses, acabaré regresando justo aquí, a tu lado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1653
translate spanish end_game2_33c06862:

    # a "\"So there is a belief that the universe could hold a similar shape; a sphere that is expanding, and this ring—\""
    a "\"Así que se cree que el universo podría tener una forma similar: una esfera que se expande, y este anillo—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1654
translate spanish end_game2_b248b817:

    # "Amicus spins the ring around, showing me the silver circle."
    "Amicus gira el anillo para enseñarme el círculo plateado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1655
translate spanish end_game2_7dc31d26:

    # a "\"—reminds us that, even if we are moving apart on the stretch drive, we are still moving toward each other in a straight line; which is the fastest way to get somewhere.\""
    a "\"—nos recuerda que, aunque nos alejemos mediante la Propulsión Dilatatoria, seguimos moviéndonos el uno hacia el otro en línea recta, que es la forma más rápida de llegar a algún sitio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1657
translate spanish end_game2_4cf704d0:

    # a "\"A touch convoluted, I know, and a somewhat unlikely theory, but it can be a comforting thought.\""
    a "\"Un poco enrevesado, lo sé, y una teoría algo improbable, pero puede ser un pensamiento reconfortante.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1659
translate spanish end_game2_29e669e8:

    # a "\"I like to think of it more as being connected by fate. Yes, we will be far apart, but there is an invisible thread connecting us that cannot be broken and will soon draw us back toge—\""
    a "\"Prefiero pensar que estamos unidos por el destino. Sí, estaremos muy lejos, pero hay un hilo invisible que nos une, que no se puede romper y pronto nos volverá a reu—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1662
translate spanish end_game2_35fe23e0:

    # "I cut the wolf off as I hug him, pressing my face into his chest, the bittersweet sadness I'd been feeling for many months coming to the surface all at once."
    "Interrumpo al lobo abrazándolo y hundiendo la cara en su pecho; la tristeza agridulce que llevaba meses sintiendo sale de golpe a la superficie."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1664
translate spanish end_game2_3619784e:

    # "Amicus holds me quietly as we stand there on the beach in silence."
    "Amicus me sostiene en silencio mientras permanecemos de pie en la playa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1665
translate spanish end_game2_3a9695bd:

    # "I'm happy and sad all at once, and I just want to stay here forever..."
    "Estoy feliz y triste al mismo tiempo, y solo quiero quedarme aquí para siempre..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1668
translate spanish end_game2_e772a8c7:

    # "We make our way back to our room, the sky beginning to lighten with the approaching dawn."
    "Regresamos a nuestra habitación mientras el cielo empieza a aclararse con la proximidad del amanecer."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1669
translate spanish end_game2_43af16f0:

    # "Along the way, Amicus starts to get handsy, and by the time we're at the door, the wolf practically pushes me inside, attacking my neck with licks."
    "Por el camino, Amicus empieza a manosearme y, cuando llegamos a la puerta, prácticamente me empuja dentro, atacando mi cuello a lamidas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1670
translate spanish end_game2_6bf442bc:

    # "I cringe and laugh at the ticklishness of it, trying to escape until Amicus has me pinned to the wall next to the door."
    "Me retuerzo y río por las cosquillas, intentando escapar hasta que Amicus me inmoviliza contra la pared junto a la puerta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1672
translate spanish end_game2_dcdcb8ac:

    # a "\"Going somewhere?\""
    a "\"¿Vas a alguna parte?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1673
translate spanish end_game2_e473e802:

    # "The wolf starts to take off my robe, and at the same time I start to remove his garments."
    "El lobo empieza a quitarme la túnica, y al mismo tiempo yo comienzo a quitarle la ropa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1674
translate spanish end_game2_2265b5de:

    # m "\"Yes, and you're coming with me.\""
    m "\"Sí, y tú vienes conmigo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1675
translate spanish end_game2_3ace89a9:

    # a "\"Oh, well, lead the way then.\""
    a "\"Oh, bueno, guíame entonces.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1676
translate spanish end_game2_d0ef941f:

    # "I grab his semi-hard length, which causes it to immediately twitch to full-mast."
    "Agarro su miembro semierecto, que enseguida se sacude y alcanza una erección completa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1677
translate spanish end_game2_4da455ab:

    # "Amicus seems to grow frustrated with undoing my underwear, and resorts to just yanking it down from my body, leaving me naked as well."
    "Amicus parece frustrarse al intentar desatar mi ropa interior y termina bajándomela de un tirón, dejándome también desnudo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1678
translate spanish end_game2_0d4eab15:

    # "The wolf sweeps me off my feet and takes me to the bed, all the while we both kiss each other."
    "El lobo me levanta en brazos y me lleva a la cama, mientras seguimos besándonos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1679
translate spanish end_game2_850231f0:

    # "It's much more passionate, almost animalistic compared to our kiss on the beach, Amicus growling into it while my tongue pushes past his lips, feeling his big, long teeth and wide, flat tongue."
    "Es mucho más apasionado, casi animal en comparación con nuestro beso en la playa; Amicus gruñe mientras mi lengua atraviesa sus labios y siente sus dientes grandes y largos y su lengua ancha y plana."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1680
translate spanish end_game2_2ece8ceb:

    # "He lays me on the bed and we kiss for a while longer, Amicus's paws moving up and down my sides while I feel up his back, his cock laying heavy on top of mine, twitching each time I make a moaning sound."
    "Me tiende en la cama y seguimos besándonos un rato, con las patas de Amicus recorriendo mis costados mientras yo le acaricio la espalda; su polla descansa pesada sobre la mía y se sacude cada vez que gimo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1681
translate spanish end_game2_04dd1002:

    # "Finally, the wolf pulls back, his tongue hanging out for a moment before he clears his throat, suddenly looking nervous."
    "Por fin, el lobo se aparta, dejando la lengua fuera un momento antes de aclararse la garganta, de repente nervioso."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1682
translate spanish end_game2_702cfbe4_3:

    # m "\"You alright?\""
    m "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1684
translate spanish end_game2_b97cb8e0:

    # a "\"Erm...yes, but there was something else I wanted to do for Lover's Day.\""
    a "\"Eh...sí, pero había otra cosa que quería hacer por el Día de los Enamorados.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1685
translate spanish end_game2_9b78ca0f_2:

    # m "\"Yeah?\""
    m "\"¿Sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1686
translate spanish end_game2_330b1798:

    # "I look around, wondering what else could be done aside from what we're doing right now."
    "Miro alrededor, preguntándome qué más podemos hacer aparte de lo que estamos haciendo ahora."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1687
translate spanish end_game2_563a1526:

