# game/end_game2.rpy:1906
translate spanish end_game2_bb0ef2f4:

    # "Of course he's asked on my behalf if they have anything to say to me but...nothing."
    "Por supuesto, les ha preguntado por mí si tienen algo que decirme, pero...nada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1907
translate spanish end_game2_49699269:

    # "I can only assume it's because they don't want to \"interfere\" with the process, even though they're going to have to tell me {i}something{/i}."
    "Solo puedo suponer que no quieren \"interferir\" en el proceso, aunque tendrán que decirme {i}algo{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1908
translate spanish end_game2_2f00fe2e:

    # "At least direct where to go first."
    "Al menos indicarme adónde ir primero."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1909
translate spanish end_game2_29b6b729:

    # "Otherwise they're probably just going to hospitalize me when I show up talking about space wolves and the impending assimilation with the {i}Galaxias{/i}."
    "De lo contrario, probablemente me ingresarán cuando aparezca hablando de lobos espaciales y de la inminente integración en el {i}Galaxias{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1910
translate spanish end_game2_5b90c21a:

    # "I feel my insides twist uncomfortably like they have been for the past several months, and especially in the past week."
    "Siento que se me retuercen las entrañas de forma desagradable, como en los últimos meses y, especialmente, en la última semana."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1911
translate spanish end_game2_ba567ca4:

    # "I'd had to leave Amicus's room because I didn't want to keep waking him up with my tossing and turning."
    "Había tenido que salir de la habitación de Amicus porque no quería seguir despertándolo con mis vueltas en la cama."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1912
translate spanish end_game2_8bf141a4:

    # "That, and lying there awake, watching Amicus sleep innocently next to me is just a bit too much for me right now."
    "Eso, y que quedarme despierto, viendo a Amicus dormir inocentemente a mi lado, es demasiado para mí ahora mismo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1913
translate spanish end_game2_fb7b99fa:

    # "I know I should be savoring these last moments, but instead, I find myself twisted up in worry."
    "Sé que debería saborear estos últimos momentos, pero en lugar de eso estoy consumido por la preocupación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1914
translate spanish end_game2_2966b2fa:

    # "I'm going to be alone."
    "Voy a estar solo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1915
translate spanish end_game2_46ca67b0:

    # "It's something that hasn't really scared me much before I came here, but after being with Amicus for so long, and now with this path ahead of me..."
    "Es algo que no me daba mucho miedo antes de venir aquí, pero después de tanto tiempo con Amicus, y ahora con este camino ante mí..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1916
translate spanish end_game2_64827b35:

    # "I go from hugging myself to twirling the now-fitted ring on my finger."
    "Paso de abrazarme a mí mismo a girar en mi dedo el anillo, que ahora ya está ajustado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1917
translate spanish end_game2_33628e19:

    # "It's been a security blanket of sorts."
    "Ha sido una especie de refugio emocional."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1918
translate spanish end_game2_c1357809:

    # "We had debated on whether or not to marry before I leave, but eventually decided Amicus should lay some legal ground work first so as not to cause too much of an uproar."
    "Habíamos debatido si casarnos antes de mi partida, pero al final decidimos que Amicus debería preparar primero las bases legales para no provocar demasiado revuelo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1919
translate spanish end_game2_4351f6cf:

    # "He has eight years to do it after all."
    "Después de todo, tiene ocho años para hacerlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1920
translate spanish end_game2_2ce25943:

    # "It will give me something to look forward to when I return."
    "Me dará algo que esperar con ilusión cuando vuelva."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1921
translate spanish end_game2_11ba009c:

    # "Our entire lives adjusted to fit the schedule laid out by the parents."
    "Nuestras vidas enteras, adaptadas al calendario trazado por los Padres."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1922
translate spanish end_game2_8c0f72e7:

    # "This is all assuming they're telling the truth and, not for the first time, I wonder if I can really count on them to make sure I return to Adastra."
    "Todo esto supone que estén diciendo la verdad y, no por primera vez, me pregunto si puedo contar realmente con ellos para asegurar mi regreso a Adastra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1923
translate spanish end_game2_0852edf6:

    # "They're controlling everything, and I don't think they would be sending me on a mission that would somehow result in me never coming back here."
    "Lo controlan todo, y no creo que me envíen a una misión cuyo resultado sea que nunca vuelva aquí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1924
translate spanish end_game2_1151c4e3:

    # "That's the whole point."
    "Ese es el objetivo de todo esto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1925
translate spanish end_game2_192b45c2:

    # "I'm uniting two different worlds..."
    "Estoy uniendo dos mundos diferentes..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1926
translate spanish end_game2_c8b6a0ec:

    # "I sigh, closing my eyes at the ridiculous weight of that statement."
    "Suspiro y cierro los ojos ante el absurdo peso de esa afirmación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1927
translate spanish end_game2_2fc89e78:

    # "This is all wrong."
    "Todo esto está mal."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1928
translate spanish end_game2_2e858099:

    # "I've been trying to ignore it for months, but something here is wrong."
    "Llevo meses intentando ignorarlo, pero aquí hay algo que no está bien."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1929
translate spanish end_game2_57f4e1d2:

    # "I open my eyes again as I hear shuffling steps up the path."
    "Vuelvo a abrir los ojos al oír pasos arrastrados por el sendero."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1930
translate spanish end_game2_05b72e5a:

    # "For a moment, I think it's going to be Amicus, maybe having woken up and found me missing from the bed."
    "Por un momento pienso que será Amicus, que quizá se ha despertado y no me ha encontrado en la cama."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1931
translate spanish end_game2_1da81d32:

    # "It's what I hope to see, even though I know he needs his sleep."
    "Es lo que espero ver, aunque sé que necesita dormir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1932
translate spanish end_game2_21e7543c:

    # "I'm under enough stress right now that I'm willing to be selfish."
    "Estoy tan estresado que ahora mismo estoy dispuesto a ser egoísta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1933
translate spanish end_game2_c171048e:

    # "But no."
    "Pero no."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1934
translate spanish end_game2_29338550:

    # "I'm a bit surprised to see Virginia walking along the main path, head down as she manipulates one of those transparent tablets that the officials around here have."
    "Me sorprende un poco ver a Virginia por el sendero principal, con la cabeza gacha mientras maneja una de esas tabletas transparentes que tienen los funcionarios de aquí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1935
translate spanish end_game2_80504f1f:

    # "As she gets closer, I let out a soft cough so I don't surprise her."
    "Cuando se acerca, toso suavemente para no sorprenderla."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1936
translate spanish end_game2_313c4673:

    # "She looks up, her pace slowing before she realizes that it's me."
    "Alza la vista y ralentiza el paso antes de darse cuenta de que soy yo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1937
translate spanish end_game2_a3ab8129:

    # "I had assumed she would just continue on her way, but now she deliberately walks in my direction."
    "Había supuesto que seguiría su camino, pero ahora se dirige deliberadamente hacia mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1939
translate spanish end_game2_57bbcd0f:

    # v "\"Pleasant early morning to you, [mc].\""
    v "\"Que tengas una agradable madrugada, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1940
translate spanish end_game2_610e1884:

    # m "\"Good morning.\""
    m "\"Buenos días.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1942
translate spanish end_game2_cc6cb352:

    # v "\"I must say that I'm a bit surprised to see you outside before Vita has even risen.\""
    v "\"Debo decir que me sorprende un poco verte fuera antes siquiera de que salga Vita.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1943
translate spanish end_game2_8619f2c6_3:

    # "I shrug."
    "Me encojo de hombros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1944
translate spanish end_game2_3af30a7f:

    # m "\"Had trouble sleeping.\""
    m "\"Me costaba dormir.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1946
translate spanish end_game2_675a0568:

    # "There's a pause, and Virginia gives me a look, one that I think is sympathetic."
    "Hay una pausa, y Virginia me lanza una mirada que me parece comprensiva."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1947
translate spanish end_game2_9e902d22:

    # v "\"I imagine.\""
    v "\"Me lo imagino.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1948
translate spanish end_game2_486859e8:

    # "More silence."
    "Más silencio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1949
translate spanish end_game2_60beff57:

    # "Even now, at the very end of my journey on Adastra, I feel the stiff, awkward wall between us"
    "Incluso ahora, al final de mi viaje en Adastra, siento esa rígida e incómoda barrera entre nosotros"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1950
translate spanish end_game2_4191b536:

    # "Out of everyone I've met in the palace, I feel I know Virginia the least, and that includes Alex."
    "De todos los que he conocido en el palacio, siento que a Virginia es a quien menos conozco, incluso contando a Alex."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1951
translate spanish end_game2_534bff99:

    # "While her intentions became clear to me, like everyone's eventually did, I literally know nothing else about her."
    "Aunque sus intenciones acabaron quedando claras, como las de todos, no sé absolutamente nada más sobre ella."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1952
translate spanish end_game2_4cfb8897:

    # "I try to fill the silence."
    "Intento llenar el silencio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1953
translate spanish end_game2_239b6cb3:

    # m "\"So what has you up so early?\""
    m "\"Entonces, ¿qué te trae despierta tan temprano?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1954
translate spanish end_game2_d1cffbf1:

    # "Virginia raises an eyebrow."
    "Virginia alza una ceja."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1956
translate spanish end_game2_7f413296:

    # v "\"We have run out of time to negotiate funding for a few smaller provinces to the north. I am using the early hours to make time.\""
    v "\"Se nos ha acabado el tiempo para negociar la financiación de unas provincias menores del norte. Estoy aprovechando las primeras horas para sacar tiempo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1957
translate spanish end_game2_313863db:

    # m "\"That doesn't sound fun.\""
    m "\"No suena divertido.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1959
translate spanish end_game2_778dffda:

    # v "\"It is not meant to be {i}fun{/i}. My life is now dedicated to serving the empire. My own concerns do not matter.\""
    v "\"No pretende ser {i}divertido{/i}. Mi vida está ahora dedicada a servir al imperio. Mis propias preocupaciones no importan.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1960
translate spanish end_game2_3f739ce1_1:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1961
translate spanish end_game2_9dc09dd9:

    # m "\"Listen, I'm gonna be honest here. You seem less happy than you were before you had this position.\""
    m "\"Escucha, voy a ser sincero. Pareces menos feliz que antes de tener este cargo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1963
translate spanish end_game2_06f5e32c:

    # v "\"Again, my concerns are not important.\""
    v "\"Insisto: mis preocupaciones no son importantes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1964
translate spanish end_game2_5f1c3045:

    # m "\"I'm not saying they are, I'm just wondering why you wanted this position if it's only making your life worse.\""
    m "\"No digo que lo sean; solo me pregunto por qué querías este cargo si únicamente empeora tu vida.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1965
translate spanish end_game2_fc02cfa9:

    # "Virginia gives me a long, hard look."
    "Virginia me dirige una mirada larga y dura."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1966
translate spanish end_game2_2767a744:

    # "It always seems like our conversations become tense if we talk for more than three sentences."
    "Siempre parece que nuestras conversaciones se tensan si intercambiamos más de tres frases."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1967
translate spanish end_game2_d8709670:

    # v "\"I think that you are not understanding the concept. {i}My{/i} concerns do not matter. {i}I{/i} do not matter. What does matter is the work I do."
    v "\"Creo que no estás entendiendo el concepto. {i}Mis{/i} preocupaciones no importan. {i}Yo{/i} no importo. Lo que importa es el trabajo que hago."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1968
translate spanish end_game2_91bcf6b1:

    # m "\"So...you just wanted to run the empire in a more efficient way, or something?\""
    m "\"Así que...¿solo querías dirigir el imperio con más eficiencia o algo así?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1969
translate spanish end_game2_77e3798b:

    # v "\"Yes, or something.\""
    v "\"Sí, o algo así.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1970
translate spanish end_game2_78cd6ac8:

    # m "\"You could just be blunt like the Khemians are and tell me. We'd get to the point, and then you wouldn't have to be so angry all the time.\""
    m "\"Podrías ser directa como los Khemianos y decírmelo. Iríamos al grano y no tendrías que estar tan enfadada todo el tiempo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1972
translate spanish end_game2_680db11c:

    # "The look on Virginia's face has me raising my hands defensively."
    "La expresión de Virginia hace que levante las manos a la defensiva."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1973
translate spanish end_game2_6e9c3ca6:

    # m "\"Alright, sorry. I know whenever I talk I just piss you off, so I'll just stop.\""
    m "\"Está bien, perdona. Sé que cada vez que hablo solo consigo cabrearte, así que dejaré de hacerlo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1975
translate spanish end_game2_b3ab0b1a:

    # v "\"What has you so brash this morning?\""
    v "\"¿Qué te hace estar tan insolente esta mañana?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1976
translate spanish end_game2_6c15f3b1:

    # m "\"Everything.\""
    m "\"Todo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1977
translate spanish end_game2_c4c1b51d:

    # "I put out my hands to either side of myself, as if to indicate the whole situation I'm in."
    "Extiendo las manos a ambos lados, como indicando toda la situación en la que me encuentro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1978
translate spanish end_game2_5b803beb:

    # m "\"But at least I'm not always...I dunno, acting like you're just an annoying distraction. Hell, even Cassius acknowledges my presence more than you do.\""
    m "\"Pero al menos no estoy siempre...no sé, actuando como si fueras una distracción molesta. Joder, hasta Cassius reconoce más mi presencia que tú.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1979
translate spanish end_game2_f7830b08:

    # m "\"I mean, it's a bit late now, but considering I'm in a relationship with your brother, maybe we should get to know each other when I come back.\""
    m "\"Quiero decir, ahora es un poco tarde, pero teniendo en cuenta que tengo una relación con tu hermano, quizá deberíamos conocernos mejor cuando vuelva.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1980
translate spanish end_game2_ab60fc93:

    # "Virginia regards me for a moment, then takes a deep breath."
    "Virginia me observa un momento y luego respira hondo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1981
translate spanish end_game2_26ab4a4d:

    # v "\"[mc], I know you are leaving tomorrow, as we all do...but I also know that you will be back, and I will be made to work with you for a very long time, likely the rest of our lives.\""
    v "\"[mc], sé que te marchas mañana, como todos...pero también sé que volverás y que tendré que trabajar contigo durante mucho tiempo, probablemente el resto de nuestras vidas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1982
translate spanish end_game2_e499761a_3:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1983
translate spanish end_game2_749450e4:

    # "How would Virginia know I'll be working with the empire?"
    "¿Cómo sabe Virginia que voy a trabajar con el imperio?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1984
translate spanish end_game2_8d9caf96:

    # "Is she supposed to know that?"
    "¿Se supone que puede saberlo?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1985
translate spanish end_game2_7932ba98:

    # "I start to wonder if the parents {i}are{/i} talking, just not to me."
    "Empiezo a preguntarme si los Padres {i}sí{/i} están hablando, solo que no conmigo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1986
translate spanish end_game2_66c1fa2c:

    # "Virginia answers that question next, though."
    "Pero Virginia responde a esa pregunta a continuación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1988
translate spanish end_game2_f68cbab3:

    # v "\"Amicus told me, as he should have, considering my position. It will help us prepare, at least in secret.\""
    v "\"Amicus me lo contó, como debía, teniendo en cuenta mi cargo. Nos ayudará a prepararnos, al menos en secreto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1989
translate spanish end_game2_09f43605:

    # "I wonder if the parents told him that was okay."
    "Me pregunto si los Padres le dijeron que podía hacerlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1990
translate spanish end_game2_49ac9687:

    # "I don't want to deviate from their plan at all if it risks my mission."
    "No quiero desviarme en absoluto de su plan si eso pone en riesgo mi misión."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1991
translate spanish end_game2_c260dea0:

    # "Virginia interrupts my thoughts though."
    "Pero Virginia interrumpe mis pensamientos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1993
translate spanish end_game2_5fcd5c58:

    # v "\"But I will say this once, and never again, so remember it when you return.\""
    v "\"Pero diré esto una sola vez y nunca más, así que recuérdalo cuando regreses.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1994
translate spanish end_game2_0df5b9fc:

    # "I wait expectantly."
    "Espero con expectación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1995
translate spanish end_game2_09ef3c47:

    # v "\"While young, my brothers and I experienced very different sides of my father. He coddled Amicus, neglected Cassius, and for me, it was a sort of in-between.\""
    v "\"Cuando éramos jóvenes, mis hermanos y yo conocimos facetas muy diferentes de nuestro padre. Mimaba a Amicus, desatendía a Cassius y, conmigo, era algo intermedio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1996
translate spanish end_game2_534b6df1:

    # v "\"He paid me very close, but strict attention. Unlike my brothers, who received lessons in maths, science, and combat—\""
    v "\"Me prestaba mucha atención, pero de forma estricta. A diferencia de mis hermanos, que recibían clases de matemáticas, ciencias y combate—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1997
translate spanish end_game2_282d147b:

    # v "\"—I was given lessons in speech, etiquette, but mainly I was subjected to long, cruel sessions of behavioral-molding.\""
    v "\"—yo recibía clases de oratoria y etiqueta, pero principalmente me sometían a largas y crueles sesiones de modelado de la conducta.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1998
translate spanish end_game2_df112bcc:

    # v "\"He altered who I was as a person, something he would never do to his sons.\""
    v "\"Alteró mi personalidad, algo que jamás haría con sus hijos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1999
translate spanish end_game2_6d9b1db9:

    # m "\"Oh...why?\""
    m "\"Oh...¿por qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2000
translate spanish end_game2_38b39f44:

    # v "\"All I understood at the time was that he planned for me to occupy a prestigious position in the empire.\""
    v "\"Lo único que entendía entonces era que planeaba que yo ocupara un cargo prestigioso en el imperio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2001
translate spanish end_game2_8dbed4bb:

    # v "\"Still, I hated him for it. I felt almost no emotion when his sabotaged ship crashed.\""
    v "\"Aun así, lo odiaba por ello. Apenas sentí emoción alguna cuando su nave saboteada se estrelló.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2002
translate spanish end_game2_89357ba6_1:

    # m "\"Oh...\""
    m "\"Ah...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2004
translate spanish end_game2_32fccc2d:

    # v "\"Yes, odd how he would project himself to be the most egalitarian emperor in our history, yet treat his own daughter like clay that he could shape in any way he wanted.\""
    v "\"Sí, es extraño que se presentara como el emperador más igualitario de nuestra historia y, sin embargo, tratara a su propia hija como arcilla que podía moldear a su antojo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2005
translate spanish end_game2_e34ba8f7:

    # "Now I'm really at a loss for words."
    "Ahora sí que no sé qué decir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2007
translate spanish end_game2_71a82174:

    # v "\"But...following his death and the resulting power struggle, I came to learn why, and the reason was rather simple.\""
    v "\"Pero...tras su muerte y la lucha de poder que siguió, comprendí por qué, y la razón era bastante sencilla.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2009
translate spanish end_game2_5bb182d0:

    # v "\"If I were to be the first female in a particular position of power, I needed to set an example. Not only that, but I would need to ward off attempts by those in power to undermine me.\""
    v "\"Si iba a ser la primera mujer en cierto cargo de poder, debía dar ejemplo. No solo eso: también tendría que defenderme de los intentos de quienes tenían poder por socavarme.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2010
translate spanish end_game2_a3b966b3:

    # v "\"My mind was already trained for the deceit I would come up against, and it serves me well, even now as officials spread rumors and attempt to discredit me.\""
    v "\"Mi mente ya estaba preparada para los engaños a los que me enfrentaría, y me resulta útil incluso ahora, cuando los funcionarios difunden rumores e intentan desacreditarme.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2011
translate spanish end_game2_dd262dae:

    # v "\"Amateurish rumors, I'll have you know. Seems they can't think of anything more complex than saying the reason I get so much done is because I'm a whore.\""
    v "\"Rumores de aficionados, que conste. Parece que no se les ocurre nada más complejo que decir que consigo hacer tanto porque soy una puta.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2012
translate spanish end_game2_c2e1c858:

    # v "\"But father personally made sure I understood the most important lesson in this empire: trust no male.\""
    v "\"Pero padre se aseguró personalmente de que entendiera la lección más importante de este imperio: no confíes en ningún varón.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2013
translate spanish end_game2_ec4d8367:

    # v "\"It's what will keep me alive in this role. While I still hate father, I {i}understand{/i} him, now, which is better than just hate.\""
    v "\"Es lo que me mantendrá viva en este cargo. Aunque aún odio a padre, ahora lo {i}comprendo{/i}, lo cual es mejor que solo odiarlo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2014
translate spanish end_game2_43268636:

    # "Through all of this, I can only sit there awkwardly on the bench."
    "Durante todo esto, solo puedo permanecer incómodo en el banco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2015
translate spanish end_game2_9daf0e98:

    # m "\"Okay...so is that why you treat me the way you do? I'm a male and you can't trust me?\""
    m "\"Vale...¿por eso me tratas como lo haces? ¿Soy un varón y no puedes confiar en mí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2017
translate spanish end_game2_cfe21df7:

    # v "\"[mc], I trust no one. I simply don't have to worry about women because they hold no power...yet.\""
    v "\"[mc], no confío en nadie. Simplemente no tengo que preocuparme por las mujeres porque no tienen poder...todavía.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2018
translate spanish end_game2_9d55ca39:

    # v "\"I tell you this so that you might {i}understand{/i} me, as you wished. We will need to be close allies in the future, after all.\""
    v "\"Te cuento esto para que puedas {i}comprenderme{/i}, como deseabas. Después de todo, necesitaremos ser aliados cercanos en el futuro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2020
translate spanish end_game2_244bbb1b:

    # v "\"While I'm sure my upbringing has a little bit to do with my demeanor, the main reason for my shortness with you is simply due to your immaturity and lack of self-control. Amicus is no different.\""
    v "\"Aunque estoy segura de que mi educación influye un poco en mi conducta, la principal razón de mi brusquedad contigo es sencillamente tu inmadurez y tu falta de autocontrol. Amicus no es diferente.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2021
translate spanish end_game2_cd938aab:

    # "I grimace."
    "Hago una mueca."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2022
translate spanish end_game2_9d706b34:

    # m "\"I think I'm a bit better than Amicus...\""
    m "\"Creo que soy un poco mejor que Amicus...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2024
translate spanish end_game2_17898228:

    # v "\"Mmh, yes, though he is growing into his position well enough. I'm sure you will as well.\""
    v "\"Mmh, sí, aunque él está madurando en su cargo bastante bien. Estoy segura de que tú también lo harás.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2025
translate spanish end_game2_5b0396ad:

    # "I'm not sure if that's encouragement, or an insult."
    "No sé si es un ánimo o un insulto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2027
translate spanish end_game2_57167d6a:

    # v "\"And thank you for saving my brother. I don't believe I've had the chance to say that yet. I know what I just said, but he is one of the few I can trust to...be himself.\""
    v "\"Y gracias por salvar a mi hermano. Creo que aún no había tenido oportunidad de decirlo. Sé lo que acabo de decir, pero es uno de los pocos en quienes puedo confiar para que...sea él mismo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2028
translate spanish end_game2_200704bc:

    # "Then Virginia turns away, walking toward the imperial ship."
    "Entonces Virginia se da la vuelta y camina hacia la nave imperial."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2031
translate spanish end_game2_7b64b5f8:

    # v "\"I really must be off to the city now. I'll be present for your departure tomorrow morning. Goodbye.\""
    v "\"De verdad tengo que marcharme a la ciudad ya. Estaré presente en tu partida mañana por la mañana. Adiós.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2032
translate spanish end_game2_323db076:

    # m "\"Bye...\""
    m "\"Adiós...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2033
translate spanish end_game2_4f79ef2c:

    # "I watch Virginia walk off into the dark, still feeling like I don't really know anything about her, even if she did kind of open up to me for the first time."
    "Veo a Virginia alejarse hacia la oscuridad, todavía sintiendo que no sé realmente nada sobre ella, aunque por primera vez se haya abierto un poco conmigo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2034
translate spanish end_game2_1dbe6c6c:

    # "At least she's willing to work with me on how to integrate humanity."
    "Al menos está dispuesta a trabajar conmigo en la integración de la humanidad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2035
translate spanish end_game2_cf2c0cc1:

    # "I'd been worried about that."
    "Eso me preocupaba."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2037
translate spanish end_game2_db27fce1:

    # "The edge of the sky is just turning a lighter blue as I make my way back into the palace."
    "El borde del cielo empieza a tornarse de un azul más claro mientras regreso al palacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2038
translate spanish end_game2_1f8c7972:

    # "This is usually about the time that Amicus wakes up, so I'm not surprised to hear the shower running when I walk into his room."
    "Esta suele ser la hora a la que Amicus se despierta, así que no me sorprende oír la ducha cuando entro en su habitación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2042
translate spanish end_game2_af9b9cbb:

    # "I think about going into the bathroom, then think better of it, not wanting to hold up Amicus's morning routine."
    "Pienso en entrar al baño, pero cambio de idea para no retrasar la rutina matutina de Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2043
translate spanish end_game2_79d4833a:

    # "I have to admit that I'm a little disappointed that he didn't come looking for me first thing."
    "Tengo que admitir que me decepciona un poco que no haya venido a buscarme antes que nada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2044
translate spanish end_game2_27969ec4:

    # "Usually that's something he'd do if he's not sure where I am."
    "Normalmente lo haría si no supiera dónde estoy."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2045
translate spanish end_game2_2db086bc:

    # "For now, I just sit on the bed and wait, gradually growing more tired as the minutes go by, finally feeling like I might be able to get some sleep."
    "Por ahora, simplemente me siento en la cama y espero, cansándome poco a poco con el paso de los minutos, hasta sentir por fin que quizá podría dormir algo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2046
translate spanish end_game2_c9c1553f:

    # "Then the door slides open and Amicus steps out, freshly showered and dressed."
    "Entonces la puerta se desliza y sale Amicus, recién duchado y vestido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2047
translate spanish end_game2_6e09351a:

    # "He smiles brightly when he sees me."
    "Sonríe radiante al verme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2049
translate spanish end_game2_bf445fd1:

    # a "\"There you are! I was wondering if maybe you'd gone to get breakfast early.\""
    a "\"¡Ahí estás! Me preguntaba si habrías ido a desayunar temprano.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2050
translate spanish end_game2_e783f2c3:

    # "Immediately I'm jarred by Amicus's overly-cheerful demeanor, his voice louder than usual."
    "Enseguida me desconcierta el aire excesivamente alegre de Amicus, con la voz más alta de lo habitual."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2051
translate spanish end_game2_640db045:

    # m "\"No, I just needed some air.\""
    m "\"No, solo necesitaba un poco de aire.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2053
translate spanish end_game2_b0b0ede2:

    # a "\"Air? Is it too stuffy in here?\""
    a "\"¿Aire? ¿Está demasiado cargado aquí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2054
translate spanish end_game2_349b9dcc:

    # m "\"No, it's freezing, as usual.\""
    m "\"No, hace un frío horrible, como siempre.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2055
translate spanish end_game2_9c56b6e6:

    # "I stand up and hug Amicus, which he enthusiastically accepts."
    "Me levanto y abrazo a Amicus, que lo acepta con entusiasmo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2057
translate spanish end_game2_ddf786c5:

    # "I sink into his furry warmth, and I feel my eyes sting as the reality of how much time we have left really sinks in."
    "Me hundo en su cálida suavidad peluda y siento que me escuecen los ojos cuando realmente asimilo el poco tiempo que nos queda."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2058
translate spanish end_game2_6ae30550_1:

    # m "\"Amicus...\""
    m "\"Amicus...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2059
translate spanish end_game2_7f86972b:

    # "My voice is small and sad, and Amicus quickly but gently sets his paws on my shoulders to push me back a step so that he can look me in the eyes."
    "Mi voz es débil y triste, y Amicus enseguida me pone con delicadeza las patas en los hombros para apartarme un paso y poder mirarme a los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2061
translate spanish end_game2_ebc313a6:

    # a "\"Hey, I'm going to be back early tonight, as early as possible. Unfortunately there are a few mandatory meetings involving the Khemians that I must attend.\""
    a "\"Oye, volveré temprano esta noche, lo antes posible. Por desgracia, tengo que asistir a unas reuniones obligatorias relacionadas con los Khemianos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2062
translate spanish end_game2_abc1a553:

    # m "\"I know.\""
    m "\"Lo sé.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2063
translate spanish end_game2_a9d222f3:

    # "Amicus had already tried to take the day off, but of course things came up."
    "Amicus ya había intentado tomarse el día libre, pero, por supuesto, surgieron cosas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2065
translate spanish end_game2_c785d827:

    # a "\"And don't worry; I've kept tonight simple. Just dinner between you and I.\""
    a "\"Y no te preocupes; he preparado una noche sencilla. Solo una cena entre tú y yo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2066
translate spanish end_game2_03f7b25c:

    # "I can tell that Amicus is putting on a brave face."
    "Me doy cuenta de que Amicus está intentando mostrarse fuerte."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2067
translate spanish end_game2_18d12c9d:

    # "So I do the same and swallow back the awful feelings that have been threatening to overwhelm me."
    "Así que hago lo mismo y reprimo los horribles sentimientos que amenazaban con abrumarme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2068
translate spanish end_game2_b6968389:

    # m "\"Alright. I'll be waiting.\""
    m "\"Está bien. Estaré esperando.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2070
translate spanish end_game2_6c3aa969:

    # a "\"Good. I won't be long, and the sooner I leave, the sooner I will return.\""
    a "\"Bien. No tardaré, y cuanto antes salga, antes regresaré.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2071
translate spanish end_game2_d6a866a9:

    # m "\"Then you'd better get going.\""
    m "\"Entonces será mejor que te vayas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2073
translate spanish end_game2_7f8077c0:

    # a "\"Right away, Emperor Consort!\""
    a "\"¡Ahora mismo, emperador consorte!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2074
translate spanish end_game2_df48460b:

    # "I grimace at the title I would hold if Amicus made our marriage official."
    "Hago una mueca ante el título que tendría si Amicus hiciera oficial nuestro matrimonio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2075
translate spanish end_game2_f0c2633c:

    # "But he plants a kiss on my face anyway before pulling back and smiling at me."
    "Pero él me planta un beso en la cara antes de apartarse y sonreírme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2077
translate spanish end_game2_e2ff96f8:

    # a "\"I love you, and tonight we shall be happy!\""
    a "\"Te amo, ¡y esta noche seremos felices!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2080
translate spanish end_game2_5994faf5:

    # "I try to smile back as Amicus takes his leave, disappearing out the door, wondering how I'm going to manage to do that."
    "Intento devolverle la sonrisa mientras Amicus se marcha y desaparece por la puerta, preguntándome cómo voy a conseguirlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2082
translate spanish end_game2_4979d717:

    # "Hopefully well enough for Amicus's sake."
    "Espero hacerlo lo bastante bien por Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2085
translate spanish end_game2_51852bf5:

    # "I'm able to nap for a few hours, after which I walk through the halls, though at a much slower pace than usual."
    "Consigo dormir unas horas y después recorro los pasillos, aunque a un ritmo mucho más lento que de costumbre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2086
translate spanish end_game2_3c15347c:

    # "I take a good look at everything, remembering."
    "Observo todo detenidamente, recordando."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2087
translate spanish end_game2_34ec6244:

    # "I walk past the meditation room, and I pause before opening the door."
    "Paso junto a la sala de meditación y me detengo antes de abrir la puerta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2089
translate spanish end_game2_a21d4161:

    # "I'd made up with Amicus here after our fight a year ago."
    "Aquí me reconcilié con Amicus después de nuestra pelea de hace un año."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2090
translate spanish end_game2_0c771429:

    # "This is also where I accidentally got high on the {i}somni{/i} Cassius had been smoking."
    "También fue aquí donde me coloqué accidentalmente con el {i}somni{/i} que estaba fumando Cassius."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2091
translate spanish end_game2_33038df3:

    # "The main reason I open the door though, is because I'm curious if any of that plant is lying around, maybe try to contact the Monitor myself."
    "Pero la razón principal por la que abro la puerta es que tengo curiosidad por saber si queda algo de esa planta, quizá para intentar contactar yo mismo con el Monitor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2092
translate spanish end_game2_b7871814:

    # "I don't see any, and remembering Cassius's horrible experience gets me to give up pretty fast, not wanting to be tormented by the Monitor because I didn't follow their plan correctly."
    "No veo nada y, al recordar la horrible experiencia de Cassius, desisto bastante deprisa: no quiero que el Monitor me atormente por no seguir su plan correctamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2095
translate spanish end_game2_39a46166:

    # "I head out into the gardens like usual, taking in the beauty of the arranged foliage for the last time."
    "Salgo a los jardines como siempre, contemplando por última vez la belleza de la vegetación cuidadosamente dispuesta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2096
translate spanish end_game2_56897f4a:

    # "I remember my first morning here...with Alex."
    "Recuerdo mi primera mañana aquí...con Alex."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2097
translate spanish end_game2_b61512c5:

    # "He'd been so helpful and kind, and I feel some sadness at the idea that I'll probably never see him again."
    "Había sido tan servicial y amable, y me entristece pensar que probablemente nunca volveré a verlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2098
translate spanish end_game2_0390494f:

    # "It's dulled a bit as I also remember that he'd only been sizing me up for manipulation, even then."
    "Esa tristeza se atenúa un poco al recordar que, incluso entonces, solo estaba evaluándome para manipularme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2099
translate spanish end_game2_c08d8986:

    # "While I feel our friendship had been partially genuine, I know that what he's done is something I can never forgive, even though Cassius was able to."
    "Aunque siento que nuestra amistad fue en parte auténtica, sé que lo que ha hecho es algo que nunca podré perdonar, aunque Cassius haya podido hacerlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2102
translate spanish end_game2_3a686dd9:

    # "I head back in for a light breakfast, sitting on Amicus's usual bed."
    "Vuelvo dentro para tomar un desayuno ligero y me siento en el lecho que suele usar Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2103
translate spanish end_game2_50b02153:

    # "I watch the screens as I do, not surprised to see Amicus's face pop up a few times."
    "Mientras como, miro las pantallas; no me sorprende ver aparecer unas cuantas veces la cara de Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2104
translate spanish end_game2_99148fd9:

    # "He is the emperor, after all, but I am surprised to see my own face, and I know immediately they're talking about us, speculating."
    "Después de todo, es el emperador, pero sí me sorprende ver mi propia cara; enseguida sé que están hablando de nosotros y haciendo conjeturas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2105
translate spanish end_game2_cf83a85a:

    # "I tell Com to turn it off and sit there for a bit, thinking back on what had happened in this room."
    "Le digo a Com que las apague y me quedo allí un rato, recordando lo que ocurrió en esta sala."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2106
translate spanish end_game2_500c9e60:

    # "As always, my eyes are drawn to the dark wine stain in Cassius's bed, something that remained even after a deep cleaning."
    "Como siempre, mis ojos se dirigen a la oscura mancha de vino en el lecho de Cassius, que quedó incluso después de una limpieza a fondo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2107
translate spanish end_game2_13e4650b:

    # "It hasn't been replaced, likely because Cassius doesn't really live in the palace anymore."
    "No lo han reemplazado, probablemente porque Cassius ya no vive realmente en el palacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2108
translate spanish end_game2_7daf6c12:

    # "Of course, it always brings to mind the moment he drank that poisoned wine."
    "Por supuesto, siempre me recuerda el momento en que bebió aquel vino envenenado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2109
translate spanish end_game2_b2c4190b:

    # "The day we'd all sat there, knowing something was wrong, yet Cassius still trusting Cato enough to never suspect an assassination attempt."
    "El día en que todos estábamos sentados allí, sabiendo que algo iba mal, mientras Cassius aún confiaba lo suficiente en Cato como para no sospechar jamás un intento de asesinato."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2110
translate spanish end_game2_95732994:

    # "Something he would have suspected if Neferu and I had been less cautious about releasing the information on the sabotaged ship."
    "Algo que habría sospechado si Neferu y yo hubiéramos sido menos cautelosos al revelar la información sobre la nave saboteada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2111
translate spanish end_game2_471db41b:

    # "It probably wasn't enough to convict him in a trial, but all would have known."
    "Probablemente no bastaba para condenarlo en un juicio, pero todos lo habrían sabido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2112
translate spanish end_game2_5d788c1f:

    # "Even now I'm not sure why I'd handed the wine to him, knowing it would end badly, knowing I should spill it, just like I did my first time serving."
    "Incluso ahora no sé por qué le entregué el vino, sabiendo que acabaría mal, sabiendo que debía derramarlo, como hice la primera vez que serví."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2113
translate spanish end_game2_34906d30:

    # "Yet I did what I was told, almost like a robot, maybe because I'd been conditioned to do whatever the wolves told me."
    "Sin embargo, hice lo que me ordenaron, casi como un robot, quizá porque me habían condicionado a hacer todo lo que me dijeran los lobos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2114
translate spanish end_game2_8db2d112:

    # "I don't blame Cassius for staying away from the palace after what he went through."
    "No culpo a Cassius por mantenerse alejado del palacio después de lo que sufrió."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2115
translate spanish end_game2_1781df43:

    # "An assassination attempt resulting in a medically-induced coma does things to the mind, according to him."
    "Un intento de asesinato que desemboca en un coma inducido afecta a la mente, según él."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2116
translate spanish end_game2_0122869f:

    # "I wonder if that includes forgiving a spy that's partially responsible for dozens of deaths."
    "Me pregunto si eso incluye perdonar a un espía parcialmente responsable de decenas de muertes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2117
translate spanish end_game2_cbd5dae3:

    # "Feeling slightly nauseous, I send the rest of my food back."
    "Sintiéndome un poco mareado, devuelvo el resto de la comida."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2118
translate spanish end_game2_df357b7d:

    # "I decide not to think about Alex anymore, feeling like the cat had never gotten what he deserved."
    "Decido no pensar más en Alex, con la sensación de que el gato nunca recibió lo que merecía."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2119
translate spanish end_game2_45dd422a:

    # "I need to distract myself until Amicus gets back, so I head for the baths."
    "Necesito distraerme hasta que vuelva Amicus, así que me dirijo a los baños."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2123
translate spanish end_game2_c8fca5d2:

    # "It's become part of my routine, and the part I always look forward to the most for a couple of reasons."
    "Se han convertido en parte de mi rutina, y en la parte que más espero por un par de razones."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2124
translate spanish end_game2_0d5e0348:

    # "First, it's just nice to soak, and second, because I see the person I often run into here."
    "Primero, porque es agradable remojarse y, segundo, porque veo a la persona con la que suelo encontrarme aquí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2126
translate spanish end_game2_c11d8300:

    # "He soaks in the pool, head leaning back against the edge, eyes closed."
    "Está sumergido en la piscina, con la cabeza apoyada hacia atrás en el borde y los ojos cerrados."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2127
translate spanish end_game2_0b3abf02:

    # "While I may have lost my friendship with Alex, I'd gained a great one with Neferu."
    "Aunque perdí mi amistad con Alex, había ganado una estupenda con Neferu."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2128
translate spanish end_game2_7126d1b1:

    # "Good thing too, considering he's the only other sapient that's regularly in the palace during the day."
    "También es una suerte, teniendo en cuenta que es el único otro Sapiente que está habitualmente en el palacio durante el día."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2129
translate spanish end_game2_e0c5e81f:

    # "I walk over to the benches, beginning to strip off my robe, glancing at the jackal."
    "Camino hacia los bancos y empiezo a quitarme la túnica, mirando al chacal."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2130
translate spanish end_game2_1f9f1b86:

    # m "\"You know, it's not safe to fall asleep in the bath.\""
    m "\"Sabes que no es seguro quedarse dormido en el baño.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2131
translate spanish end_game2_2a1c1349:

    # "Neferu shifts, raising an eyebrow even though he keeps his eyes closed."
    "Neferu se mueve y alza una ceja, aunque mantiene los ojos cerrados."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2134
translate spanish end_game2_59dccc63:

    # n "\"I appreciate your concern, but I feel that the sensation of water filling my lungs would be sufficient to wake me.\""
    n "\"Agradezco tu preocupación, pero creo que sentir mis pulmones llenarse de agua bastaría para despertarme.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2136
translate spanish end_game2_e4b43167:

    # n "\"And I was not asleep. I was awaiting your arrival.\""
    n "\"Y no estaba dormido. Estaba esperando tu llegada.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2137
translate spanish end_game2_4b7b1310:

    # "I walk up to the edge of the pool, Neferu turning his head to look back at me, not even glancing at my naked groin."
    "Camino hasta el borde de la piscina; Neferu vuelve la cabeza para mirarme, sin siquiera echar un vistazo a mi entrepierna desnuda."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2138
translate spanish end_game2_70a12a49:

    # m "\"Really? I didn't think you'd be here. Amicus told me he had Khemian meetings to go to.\""
    m "\"¿En serio? No creía que estarías aquí. Amicus me dijo que tenía reuniones Khemianas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2139
translate spanish end_game2_19d3943b:

    # "Briefly, I feel a little upset at the idea that Neferu might stay at the palace to see me while Amicus wouldn't."
    "Por un instante me molesta pensar que Neferu pueda quedarse en el palacio para verme y Amicus no."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2140
translate spanish end_game2_bdcf882b:

    # "But only briefly."
    "Pero solo por un instante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2141
translate spanish end_game2_80da4ffb:

    # "Things are different for the emperor."
    "Para el emperador las cosas son diferentes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2143
translate spanish end_game2_4e5aadde:

    # n "\"Luckily for me, my presence is no longer requested at such meetings. It matters little. I have direct access to the emperor anyway.\""
    n "\"Por suerte para mí, ya no solicitan mi presencia en esas reuniones. Importa poco. Tengo acceso directo al emperador de todas formas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2144
translate spanish end_game2_3f739ce1_2:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2145
translate spanish end_game2_4b43164b:

    # m "\"You should choose your words carefully in front of the emperor's fiancée."
    m "\"Deberías elegir tus palabras con cuidado delante del prometido del emperador."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2147
translate spanish end_game2_22fa449a:

    # n "\"Why must you think I always speak in innuendos.\""
    n "\"¿Por qué tienes que pensar que siempre hablo con segundas intenciones?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2148
translate spanish end_game2_b047b2f5:

    # m "\"Because you do.\""
    m "\"Porque lo haces.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2149
translate spanish end_game2_754f51e9:

    # "I jump into the pool."
    "Salto a la piscina."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2152
translate spanish end_game2_266ea5f8:

    # "It's not something I usually do, and I'm reminded why as my entire being burns for a few moments."
    "No es algo que suela hacer, y recuerdo por qué al sentir que todo mi cuerpo arde unos momentos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2153
translate spanish end_game2_578d097a:

    # "It's worth it though, as I come up and see that I've accomplished my goal of splashing Neferu, the jackal in the middle of pawing water from his eyes."
    "Sin embargo, merece la pena cuando emerjo y veo que he cumplido mi objetivo de salpicar a Neferu; el chacal se está quitando el agua de los ojos con las patas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2155
translate spanish end_game2_0bf3a13b:

    # n "\"I must say, you become more like him every day.\""
    n "\"Debo decir que cada día te pareces más a él.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2156
translate spanish end_game2_7e454f4c:

    # "I move to the bench to sit beside the jackal, my own eyes stinging from the salty, spring water."
    "Me acerco al banco para sentarme junto al chacal; mis propios ojos escuecen por el agua salada del manantial."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2157
translate spanish end_game2_d32985f8:

    # m "\"Because I'm more willing to shut you up?\""
    m "\"¿Porque estoy más dispuesto a callarte?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2159
translate spanish end_game2_9f1a2c77:

    # n "\"Yes, crude like the wolves, having to resort to physical methods because they can't use their words properly.\""
    n "\"Sí, tosco como los lobos, que tienen que recurrir a métodos físicos porque no saben usar bien las palabras.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2160
translate spanish end_game2_0cd535bd_1:

    # "I narrow my eyes."
    "Entrecierro los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2161
translate spanish end_game2_9e7266c2:

    # m "\"Well, talk enough shit, then you're gonna get hit. Humans are the same, and I have a feeling jackals are too.\""
    m "\"Bueno, si dices suficientes gilipolleces, acabarán pegándote. Los humanos son iguales, y me da la impresión de que los chacales también.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2163
translate spanish end_game2_165d4bf6:

    # n "\"How would you know? I've never raised a paw against anyone on this moon.\""
    n "\"¿Cómo lo sabes? Nunca he levantado una pata contra nadie en esta luna.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2164
translate spanish end_game2_722cba8a:

    # m "\"Probably because you know you wouldn't stand a chance. Also I have seen you fight, first with Alex, and remember you accepted a spar with Amicus a few months back?\""
    m "\"Probablemente porque sabes que no tendrías ninguna oportunidad. Además, te he visto pelear, primero con Alex, y ¿recuerdas que aceptaste combatir con Amicus hace unos meses?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2166
translate spanish end_game2_d3858984:

    # n "\"I seem to have forgotten.\""
    n "\"Parece que lo he olvidado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2167
translate spanish end_game2_e6089c4b:

    # m "\"Well I haven't. You took off all your clothes to tease him, then got floored in like a second.\""
    m "\"Pues yo no. Te quitaste toda la ropa para provocarlo y luego te derribó en un segundo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2169
translate spanish end_game2_072a6124:

    # n "\"He struck me in the stomach when I was not ready, and very hard, mind you. Their combat techniques are as crude as their words.\""
    n "\"Me golpeó en el estómago cuando no estaba preparado, y muy fuerte, que conste. Sus técnicas de combate son tan toscas como sus palabras.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2170
translate spanish end_game2_517194ee:

    # m "\"You weren't ready because you were still using {i}your words{/i} after the fight had started.\""
    m "\"No estabas preparado porque seguías usando {i}tus palabras{/i} después de que empezara la pelea.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2171
translate spanish end_game2_90cdfeab:

    # "Even though the incident had been a little worrying at the time, I find it mostly funny now and I smirk at the memory."
    "Aunque entonces el incidente fue algo preocupante, ahora me resulta más bien divertido y sonrío al recordarlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2172
translate spanish end_game2_8e5a2559:

    # n "\"How is that funny? I had to check into hospital to make sure he didn't rupture anything. It was very dangerous to do such a thing in what was supposed to be a friendly spar.\""
    n "\"¿Cómo puede ser divertido? Tuve que ir al hospital para asegurarme de que no me hubiera roto nada. Fue muy peligroso hacer eso en lo que debía ser un combate amistoso.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2173
translate spanish end_game2_74a7b2f9:

    # m "\"I think it was the way you went from showboating to making the weirdest noises after you fell on the ground.\""
    m "\"Creo que fue cómo pasaste de presumir a hacer los ruidos más raros después de caer al suelo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2174
translate spanish end_game2_e20c79ed:

    # "Amicus probably did take out a lot of his built-up frustration in that attack."
    "Probablemente Amicus descargó buena parte de su frustración acumulada en aquel ataque."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2175
translate spanish end_game2_a40854ce:

    # "Unfortunately, it resulted in even more tension between the two of them, which makes things difficult because I like them both."
    "Por desgracia, eso provocó aún más tensión entre los dos, lo que complica las cosas porque ambos me caen bien."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2176
translate spanish end_game2_c424c5ab:

    # "I guess Neferu at least still talks official business with Amicus."
    "Supongo que al menos Neferu todavía habla de asuntos oficiales con Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2177
translate spanish end_game2_9273eb0c:

    # "Neferu huffs."
    "Neferu resopla."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2178
translate spanish end_game2_5b2e8498:

    # n "\"And like that blow, bringing that up is rather low of you.\""
    n "\"Y, al igual que aquel golpe, mencionar eso es bastante bajo por tu parte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2179
translate spanish end_game2_e058bc90:

    # "He's right."
    "Tiene razón."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2180
translate spanish end_game2_57005a5c:

    # "My mood is a bit strange today, and just like with Virginia, I find myself being more blunt."
    "Hoy tengo un humor algo extraño y, como con Virginia, me encuentro siendo más brusco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2181
translate spanish end_game2_8619f2c6_4:

    # "I shrug."
    "Me encojo de hombros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2182
translate spanish end_game2_557ddb38:

    # m "\"Well, so was making shitty comments about all wolves.\""
    m "\"Bueno, también lo era hacer comentarios de mierda sobre todos los lobos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2184
translate spanish end_game2_2dbe9971:

    # "Neferu sighs loudly, seemingly at a loss for words."
    "Neferu suspira ruidosamente, como si no supiera qué decir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2185
translate spanish end_game2_dee7ebb0:

    # "A rare sight."
    "Algo poco habitual."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2186
translate spanish end_game2_3c0baa52:

    # "I start to feel a bit guilty and clear my throat, changing the subject, to the subject I'm not really sure how to explain to the jackal."
    "Empiezo a sentirme algo culpable y me aclaro la garganta, cambiando de tema hacia algo que no sé muy bien cómo explicarle al chacal."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2187
translate spanish end_game2_faf79df4:

    # m "\"So...I'm leaving tomorrow.\""
    m "\"Entonces...me marcho mañana.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2189
translate spanish end_game2_6ef6c71c:

    # "Neferu's eyes light up."
    "Los ojos de Neferu se iluminan."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2190
translate spanish end_game2_f566cc83:

    # n "\"So I have heard. Which is why I wanted to be sure that I would see you today, though I'm starting to regret it considering your mood.\""
    n "\"Eso he oído. Por eso quería asegurarme de verte hoy, aunque empiezo a lamentarlo, dado tu humor.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2191
translate spanish end_game2_b0028243:

    # "I slump against the ledge."
    "Me dejo caer contra el borde."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2192
translate spanish end_game2_4adcbaaf:

    # m "\"Sorry, I'm feeling...weird today. I'm just overwhelmed with everything that's happening.\""
    m "\"Perdona, hoy me siento...raro. Estoy abrumado con todo lo que está pasando.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2193
translate spanish end_game2_c34664d3:

    # n "\"Well, you'll be returning, won't you?\""
    n "\"Bueno, volverás, ¿verdad?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2194
translate spanish end_game2_6a13c2fd:

    # m "\"...Yeah, just not sure when that might be."
    m "\"...Sí, solo que no sé cuándo será."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2195
translate spanish end_game2_cdf0f063:

    # "Obviously Amicus wouldn't have told Neferu about our situation, maybe even if the parents directed him to."
    "Obviamente, Amicus no le habría contado a Neferu nuestra situación, quizá ni siquiera si los Padres se lo hubieran indicado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2196
translate spanish end_game2_f53e1fa0:

    # "I'm guessing it was Virginia who told him I'm leaving."
    "Supongo que fue Virginia quien le dijo que me marcho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2198
translate spanish end_game2_50bcae1a:

    # n "\"This is a temporary trip, is it not? You are engaged to be married, after all.\""
    n "\"Es un viaje temporal, ¿no? Después de todo, estáis prometidos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2199
translate spanish end_game2_c0321214:

    # "I shift a little under his intense gaze."
    "Me muevo un poco bajo su intensa mirada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2200
translate spanish end_game2_aa2e7dab:

    # m "\"Yeah, but I miss my planet. I just need to be home for a while...so it might be a while.\""
    m "\"Sí, pero echo de menos mi planeta. Necesito estar en casa un tiempo...así que quizá tarde bastante.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2201
translate spanish end_game2_f651cd9d:

    # "Neferu is quiet for a moment."
    "Neferu guarda silencio un momento."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2203
translate spanish end_game2_a9e468a7:

    # n "\"Does 'a while' mean weeks...months?\""
    n "\"¿'Un tiempo' significa semanas...meses?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2204
translate spanish end_game2_1609e617:

    # "I look away, over the surface of the steaming water."
    "Aparto la mirada sobre la superficie del agua humeante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2205
translate spanish end_game2_d7b556f7:

    # m "\"Maybe a bit longer.\""
    m "\"Quizá algo más.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2207
translate spanish end_game2_0e7d8d62:

    # n "\"Years.\""
    n "\"Años.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2208
translate spanish end_game2_c7f91870:

    # "It's more of a statement than a question."
    "Es más una afirmación que una pregunta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2209
translate spanish end_game2_6f40f7c3:

    # m "\"Maybe.\""
    m "\"Quizá.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2211
translate spanish end_game2_8eb60deb:

    # n "\"Well, I must say that I was rather shocked to hear of your sudden plans for departure, that you would not tell me earlier.\""
    n "\"Bueno, debo decir que me sorprendió bastante saber de tus repentinos planes de partida y que no me lo hubieras contado antes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2212
translate spanish end_game2_1257600b:

    # "I half-heartedly will the parents to send me a signal that I can just tell Neferu everything."
    "Deseo sin mucha convicción que los Padres me envíen una señal de que puedo contarle todo a Neferu."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2213
translate spanish end_game2_027c80d5:

    # "But, like always, all is quiet in space."
    "Pero, como siempre, todo está en silencio en el espacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2214
translate spanish end_game2_12905e0d:

    # n "\"But now I'm less surprised, considering that it sounds like you yourself did not realize you would be leaving.\""
    n "\"Pero ahora me sorprende menos, teniendo en cuenta que parece que tú mismo no sabías que te marcharías.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2215
translate spanish end_game2_4c3ab0d4:

    # m "\"I just didn't know how to tell you.\""
    m "\"Simplemente no sabía cómo decírtelo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2216
translate spanish end_game2_2f34b8dd:

    # n "\"Mmh, that, or you're hiding something.\""
    n "\"Mmh, eso, o estás ocultando algo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2217
translate spanish end_game2_dd0ee98f:

    # "I look at him."
    "Lo miro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2218
translate spanish end_game2_df8ec4bc_2:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2220
translate spanish end_game2_aabc5277:

    # n "\"Oh [mc], you're not nearly as subtle as you think. Like I said, you're becoming more like Amicus every day.\""
    n "\"Oh, [mc], no eres ni de lejos tan sutil como crees. Como he dicho, cada día te pareces más a Amicus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2221
translate spanish end_game2_9d3344cb:

    # m "\"What do you mean?\""
    m "\"¿Qué quieres decir?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2223
translate spanish end_game2_dc6454c2:

    # n "\"Well, your sudden interest in galactic affairs, for one, but mostly, it's your mere presence here in the first place. It makes little sense.\""
    n "\"Por un lado, tu repentino interés por los asuntos galácticos; pero principalmente, el mero hecho de que estés aquí. No tiene mucho sentido.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2224
translate spanish end_game2_73453da0_1:

    # m "\"Oh yeah?\""
    m "\"Ah, ¿sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2225
translate spanish end_game2_e686e1c0:

    # "I kind of hope that Neferu figures it out on his own, considering that would dodge the issue of me telling anyone."
    "En cierto modo, espero que Neferu lo descubra por su cuenta, porque así evitaría el problema de contárselo a alguien."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2227
translate spanish end_game2_93ed5efe:

    # n "\"Oh yes. If I were to guess, you are currently being trained by Adastra to assimilate your people with the children of the wolves.\""
    n "\"Oh, sí. Si tuviera que adivinar, Adastra te está preparando para integrar a tu pueblo con los Hijos de los lobos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2228
translate spanish end_game2_833a0a07:

    # "I physically recoil at the idea, even though he's incredibly close."
    "Me echo físicamente hacia atrás ante la idea, aunque está increíblemente cerca de la verdad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2229
translate spanish end_game2_2f912eb2:

    # m "\"What? Hell no! I would never do that to my people...or to any people!\""
    m "\"¿Qué? ¡Ni de coña! Nunca le haría eso a mi pueblo...¡ni a ningún pueblo!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2230
translate spanish end_game2_62fe6725:

    # "Despite Amicus being emperor, and despite his slow but steady improvements for the wolven children, it's still not a situation I would put Earth in willingly."
    "Aunque Amicus sea el emperador y esté mejorando lenta pero constantemente las condiciones de los Hijos de los lobos, sigue siendo una situación en la que no pondría voluntariamente a la Tierra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2232
translate spanish end_game2_19a8bca3:

    # "Neferu raises his eyebrow again, seemingly convinced by my reaction."
    "Neferu vuelve a alzar una ceja, al parecer convencido por mi reacción."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2233
translate spanish end_game2_7cd75aa3:

    # n "\"Hm...\""
    n "\"Hm...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2234
translate spanish end_game2_1fec7261:

    # "We regard each other for a moment, and Neferu blinks first."
    "Nos observamos un momento, y Neferu parpadea primero."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2236
translate spanish end_game2_4f08eba1:

    # n "\"So, you really won't tell me?\""
    n "\"Así que, ¿de verdad no me lo vas a contar?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2237
translate spanish end_game2_210d5a96:

    # m "\"I didn't say I have a secret to tell, though. You're just assuming.\""
    m "\"Pero no he dicho que tenga un secreto que contar. Solo lo estás suponiendo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2238
translate spanish end_game2_204e1544:

    # n "\"Honestly, I'm a bit hurt that you feel you can't trust me with this information, after all this time.\""
    n "\"Sinceramente, me duele un poco que sientas que no puedes confiarme esta información, después de tanto tiempo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2239
translate spanish end_game2_911c6045:

    # "Now I raise an eyebrow."
    "Ahora soy yo quien alza una ceja."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2240
translate spanish end_game2_a3a30c8e:

    # m "\"Neferu, you haven't told me anything about your own situation on your planet, along with your family.\""
    m "\"Neferu, tú no me has contado nada sobre tu propia situación en tu planeta, ni con tu familia.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2242
translate spanish end_game2_feeb28cb:

    # n "\"Well, you've never asked.\""
    n "\"Bueno, nunca has preguntado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2243
translate spanish end_game2_a4e3c8d5:

    # m "\"Because I know it's personal. You dodged the topic whenever I brought it up.\""
    m "\"Porque sé que es personal. Esquivabas el tema cada vez que lo sacaba.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2245
translate spanish end_game2_5c3e9c6d:

    # n "\"It's a very long story, first of all, and second of all, it's a story about me being a selfish, foolish brat. Of course I wouldn't want to tell you.\""
    n "\"En primer lugar, es una historia muy larga; y en segundo, es una historia sobre mí siendo un mocoso egoísta y estúpido. Por supuesto que no querría contártela.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2247
translate spanish end_game2_54a7b329:

    # n "\"But if I tell you, would you tell me?\""
    n "\"Pero, si te la cuento, ¿me contarías la tuya?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2248
translate spanish end_game2_cb83fb0b:

    # "I think, somewhat tempted to make him tell his story, then just lie about mine...but only for a second."
    "Pienso, algo tentado de hacer que cuente su historia y después mentirle sobre la mía...pero solo un segundo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2249
translate spanish end_game2_3f739ce1_3:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2250
translate spanish end_game2_7b9a7861:

    # m "\"No. I...I'll only be able to when I come back.\""
    m "\"No. Yo...solo podré cuando vuelva.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2252
translate spanish end_game2_ffadb9d0:

    # "Neferu's impish nature deflates pretty quick."
    "La picardía de Neferu se apaga bastante rápido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2253
translate spanish end_game2_c5952df9:

    # n "\"Well, at least you're honest.\""
    n "\"Bueno, al menos eres sincero.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2255
translate spanish end_game2_937892a1:

    # n "\"I suppose I'll trust you that it's rather important and not my place to know. I admit that I am still hurt by all this, and that's not something I admit often.\""
    n "\"Supongo que confiaré en que es algo bastante importante y no me corresponde saberlo. Admito que todo esto sigue doliéndome, y no es algo que admita a menudo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2256
translate spanish end_game2_4a111ef8:

    # m "\"Sorry. I promise, you'll understand once I'm back.\""
    m "\"Lo siento. Te prometo que lo entenderás cuando vuelva.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2257
translate spanish end_game2_1a7c01f6:

    # "Again, I wonder if I'm already admitting too much."
    "De nuevo, me pregunto si ya estoy admitiendo demasiado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2259
translate spanish end_game2_f523611d:

    # n "\"But years? I can't predict where I'll be in that amount of time.\""
    n "\"¿Pero años? No puedo predecir dónde estaré dentro de tanto tiempo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2260
translate spanish end_game2_7a05e994:

    # m "\"Back on Khemia?\""
    m "\"¿De vuelta en Khemia?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2261
translate spanish end_game2_114a3364:

    # n "\"Possibly, if all goes well.\""
    n "\"Posiblemente, si todo sale bien.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2262
translate spanish end_game2_3526662a:

    # m "\"I'll visit. I'm a citizen, remember?\""
    m "\"Iré a visitarte. Soy ciudadano, ¿recuerdas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2264
translate spanish end_game2_26e2ca6c:

    # n "\"Well, they rarely allow use of the stretch for only visits, but being the emperor's husband might make that easier.\""
    n "\"Bueno, rara vez permiten usar la Propulsión solo para visitas, pero ser el esposo del emperador podría facilitarlo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2265
translate spanish end_game2_16a0cead:

    # m "\"Yeah, I'll convince him.\""
    m "\"Sí, lo convenceré.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2266
translate spanish end_game2_2e0b0c7e:

    # "That seems to bring the issue of my sudden departure to a close."
    "Eso parece dar por concluido el asunto de mi repentina partida."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2267
translate spanish end_game2_bad302f4:

    # "We sit there in silence for a long while, then I place a hand on Neferu's knee."
    "Nos quedamos allí en silencio un buen rato, y luego le pongo una mano en la rodilla a Neferu."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2268
translate spanish end_game2_5e5f6d27:

    # "It's not something I would have done in the past, considering the jackal's reputation, but nothing about it feels sensual."
    "No es algo que hubiera hecho antes, teniendo en cuenta la reputación del chacal, pero no tiene nada de sensual."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2269
translate spanish end_game2_89f0eb15:

    # "Instead, I do it out of pure solidarity and friendship."
    "Lo hago simplemente por solidaridad y amistad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2270
translate spanish end_game2_0da9fa66:

    # m "\"And I wanted to say thank you, Neferu, for everything. I don't think I'd be alive if you weren't there for me. I know you had your reasons, everyone did, but thank you.\""
    m "\"Y quería darte las gracias, Neferu, por todo. No creo que siguiera vivo si no hubieras estado a mi lado. Sé que tenías tus motivos, todos los tenían, pero gracias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2272
translate spanish end_game2_3869227a:

    # n "\"It is the duty of all Khemians to protect any sapient fleeing wolven violence, whether they be sibling, child, or as you happen to be, abandoned.\""
    n "\"Es deber de todos los Khemianos proteger a cualquier Sapiente que huya de la violencia de los lobos, sea Hermano, Hijo o, como es tu caso, abandonado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2273
translate spanish end_game2_c6f32c90:

    # m "\"I'll believe that after I visit Khemia and have a look for myself.\""
    m "\"Me lo creeré después de visitar Khemia y verlo por mí mismo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2275
translate spanish end_game2_22b87124:

    # n "\"I'll be your tour guide.\""
    n "\"Seré tu guía turístico.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2276
translate spanish end_game2_5b4e92f8:

    # m "\"And Neferu, you can still tell me what's going on with your family, if you want.\""
    m "\"Y, Neferu, todavía puedes contarme qué ocurre con tu familia, si quieres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2278
translate spanish end_game2_81867468:

    # n "\"Definitely not. Do you {i}really{/i} want to know? The situation is complex, unresolved, and seems to always be changing.\""
    n "\"Definitivamente no. ¿{i}De verdad{/i} quieres saberlo? La situación es compleja, está sin resolver y parece cambiar siempre.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2279
translate spanish end_game2_b42bda03:

    # m "\"I mean, yeah, I'd like to know. It seems really important to you, but...\""
    m "\"Quiero decir, sí, me gustaría saberlo. Parece realmente importante para ti, pero...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2280
translate spanish end_game2_7f6e37de:

    # "It feels unfair that I'd make him tell me his clearly painful story without my own."
    "Me parece injusto hacerle contar una historia claramente dolorosa sin contarle la mía."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2281
translate spanish end_game2_0d36bfbd:

    # m "\"Again, when I'm back. Then we can trade.\""
    m "\"Como decía, cuando vuelva. Entonces podremos intercambiarlas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2283
translate spanish end_game2_984a65b5:

    # n "\"Deal.\""
    n "\"Trato hecho.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2284
translate spanish end_game2_a96d73eb:

    # "Neferu stands up, stepping up onto the bench before reaching down to pull me up."
    "Neferu se levanta, sube al banco y luego baja una pata para ayudarme a subir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2286
translate spanish end_game2_eeeaa10e:

    # n "\"Now let's go for a walk before your wolf returns. I would like our last conversations to be of happier things.\""
    n "\"Ahora vayamos a dar un paseo antes de que vuelva tu lobo. Me gustaría que nuestras últimas conversaciones fueran de cosas más alegres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2288
translate spanish end_game2_b1da4148:

    # "I take his paw, letting him pull me up."
    "Tomo su pata y dejo que me levante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2290
translate spanish end_game2_f5441a5c:

    # "Then the two of us step out of the pool to towel off and dress."
    "Después salimos de la piscina para secarnos y vestirnos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2291
translate spanish end_game2_d24914a0:

    # "Neferu is easily able to shift the conversation to things that are light and interesting, and it almost makes me forget that I'm leaving."
    "Neferu consigue llevar fácilmente la conversación a temas ligeros e interesantes, y casi me hace olvidar que me marcho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2296
translate spanish end_game2_9c5d32f3:

    # a "\"And so this wolverine actually believes that the imperial family would even {i}consider{/i} apologizing for the war. Absolutely asinine, if you ask me.\""
    a "\"Y ese glotón cree de verdad que la familia imperial siquiera {i}consideraría{/i} disculparse por la guerra. Absolutamente estúpido, si me preguntas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2297
translate spanish end_game2_f8108e6c:

    # m "\"Sounds reasonable.\""
    m "\"Suena razonable.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2299
translate spanish end_game2_3e7400a4:

    # a "\"What!? No, [mc], it is not! We suffered the heaviest casualties.\""
    a "\"¿¡Qué!? ¡No, [mc], no lo es! Nosotros sufrimos las mayores bajas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2300
translate spanish end_game2_71c048da:

    # m "\"But wasn't it started by the empire?\""
    m "\"¿Pero no fue el imperio quien la empezó?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2302
translate spanish end_game2_3451b747:

    # a "\"No, it was started by Khemian provocation. Haven't you learned the history?\""
    a "\"No, la empezó la provocación Khemiana. ¿No has aprendido la historia?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2303
translate spanish end_game2_3507c7f7:

    # m "\"Well, yeah, but attacking a planet full of sapient children wasn't the best way to respond.\""
    m "\"Bueno, sí, pero atacar un planeta lleno de Hijos Sapientes no era la mejor respuesta.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2304
translate spanish end_game2_4eef9e50:

    # a "\"We attacked the Khemian bases with weaponry which happened to be on a planet full of children. They were never fired on directly.\""
    a "\"Atacamos las bases Khemianas con armamento que estaban en un planeta lleno de Hijos. A ellos nunca se les disparó directamente.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2305
translate spanish end_game2_43a06ddb:

    # m "\"So says the Adastran history books.\""
    m "\"Eso dicen los libros de historia de Adastra.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2307
translate spanish end_game2_fb6a565a:

    # a "\"Ugh! Why would you assume that? It's not a good argument to just...whip out assumptions that these are lies. My father never lied.\""
    a "\"¡Ugh! ¿Por qué supondrías eso? No es un buen argumento simplemente...sacar suposiciones de que son mentiras. Mi padre nunca mintió.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2308
translate spanish end_game2_5437b4b6:

    # m "\"I'm basing it off what I've learned from Khemian history as well. I'm not only learning about Adastra, you know.\""
    m "\"También me baso en lo que he aprendido de la historia Khemiana. No estoy aprendiendo solo sobre Adastra, ¿sabes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2309
translate spanish end_game2_26fdc21b:

    # "Amicus is quiet, but still looking huffy, so I lean over from my side of the couch to touch his shoulder."
    "Amicus guarda silencio, aunque sigue pareciendo enfurruñado, así que me inclino desde mi lado del sofá para tocarle el hombro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2310
translate spanish end_game2_00ffc66e:

    # m "\"Listen, I'm not saying your father is a liar...I'm saying that sapients as a whole are. I know because humans do the exact same thing when we write our history.\""
    m "\"Escucha, no digo que tu padre sea un mentiroso...digo que los Sapientes en general lo son. Lo sé porque los humanos hacemos exactamente lo mismo al escribir nuestra historia.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2311
translate spanish end_game2_ae079bd8:

    # a "\"You should have a bit more pride in your species. How will you lead the humans, otherwise?\""
    a "\"Deberías tener un poco más de orgullo por tu especie. ¿Cómo vas a guiar a los humanos si no?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2312
translate spanish end_game2_59d25363:

    # m "\"Actually, I think pride is the biggest wolven problem.\""
    m "\"De hecho, creo que el orgullo es el mayor problema de los lobos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2314
translate spanish end_game2_d277cbf7:

    # "Amicus just goes quiet."
    "Amicus simplemente se queda callado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2315
translate spanish end_game2_f1b92e5d:

    # "I think I hit a sore spot talking about his dad, and although I'm enjoying our usual, somewhat intense banter, I don't have as much energy as usual."
    "Creo que he tocado un punto sensible al hablar de su padre y, aunque disfruto de nuestras habituales bromas algo intensas, no tengo tanta energía como de costumbre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2316
translate spanish end_game2_d5cbd0bf:

    # m "\"Sorry...I shouldn't talk about things I don't understand.\""
    m "\"Perdona...no debería hablar de cosas que no entiendo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2317
translate spanish end_game2_9e89c41e:

    # "Amicus looks at me with surprise."
    "Amicus me mira sorprendido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2319
translate spanish end_game2_7df2cfda:

    # a "\"What? No, I do want you to talk to me about these things. I might seem upset, but I've already told you I enjoy debating—\""
    a "\"¿Qué? No, sí quiero que hables conmigo de estas cosas. Puede que parezca molesto, pero ya te he dicho que me gusta debatir—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2320
translate spanish end_game2_2bc623db:

    # "I wave away Amicus's rush to smooth things over."
    "Aparto con un gesto el apresurado intento de Amicus de arreglarlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2321
translate spanish end_game2_7349bc5b:

    # m "\"No, me too. I'm just a little tired today.\""
    m "\"No, a mí también. Solo estoy un poco cansado hoy.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2323
translate spanish end_game2_c2f7d8b7:

    # a "\"Ah...\""
    a "\"Ah...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2324
translate spanish end_game2_5c589e68:

    # "What I want to talk about is what's about to happen to me, about how I very much doubt the parents themselves, how I don't want to do anything except stay on this couch."
    "Quiero hablar de lo que está a punto de pasarme, de lo mucho que desconfío de los propios Padres, de que no quiero hacer nada excepto quedarme en este sofá."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2325
translate spanish end_game2_bb81df59:

    # "But I can tell Amicus doesn't."
    "Pero me doy cuenta de que Amicus no quiere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2326
translate spanish end_game2_930f0beb:

    # "He came in with the stories of the day right away, as if this isn't our last night together."
    "Entró contando enseguida las historias del día, como si esta no fuera nuestra última noche juntos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2327
translate spanish end_game2_4c7ad3ad:

    # "While it had been easy to pretend with Neferu, it's much more difficult seeing Amicus put on such an act to, I assume, make me feel better."
    "Aunque fingir con Neferu había sido fácil, resulta mucho más difícil ver a Amicus interpretar ese papel para, supongo, hacerme sentir mejor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2328
translate spanish end_game2_246a9638:

    # m "\"Amicus, I don't know if I can—\""
    m "\"Amicus, no sé si puedo—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2330
translate spanish end_game2_581182d7:

    # "Amicus suddenly holds up a paw."
    "Amicus levanta de repente una pata."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2331
translate spanish end_game2_467a16cd:

    # a "\"Wait, [mc], I—I know, but please, let's have this night together. I promise you, the situation will become clearer for you, just give it a little more time.\""
    a "\"Espera, [mc], yo—lo sé, pero, por favor, pasemos esta noche juntos. Te prometo que la situación se aclarará para ti; dale un poco más de tiempo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2332
translate spanish end_game2_abde442e:

    # "That gives me pause."
    "Eso me hace detenerme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2333
translate spanish end_game2_fb8d3be6:

    # "It's like Amicus knows something that I don't..."
    "Es como si Amicus supiera algo que yo no sé..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2335
translate spanish end_game2_116f6903:

    # a "\"And trust me, because we are traveling back to Earth together, we will have plenty of time to discuss whatever you wish—\""
    a "\"Y confía en mí: como volveremos juntos a la Tierra, tendremos tiempo de sobra para hablar de lo que quieras—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2337
translate spanish end_game2_05321a92:

    # "Amicus's eyes start to glisten just slightly as he holds back tears, then clears his throat."
    "Los ojos de Amicus empiezan a brillar ligeramente al contener las lágrimas, y luego se aclara la garganta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2339
translate spanish end_game2_fd5c1b5f:

    # a "\"—but for now...I think it's preposterous that they expect me to apologize.\""
    a "\"—pero por ahora...creo que es absurdo que esperen que me disculpe.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2340
translate spanish end_game2_2649d278:

    # "I watch Amicus for a long time, realizing that maybe I should keep my suspicions to myself, for now."
    "Observo a Amicus durante mucho tiempo y comprendo que quizá debería guardarme mis sospechas, por ahora."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2341
translate spanish end_game2_9eb7d982:

    # "He's in constant contact with the parents, and I've respected the fact that he can't tell me what they say unless given specific permission to do so."
    "Está en contacto constante con los Padres, y he respetado el hecho de que no pueda contarme lo que dicen sin permiso específico."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2342
translate spanish end_game2_355c2532:

    # "But he must believe in them if he's still wanting to go along with this plan."
    "Pero debe creer en ellos si todavía quiere seguir adelante con este plan."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2343
translate spanish end_game2_000ad9eb:

    # "I think I need to figure out the parents on my own."
    "Creo que necesito entender a los Padres por mi cuenta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2344
translate spanish end_game2_ab0fa07f:

    # "On top of that, he knows how hard this separation is going to be, we both do."
    "Además, sabe lo difícil que va a ser esta separación; ambos lo sabemos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2345
translate spanish end_game2_bb57c5a9:

    # "But he wants to save the tears for the end, and so do I."
    "Pero quiere guardar las lágrimas para el final, y yo también."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2346
translate spanish end_game2_42b896f8:

    # "So..."
    "Así que..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2347
translate spanish end_game2_2e087ece:

    # m "\"Well, if it's just the imperial family apologizing that's actually asking for very little to create an alliance.\""
    m "\"Bueno, si solo piden que la familia imperial se disculpe, en realidad es pedir muy poco para establecer una alianza.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2349
translate spanish end_game2_a36109b8:

    # a "\"It's one of many demands, and they simply want to humiliate us, all because Neferu managed to get his balls kicked in.\""
    a "\"Es una de muchas exigencias, y solo quieren humillarnos, todo porque Neferu consiguió que le patearan los huevos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2350
translate spanish end_game2_454c01d5:

    # m "\"I mean, the Pharaoh's son. You should honestly consider yourself lucky no one else saw {i}you{/i} hit him.\""
    m "\"Quiero decir, el hijo del faraón. Sinceramente, deberías considerarte afortunado de que nadie más viera que {i}tú{/i} le pegabas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2352
translate spanish end_game2_3aaf056f:

    # a "\"Heh, he's an easy one to hit. What does he expect always leaving himself wide open? He deserved it. Both times.\""
    a "\"Je, es fácil pegarle. ¿Qué espera, si siempre se deja totalmente expuesto? Se lo merecía. Las dos veces.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2353
translate spanish end_game2_3f739ce1_4:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2354
translate spanish end_game2_49e6a085:

    # m "\"Be nice, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Sé amable, Amicus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2356
translate spanish end_game2_7eeecbae:

    # "But I lean into him, and he finally pulls me into his lap, nuzzling my hair."
    "Pero me apoyo en él y por fin me atrae a su regazo, acariciándome el pelo con el hocico."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2359
translate spanish end_game2_dc55772b:

    # "We talk for a while longer, the two of us trying to stay awake as long as possible."
    "Hablamos un rato más, intentando mantenernos despiertos todo el tiempo posible."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2360
translate spanish end_game2_1846f2a6:

    # "I finally manage to relax a bit, and finally my eyes grow heavy, and Amicus's warm breath puffs steadily against my head."
    "Por fin consigo relajarme un poco, mis ojos se vuelven pesados y el cálido aliento de Amicus sopla de forma constante contra mi cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2361
translate spanish end_game2_cf07b580:

    # "I imagine this moment folding into a pocket of infinity, made to go on forever, our responsibilities gone, the coming trials never to arrive."
    "Imagino este momento plegándose en un rincón de la eternidad, destinado a durar para siempre, sin nuestras responsabilidades ni las pruebas que están por venir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2362
translate spanish end_game2_870e839a:

    # "But time does march on, because without realizing it, I start to fall asleep..."
    "Pero el tiempo sigue avanzando porque, sin darme cuenta, empiezo a quedarme dormido..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2366
translate spanish end_game2_42992b10:

    # "{i}\"You are on the right path.\"{/i}"
    "{i}\"Estás en el camino correcto.\"{/i}"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2367
translate spanish end_game2_b6a8fd99:

    # "I grasp blindly at the sound of his voice."
    "Busco a ciegas el sonido de su voz."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2368
translate spanish end_game2_c22490cd:

    # "Hello?"
    "¿Hola?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2369
translate spanish end_game2_2c1b407f:

    # "I don't know what to do."
    "No sé qué hacer."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2371
translate spanish end_game2_92ad9a2c:

    # "My feet slide quietly across the rug and marble, leaving Amicus behind on the sofa."
    "Mis pies se deslizan silenciosamente por la alfombra y el mármol, dejando a Amicus en el sofá."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2373
translate spanish end_game2_09585107:

    # "{i}\"Apologies for the extended silence...\"{/i}"
    "{i}\"Disculpas por el prolongado silencio...\"{/i}"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2374
translate spanish end_game2_3440caa5:

    # "But why?"
    "¿Pero por qué?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2375
translate spanish end_game2_dca42e52:

    # "Who are you?"
    "¿Quién eres?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2376
translate spanish end_game2_9ac078de:

    # "{i}\"You know me.\"{/i}"
    "{i}\"Me conoces.\"{/i}"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2378
translate spanish end_game2_e679766b:

    # "I walk deliberately in the direction I know to go, my only distraction being the furious twitching in my left eyelid."
    "Camino deliberadamente en la dirección que sé que debo seguir; solo me distrae el violento temblor de mi párpado izquierdo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2380
translate spanish end_game2_9d99a935:

    # "{i}\"You needed time to learn about yourself, to learn about the {i}Galaxias{/i}, to steel your resolve, and now you are ready to forge ahead.\"{/i}"
    "{i}\"Necesitabas tiempo para conocerte a ti mismo, para aprender sobre el {i}Galaxias{/i}, para afianzar tu determinación, y ahora estás preparado para seguir adelante.\"{/i}"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2382
translate spanish end_game2_bcf6dd4d:

    # "No."
    "No."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2384
translate spanish end_game2_b6233d6a:

    # "{i}\"What?\"{/i}"
    "{i}\"¿Qué?\"{/i}"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2387
translate spanish end_game2_6947da93:

    # mon "\"Would you like to glance through the eyes of the parents, to see what lies ahead?\""
    mon "\"¿Te gustaría mirar a través de los ojos de los Padres para ver lo que te espera?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2388
translate spanish end_game2_67aaa788:

    # "What?"
    "¿Qué?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2389
translate spanish end_game2_dfcc9b73:

    # "Something trembles under my feet."
    "Algo tiembla bajo mis pies."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2390
translate spanish end_game2_fead4c8c:

    # "I sense someone else."
    "Siento a alguien más."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2391
translate spanish end_game2_e5e3b81e:

    # mon "\"...\""
    mon "\"...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2392
translate spanish end_game2_481f62e0:

    # "He does too."
    "Ella también."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2393
translate spanish end_game2_4f965ec8:

    # "I move my mind towards the presence...towards {i}her{/i}."
    "Dirijo mi mente hacia la presencia...hacia {i}ella{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2394
translate spanish end_game2_c32b65ab:

    # mon "\"This way.\""
    mon "\"Por aquí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2395
translate spanish end_game2_bcf6dd4d_1:

    # "No."
    "No."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2396
translate spanish end_game2_348adab7:

    # "He watches me, and for the first time, I sense something from the dragon that almost feels like worry."
    "Me observa y, por primera vez, percibo algo procedente del dragón que casi parece preocupación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2397
translate spanish end_game2_09f875f1:

    # mon "\"Don't be distracted by rogue entities, this is dangerous...\""
    mon "\"No te distraigas con entidades rebeldes; esto es peligroso...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2398
translate spanish end_game2_c1aba2f1:

    # "What does that mean?"
    "¿Qué significa eso?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2399
translate spanish end_game2_f8e44c12:

    # "But it doesn't matter, because I keep moving away."
    "Pero no importa, porque sigo alejándome."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2402
translate spanish end_game2_f4dc32c1:

    # "This presence, I know her."
    "Esta presencia, la conozco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2403
translate spanish end_game2_20a4518f:

    # "She tried to contact me in the amalgamation."
    "Intentó contactar conmigo en la amalgamación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2404
translate spanish end_game2_76a32cd7:

    # "She refused to mingle, she stayed separate."
    "Se negó a fusionarse; permaneció separada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2405
translate spanish end_game2_b250c582:

    # "And now, I can see her."
    "Y ahora puedo verla."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2406
translate spanish end_game2_58f303ed:

    # "She appears before me."
    "Aparece ante mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2408
translate spanish end_game2_645c9371:

    # "She bows to me."
    "Me hace una reverencia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2409
translate spanish end_game2_a077825f:

    # unk "\"Hello, my replacement. There is much to say.\""
    unk "\"Hola, mi sustituto. Hay mucho que decir.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2410
translate spanish end_game2_f6a57508:

    # "I know her."
    "La conozco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2411
translate spanish end_game2_7cd1acb3:

    # "Already, I know who this is."
    "Ya sé quién es."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2412
translate spanish end_game2_7905f008:

    # m "\"Meera.\""
    m "\"Meera.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2413
translate spanish end_game2_3cb2199d:

    # me "\"Ah, so you do possess a notable level of intelligence.\""
    me "\"Ah, así que sí posees un nivel de inteligencia notable.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2414
translate spanish end_game2_fbb2fe16:

    # "I'm confused, unsure as to what's happening, {i}why{/i} it's happening."
    "Estoy confundido, sin saber qué está ocurriendo ni {i}por qué{/i} ocurre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2415
translate spanish end_game2_f1f06139:

    # "I swallow, or at least I do mentally."
    "Trago saliva, o al menos lo hago mentalmente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2416
translate spanish end_game2_2bd0777c:

    # "I still feel out-of-body, anchored to nothing."
    "Sigo sintiéndome fuera de mi cuerpo, sin estar anclado a nada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2417
translate spanish end_game2_b412417f:

    # "I'm just an observer from an indefinable point in space."
    "Solo soy un observador desde un punto indefinible del espacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2418
translate spanish end_game2_30484fbf:

    # m "\"You...you say I'm a replacement?\""
    m "\"Tú...¿dices que soy un sustituto?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2419
translate spanish end_game2_e0497e5d:

    # me "\"My replacement, yes. Though I suppose that label isn't entirely accurate...you're more of a successor.\""
    me "\"Mi sustituto, sí. Aunque supongo que esa etiqueta no es del todo precisa...eres más bien un sucesor.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2420
translate spanish end_game2_7d9f99ce:

    # "My concentration on summoning myself a body begins to yield some results as I see the outlines of my torso and legs below me."
    "Mi concentración en invocar un cuerpo para mí empieza a dar algún resultado, y veo los contornos de mi torso y mis piernas debajo de mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2421
translate spanish end_game2_ba877dcb:

    # me "\"Though, my...inability to complete their requests has thrust some of those duties upon you. So yes, a successor, but also a replacement.\""
    me "\"Aunque mi...incapacidad para cumplir sus peticiones te ha impuesto algunos de esos deberes. Así que sí, un sucesor, pero también un sustituto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2422
translate spanish end_game2_ad2ca24c:

    # "I finally materialize the majority of my body, solidifying its shape beneath my point of view."
    "Por fin materializo la mayor parte de mi cuerpo, solidificando su forma debajo de mi punto de vista."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2423
translate spanish end_game2_820917d3:

    # "I lift my hands to my face, and though they look tangible, there's also a dream-like quality to them, bending and moving in ways that don't seem real."
    "Levanto las manos hacia mi cara y, aunque parecen tangibles, también tienen algo de sueño; se doblan y se mueven de maneras que no parecen reales."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2424
translate spanish end_game2_e0781ba9:

    # "Meera is quiet, and I realize my focus isn't fully dedicated to her, though it should be."
    "Meera está callada y me doy cuenta de que mi atención no está dedicada por completo a ella, aunque debería."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2425
translate spanish end_game2_6402fd69:

    # "I look up."
    "Levanto la mirada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2426
translate spanish end_game2_7fb6a0c0:

    # m "\"Sorry, what was your assignment?\""
    m "\"Lo siento, ¿cuál era tu misión?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2427
translate spanish end_game2_0506f4ca:

    # "She stares back at me for a while, brow furrowed, and I wonder if she's upset with me."
    "Me mira fijamente un rato, con el ceño fruncido, y me pregunto si está enfadada conmigo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2428
translate spanish end_game2_c614ff64:

    # me "\"Shall we adopt Khemian etiquette and get to the point quickly? I have a feeling my time with you will not be long.\""
    me "\"¿Adoptamos los modales khemianos y vamos rápidamente al grano? Tengo la sensación de que mi tiempo contigo no será largo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2429
translate spanish end_game2_7c265d8b:

    # m "\"S—sure.\""
    m "\"C-claro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2430
translate spanish end_game2_3f96ea03:

    # me "\"Splendid. So, [mc], do you trust the parents?\""
    me "\"Estupendo. Entonces, [mc], ¿confías en los Padres?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2431
translate spanish end_game2_ac94747a:

    # m "\"Huh?\""
    m "\"¿Eh?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2432
translate spanish end_game2_7519979b:

    # "I heard her well enough, I just don't know how I should answer the question."
    "La he oído perfectamente; simplemente no sé cómo debería responder a la pregunta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2433
translate spanish end_game2_41ba960e:

    # me "\"I said, do you trust the parents?\""
    me "\"He dicho: ¿confías en los Padres?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2434
translate spanish end_game2_73fa2339:

    # m "\"Yeah...mostly.\""
    m "\"Sí...en general.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2435
translate spanish end_game2_b3443d55:

    # "I say that because I'm pretty sure the parents are listening right now."
    "Lo digo porque estoy bastante seguro de que los Padres están escuchando ahora mismo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2436
translate spanish end_game2_d665883e:

    # "For the past several months I've been trying to smother the questioning thoughts that I've had, the worry that I'm being kept from the full truth."
    "Durante los últimos meses he intentado sofocar mis dudas, la preocupación de que me estén ocultando toda la verdad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2437
translate spanish end_game2_2a218be3:

    # "That's mainly because I don't want to jeopardize Amicus's plans, his future goals."
    "Sobre todo porque no quiero poner en peligro los planes de Amicus, sus objetivos futuros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2438
translate spanish end_game2_bd62d050:

    # "He knows much more about the parents than I do, and though he has his reservations after what happened to me, I think he trusts them."
    "Sabe mucho más de los Padres que yo, y aunque tiene sus reservas después de lo que me pasó, creo que confía en ellos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2439
translate spanish end_game2_4e75bf9e:

    # "And because I trust Amicus, I guess I trust the parents as well."
    "Y como confío en Amicus, supongo que también confío en los Padres."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2440
translate spanish end_game2_115eefcd:

    # "...Sort of.\""
    "...Más o menos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2441
translate spanish end_game2_33af90c5:

    # me "\"You're not a very good liar, are you, [mc]?\""
    me "\"No se te da muy bien mentir, ¿verdad, [mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2442
translate spanish end_game2_e0694995:

    # m "\"I'm not lyin—\""
    m "\"No estoy mintien...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2443
translate spanish end_game2_e1eb7721:

    # me "\"Do you know what my fate was, [mc]?\""
    me "\"¿Sabes cuál fue mi destino, [mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2444
translate spanish end_game2_fe10ab79_1:

    # m "\"Uh...\""
    m "\"Eh...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2445
translate spanish end_game2_5c72397c:

    # "I think back, trying to remember the full story."
    "Recuerdo el pasado, intentando recuperar la historia completa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2446
translate spanish end_game2_7d69404a:

    # m "\"You committed suicide...to force Drusus into a choice...right?\""
    m "\"Te suicidaste...para obligar a Drusus a elegir...¿no?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2447
translate spanish end_game2_4d534806:

    # "The tigress continues to look at me with that piercing gaze."
    "La tigresa sigue mirándome con aquella mirada penetrante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2448
translate spanish end_game2_34b24e93:

    # "I start to become more uncomfortable."
    "Empiezo a sentirme más incómodo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2449
translate spanish end_game2_0738d2c5:

    # m "\"Listen, you had a lot to say, right? What is it?\""
    m "\"Escucha, tenías mucho que decir, ¿verdad? ¿Qué es?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2450
translate spanish end_game2_46b0b569:

    # me "\"[mc], what does it mean to be a sapient?\""
    me "\"[mc], ¿qué significa ser un Sapiente?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2451
translate spanish end_game2_cec87f76:

    # "I sigh, starting to get annoyed with how little explanation I'm getting."
    "Suspiro, empezando a molestarme lo pocas explicaciones que recibo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2452
translate spanish end_game2_f5bb2416:

    # "I shouldn't be the one answering questions."
    "No debería ser yo quien contesta las preguntas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2453
translate spanish end_game2_7ce305a1:

    # m "\"I don't know, to be self-aware?\""
    m "\"No lo sé, ¿tener conciencia de uno mismo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2454
translate spanish end_game2_db27f46e:

    # "Meera laughs, and there's an odd, growling quality to it."
    "Meera se ríe, y su risa tiene algo extraño, como un gruñido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2455
translate spanish end_game2_1dbd4396:

    # me "\"If that were true, then my lover would not have been considered a sapient.\""
    me "\"Si eso fuera cierto, a mi amante no lo habrían considerado un Sapiente.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2456
translate spanish end_game2_b00d2cb5:

    # "Lover."
    "Amante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2457
translate spanish end_game2_fea0e1d4:

    # "I wonder if Drusus is here with her."
    "Me pregunto si Drusus está aquí con ella."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2458
translate spanish end_game2_3b852ff9:

    # "I hope so, because if I end up like her, I'd still want to be with Amicus."
    "Espero que sí, porque si acabo como ella todavía querría estar con Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2459
translate spanish end_game2_0a8f0afc:

    # "The tigress adjusts her sari, pushing it back slightly to reveal more of her striped face."
    "La tigresa se ajusta el sari, apartándolo un poco para mostrar más de su rostro rayado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2460
translate spanish end_game2_60750310:

    # me "\"But that is certainly part of being sapient, though I suppose my question should be more broad: what does it mean to be alive?\""
    me "\"Pero eso sin duda forma parte de ser Sapiente, aunque supongo que mi pregunta debería ser más amplia: ¿qué significa estar vivo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2461
translate spanish end_game2_504133b1:

    # "I sigh, opening my mouth to tell her I don't know before Meera answers anyway."
    "Suspiro y abro la boca para decirle que no lo sé, pero Meera responde de todos modos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2462
translate spanish end_game2_0f9413e8:

    # me "\"Agency, the ability to make your own decisions.\""
    me "\"La autonomía, la capacidad de tomar tus propias decisiones.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2463
translate spanish end_game2_04650e3e:

    # "The tigress becomes serious once again."
    "La tigresa vuelve a ponerse seria."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2464
translate spanish end_game2_669e43ba:

    # me "\"Consider that the parents claim to hold life above all else in the universe.\""
    me "\"Piensa que los Padres afirman valorar la vida por encima de todo lo demás en el universo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2465
translate spanish end_game2_b52e58f2:

    # me "\"With that in mind, does the concept of what it means to be alive merge with the goals of the parents? Does it merge with what they are doing to you?\""
    me "\"Teniendo eso en cuenta, ¿encaja el concepto de lo que significa estar vivo con los objetivos de los Padres? ¿Encaja con lo que te están haciendo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2466
translate spanish end_game2_cbc0f624:

    # "Now I see where she's going with this."
    "Ahora veo adónde quiere llegar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2467
translate spanish end_game2_9facef06:

    # m "\"I don't have a choice.\""
    m "\"No puedo elegir.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2468
translate spanish end_game2_66acc4df:

    # "The tigress pauses, and I think I see her smirk a little."
    "La tigresa se detiene, y creo ver una pequeña sonrisa en sus labios."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2469
translate spanish end_game2_856a4d71:

    # me "\"No, you do not. Now, they attempt to right this fallacy by re-establishing choice, by telling you that you do not have to follow their guidance.\""
    me "\"No, no puedes. Ahora intentan corregir esta falacia restableciendo la elección, diciéndote que no tienes que seguir sus indicaciones.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2470
translate spanish end_game2_f1ca2b3f:

    # me "\"But in my experience, the alternative was a scenario which threatened my very life, a sapient life which they claim to hold dear.\""
    me "\"Pero en mi experiencia, la alternativa era una situación que amenazaba mi propia vida, una vida Sapiente que afirman apreciar.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2471
translate spanish end_game2_7031ea03:

    # "I think of Amicus's choice, a choice which wasn't really a choice at all for the wolf."
    "Pienso en la elección de Amicus, una elección que para el lobo no era realmente una elección."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2472
translate spanish end_game2_d5e5e77e:

    # me "\"How can they proclaim themselves benevolent if they threaten the life of the individuals they manipulate?\""
    me "\"¿Cómo pueden proclamarse benevolentes si amenazan la vida de los individuos a los que manipulan?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2473
translate spanish end_game2_0f979164:

    # me "\"How is that even possible when they use our very lives to manipulate the ones we love?\""
    me "\"¿Cómo es eso siquiera posible cuando usan nuestras propias vidas para manipular a quienes amamos?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2474
translate spanish end_game2_cd938aab_1:

    # "I grimace."
    "Hago una mueca."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2475
translate spanish end_game2_c17a2a72:

    # "It's almost like this tiger is reading my mind."
    "Es casi como si esta tigresa me leyera la mente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2476
translate spanish end_game2_6b474037:

    # me "\"I could not stand for it, thus here I am.\""
    me "\"No pude tolerarlo, y por eso estoy aquí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2477
translate spanish end_game2_51231553:

    # m "\"They...try not to interfere—\""
    m "\"Ellos...intentan no intervenir...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2478
translate spanish end_game2_cad7a89d:

    # me "\"They say they don't want to interfere, yet they've set plans into motion to take power from the empire and govern the siblings directly.\""
    me "\"Dicen que no quieren intervenir, y aun así han puesto en marcha planes para quitarle poder al imperio y gobernar directamente a los Hermanos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2479
translate spanish end_game2_61f958ee_1:

    # "I stare."
    "Me quedo mirándolo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2480
translate spanish end_game2_5080be28:

    # m "\"How do you know this?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo sabes eso?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2481
translate spanish end_game2_c7107a1d:

    # "The tiger glares."
    "La tigresa me mira con enfado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2482
translate spanish end_game2_8f09ace8:

    # me "\"I was privy to every one of their plans, even those 10,000 years into the future.\""
    me "\"Conocía todos y cada uno de sus planes, incluso los de aquí a 10.000 años.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2483
translate spanish end_game2_2a15deac:

    # "I try to comprehend that, but then shake my head."
    "Intento comprenderlo, pero luego sacudo la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2484
translate spanish end_game2_8889b80d:

    # m "\"But isn't their goal not to interfere at all? They're just trying to set us on the right path. Taking full control would go against everything they say.\""
    m "\"¿Pero no es su objetivo no intervenir en absoluto? Solo intentan encaminarnos por la senda correcta. Tomar el control total iría en contra de todo lo que dicen.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2485
translate spanish end_game2_472d57ec:

    # me "\"So they say. Yet they are stepping in to directly control your every move, your thoughts. Soon it will be the entire {i}Galaxias{/i}.\""
    me "\"Eso dicen. Pero están interviniendo para controlar directamente cada movimiento tuyo, tus pensamientos. Pronto será toda la {i}Galaxias{/i}.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2486
translate spanish end_game2_117526a8:

    # "I shake my head again, but Meera goes on."
    "Vuelvo a sacudir la cabeza, pero Meera continúa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2487
translate spanish end_game2_8fa0dee8:

    # me "\"Did you ever wonder why the intel you gathered on Cato's sabotage of the emperor's ship was never utilized, seemingly pressed to the back of the minds of all who knew of it?\""
    me "\"¿Nunca te has preguntado por qué jamás se utilizó la información que reuniste sobre el sabotaje de Cato a la nave del emperador, como si la hubieran relegado al fondo de la mente de todos los que la conocían?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2488
translate spanish end_game2_81c4a6f4:

    # me "\"Information that could have brought an end to the struggle in a much more peaceful process.\""
    me "\"Información que podría haber puesto fin al conflicto mediante un proceso mucho más pacífico.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2489
translate spanish end_game2_284e39d7:

    # "I narrow my gaze on the tiger, starting to feel uncomfortable."
    "Entrecierro los ojos al mirar a la tigresa, empezando a sentirme incómodo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2490
translate spanish end_game2_81279e08:

    # me "\"Why did you hand the goblet to Cassius, despite knowing what would follow?\""
    me "\"¿Por qué le diste la copa a Cassius, pese a saber lo que sucedería después?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2492
translate spanish end_game2_21381742:

    # "Now I start to really feel uneasy, looking carefully at the tigress."
    "Ahora empiezo a sentirme realmente inquieto, observando con cautela a la tigresa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2493
translate spanish end_game2_8ecb86e8:

    # m "\"How do you know this? Are you watching me?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo sabes eso? ¿Me estás vigilando?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2494
translate spanish end_game2_cbea3359:

    # "Meera's image seems to quiver."
    "La imagen de Meera parece temblar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2495
translate spanish end_game2_52a9ceb5:

    # me "\"{i}I am always watching.{/i}\""
    me "\"{i}Siempre estoy vigilando.{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2497
translate spanish end_game2_14ab4db5:

    # me "\"{i}I lurk outside your windows as you work. I sit in your closet, listening to you breathe as you sleep. I creep up upon your bed, willing you to die...{/i}\""
    me "\"{i}Acecho tras tus ventanas mientras trabajas. Me siento en tu armario, escuchando tu respiración mientras duermes. Me arrastro hasta tu cama, deseando que mueras...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2498
translate spanish end_game2_f1e91418:

    # "Her voice takes on an odd tone, becoming muffled, staticky, like it's coming through a phone's speaker."
    "Su voz adquiere un tono extraño; se vuelve amortiguada y llena de interferencias, como si llegara por el altavoz de un teléfono."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2499
translate spanish end_game2_4e3b60f1:

    # "Yet it grows louder."
    "Y aun así suena cada vez más fuerte."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2500
translate spanish end_game2_df8ec4bc_3:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2502
translate spanish end_game2_aa425faa:

    # "The back of my neck prickles, the hairs rising as Meera begins to disappear."
    "Siento un cosquilleo en la nuca; se me eriza el pelo cuando Meera empieza a desaparecer."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2504
translate spanish end_game2_935cca7d:

    # "The space around me pulses, then fades out slowly as well."
    "El espacio que me rodea palpita y luego también se desvanece lentamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2505
translate spanish end_game2_5f2f81f5:

    # unk "\"{i}Do you want to know what death is like?{/i}\""
    unk "\"{i}¿Quieres saber cómo es la muerte?{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2506
translate spanish end_game2_9bfd2c89:

    # "Meera's voice isn't her voice anymore...it's a cacophony of whispers and rustling, like a writhing pile of dead leaves."
    "La voz de Meera ya no es la suya...es una cacofonía de susurros y crujidos, como un montón de hojas muertas que se retuercen."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2507
translate spanish end_game2_9383a979:

    # unk "\"{i}I still taste the poison in my mouth, the agony in my body, the terror of dissolving into nothing.{/i}\""
    unk "\"{i}Todavía saboreo el veneno en la boca, la agonía en mi cuerpo, el terror de disolverme en la nada.{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2508
translate spanish end_game2_a93b46c2:

    # "The whispers move behind me, up my neck."
    "Los susurros se mueven detrás de mí, subiendo por mi cuello."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2509
translate spanish end_game2_9266847e:

    # unk "\"{i}A nothingness that was simultaneously something, forced to be tormented in the hell of non-existence, of never-ending black.{/i}\""
    unk "\"{i}Una nada que al mismo tiempo era algo, obligada a sufrir tormento en el infierno de la inexistencia, de una oscuridad sin fin.{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2510
translate spanish end_game2_a457ac89:

    # "Is it talking about the amalgamation?"
    "¿Está hablando de la amalgamación?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2511
translate spanish end_game2_4ee20909:

    # "The voice chuckles, whipping up a vortex of dried leaves."
    "La voz suelta una risita y levanta un remolino de hojas secas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2512
translate spanish end_game2_c79267c8:

    # unk "\"{i}The Amalgamation...even you know how unnatural its existence is. A swirl of countless souls being harvested by the parents, to be used...{/i}\""
    unk "\"{i}La Amalgamación...hasta tú sabes lo antinatural que es su existencia. Un torbellino de incontables almas que los Padres están recolectando para ser utilizadas...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2513
translate spanish end_game2_72aaa430:

    # "I start to try and pull away from this thing, this creature that is no longer Meera."
    "Empiezo a intentar alejarme de esa cosa, de esa criatura que ya no es Meera."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2514
translate spanish end_game2_f2109e1d:

    # unk "\"{i}You will experience it soon enough, the horror of it all.{/i}\""
    unk "\"{i}Lo experimentarás muy pronto, todo su horror.{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2515
translate spanish end_game2_0602b77c:

    # "Something begins to wrap around my neck, the pressure growing."
    "Algo empieza a enroscarse en mi cuello; la presión aumenta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2516
translate spanish end_game2_f8992974:

    # unk "\"{i}But don't worry. You won't be alone.{/i}\""
    unk "\"{i}Pero no te preocupes. No estarás solo.{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2517
translate spanish end_game2_de58c136:

    # unk "\"{i}You will suffer together...{/i}\""
    unk "\"{i}Sufriréis juntos...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2518
translate spanish end_game2_aad8e3b2:

    # unk "\"{i}...With your wolf...{/i}\""
    unk "\"{i}...Con tu lobo...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2519
translate spanish end_game2_cdb90bad:

    # unk "\"{i}Forever.{/i}\""
    unk "\"{i}Para siempre.{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2520
translate spanish end_game2_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2521
translate spanish end_game2_a20cefa7_3:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2522
translate spanish end_game2_a20cefa7_4:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2524
translate spanish end_game2_3d25e24b:

    # mon "\"Enough.\""
    mon "\"Basta.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2525
translate spanish end_game2_adc363d8:

    # "A strong, solid voice breaks through the smothering terror, and I cling to it immediately."
    "Una voz fuerte y firme se abre paso a través del terror asfixiante, y me aferro a ella de inmediato."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2526
translate spanish end_game2_a9a74605:

    # "As if being pulled from a deep pool of water, I emerge from the black, back into the dazzling glimmers of space."
    "Como si me sacaran de una profunda piscina, emerjo de la oscuridad y vuelvo a los deslumbrantes destellos del espacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2528
translate spanish end_game2_2720a3b0:

    # "I gasp for breath, even though I have no lungs to gasp into."
    "Jadeo en busca de aire, aunque no tengo pulmones en los que introducirlo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2529
translate spanish end_game2_658294b4:

    # "The monitor looms before me, exuding a stifled combination of frustration and concern."
    "La Observadora se alza ante mí, desprendiendo una contenida mezcla de frustración y preocupación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2530
translate spanish end_game2_aa6b536c:

    # mon "\"Are you alright, [mc]?\""
    mon "\"¿Estás bien, [mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2531
translate spanish end_game2_dde57a18:

    # "The fear I've had lingers, but I'm able to steady my nerves enough to talk."
    "El miedo que he sentido persiste, pero consigo calmar los nervios lo suficiente para hablar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2532
translate spanish end_game2_d2e8e108:

    # m "\"What the hell was that?\""
    m "\"¿Qué demonios ha sido eso?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2533
translate spanish end_game2_c0476d9f:

    # "The monitor stares at me for a while, thinking, contemplating something."
    "La Observadora me mira un rato, pensando, meditando sobre algo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2534
translate spanish end_game2_8862a855:

    # mon "\"The Other.\""
    mon "\"El Otro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2535
translate spanish end_game2_3c749590:

    # "I'd already suspected that, but to have it confirmed makes my heart sink."
    "Ya lo había sospechado, pero que me lo confirme hace que se me hunda el corazón."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2536
translate spanish end_game2_e6c9c70d:

    # m "\"I was told it wasn't here yet.\""
    m "\"Me dijeron que todavía no estaba aquí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2537
translate spanish end_game2_95715998:

    # mon "\"Where you are now is not where you used to be.\""
    mon "\"Donde estás ahora no es donde estabas antes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2538
translate spanish end_game2_733a7a75:

    # m "\"But...why was it Meera?\""
    m "\"Pero...¿por qué era Meera?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2539
translate spanish end_game2_2b4a3e96:

    # mon "\"It can take any forms its host can imagine...speak any words its host might imagine...\""
    mon "\"Puede adoptar cualquier forma que su huésped pueda imaginar...decir cualquier palabra que su huésped pueda imaginar...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2540
translate spanish end_game2_ac03bc5d:

    # "The dragon looks pointedly at me here."
    "En este punto el dragón me mira de manera significativa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2541
translate spanish end_game2_94b213b1:

    # m "\"Host?\""
    m "\"¿Huésped?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2542
translate spanish end_game2_fbd3648e:

    # "I sense something like a sigh from the reptile."
    "Percibo algo parecido a un suspiro por parte del reptil."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2543
translate spanish end_game2_b8f81c00:

    # mon "\"You were the host, it was simply using your doubts against you.\""
    mon "\"Tú eras el huésped; simplemente estaba usando tus dudas contra ti.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2544
translate spanish end_game2_e80293df:

    # "I think, trying to remember everything Meera...the Other, had said."
    "Reflexiono, intentando recordar todo lo que había dicho Meera...el Otro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2545
translate spanish end_game2_a5304c56:

    # "Something still doesn't feel right."
    "Todavía hay algo que no encaja."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2546
translate spanish end_game2_c17dde80:

    # "She definitely didn't feel like something I could just think up, and the things she was saying, like about the Amalgamation, I'd never thought those things before."
    "Desde luego no parecía algo que yo pudiera inventarme sin más, y las cosas que decía, como lo de la Amalgamación, nunca las había pensado antes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2547
translate spanish end_game2_326e658a:

    # mon "\"Many thoughts are subconscious.\""
    mon "\"Muchos pensamientos son subconscientes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2548
translate spanish end_game2_366de2d8:

    # "I wonder if Meera is still out there with the other."
    "Me pregunto si Meera sigue ahí fuera con el Otro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2549
translate spanish end_game2_cd05c0f7:

    # mon "\"The true Meera is in the Amalgamation, and though she may have come up short in her duties, she still rests happily with Drusus.\""
    mon "\"La verdadera Meera está en la Amalgamación, y aunque quizá no cumplió con todos sus deberes, sigue descansando feliz con Drusus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2550
translate spanish end_game2_37811be7:

    # "Yet I can't help but feel that must have been part of Meera, a mixture of doubts between me and her."
    "Aun así, no puedo evitar sentir que debía de haber una parte de Meera en aquello, una mezcla de dudas entre ella y yo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2551
translate spanish end_game2_98501db0:

    # "Can the other store bits of memory of people that it's come into contact with?"
    "¿Puede el Otro almacenar fragmentos de memoria de las personas con las que ha entrado en contacto?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2552
translate spanish end_game2_6da05f46:

    # mon "\"Do not worry yourself over things that do not currently matter. What matters now is your doubts.\""
    mon "\"No te preocupes por cosas que ahora no importan. Lo que importa ahora son tus dudas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2553
translate spanish end_game2_c57e4d0c:

    # "Despite what I've just been through, I feel a flare of irritation at the dragon's nonchalant attitude."
    "Pese a lo que acabo de vivir, siento un fogonazo de irritación ante la actitud despreocupada del dragón."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2554
translate spanish end_game2_355c4259:

    # "Even if that was the Other that brought it out of me, at least now my worries are out in the open."
    "Aunque fuera el Otro quien me lo sacó, al menos ahora mis preocupaciones están sobre la mesa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2555
translate spanish end_game2_4915e3bc:

    # m "\"Well, you heard my doubts. What do you have to say about them?\""
    m "\"Bueno, has oído mis dudas. ¿Qué tienes que decir sobre ellas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2556
translate spanish end_game2_de23b58a:

    # "The monitor bows his head slowly, closing his eyes."
    "La Observadora inclina lentamente la cabeza y cierra los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2557
translate spanish end_game2_30191d32:

    # mon "\"It is worrying.\""
    mon "\"Es preocupante.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2558
translate spanish end_game2_8325385b:

    # m "\"Is it? Well, now you know how I've felt the past year.\""
    m "\"¿Lo es? Bueno, ahora sabes cómo me he sentido durante el último año.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2559
translate spanish end_game2_9c6302d6:

    # "I'm defiant, even though I'm scared."
    "Me muestro desafiante, aunque tengo miedo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2560
translate spanish end_game2_6da7d68c:

    # "I might have just screwed up Amicus's destiny if they know what I think now."
    "Puede que acabe de arruinar el destino de Amicus si ahora saben lo que pienso."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2561
translate spanish end_game2_a73e1e75:

    # mon "\"We've always known. We had simply hoped that those feelings would fade with time.\""
    mon "\"Siempre lo hemos sabido. Solo esperábamos que esos sentimientos desaparecieran con el tiempo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2562
translate spanish end_game2_e852c5fd:

    # m "\"By just not saying anything on your end? I have no idea what's going on.\""
    m "\"¿Sin decir nada por vuestra parte? No tengo idea de lo que está pasando.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2563
translate spanish end_game2_1b6363b0:

    # mon "\"We mustn't interfere—\""
    mon "\"No debemos intervenir...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2564
translate spanish end_game2_a127e1cd:

    # m "\"I don't care. If you don't start telling me what I'm doing, and why, then I'm gonna follow Meera.\""
    m "\"Me da igual. Si no empezáis a decirme qué estoy haciendo y por qué, voy a seguir a Meera.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2565
translate spanish end_game2_dfcc7c61:

    # m "\"You care about choice? I'm making my choice now; either you tell me, or I walk out.\""
    m "\"¿Os importa la elección? Yo estoy eligiendo ahora: o me lo decís, o me voy.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2566
translate spanish end_game2_47a0e9bd:

    # "I'm bluffing, but only partly."
    "Estoy echando un farol, pero solo en parte."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2567
translate spanish end_game2_84739834:

    # "There's a small bit of me that is determined to follow through on that, and I think the Monitor senses it too."
    "Hay una pequeña parte de mí decidida a cumplirlo, y creo que la Observadora también lo percibe."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2568
translate spanish end_game2_dc6059dd:

    # "I'm just done."
    "Simplemente estoy harto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2569
translate spanish end_game2_52a08222:

    # "Again, that big, heaving sigh."
    "Otra vez ese gran suspiro profundo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2570
translate spanish end_game2_cdbb4cc1:

    # mon "\"Providing you with knowledge ahead of schedule makes our ability to see blurry.\""
    mon "\"Darte información antes de lo previsto enturbia nuestra capacidad de ver.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2571
translate spanish end_game2_8619f2c6_5:

    # "I shrug."
    "Me encojo de hombros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2572
translate spanish end_game2_585e2e0e:

    # m "\"Better than me just leaving, right? Now tell me about your future plans, the amalgamation, why your moral compass is so fucked up.\""
    m "\"Mejor que que me vaya sin más, ¿no? Ahora contadme vuestros planes futuros, lo de la amalgamación y por qué vuestra brújula moral está tan jodida.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2573
translate spanish end_game2_cf54a392:

    # "A typical pause."
    "Una pausa típica."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2574
translate spanish end_game2_0d1c29f8:

    # mon "\"I'm sorry, but we cannot reveal everything to you, at least not yet...but we can at least tell you the plan we have set forth for you.\""
    mon "\"Lo siento, pero no podemos revelártelo todo, al menos aún no...aunque por lo menos podemos contarte el plan que hemos trazado para ti.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2575
translate spanish end_game2_dbf6831f:

    # "I'm relieved, and a little surprised that I got the parents to do something that I want for a change."
    "Me siento aliviado y algo sorprendido de haber conseguido, para variar, que los Padres hagan algo que yo quiero."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2576
translate spanish end_game2_ae3f25e7:

    # mon "\"Do not get used to it. Trust me, they do not do this often.\""
    mon "\"No te acostumbres. Créeme, no hacen esto a menudo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2577
translate spanish end_game2_f19555b0:

    # "I shrug, trying not to feel too smug that I just figured out that I hold a good deal of power myself."
    "Me encojo de hombros, intentando no sentirme demasiado satisfecho de haber descubierto que yo mismo tengo bastante poder."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2578
translate spanish end_game2_25bb0f11:

    # "The parents struggle between wanting to appear benevolent while also wanting to force their subjects into specific roles leaves them at a bit of a disadvantage with me."
    "El conflicto de los Padres entre querer parecer benevolentes y querer obligar a sus súbditos a desempeñar papeles concretos los deja en cierta desventaja conmigo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2579
translate spanish end_game2_1895812e:

    # "The Monitor seems to choose not to comment on that thought process."
    "La Observadora parece decidir no comentar esa línea de pensamiento."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2580
translate spanish end_game2_795b756b:

    # "I focus back on him."
    "Vuelvo a centrarme en ella."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2581
translate spanish end_game2_27516b03:

    # m "\"So what is it that I'm doing and why?\""
    m "\"Entonces, ¿qué es lo que estoy haciendo y por qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2585
translate spanish end_game2_1a224131:

    # "I come to slowly on the floor, under the archives."
    "Recobro lentamente el sentido en el suelo, bajo los archivos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2587
translate spanish end_game2_475cc359:

    # "My vision is blurry."
    "Mi visión está borrosa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2588
translate spanish end_game2_821eaa91:

    # "For the first time, I feel somewhat confident."
    "Por primera vez me siento algo seguro de mí mismo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2589
translate spanish end_game2_fa0a25d7:

    # "Having the entire Earth plan laid out before me has made everything make so much more sense."
    "Tener ante mí todo el plan para la Tierra ha hecho que todo cobre mucho más sentido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2590
translate spanish end_game2_b316b8c5:

    # "Still, the experience I had with the Other, it's left me paranoid, and worried."
    "Aun así, lo que viví con el Otro me ha dejado paranoico y preocupado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2591
translate spanish end_game2_2dd7e9c5:

    # "I refuse to believe that everything that came out of its mouth was all from my own mind."
    "Me niego a creer que todo lo que salió de su boca procediera únicamente de mi propia mente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2592
translate spanish end_game2_7efe2cbc:

    # "There was something more, things that I can only imagine Meera had said herself."
    "Había algo más, cosas que solo puedo imaginar que la propia Meera había dicho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2593
translate spanish end_game2_a4126921:

    # "Maybe it wasn't to me at that moment, maybe it was simply words she had said in the past, brought to the present by the Other."
    "Quizá no me las dijo a mí en ese momento; quizá eran simplemente palabras que había pronunciado en el pasado, traídas al presente por el Otro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2594
translate spanish end_game2_28976f0b:

    # "Either way, I'm going along with the plan, but knowing what I'm doing and why has made me feel much more in control."
    "Sea como sea, voy a seguir el plan, pero saber qué estoy haciendo y por qué me ha dado una sensación de control mucho mayor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2595
translate spanish end_game2_5193296d:

    # "I can even reject certain tasks that they might give me in advance, force them to come up with another way."
    "Incluso puedo rechazar de antemano ciertas tareas que podrían darme y obligarlos a buscar otro camino."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2596
translate spanish end_game2_b3c0ac92:

    # "This new dynamic feels closer to true agency."
    "Esta nueva dinámica se acerca más a una verdadera autonomía."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2597
translate spanish end_game2_1154b4d0:

    # "I was able to tell that the monitor, and thus the parents, were unhappy about it."
    "He podido notar que a la Observadora, y por tanto a los Padres, no les ha gustado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2598
translate spanish end_game2_e128aa52:

    # "Still, I can't help but feel that this new-found sense of power on my end is going to make my life a lot easier, even if it makes theirs harder."
    "Aun así, no puedo evitar sentir que esta nueva sensación de poder por mi parte hará mi vida mucho más fácil, aunque complique la suya."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2599
translate spanish end_game2_edf49843:

    # "I get up slowly, a smile on my face, feeling good for once."
    "Me levanto despacio, con una sonrisa, sintiéndome bien por una vez."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2600
translate spanish end_game2_17031719:

    # "I make my way to the door, pressing the panel."
    "Voy a la puerta y presiono el panel."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2605
translate spanish end_game2_7ffbd8ab:

    # "I take a deep breath, feeling the cool, fragrant night air against my face."
    "Respiro hondo, sintiendo el aire fresco y perfumado de la noche contra mi cara."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2606
translate spanish end_game2_7c3b44ec:

    # "I stand there a moment, enjoying the feeling on level ground with the {i}Galaxias{/i}."
    "Me quedo de pie un momento, disfrutando de la sensación de estar en igualdad de condiciones con la {i}Galaxias{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2607
translate spanish end_game2_a0e85fe6:

    # "I'm so lost in this feeling of relief that I barely notice footsteps up the hall."
    "Estoy tan absorto en esta sensación de alivio que apenas noto unos pasos en el pasillo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2608
translate spanish end_game2_8aa4ee51:

    # "Then voices."
    "Luego, voces."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2609
translate spanish end_game2_c1aa0031:

    # "Laughing and talking."
    "Risas y conversación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2610
translate spanish end_game2_4f3ee4e2:

    # "I just stand in the doorway, suddenly recognizing those voices."
    "Me quedo en la puerta y de repente reconozco esas voces."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2611
translate spanish end_game2_6d277516:

    # al "\"Cassius, stop! We need to be quiet.\""
    al "\"¡Cassius, para! Tenemos que hacer silencio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2612
translate spanish end_game2_b1689d84:

    # "Alex's voice is a hushed whisper, though I can tell he's trying not to laugh."
    "La voz de Alex es un susurro quedo, aunque noto que intenta no reírse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2613
translate spanish end_game2_b0a16909:

    # c "\"Oh un-knot your tail, kitten. What will they do, arrest ME?\""
    c "\"Oh, deshaz ese nudo de tu cola, gatito. ¿Qué van a hacer, arrestarme a MÍ?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2614
translate spanish end_game2_b3a4dbb3:

    # "Something is odd about Cassius's voice."
    "Hay algo extraño en la voz de Cassius."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2615
translate spanish end_game2_e76c6aaf:

    # "It's slurred and tired-sounding."
    "Arrastra las palabras y suena cansado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2616
translate spanish end_game2_4589007b:

    # "I don't even attempt to hide as the two of them stumble into view, Alex clinging to Cassius's neck as the wolf tries to keep his balance."
    "Ni siquiera intento esconderme cuando ambos aparecen dando tumbos; Alex se aferra al cuello de Cassius mientras el lobo intenta mantener el equilibrio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2617
translate spanish end_game2_83788b8a:

    # "Alex giggles while Cassius playfully nips him around his face and neck."
    "Alex se ríe mientras Cassius le da mordisquitos juguetones en la cara y el cuello."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2618
translate spanish end_game2_27e08573:

    # al "\"Stop! You're going to make me laugh. Someone will hear—\""
    al "\"¡Para! Me vas a hacer reír. Alguien nos oirá...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2619
translate spanish end_game2_e2bc8b47:

    # "Alex spots me and pulls away from Cassius, standing stiffly to the side."
    "Alex me ve y se aparta de Cassius, quedándose rígido a un lado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2621
translate spanish end_game2_bdf1568f:

    # "Cassius, not having seen me yet, tries grabbing at him, but gets his paws slapped."
    "Cassius, que aún no me ha visto, intenta agarrarlo, pero recibe unos manotazos en las patas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2623
translate spanish end_game2_f1416168:

    # c "\"Ouch! Not so rough. My joints ache.\""
    c "\"¡Ay! No tan fuerte. Me duelen las articulaciones.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2624
translate spanish end_game2_fae98249:

    # "He stares at Alex even as the Cat tries to nod in my direction to tip the wolf off."
    "Mira fijamente a Alex, incluso mientras el gato intenta señalarme con la cabeza para avisar al lobo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2625
translate spanish end_game2_81be5240:

    # "It takes a minute, but eventually the white wolf gets it."
    "Tarda un minuto, pero al final el lobo blanco lo capta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2626
translate spanish end_game2_43bd7b5c:

    # c "\"What'sa?\""
    c "\"¿Quéseso?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2627
translate spanish end_game2_31bb6bdf:

    # "He looks at me, takes a moment to process it, then stiffens up as well."
    "Me mira, tarda un momento en asimilarlo y también se queda rígido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2629
translate spanish end_game2_0047c983:

    # c "\"Oh...ape creature.\""
    c "\"Oh...criatura simiesca.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2630
translate spanish end_game2_1e2f23a0:

    # "I frown, wondering if he's forgotten my name already."
    "Frunzo el ceño, preguntándome si ya se ha olvidado de mi nombre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2631
translate spanish end_game2_2caed963:

    # "But my focus is mainly on Alex."
    "Pero mi atención está sobre todo en Alex."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2632
translate spanish end_game2_64934fe8:

    # m "\"Hey, Alex.\""
    m "\"Hola, Alex.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2634
translate spanish end_game2_f37bff4e:

    # "I'm still feeling a little high and mighty after the trip I'd just had."
    "Todavía me siento un poco superior y poderoso tras el viaje que acabo de vivir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2636
translate spanish end_game2_21edd8d1:

    # al "\"Uh...hello.\""
    al "\"Eh...hola.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2637
translate spanish end_game2_8dd51e45:

    # m "\"This is good. I actually wanted to talk to you before I leave.\""
    m "\"Esto viene bien. De hecho, quería hablar contigo antes de irme.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2639
translate spanish end_game2_82156506:

    # al "\"Oh? what about?\""
    al "\"¿Ah? ¿Sobre qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2641
translate spanish end_game2_6d4aa104:

    # m "\"Well, first of all, what are you doing here?\""
    m "\"Bueno, para empezar, ¿qué haces aquí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2642
translate spanish end_game2_2d9201e8:

    # "Cassius steps forward unsteadily, pointing at me, I think."
    "Cassius avanza con paso inseguro, señalándome, creo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2643
translate spanish end_game2_017fbcc9:

    # "His finger kind of drifts off to the side."
    "Su dedo se desvía un poco hacia un lado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2645
translate spanish end_game2_cad6cee0:

    # c "\"What right do you have to question him, human?\""
    c "\"¿Qué derecho tienes a interrogarlo, humano?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2646
translate spanish end_game2_735ef9c5:

    # "Alex quickly grabs one of Cassius's arms and tries to pull him back."
    "Alex agarra enseguida uno de los brazos de Cassius e intenta hacerlo retroceder."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2648
translate spanish end_game2_fb04208d:

    # al "\"Cassius, please!\""
    al "\"¡Cassius, por favor!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2650
translate spanish end_game2_7b3b5b40:

    # c "\"You're acting very uppity for someone who is still considered a pet, even if you did win my brother's favor.\""
    c "\"Te comportas con mucha insolencia para alguien al que aún se considera una mascota, aunque te hayas ganado el favor de mi hermano.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2651
translate spanish end_game2_bb2d25bb:

    # "I lean against the doorway casually, smiling."
    "Me apoyo despreocupadamente en el marco de la puerta, sonriendo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2652
translate spanish end_game2_abe499cd:

    # m "\"Oh, I won more than that, but if you really want I can call Amicus. He should have the proper authority.\""
    m "\"Oh, me he ganado más que eso, pero si de verdad quieres puedo llamar a Amicus. Él sí debería tener la autoridad necesaria.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2655
translate spanish end_game2_301701b6:

    # al "\"No!\""
    al "\"¡No!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2656
translate spanish end_game2_0e8bebde:

    # "Alex freezes and every inch of his fur bristles out."
    "Alex se queda inmóvil y se le eriza hasta el último pelo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2657
translate spanish end_game2_246aa1c0:

    # "I wait, not saying anything, but Alex also says nothing, just clinging to Cassius's arm as he stares at me, as if just moving will lead to me making good on my threat."
    "Espero sin decir nada, pero Alex tampoco habla; solo se aferra al brazo de Cassius mientras me mira, como si el simple hecho de moverse fuera a hacer que cumpliera mi amenaza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2658
translate spanish end_game2_762d0270:

    # m "\"Well, then maybe we can start with what it is you're doing here. Last I heard, you were banished from the palace.\""
    m "\"Bueno, entonces quizá podamos empezar por qué estáis haciendo aquí. Lo último que supe es que te habían desterrado del palacio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2659
translate spanish end_game2_cfd9304c:

    # "Cassius steps forward again, stumbling a bit as he drags Alex along."
    "Cassius vuelve a avanzar, tropezando un poco mientras arrastra a Alex consigo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2661
translate spanish end_game2_e9bb0595:

    # c "\"Enough intimidating my cat. We are here to claim my father's ship, which we will then pilot to Omorfa!\""
    c "\"Deja de intimidar a mi gato. ¡Estamos aquí para reclamar la nave de mi padre, que luego pilotaremos hasta Omorfa!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2663
translate spanish end_game2_f2dc1faa:

    # "Alex stares open-mouthed at Cassius, clearly shocked at how quickly his plans had just been revealed."
    "Alex mira a Cassius con la boca abierta, claramente horrorizado por lo rápido que acaban de quedar al descubierto sus planes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2665
translate spanish end_game2_c05692ab:

    # al "\"Cassius!\""
    al "\"¡Cassius!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2667
translate spanish end_game2_45202662:

    # c "\"What!? Am I saying something wrong? Well, consider it your fault as you wouldn't stop pressing the wine bottle to my mouth.\""
    c "\"¿¡Qué!? ¿He dicho algo malo? Bueno, considéralo culpa tuya, porque no dejabas de ponerme la botella de vino en la boca.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2668
translate spanish end_game2_8de5002a:

    # "Alexios can only stare back at the wolf, mouth agape before he snaps it closed and turns to me."
    "Alexios solo puede quedarse mirando al lobo con la boca abierta, antes de cerrarla de golpe y volverse hacia mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2670
translate spanish end_game2_82907867:

    # al "\"My master is simply drunk, if that was not already obvious.\""
    al "\"Mi amo simplemente está borracho, por si aún no era evidente.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2672
translate spanish end_game2_4bdcdd17:

    # c "\"I am perfectly coherent despite my slightly inebriated state!\""
    c "\"¡Soy perfectamente coherente a pesar de mi ligera embriaguez!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2674
translate spanish end_game2_8cae891e:

    # al "\"Coherency isn't the issue, Cass!\""
    al "\"¡La coherencia no es el problema, Cass!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2675
translate spanish end_game2_b24f0aeb:

    # "Alex hisses angrily at the wolf before turning back to me, smoothing his fur down."
    "Alex le sisea enfadado al lobo antes de volverse hacia mí, alisándose el pelo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2677
translate spanish end_game2_40b914ad:

    # al "\"My master brought me here simply because he wanted to. As his pet, I have no choice but to obey.\""
    al "\"Mi amo me ha traído aquí simplemente porque quería. Como mascota suya, no tengo más opción que obedecer.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2678
translate spanish end_game2_0fbaec2a:

    # "I see Alexios's paw grip more tightly onto Cassius's arm, warning him."
    "Veo que la pata de Alexios aprieta con más fuerza el brazo de Cassius, advirtiéndole."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2680
translate spanish end_game2_1a9bba22:

    # c "\"Ouch! What did I say about me being sore?\""
    c "\"¡Ay! ¿Qué te he dicho de mis dolores?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2681
translate spanish end_game2_86274321:

    # "I sigh as finally recognize that look in Alex's eyes."
    "Suspiro al reconocer por fin esa mirada en los ojos de Alex."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2682
translate spanish end_game2_0e18c4db:

    # m "\"So, you were planning to steal the emperor's ship, which is Amicus's ship now, by the way, just before I was due to leave?\""
    m "\"Así que pensabais robar la nave del emperador, que ahora es la nave de Amicus, por cierto, justo antes de que me tocara irme.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2683
translate spanish end_game2_f2b302eb:

    # al "\"Oh, you're leaving?\""
    al "\"Oh, ¿te vas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2684
translate spanish end_game2_7fbd7712:

    # "Alex isn't even trying at this point."
    "A estas alturas Alex ni siquiera se esfuerza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2685
translate spanish end_game2_28417a74:

    # m "\"Man, you're a real piece of shit, you know that?\""
    m "\"Tío, eres un verdadero pedazo de mierda, ¿lo sabes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2687
translate spanish end_game2_c16df18d:

    # al "\"And you're a reckless ape with no consideration for the rest of the galaxy!\""
    al "\"¡Y tú eres un simio imprudente al que no le importa el resto de la galaxia!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2688
translate spanish end_game2_f5f00b35:

    # "I blink in surprise, though I'm a little satisfied to see that I've gotten through his shield of indifference."
    "Parpadeo sorprendido, aunque me satisface un poco comprobar que he atravesado su escudo de indiferencia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2689
translate spanish end_game2_36a38e5e:

    # "Cassius, who had opened his mouth to butt in again, suddenly pauses, raising an eyebrow at the two of us."
    "Cassius, que había abierto la boca para volver a intervenir, se detiene de repente y nos mira a ambos con una ceja levantada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2691
translate spanish end_game2_0f0c1690:

    # c "\"Wait a moment, do you two have some sort of history? You speak in a familiar way to each other.\""
    c "\"Un momento, ¿vosotros dos tenéis algún tipo de historia? Os habláis con familiaridad.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2693
translate spanish end_game2_d57b1bcc:

    # al "\"No Cassius. Only in passing.\""
    al "\"No, Cassius. Solo de pasada.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2694
translate spanish end_game2_4fe51ee1:

    # "I remember then that Alex had tried to keep our interactions hidden from Cassius...though not the information I'd unwittingly given the cat during our many conversations."
    "Recuerdo entonces que Alex había intentado ocultarle a Cassius nuestras interacciones...aunque no la información que le había dado al gato sin querer durante nuestras muchas conversaciones."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2695
translate spanish end_game2_3302a957:

    # "I ignore the wolf for the moment, unwilling to let this traitorous feline get the last word in."
    "Por el momento ignoro al lobo, decidido a no dejar que este felino traidor tenga la última palabra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2696
translate spanish end_game2_1d702e94:

    # m "\"And you have no consideration for the lives of anyone on this moon.\""
    m "\"Y a ti no te importan las vidas de nadie en esta luna.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2697
translate spanish end_game2_b11021ed:

    # "I turn to Cassius."
    "Me vuelvo hacia Cassius."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2698
translate spanish end_game2_e3f9ea7f:

    # m "\"And how do you explain still wanting to get with this cat when he's responsible for most of the terrible things that happened to us last year, to your family?\""
    m "\"¿Y cómo explicas que aún quieras estar con este gato, cuando es responsable de la mayoría de las cosas terribles que nos pasaron el año pasado, a tu familia?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2699
translate spanish end_game2_823d2aba:

    # al "\"Don't talk to him, Cassius. Let's just leave.\""
    al "\"No hables con él, Cassius. Vámonos y ya está.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2700
translate spanish end_game2_7e57691b:

    # m "\"No, you're not leaving, otherwise I am calling for Amicus.\""
    m "\"No, no os vais; si no, llamaré a Amicus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2701
translate spanish end_game2_a43948dd:

    # "I look at Alex who purses his lips tightly before turning my attention back to Cassius."
    "Miro a Alex, que aprieta mucho los labios, antes de volver a centrarme en Cassius."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2703
translate spanish end_game2_36d8f02b:

    # c "\"That is none of your concern, but if you {i}must{/i} know, then—\""
    c "\"Eso no es asunto tuyo, pero si {i}tienes{/i} que saberlo, entonces...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2705
translate spanish end_game2_809b7787:

    # al "\"Cassius.\""
    al "\"Cassius.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2707
translate spanish end_game2_dbfa243f:

    # c "\"—consider how you would feel, left in a position in which the intents of your entire society rested upon your shoulders.\""
    c "\"...piensa cómo te sentirías si te dejaran en una situación en la que las intenciones de toda tu sociedad descansaran sobre tus hombros.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2709
translate spanish end_game2_0c138f3b:

    # c "\"He had little choice, while also underestimating Cato's brutality.\""
    c "\"Apenas podía elegir, y además subestimó la brutalidad de Cato.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2710
translate spanish end_game2_eb5b4b13:

    # "Cassius's words are less slurred now, the topic of conversation seeming to have sobered him up a bit."
    "Cassius ya no arrastra tanto las palabras; el tema de conversación parece haberle despejado un poco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2711
translate spanish end_game2_e49dea8c:

    # m "\"He did have the choice to accept his 'assignment', as he put it, and I think he's smart enough to know his actions would destroy countless lives.\""
    m "\"Sí pudo elegir si aceptaba su 'misión', como la llamó, y creo que es lo bastante listo para saber que sus actos destruirían incontables vidas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2712
translate spanish end_game2_857ea0b7:

    # c "\"You misunderstand. His choice was an illusion so as to assure the cats, especially the ones giving the command, that they are still grounded by their values.\""
    c "\"No lo entiendes. Su elección era una ilusión para asegurarles a los gatos, especialmente a quienes daban las órdenes, que todavía se regían por sus valores.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2714
translate spanish end_game2_6c3e7480:

    # unk "\"{i}Illusion of choice...to steady unstable values.{/i}\""
    unk "\"{i}Ilusión de elección...para estabilizar valores inestables.{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2716
translate spanish end_game2_afcd0da0:

    # c "\"I fully understand this, and so did Amicus when I explained the situation. We have both been left in such positions before—\""
    c "\"Lo entiendo perfectamente, y Amicus también lo entendió cuando le expliqué la situación. Ambos hemos estado antes en situaciones así...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2717
translate spanish end_game2_6a20a80d:

    # "I shake my head."
    "Niego con la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2718
translate spanish end_game2_c2fca13a:

    # m "\"How can you not blame him for the destruction and death of your people?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo puedes no culparlo por la destrucción y la muerte de tu pueblo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2719
translate spanish end_game2_c5345284:

    # c "\"[mc], he is only the stylus. I blame the hand of his government that wielded him like a disposable tool.\""
    c "\"[mc], él no es más que el estilete. Culpo a la mano de su gobierno, que lo manejó como una herramienta desechable.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2720
translate spanish end_game2_b4b9141b:

    # "Alex is tugging on the wolf's arm again, pulling him toward the main exit."
    "Alex vuelve a tirar del brazo del lobo, llevándolo hacia la salida principal."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2722
translate spanish end_game2_831c4f04:

    # al "\"Cassius, let's just leave. There's more wine in our apartment...\""
    al "\"Cassius, vámonos y ya está. Hay más vino en nuestro apartamento...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2723
translate spanish end_game2_9bb4ede0:

    # "I sigh, realizing that I probably won't ever have my questions about Alex answered, that he'll probably never get what he deserves."
    "Suspiro al darme cuenta de que probablemente nunca obtendré respuesta a mis preguntas sobre Alex, de que probablemente nunca recibirá lo que se merece."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2724
translate spanish end_game2_b9e78129:

    # "It still bothers me that he got off so easily, that Cassius shields him from any sort of comeuppance."
    "Todavía me molesta que haya salido tan bien parado, que Cassius lo proteja de cualquier castigo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2725
translate spanish end_game2_e580ee1d:

    # m "\"Why do you trust him, Cassius? He's a traitor, but here you are, leaving your empire vulnerable by letting him get close to you, the brother of the emperor.\""
    m "\"¿Por qué confías en él, Cassius? Es un traidor, pero aquí estás, dejando vulnerable a tu imperio al permitir que se acerque a ti, el hermano del emperador.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2726
translate spanish end_game2_5e8dbbdf:

    # "Cassius pouts, putting an arm around Alexios."
    "Cassius hace un puchero y rodea a Alexios con un brazo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2728
translate spanish end_game2_bee4b81b:

    # c "\"Because we understand each other, [mc], as you and Amicus somehow understand each other. I've grown tired of the games of politics. I simply want peace with an understanding partner.\""
    c "\"Porque nos entendemos, [mc], igual que Amicus y tú os entendéis de algún modo. Me he cansado de los juegos políticos. Solo quiero paz con una pareja que me comprenda.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2729
translate spanish end_game2_1175a5b3:

    # m "\"By running away to Omorfa? Last I heard, they despise your kind.\""
    m "\"¿Huyendo a Omorfa? Lo último que supe es que desprecian a los de tu especie.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2731
translate spanish end_game2_dc084697:

    # c "\"Actually, we're similar in many ways, one being our shared culture—\""
    c "\"En realidad, nos parecemos en muchos aspectos; uno es nuestra cultura compartida...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2732
translate spanish end_game2_05e3ba31:

    # "I try not to roll my eyes at the word \"shared\"."
    "Intento no poner los ojos en blanco al oír la palabra \"compartida\"."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2733
translate spanish end_game2_91daad22:

    # c "\"And the other being the fact that the cats now oppose the parents. I believe this can result in plenty of common grou—\""
    c "\"Y el otro es que ahora los gatos se oponen a los Padres. Creo que eso puede dar lugar a muchos puntos en comú...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2735
translate spanish end_game2_fa03ab8f:

    # al "\"Come on!\""
    al "\"¡Vamos!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2739
translate spanish end_game2_ee352006:

    # "Alex yanks the wolf, making Cassius yelp before stumbling after the cat."
    "Alex da un tirón al lobo, haciendo que Cassius suelte un gemido antes de seguir al gato a trompicones."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2740
translate spanish end_game2_de725071:

    # c "\"Ooooh! Son of a whore, Alex! You're lucky I'm drunk, otherwise you could have seriously injured me!\""
    c "\"¡Ooooh! ¡Hijo de puta, Alex! ¡Tienes suerte de que esté borracho, porque si no podrías haberme hecho mucho daño!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2742
translate spanish end_game2_8ff64e3f:

    # "I watch the two of them disappear through the exit, part of me wanting to call security and have the cat arrested for trying to hijack Amicus's ship."
    "Los veo desaparecer por la salida; una parte de mí quiere llamar a seguridad y hacer que arresten al gato por intentar secuestrar la nave de Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2743
translate spanish end_game2_8ee50e36:

    # "At the same time though, I wonder if it'll do us any good, considering what the cat has already gotten away with."
    "Pero al mismo tiempo me pregunto si eso nos serviría de algo, teniendo en cuenta todo lo que el gato ya ha hecho sin consecuencias."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2744
translate spanish end_game2_74629da2:

    # "Still, I feel like Cassius seemingly wanting to abandon the empire, while drunk or not, is something Amicus should know about."
    "Aun así, siento que Amicus debería saber que Cassius parece querer abandonar el imperio, esté borracho o no."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2745
translate spanish end_game2_84354930:

    # "I decide that I will tell Amicus, but when we're both on our way back to Earth and he has time to think over what he wants to do about this."
    "Decido que se lo contaré a Amicus, pero cuando ambos estemos de camino a la Tierra y él tenga tiempo de pensar qué quiere hacer al respecto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2746
translate spanish end_game2_fd109146:

    # "As for Alex as a whole, I suppose his motivation, and Cassius's willingness to defend him makes a little more sense."
    "En cuanto a Alex en general, supongo que sus motivos y la disposición de Cassius a defenderlo tienen un poco más de sentido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2747
translate spanish end_game2_ef4ddbbc:

    # "We don't always have a choice, especially when those in power seek to manipulate us."
    "No siempre podemos elegir, especialmente cuando quienes tienen el poder intentan manipularnos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2748
translate spanish end_game2_3434c20f:

    # "If we really want to break free, we have to make our own choices."
    "Si de verdad queremos liberarnos, tenemos que tomar nuestras propias decisiones."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2751
translate spanish end_game2_f5bea750:

    # "I head back to our bedroom, suddenly extremely tired as the euphoria of the night begins to wear off."
    "Vuelvo a nuestro dormitorio, de repente agotado, mientras la euforia de la noche empieza a disiparse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2752
translate spanish end_game2_d81255aa:

    # "I feel like days have passed."
    "Siento como si hubieran pasado días."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2753
translate spanish end_game2_d0e94b0d:

    # "So when I find Amicus in the same position on the couch, I practically fall back into his arms."
    "Así que, cuando encuentro a Amicus en la misma postura en el sofá, prácticamente me dejo caer otra vez en sus brazos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2754
translate spanish end_game2_b06f7e52:

    # "He shifts when I do, then hugs me tight before falling back to sleep."
    "Se mueve cuando lo hago, me abraza con fuerza y vuelve a dormirse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2755
translate spanish end_game2_46596633:

    # "I wiggle myself deeper into his embrace before doing the same, falling asleep almost instantly."
    "Me acomodo más profundamente en su abrazo antes de hacer lo mismo, quedándome dormido casi al instante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2758
translate spanish end_game2_f14076ef:

    # "It only seems like a second passes before I feel myself being moved around."
    "Parece que solo pasa un segundo antes de sentir que me están moviendo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2759
translate spanish end_game2_2fbe5909:

    # "Then I feel Amicus's paw on my head, gently nudging me out of sleep."
    "Entonces siento la pata de Amicus en mi cabeza, despertándome con suavidad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2761
translate spanish end_game2_390cf09d:

    # a "\"Hey there, love.\""
    a "\"Hola, amor.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2763
translate spanish end_game2_c72f7028:

    # a "\"It's time to get ready.\""
    a "\"Es hora de prepararnos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2767
translate spanish end_game2_c8a6f0ea:

    # "I stand off to the side, watching Amicus load up the ship while checking various gadgets."
    "Me quedo a un lado, viendo cómo Amicus carga la nave mientras comprueba varios aparatos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2768
translate spanish end_game2_6fee16f4:

    # "Virginia and Neferu make small talk, the kind that makes it feel as if I'm not going away for eight years, that everything is still normal."
    "Virginia y Neferu charlan de cosas triviales, de esas que hacen que parezca que no voy a irme durante ocho años, que todo sigue siendo normal."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2769
translate spanish end_game2_5805f8ed:

    # "Then I have to remind myself that this technically isn't normal, even though it feels that way now."
    "Entonces tengo que recordarme que, técnicamente, esto no es normal, aunque ahora lo parezca."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2770
translate spanish end_game2_38f8162c:

    # "Finally, Amicus walks up to us, brushing his paws together."
    "Por fin Amicus se acerca a nosotros, frotándose las patas entre sí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2772
translate spanish end_game2_7152ab65:

    # a "\"Well! It's about time we're off. I should be back in no more than two day's time, Virginia.\""
    a "\"¡Bueno! Ya es casi hora de irnos. Debería estar de vuelta en un máximo de dos días, Virginia.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2774
translate spanish end_game2_c197ba6c:

    # v "\"I certainly hope that to be the case, considering how much work will pile up. I'll try and keep the empire from rebelling while you're gone, though.\""
    v "\"Eso espero, desde luego, teniendo en cuenta todo el trabajo que se acumulará. Aunque intentaré que el imperio no se rebele mientras estés fuera.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2776
translate spanish end_game2_f8a72902:

    # a "\"Thank you, Virginia.\""
    a "\"Gracias, Virginia.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2777
translate spanish end_game2_4aa0c234:

    # v "\"And I look forward to our next reunion, [mc]. I hope your experiences contribute to a more disciplined character.\""
    v "\"Y espero con ganas nuestro próximo reencuentro, [mc]. Espero que tus experiencias contribuyan a un carácter más disciplinado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2778
translate spanish end_game2_fd56c2b7:

    # m "\"Uh, thanks?\""
    m "\"Eh, ¿gracias?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2780
translate spanish end_game2_9544e7c7:

    # v "\"Of course.\""
    v "\"Por supuesto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2781
translate spanish end_game2_e3e30d2f:

    # "Virginia sticks out a paw, and I blink at it until realizing what she's doing."
    "Virginia extiende una pata y yo la miro parpadeando hasta comprender qué está haciendo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2782
translate spanish end_game2_a5c93da8:

    # "The way I first greeted her."
    "La forma en que la saludé por primera vez."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2783
translate spanish end_game2_a9d3328c:

    # "I bend to kiss it."
    "Me inclino para besársela."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2785
translate spanish end_game2_0dc06ff1:

    # v "\"Goodbye, [mc].\""
    v "\"Adiós, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2786
translate spanish end_game2_edec1b86:

    # "I step back awkwardly."
    "Retrocedo con torpeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2787
translate spanish end_game2_323db076_1:

    # m "\"Bye...\""
    m "\"Adiós...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2791
translate spanish end_game2_3ce5c735:

    # "Then Neferu's paw sticks out, and I hear Amicus sigh loudly next to me."
    "Entonces Neferu extiende su pata, y oigo a Amicus suspirar sonoramente a mi lado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2792
translate spanish end_game2_08c73cb1:

    # "I don't humor the jackal though, instead just forcing it into an awkward handshake."
    "Pero no le sigo el juego al chacal; en cambio, lo fuerzo a darme un incómodo apretón de manos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2794
translate spanish end_game2_433c39c6:

    # n "\"That's a new one.\""
    n "\"Eso es nuevo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2795
translate spanish end_game2_ddf3b6f3:

    # m "\"Another human greeting. I'll have to show you more when I see you next time.\""
    m "\"Otro saludo humano. Tendré que enseñarte más cuando vuelva a verte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2797
translate spanish end_game2_24815168:

    # n "\"Whenever that might be.\""
    n "\"Sea cuando sea.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2798
translate spanish end_game2_91663c88:

    # m "\"It'll happen. I promise.\""
    m "\"Ocurrirá. Te lo prometo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2800
translate spanish end_game2_86eccd72:

    # "Neferu raises an eyebrow at my assuredness, but nods."
    "Neferu levanta una ceja ante mi seguridad, pero asiente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2801
translate spanish end_game2_ab74179e:

    # n "\"Well, here's a Khemian goodbye, one between those who are close.\""
    n "\"Bueno, aquí tienes una despedida khemiana, entre personas cercanas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2802
translate spanish end_game2_6c9c6913:

    # "He then leans down, pulling me forward."
    "Entonces se inclina y tira de mí hacia él."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2807
translate spanish end_game2_d60bdd5c:

    # "My chin rests on his shoulder, his paw coming up to rest on my head, his cheek pressed to mine."
    "Mi barbilla descansa en su hombro; su pata sube hasta posarse en mi cabeza y su mejilla se aprieta contra la mía."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2808
translate spanish end_game2_0dffef14:

    # n "\"May Ahhotep be with you on every step of your journey, brother, and may he help you to find all that you seek.\""
    n "\"Que Ahhotep te acompañe en cada paso de tu viaje, hermano, y que te ayude a encontrar todo lo que buscas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2809
translate spanish end_game2_39052c8e:

    # "I expect to hear Amicus make more noises of disapproval, but it's quiet."
    "Espero oír más ruidos de desaprobación por parte de Amicus, pero todo está en silencio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2810
translate spanish end_game2_e4359bd9:

    # "I stand there for a few moments, then awkwardly put my hand on the jackal's head, hoping I'm returning the gesture appropriately."
    "Me quedo así unos momentos y luego pongo torpemente la mano en la cabeza del chacal, esperando corresponder al gesto de la forma adecuada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2811
translate spanish end_game2_ee53dd3d:

    # "I stand still until Neferu lets go and pulls back."
    "Permanezco quieto hasta que Neferu me suelta y se aparta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2816
translate spanish end_game2_2f9add81:

    # m "\"Never heard you call me brother, before.\""
    m "\"Nunca antes te había oído llamarme hermano.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2817
translate spanish end_game2_9a6029c1:

    # n "\"It's a farewell normally reserved for siblings. I haven't performed it since I last saw my sister on Khemia, in fact.\""
    n "\"Es una despedida que suele reservarse para los hermanos. De hecho, no la había hecho desde la última vez que vi a mi hermana en Khemia.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2818
translate spanish end_game2_26e7d518:

    # m "\"You see me as a brother?\""
    m "\"¿Me ves como un hermano?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2820
translate spanish end_game2_b5ba710a:

    # n "\"Close enough.\""
    n "\"Casi.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2822
translate spanish end_game2_faacf704:

    # n "\"Until we meet again, friend.\""
    n "\"Hasta que volvamos a vernos, amigo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2823
translate spanish end_game2_4dfd4a52:

    # m "\"Thanks, and yeah, until then, Neferu.\""
    m "\"Gracias, y sí, hasta entonces, Neferu.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2825
translate spanish end_game2_1167687f:

    # "Amicus coughs awkwardly, stepping forward and putting his paw around my shoulder."
    "Amicus tose incómodo, se acerca y me rodea el hombro con la pata."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2827
translate spanish end_game2_cd473855:

    # a "\"Alright, see you all when I return.\""
    a "\"Bueno, os veré a todos cuando vuelva.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2828
translate spanish end_game2_e6b73661:

    # "Virginia smiles and Neferu nods as we turn away from them, Amicus leading the way to the ship that's parked on the palace lawn."
    "Virginia sonríe y Neferu asiente mientras nos apartamos de ellos; Amicus va delante hacia la nave aparcada en el césped del palacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2833
translate spanish end_game2_45185812:

    # "He jumps in first, then reaches down to help pull me up."
    "Salta primero al interior y luego me tiende una pata para ayudarme a subir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2834
translate spanish end_game2_2e40683f:

    # "As soon as I'm inside, the door closes before I can look back."
    "En cuanto estoy dentro, la puerta se cierra antes de que pueda mirar atrás."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2838
translate spanish end_game2_7086faa6:

    # "I'm struck by the fact that I haven't been inside the ship since I first got here, yet it's all so familiar."
    "Me sorprende darme cuenta de que no había vuelto a entrar en la nave desde que llegué, y aun así todo me resulta muy familiar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2840
translate spanish end_game2_50f5c4d6:

    # a "\"Alright! Let me make sure we have everything...\""
    a "\"¡Bueno! Déjame comprobar que lo tenemos todo...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2842
translate spanish end_game2_89143bae:

    # "Amicus walks around the back of the ship, looking at various compartments, looking into the utility closet that I'd once been stuffed into."
    "Amicus recorre la parte trasera de la nave, revisando varios compartimentos y mirando dentro del armario de servicio en el que una vez me metieron a la fuerza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2843
translate spanish end_game2_97e3d351:

    # "He opens the doors to his quarters, doing more checks."
    "Abre las puertas de su camarote y sigue comprobando cosas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2844
translate spanish end_game2_c3b679f2:

    # "I move to the seat that I'd sat in a year ago and look out the window."
    "Voy al asiento en el que me senté hace un año y miro por la ventana."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2845
translate spanish end_game2_38570b17:

    # "Virginia and Neferu stand by the entrance of the palace, still watching."
    "Virginia y Neferu están junto a la entrada del palacio, todavía mirando."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2846
translate spanish end_game2_2a45ab5d:

    # "I wave, and Neferu raises a paw in acknowledgment."
    "Saludo con la mano y Neferu levanta una pata para responder."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2847
translate spanish end_game2_a600e4b6:

    # a "\"Everything appears to be in order. Com, initiate liftoff.\""
    a "\"Todo parece estar en orden. Com, inicia el despegue.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2848
translate spanish end_game2_95637af8:

    # com "\"Liftoff sequence engaged.\""
    com "\"Secuencia de despegue activada.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2850
translate spanish end_game2_78c011d4:

    # "The ship rumbles, though there isn't any sound as we begin to lift off the ground."
    "La nave vibra, aunque no se oye ningún sonido mientras empezamos a separarnos del suelo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2851
translate spanish end_game2_0ff2a25e:

    # "Amicus sits heavily in his seat with a thump, buckling his seatbelt while I do the same."
    "Amicus se deja caer pesadamente en su asiento y se abrocha el cinturón de seguridad, mientras yo hago lo mismo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2852
translate spanish end_game2_6acb0d0a:

    # "I watch out the window as Neferu, Virginia, and the palace grow smaller and smaller, along with the entire city of Adastra."
    "Miro por la ventana mientras Neferu, Virginia y el palacio se hacen cada vez más pequeños, junto con toda la ciudad de Adastra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2853
translate spanish end_game2_12c335ff:

    # "It's not unlike taking off from the airport on my way to Rome, though this is much faster."
    "No es muy distinto de despegar del aeropuerto rumbo a Roma, aunque esto es mucho más rápido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2855
translate spanish end_game2_c862bbb1:

    # "Before I know it, the glittering city fades into a small, sparkling spot of lights on the globe of the moon."
    "Antes de darme cuenta, la ciudad brillante se convierte en una pequeña mancha de luces centelleantes sobre el globo de la luna."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2856
translate spanish end_game2_4125e5ab:

    # "I stare out at Adastra, at the little patches of glittering lights indicating the cities, and at the long stretches of dark blue that indicate the oceans."
    "Contemplo Adastra, las pequeñas manchas de luces que indican las ciudades y las largas extensiones de azul oscuro que señalan los océanos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2857
translate spanish end_game2_1c76c4a1:

    # "That's when I notice Amicus watching me closely."
    "Entonces noto que Amicus me observa atentamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2858
translate spanish end_game2_df8ec4bc_4:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2859
translate spanish end_game2_a5560a27:

    # "The big wolf shrugs."
    "El gran lobo se encoge de hombros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2861
translate spanish end_game2_76d44613:

    # a "\"Oh, just curious as to how you might feel at this moment. I must say, you seem less stressed than you had been last night.\""
    a "\"Oh, solo me preguntaba cómo te sentirás en este momento. Debo decir que pareces menos estresado que anoche.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2862
translate spanish end_game2_adf331fa:

    # "I go back to looking out the window, getting a last look at Adastra, along with the smaller {i}Torque{/i} and the much larger {i}Ancoris{/i}."
    "Vuelvo a mirar por la ventana para echar un último vistazo a Adastra, junto a {i}Torque{/i}, más pequeño, y {i}Ancoris{/i}, mucho mayor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2864
translate spanish end_game2_0532d63c:

    # m "\"I guess things just became...clearer, kind of like you said they would.\""
    m "\"Supongo que las cosas simplemente se han vuelto...más claras, más o menos como dijiste que ocurriría.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2866
translate spanish end_game2_317af7b3:

    # "Amicus grins, though I'm pretty sure he doesn't know what I'm talking about."
    "Amicus sonríe ampliamente, aunque estoy bastante seguro de que no sabe de qué estoy hablando."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2867
translate spanish end_game2_e84713bc:

    # com "\"Sufficient distance achieved. Prepare to enter the stretch drive.\""
    com "\"Distancia suficiente alcanzada. Preparaos para entrar en Propulsión Dilatatoria.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2869
translate spanish end_game2_0d43ae56:

    # "Amicus reaches out a paw and I take it."
    "Amicus me tiende una pata y yo la tomo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2871
translate spanish end_game2_d0d0787d:

    # a "\"Then you know that there is much ahead of us, together.\""
    a "\"Entonces sabes que nos queda mucho por delante, juntos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2872
translate spanish end_game2_30c12401:

    # "I nod, the Other's statement of suffering with Amicus forever echoing through my head as I watch Adastra get smaller, and smaller."
    "Asiento; las palabras del Otro sobre sufrir para siempre con Amicus resuenan en mi cabeza mientras veo cómo Adastra se hace cada vez más pequeña."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2873
translate spanish end_game2_d54f0fae:

    # "Then—"
    "Entonces—"

# game/end_game2.rpy:2875
translate spanish end_game2_72e82585:

    # "It's gone, replaced with warped space and unimaginable distance."
    "Ha desaparecido, sustituida por el espacio deformado y una distancia inimaginable."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2880
translate spanish end_game2_8600b4b3:

    # "About 10 hours."
    "Unas 10 horas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2881
translate spanish end_game2_5c8a116a:

    # "That's how much time we have before we get to Earth."
    "Ese es el tiempo que tenemos antes de llegar a la Tierra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2882
translate spanish end_game2_a2f721ce:

    # "We agree to stay up and treat it like having an entire day to ourselves."
    "Acordamos mantenernos despiertos y tratarlo como si tuviéramos un día entero solo para nosotros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2883
translate spanish end_game2_1e0e586d:

    # "Two hours pass quickly as we lie on the cot as Amicus entertains me with the various foods we have stashed in the compartments along the wall."
    "Dos horas pasan deprisa mientras estamos tumbados en el catre y Amicus me entretiene con los distintos alimentos que guardamos en los compartimentos de la pared."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2884
translate spanish end_game2_db6279b1:

    # "He's brought plenty this time."
    "Esta vez ha traído de sobra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2885
translate spanish end_game2_03baccb4:

    # "He'd learned his lesson the first time after he ran out and had to rely on the less-than-savory protein mudshake."
    "Había aprendido la lección la primera vez, cuando se quedó sin comida y tuvo que recurrir al poco apetitoso batido proteico de barro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2886
translate spanish end_game2_ab4df8af:

    # "As for the space-travel food, they apparently can't go bad, so we open every single one, taste testing them and ranking them from worst to best."
    "En cuanto a los alimentos para viajes espaciales, parece que no pueden echarse a perder, así que los abrimos todos, los probamos y los ordenamos de peor a mejor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2887
translate spanish end_game2_dcb287bd:

    # "Amicus is surprised that our rankings are nearly opposite each other, even though I expected it."
    "A Amicus le sorprende que nuestras clasificaciones sean casi opuestas, aunque yo ya me lo esperaba."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2888
translate spanish end_game2_a55a1df7:

    # m "\"You're always wanting anything sweet, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Siempre quieres cualquier cosa que sea dulce, Amicus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2890
translate spanish end_game2_deab9c0b:

    # a "\"Yes, because sweet is good.\""
    a "\"Sí, porque lo dulce está bueno.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2891
translate spanish end_game2_b1f78d59:

    # m "\"Sometimes, but I'd rather have more of something that's salty and savory rather than sweet.\""
    m "\"A veces, pero yo prefiero más cantidad de algo salado y sabroso que de algo dulce.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2893
translate spanish end_game2_d7148917:

    # a "\"But why? It's like dessert all the time.\""
    a "\"¿Pero por qué? Es como comer postre todo el tiempo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2894
translate spanish end_game2_b16b40e4:

    # m "\"There's a reason dessert is small and comes last, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Hay un motivo por el que el postre es pequeño y viene al final, Amicus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2896
translate spanish end_game2_cd1fd17f:

    # a "\"I don't see the reason.\""
    a "\"No veo el motivo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2897
translate spanish end_game2_8273d56a:

    # m "\"Ever heard of too much of a good thing?\""
    m "\"¿Nunca has oído que hasta lo bueno puede ser demasiado?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2899
translate spanish end_game2_344790fa:

    # a "\"If something is good, then there can never be enough of it.\""
    a "\"Si algo es bueno, nunca puede haber suficiente.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2900
translate spanish end_game2_2a79ca43:

    # "Amicus flicks a round, blue, pebble-like pellet into his muzzle, that I assume is some kind of fruit-flavored candy."
    "Amicus se echa en la boca una bolita redonda y azul, parecida a una piedrecita, que supongo que será un caramelo con sabor a fruta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2901
translate spanish end_game2_9eaa2473:

    # "I settle with munching on my salty, potato chip-like dried vegetable, finding it sad that it's a bit better than most of the bland food on Adastra."
    "Me conformo con mordisquear mi verdura seca y salada, parecida a una patata frita; me da pena que sea un poco mejor que la mayoría de la comida insípida de Adastra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2902
translate spanish end_game2_8842c6f0:

    # m "\"Did your parents like, ban you from eating anything sweet, or something?\""
    m "\"¿Tus padres te prohibían comer cualquier cosa dulce, o algo así?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2903
translate spanish end_game2_1d179235:

    # "Amicus pauses, in the process of pouring half the bag into his muzzle before talking with his mouth full."
    "Amicus se detiene mientras se vierte media bolsa en la boca, antes de hablar con la boca llena."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2905
translate spanish end_game2_b8123cd3:

    # a "\"Oh, yeah, how didsh you knowfh?\""
    a "\"Oh, sí, ¿cómosh lo sabíaf?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2906
translate spanish end_game2_cd938aab_2:

    # "I grimace."
    "Hago una mueca."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2907
translate spanish end_game2_7cc5d89d:

    # m "\"So that's how you ran out of food last time.\""
    m "\"Así que por eso te quedaste sin comida la última vez.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2908
translate spanish end_game2_debf604d:

    # "Amicus chews for a while, then swallows."
    "Amicus mastica un rato y luego traga."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2910
translate spanish end_game2_6bf1ed18:

    # a "\"It's not like I'm always eating sweets. Virginia disallows me from doing so as well. I'm simply taking advantage of not being under supervision at the moment.\""
    a "\"No es que coma dulces todo el tiempo. Virginia también me lo prohíbe. Solo estoy aprovechando que ahora no estoy bajo supervisión.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2911
translate spanish end_game2_df07d238:

    # com "\"Amicus, your consumption of sugars has exceeded your daily limit. A report for Virginia has been filed and will be supplied to her upon our landing on Adastra.\""
    com "\"Amicus, tu consumo de azúcares ha superado tu límite diario. Se ha registrado un informe para Virginia que se le entregará cuando aterricemos en Adastra.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2914
translate spanish end_game2_c6cec3a0:

    # "Amicus pauses, then shrugs, pouring the rest of the bag into his mouth."
    "Amicus se detiene, luego se encoge de hombros y se vierte el resto de la bolsa en la boca."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2915
translate spanish end_game2_66683c06:

    # m "\"Well...as long as you have the parental tech to keep you healthy.\""
    m "\"Bueno...mientras tengas la tecnología de los Padres para mantenerte sano.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2917
translate spanish end_game2_2f669512:

    # a "\"We do. Everything in my body is regulated to normal levels once a month.\""
    a "\"La tenemos. Todo en mi cuerpo se regula a niveles normales una vez al mes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2918
translate spanish end_game2_6062bc35:

    # m "\"Wow, lucky you.\""
    m "\"Vaya, qué suerte tienes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2919
translate spanish end_game2_b8cafa0e:

    # a "\"So I am technically free from any poor choice I make diet-wise. I'm simply kept away from sweets to discipline my impulses.\""
    a "\"Así que, técnicamente, estoy libre de las consecuencias de cualquier mala elección alimentaria. Solo me mantienen apartado de los dulces para disciplinar mis impulsos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2920
translate spanish end_game2_7e169c95:

    # m "\"Well, that's clearly not working at all.\""
    m "\"Bueno, está claro que eso no funciona en absoluto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2921
translate spanish end_game2_4dcc90dc:

    # "Amicus smirks at me before opening another bag of what looks like candy."
    "Amicus me dedica una sonrisita antes de abrir otra bolsa de lo que parecen caramelos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2922
translate spanish end_game2_7fefbd70:

    # "I glare at him, then poke him in the stomach, making him grunt."
    "Lo miro con enfado y luego le doy un toque en la barriga, haciéndolo gruñir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2923
translate spanish end_game2_c4131717:

    # m "\"I think you're actually gaining a little more weight.\""
    m "\"Creo que de verdad estás ganando un poco más de peso.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2924
translate spanish end_game2_16d95c51:

    # "The wolf clasps his stomach with a hard smack."
    "El lobo se agarra la barriga con una fuerte palmada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2926
translate spanish end_game2_1403f865:

    # a "\"This? It's part of my stature and is important for my center of gravity in combat.\""
    a "\"¿Esto? Forma parte de mi complexión y es importante para mi centro de gravedad en combate.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2927
translate spanish end_game2_6c6c25c1_1:

    # m "\"Oh really?\""
    m "\"¿Ah, sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2928
translate spanish end_game2_c299c7d5:

    # "I move to sit in Amicus's lap, rubbing my face against his bulk."
    "Me siento en el regazo de Amicus, frotando la cara contra su corpulencia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2930
translate spanish end_game2_07e892be:

    # a "\"Yes, you see how handily I handle you when we wrestle. Besides, you like it.\""
    a "\"Sí, ya ves con qué facilidad te manejo cuando luchamos. Además, te gusta.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2931
translate spanish end_game2_74308e0a:

    # "I rest my head against his chest, feeling the softness of his strong body swell around me with each breath he takes."
    "Apoyo la cabeza en su pecho, sintiendo cómo la suavidad de su cuerpo fuerte se expande a mi alrededor con cada respiración."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2932
translate spanish end_game2_596ed95f:

    # m "\"You got me there.\""
    m "\"Ahí me has pillado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2935
translate spanish end_game2_9a01d4e0:

    # "I listen to the candies clack around in his mouth, against his teeth and against each other."
    "Escucho cómo los caramelos chocan dentro de su boca, contra sus dientes y entre sí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2936
translate spanish end_game2_c05ecdb2:

    # "I've been savoring everything about him that I can, even just these sounds of him eating candy."
    "Estoy saboreando todo lo que puedo de él, incluso estos sonidos que hace al comer caramelos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2937
translate spanish end_game2_a1794a9f:

    # "We sit there in silence for a bit, becoming all too aware of the passage of time."
    "Nos quedamos sentados en silencio un rato, cada vez más conscientes del paso del tiempo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2938
translate spanish end_game2_a5e8d1c4:

    # "I take a deep breath."
    "Respiro hondo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2939
translate spanish end_game2_b6ff93b6:

    # m "\"So...will we be able to communicate at all over the next eight years?\""
    m "\"Entonces...¿podremos comunicarnos de alguna manera durante los próximos ocho años?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2942
translate spanish end_game2_101379c7:

    # "Amicus pauses, his mood lowering a bit to match mine."
    "Amicus se detiene; su ánimo decae un poco hasta ponerse a la altura del mío."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2944
translate spanish end_game2_f6ac4877:

    # a "\"That's hard to say. I've wondered similar things, but I have not received an answer.\""
    a "\"Es difícil saberlo. Me he hecho preguntas parecidas, pero no he recibido respuesta.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2945
translate spanish end_game2_bfcf0b77:

    # "I sigh deeply."
    "Suspiro profundamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2946
translate spanish end_game2_f9f0cc6b:

    # m "\"Sometimes I hate the parents.\""
    m "\"A veces odio a los Padres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2948
translate spanish end_game2_3b2f0338:

    # "Amicus laughs, a stark contrast to how he would have reacted to such a statement a year ago."
    "Amicus se ríe, un contraste enorme con cómo habría reaccionado a una afirmación así hace un año."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2949
translate spanish end_game2_c6f31832:

    # a "\"They are frustrating, to say the least. I have a feeling that we will, though.\""
    a "\"Son frustrantes, por decirlo suavemente. Aunque tengo la sensación de que sí podremos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2950
translate spanish end_game2_9b78ca0f_3:

    # m "\"Yeah?\""
    m "\"¿Sí?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2952
translate spanish end_game2_60095034:

    # a "\"Yes, they work in very mysterious ways. I believe it is clear now that the archives are not their only method of communication.\""
    a "\"Sí, actúan de formas muy misteriosas. Creo que ahora está claro que los archivos no son su único medio de comunicación.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2954
translate spanish end_game2_d02e7e69:

    # a "\"I think the two of us joining together in say, a dream, would not be out of the realm of possibility.\""
    a "\"Creo que no sería imposible que ambos nos reuniéramos, por ejemplo, en un sueño.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2955
translate spanish end_game2_d2e44619:

    # "The confidence I'd originally felt while leaving Adastra is fading away at this point."
    "La confianza que sentía al salir de Adastra empieza a desvanecerse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2956
translate spanish end_game2_811249bf:

    # "Instead, I feel that familiar feeling of dread and uncertainty take over my mind."
    "En su lugar, noto que aquella sensación familiar de miedo e incertidumbre se apodera de mi mente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2957
translate spanish end_game2_d4cccfa1:

    # "Yeah, I know what I'm doing now, but the whole process is so daunting."
    "Sí, ahora sé lo que estoy haciendo, pero todo el proceso resulta tan abrumador."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2959
translate spanish end_game2_ab7598f9:

    # "I hug Amicus harder, pressing my face into his fur, inhaling the lavender scent."
    "Abrazo con más fuerza a Amicus, hundiendo la cara en su pelo e inhalando el olor a lavanda."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2960
translate spanish end_game2_27dac8bf:

    # "I mumble into his chest."
    "Murmuro contra su pecho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2961
translate spanish end_game2_98909c2e:

    # m "\"I'm scared.\""
    m "\"Tengo miedo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2963
translate spanish end_game2_e6af50db:

    # a "\"Why's that? There is nothing to be afraid of.\""
    a "\"¿Por qué? No hay nada que temer.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2964
translate spanish end_game2_157e3bc7:

    # "I smile sadly, knowing just how untrue that is, that I have a hell of a struggle ahead of me."
    "Sonrío con tristeza, sabiendo lo falso que es eso y la tremenda lucha que me espera."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2965
translate spanish end_game2_ba1b8208:

    # "Amicus hugs me tightly, nuzzling my hair."
    "Amicus me abraza con fuerza y me acaricia el pelo con el hocico."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2966
translate spanish end_game2_ccae94f4:

    # "Even now, he's managing to hold it together somehow, and that actually makes me feel a little grateful."
    "Incluso ahora consigue mantener la compostura de algún modo, y eso me hace sentir algo agradecido."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2967
translate spanish end_game2_aebded43:

    # "I don't know how I'd be able to do this if he was acting as unsure as I am right now."
    "No sé cómo podría hacer esto si él se mostrara tan inseguro como yo ahora."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2968
translate spanish end_game2_b4415a7e:

    # m "\"You know how big of a fuck up I am. What if I do something wrong?\""
    m "\"Sabes el puto desastre que soy. ¿Y si hago algo mal?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2969
translate spanish end_game2_292c202c:

    # "Amicus chuckles."
    "Amicus suelta una risita."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2971
translate spanish end_game2_f0beb299:

    # a "\"I feel that the parents would not attempt this unless they themselves were certain of success. Simply follow their guidance.\""
    a "\"Creo que los Padres no intentarían esto si ellos mismos no estuvieran seguros del éxito. Simplemente sigue sus indicaciones.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2972
translate spanish end_game2_214d1e0a:

    # "I'm silent at that, and Amicus knows why."
    "Me quedo callado ante eso, y Amicus sabe por qué."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2974
translate spanish end_game2_bbdca568:

    # a "\"I know that what we experienced with Cato was terrible. They weren't able to...{i}see{/i} as clearly. I know that they are much more confident here.\""
    a "\"Sé que lo que vivimos con Cato fue terrible. No podían...{i}ver{/i} con tanta claridad. Sé que aquí están mucho más seguros.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2975
translate spanish end_game2_f62c6cee:

    # m "\"I don't know how I feel about being guided by gods that don't know what they're doing.\""
    m "\"No sé qué pensar de que me guíen dioses que no saben lo que hacen.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2977
translate spanish end_game2_4261fb1e:

    # a "\"Well, they are not gods, which is why they are prone to mistakes, but the time I've spent communicating with them over the past year has left me a bit more confident in their capabilities.\""
    a "\"Bueno, no son dioses, por eso son propensos a cometer errores, pero el tiempo que he pasado comunicándome con ellos este último año me ha dado algo más de confianza en sus capacidades.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2978
translate spanish end_game2_61a16479:

    # "I squeeze my eyes, letting the small amount of tears that had built up get soaked into the wolf's fur so he doesn't see when I look up at him."
    "Aprieto los ojos y dejo que las pocas lágrimas que se han acumulado se absorban en el pelo del lobo, para que no las vea cuando levante la mirada hacia él."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2979
translate spanish end_game2_51e734c7:

    # m "\"Why's that?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2980
translate spanish end_game2_7cb162c2:

    # "He smiles at me, placing a paw against my head and pushing it back down against his shoulder."
    "Me sonríe, me pone una pata en la cabeza y vuelve a empujarla suavemente contra su hombro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2981
translate spanish end_game2_3bc6f63c:

    # a "\"Well, they have far more tools at their disposal than we do. I mean, they actually see the future in some ways. If I must trust anyone with my future, it would be the parents.\""
    a "\"Bueno, tienen muchas más herramientas a su disposición que nosotros. Quiero decir, realmente ven el futuro de alguna manera. Si tengo que confiarle mi futuro a alguien, sería a los Padres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2982
translate spanish end_game2_86105ec6:

    # m "\"Amicus, don't trust anyone but yourself.\""
    m "\"Amicus, no confíes en nadie excepto en ti mismo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2983
translate spanish end_game2_d8fba367:

    # a "\"Hmph, I trust you.\""
    a "\"Hmph, confío en ti.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2984
translate spanish end_game2_3f739ce1_5:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2985
translate spanish end_game2_dba059f3:

    # m "\"I just don't wanna mess up and not be able to see you again.\""
    m "\"Solo quiero evitar meter la pata y no poder volver a verte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2986
translate spanish end_game2_91200abc:

    # "Amicus's expression grows stern."
    "La expresión de Amicus se vuelve severa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2988
translate spanish end_game2_3be2d83d:

    # a "\"That will not happen. I will make sure of it, no matter what the parents say.\""
    a "\"Eso no va a pasar. Me aseguraré de ello, digan lo que digan los Padres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2989
translate spanish end_game2_b176ac10:

    # m "\"But do we even have a choice? Does it bother you that it feels like we don't have a say in anything?\""
    m "\"¿Pero siquiera podemos elegir? ¿No te molesta sentir que no tenemos voz en nada?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2990
translate spanish end_game2_f659f3eb:

    # "These are conversations we've had before, but for some reason, I keep flip-flopping on whether or not I actually do have a choice here."
    "Ya hemos tenido estas conversaciones, pero por alguna razón no dejo de cambiar de opinión sobre si de verdad puedo elegir aquí o no."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2992
translate spanish end_game2_9af128e7:

    # a "\"We do...we just have the advantage of knowing the alternatives, and that this path is much more desirable.\""
    a "\"Sí podemos...solo tenemos la ventaja de conocer las alternativas y saber que este camino es mucho más deseable.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2993
translate spanish end_game2_5d3560b6:

    # "I'm reminded that while Amicus might be more open to criticizing the parents, he certainly still believes in their plan."
    "Recuerdo que, aunque Amicus esté más dispuesto a criticar a los Padres, sin duda sigue creyendo en su plan."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2994
translate spanish end_game2_b9b6913f:

    # "I don't know if I feel the same quite yet."
    "No sé si yo ya siento lo mismo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2995
translate spanish end_game2_5a5a7651:

    # m "\"You saw our future?\""
    m "\"¿Has visto nuestro futuro?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:2996
translate spanish end_game2_a2303525:

    # "Amicus pauses, probably wondering if this is okay to share."
    "Amicus se detiene, probablemente preguntándose si puede contármelo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2997
translate spanish end_game2_678190ea:

    # "He seems to make up his mind."
    "Parece tomar una decisión."

# game/end_game2.rpy:2999
translate spanish end_game2_35fc5f78:

    # a "\"Yes...it was beautiful.\""
    a "\"Sí...era hermoso.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3000
translate spanish end_game2_c43ffbf0:

    # m "\"I just...I worry it's not really going to happen. I've only thought of it now, but what if they're leading us on?\""
    m "\"Es que...me preocupa que no vaya a ocurrir de verdad. Acabo de pensarlo, pero ¿y si nos están dando falsas esperanzas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3002
translate spanish end_game2_0d249d23:

    # "Amicus grunts in surprise, clearly not having thought of that himself."
    "Amicus gruñe sorprendido; está claro que él no lo había pensado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3004
translate spanish end_game2_3069fc0d:

    # a "\"They wouldn't do that...but I suppose there is some degree of trust that goes into this, yeah? We're here because of them, all of us are, and I have to trust that.\""
    a "\"No harían eso...pero supongo que esto exige cierto grado de confianza, ¿no? Estamos aquí gracias a ellos, todos nosotros, y tengo que confiar en eso.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3005
translate spanish end_game2_bfcf0b77_1:

    # "I sigh deeply."
    "Suspiro profundamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3006
translate spanish end_game2_7834fe91:

    # m "\"I just wish we could run away to some other peaceful planet, or something...\""
    m "\"Solo desearía que pudiéramos huir a algún otro planeta tranquilo, o algo así...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3007
translate spanish end_game2_47b9dcbb:

    # m "\"...but I know we wouldn't be together unless we were meant to do this, so I guess that's partly why I'm going along with it.\""
    m "\"...pero sé que no estaríamos juntos si no estuviéramos destinados a hacer esto, así que supongo que por eso, en parte, lo estoy aceptando.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3009
translate spanish end_game2_fb78b564:

    # a "\"You know, judging by the vision, I think we will come to believe in our mission over time.\""
    a "\"Sabes, a juzgar por la visión, creo que con el tiempo llegaremos a creer en nuestra misión.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3010
translate spanish end_game2_e2393303:

    # m "\"I hope so...\""
    m "\"Eso espero...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3013
translate spanish end_game2_a1e3f2f4:

    # "Amicus slowly pulls me back to lie down with him, both of us lying on our sides as he spoons me."
    "Amicus tira lentamente de mí para que me tumbe con él; ambos quedamos de lado mientras me abraza por detrás."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3014
translate spanish end_game2_f8eb9bc3:

    # "I try to think of something to say, anything, really."
    "Intento pensar en algo que decir, cualquier cosa, en realidad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3015
translate spanish end_game2_dbdca12e:

    # "Time is truly running out now, but I still come up short."
    "Ahora sí que se nos acaba el tiempo, pero sigo sin encontrar nada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3016
translate spanish end_game2_a3821cb5:

    # "Instead, I lie back against Amicus, amongst the many silver wrappers of food, listening to him suck on his candies."
    "En lugar de eso, me quedo tumbado contra Amicus, entre los muchos envoltorios plateados de comida, escuchándolo chupar sus caramelos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3017
translate spanish end_game2_8f4ffbe9:

    # "It's comfortable, and for a moment, I let go of my worries, and the tiredness of the night before catches up to me..."
    "Es cómodo, y por un momento dejo atrás mis preocupaciones; el cansancio de la noche anterior me alcanza..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3021
translate spanish end_game2_4a5495fc:

    # com "\"Exiting the stretch drive. Prepare for arrival in 20 minutes.\""
    com "\"Saliendo de Propulsión Dilatatoria. Preparaos para la llegada en 20 minutos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3022
translate spanish end_game2_8d066a1b:

    # "I come to with a sudden jolt, Amicus jumping behind me as well."
    "Recobro el sentido con un sobresalto; Amicus también da un salto detrás de mí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3023
translate spanish end_game2_56247dfb:

    # "I sit up, rubbing my eyes."
    "Me incorporo y me froto los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3024
translate spanish end_game2_e94f0c99:

    # m "\"Wait, already?\""
    m "\"Espera, ¿ya?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3025
translate spanish end_game2_d6eacefe:

    # "Amicus sits up next to me, a paw on my back."
    "Amicus se incorpora a mi lado y me pone una pata en la espalda."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3027
translate spanish end_game2_012c0fd7_3:

    # a "\"Are you alright?\""
    a "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3028
translate spanish end_game2_53dca22a:

    # m "\"Dammit, Amicus! We were supposed to stay up!\""
    m "\"¡Joder, Amicus! ¡Se suponía que íbamos a mantenernos despiertos!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3029
translate spanish end_game2_e8a5fa04:

    # "There's a sinking feeling in my chest as I realize we've slept away most of the time we had to travel."
    "Se me hunde el pecho al darme cuenta de que hemos dormido durante la mayor parte del tiempo de viaje que teníamos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3030
translate spanish end_game2_edc9a3e2:

    # m "\"Why'd you let me fall asleep?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué me has dejado dormirme?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3031
translate spanish end_game2_4c215b44:

    # "I look at him accusingly, even as my eyes start to blur with tears."
    "Lo miro con reproche, incluso mientras las lágrimas empiezan a nublarme los ojos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3033
translate spanish end_game2_179c0f6a:

    # a "\"Sorry, we were both so tired. You seemed at peace and I didn't—\""
    a "\"Lo siento, estábamos los dos muy cansados. Parecías estar en paz y no...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3034
translate spanish end_game2_f88c4071:

    # m "\"Ugh!\""
    m "\"¡Uf!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3035
translate spanish end_game2_d6d833cf:

    # "I throw off the blanket that Amicus had pulled over us, and step out of bed, turning away in case I break down like a little kid."
    "Aparto la manta que Amicus había echado sobre nosotros y salgo de la cama, dándole la espalda por si me derrumbo como un niño pequeño."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3036
translate spanish end_game2_804cd142_2:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"¿[mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3038
translate spanish end_game2_877825e2:

    # "I act like I don't hear him, moving to the cockpit area to look out the windows."
    "Finjo no oírlo y voy a la zona de la cabina para mirar por las ventanas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3039
translate spanish end_game2_34fc6f0f:

    # "Sure enough, we're no longer in the stretch, instead drifting toward a familiar globe in the distance."
    "En efecto, ya no estamos en dilatación; en cambio, avanzamos hacia un globo familiar a lo lejos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3040
translate spanish end_game2_db9580bb:

    # com "\"Approaching Earth. Will arrive at [mc]'s residence in Rome, Italy.\""
    com "\"Aproximándonos a la Tierra. Llegaremos a la residencia de [mc] en Roma, Italia.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3041
translate spanish end_game2_5b2e4ab4:

    # "A heavy paw rests on my back."
    "Una pata pesada se apoya en mi espalda."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3043
translate spanish end_game2_804cd142_3:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"¿[mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3044
translate spanish end_game2_439afc74:

    # m "\"We're out of time.\""
    m "\"Se nos ha acabado el tiempo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3045
translate spanish end_game2_70212395:

    # "The lump in my throat makes it hard to talk."
    "El nudo en la garganta me dificulta hablar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3046
translate spanish end_game2_996d7d4c:

    # "Slowly, Amicus hugs me."
    "Amicus me abraza despacio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3048
translate spanish end_game2_1707b5d5:

    # a "\"[mc], we did have time. Several months, in fact. A few hours on a ship is no time lost.\""
    a "\"[mc], sí hemos tenido tiempo. Varios meses, de hecho. Unas pocas horas en una nave no son tiempo perdido.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3049
translate spanish end_game2_3b638a02:

    # m "\"Any time is time lost at this point.\""
    m "\"A estas alturas, cualquier tiempo es tiempo perdido.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3050
translate spanish end_game2_4f81d612:

    # "Amicus doesn't say anything, and I lean my head back against him, swallowing down my bitter attitude because I'm not about to let it ruin our last moments together."
    "Amicus no dice nada, y vuelvo a apoyar la cabeza contra él, tragándome mi amargura porque no voy a dejar que arruine nuestros últimos momentos juntos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3051
translate spanish end_game2_56db9361:

    # m "\"Sorry, I'm just...I'm not ready.\""
    m "\"Lo siento, es que...no estoy preparado.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3053
translate spanish end_game2_c6ffc902:

    # a "\"I'll be able to come into your apartment. We do still have a bit of time left, you know.\""
    a "\"Podré entrar en tu apartamento. Todavía nos queda algo de tiempo, sabes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3054
translate spanish end_game2_594ab045:

    # "I nod quietly, allowing Amicus to hold me for a bit until we have to get back in our seats for reentry."
    "Asiento en silencio y dejo que Amicus me abrace un rato, hasta que tenemos que volver a nuestros asientos para la reentrada."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3055
translate spanish end_game2_d83f97cc:

    # "I feel slightly queasy as we approach Earth at an unreal speed."
    "Siento algo de náusea al acercarnos a la Tierra a una velocidad irreal."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3056
translate spanish end_game2_7243d27a:

    # "I quickly spot Europe, the brilliant sprawl of lights spanning the continent as a whole are far more intense than any city on Adastra."
    "Distingo enseguida Europa; la brillante extensión de luces que abarca todo el continente es mucho más intensa que cualquier ciudad de Adastra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3057
translate spanish end_game2_06614ebd:

    # "Italy's characteristic, boot-like shape stands out from the darkness of the seas that surround it."
    "La característica forma de bota de Italia destaca entre la oscuridad de los mares que la rodean."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3058
translate spanish end_game2_10650f21:

    # "I focus on the glittering patch that I know is Rome, and within seconds, we're descending into it."
    "Me concentro en la mancha reluciente que sé que es Roma, y en cuestión de segundos estamos descendiendo hacia ella."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3059
translate spanish end_game2_93ef3f53:

    # m "\"Won't everyone see us?\""
    m "\"¿No nos verá todo el mundo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3061
translate spanish end_game2_33370920:

    # a "\"We're cloaked.\""
    a "\"Estamos camuflados.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3062
translate spanish end_game2_ff84f538:

    # "I trust what the wolf says, even though I haven't noticed any difference."
    "Confío en lo que dice el lobo, aunque no he notado ninguna diferencia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3063
translate spanish end_game2_f085db4d:

    # "We continue to descend at a rapid pace, and as we approach a block of apartments, I grip onto the seat in anticipation of a hard landing...but our sudden, yet gradual halt is gentle."
    "Seguimos descendiendo deprisa, y cuando nos acercamos a un bloque de apartamentos me agarro al asiento, esperando un aterrizaje brusco...pero nuestra parada repentina, aunque gradual, es suave."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3064
translate spanish end_game2_306a1e01:

    # "We come to a rest on the roof of my residence."
    "Nos detenemos en el tejado de mi residencia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3067
translate spanish end_game2_3cbfe647:

    # m "\"You landed on the roof?\""
    m "\"¿Has aterrizado en el tejado?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3068
translate spanish end_game2_17c9e486:

    # a "\"Indeed! There was no room elsewhere.\""
    a "\"¡Así es! No había sitio en otra parte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3071
translate spanish end_game2_f60faedf:

    # "Amicus opens the door and jumps out, and again I'm worried about being seen."
    "Amicus abre la puerta y salta fuera; vuelvo a preocuparme por que nos vean."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3072
translate spanish end_game2_2fe3ac56:

    # "But when he helps me out, I realize how dark it is."
    "Pero cuando me ayuda a salir, me doy cuenta de lo oscuro que está."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3074
translate spanish end_game2_971ddec4:

    # com "\"Stretch schedule indicates liftoff should commence in fifteen minutes.\""
    com "\"El horario de dilatación indica que el despegue debe comenzar en quince minutos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3075
translate spanish end_game2_0999bc16:

    # "Another twist in my chest as we're down to literally minutes."
    "Se me vuelve a retorcer el pecho cuando literalmente solo nos quedan minutos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3076
translate spanish end_game2_d5504aa5:

    # "Amicus leads the way to a fire escape, and I'm struck by how strange it is seeing my wolf framed by this human world."
    "Amicus va delante hacia una escalera de incendios, y me impresiona lo extraño que resulta ver a mi lobo enmarcado en este mundo humano."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3077
translate spanish end_game2_5e1a1860:

    # "The sights of Rome, the sounds of distant traffic...it almost makes me dizzy with how familiar it is despite having been away for so long."
    "Las vistas de Roma, los sonidos del tráfico lejano...casi me marean de lo familiares que resultan pese a haber estado fuera tanto tiempo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3078
translate spanish end_game2_2495cac8:

    # "Amicus stops at a balcony, and I trust that it's the one to my apartment as he boldly slides open the door, apparently aware that the landlord never seems to keep it locked."
    "Amicus se detiene en un balcón; confío en que sea el de mi apartamento cuando abre sin dudar la puerta corredera, al parecer sabiendo que el casero nunca parece mantenerla cerrada con llave."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3080
translate spanish end_game2_86f74186:

    # "I step inside, and through the darkness I can see that my personal belongings are gone, obviously."
    "Entro y, a través de la oscuridad, veo que mis pertenencias personales ya no están, evidentemente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3081
translate spanish end_game2_cd8494ae:

    # "It's cleaned out and looks just about the same as when I first got there."
    "Lo han vaciado y tiene casi el mismo aspecto que cuando llegué por primera vez."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3082
translate spanish end_game2_454f3fc6:

    # "It's empty, luckily, and I wonder if anyone has stayed here since I went missing...probably not if there was an investigation."
    "Por suerte está vacío, y me pregunto si alguien se habrá alojado aquí desde que desaparecí...probablemente no, si hubo una investigación."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3083
translate spanish end_game2_1e7abf94:

    # "I swallow hard, remembering how much media coverage and documentaries there were about the two Canadian and British students that went missing here a few years ago."
    "Trago con dificultad al recordar toda la cobertura mediática y los documentales sobre los dos estudiantes, canadiense y británico, que desaparecieron aquí hace unos años."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3084
translate spanish end_game2_c0da18f8:

    # "And the coverage of an Australian student who disappeared a week before I arrived."
    "Y la cobertura de un estudiante australiano que desapareció una semana antes de que yo llegara."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3085
translate spanish end_game2_5cb97e2e:

    # "I hope I didn't get the same treatment while I was away, but I get the feeling that I must have."
    "Espero no haber recibido el mismo trato mientras estaba fuera, pero tengo la sensación de que seguramente sí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3086
translate spanish end_game2_807ce233:

    # "I shake my head, once again wondering where to even begin."
    "Sacudo la cabeza, preguntándome otra vez por dónde empezar siquiera."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3087
translate spanish end_game2_0a6b7a02:

    # "I turn around, seeing Amicus standing there, and immediately I get a painful, stabbing feeling between my throat and chest."
    "Me giro y veo a Amicus de pie; de inmediato siento una dolorosa punzada entre la garganta y el pecho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3090
translate spanish end_game2_31c4f819:

    # "His pose and demeanor, it's finally reflecting that our time together is coming to an end."
    "Su postura y su actitud reflejan por fin que nuestro tiempo juntos está llegando a su fin."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3091
translate spanish end_game2_9bd7486e:

    # "We both stand a few feet apart, unsure of what to say."
    "Nos quedamos a unos pocos pies de distancia, sin saber qué decir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3092
translate spanish end_game2_0fb53a3f:

    # a "\"Well...\""
    a "\"Bueno...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3093
translate spanish end_game2_bf023949_1:

    # m "\"Yeah...\""
    m "\"Sí...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3094
translate spanish end_game2_970b8cff:

    # a "\"I suppose we should begin our farewells.\""
    a "\"Supongo que deberíamos empezar a despedirnos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3095
translate spanish end_game2_5f9934dd:

    # m "\"Yeah, until next time, at least.\""
    m "\"Sí, hasta la próxima vez, al menos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3097
translate spanish end_game2_4931bf63:

    # a "\"Yes, it will only be a moment in the overall time that we will have together.\""
    a "\"Sí, solo será un instante dentro de todo el tiempo que tendremos juntos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3098
translate spanish end_game2_ee099986:

    # m "\"Yeah, I'll bet when you come back to get me we'll be like 'wow, it was only yesterday you dropped me off'.\""
    m "\"Sí, seguro que cuando vuelvas a buscarme diremos algo como 'vaya, si fue ayer cuando me dejaste aquí'.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3100
translate spanish end_game2_fb02bdad:

    # a "\"Of course! Not even a full day. It will feel like hours, I'm sure.\""
    a "\"¡Por supuesto! Ni siquiera un día entero. Parecerán horas, estoy seguro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3101
translate spanish end_game2_1b3c39a4:

    # m "\"The parents called it a cosmic microsecond, or something.\""
    m "\"Los Padres lo llamaron un microsegundo cósmico, o algo así.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3103
translate spanish end_game2_637c150f:

    # a "\"Ah, well, probably a bit longer than a microsecond, though I'm unsure of the length of a cosmic one.\""
    a "\"Ah, bueno, probablemente algo más que un microsegundo, aunque no sé cuánto dura uno cósmico.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3104
translate spanish end_game2_172ae19f:

    # m "\"Eight years, I guess.\""
    m "\"Ocho años, supongo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3105
translate spanish end_game2_f427483d:

    # a "\"I suppose that would be the case.\""
    a "\"Supongo que así será.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3107
translate spanish end_game2_c69f7fea:

    # "I try not to think about all of the things that are gonna make me cry."
    "Intento no pensar en todas las cosas que me van a hacer llorar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3108
translate spanish end_game2_77d5c128:

    # "Like the thought of not waking up to Amicus for the first time in months."
    "Como la idea de no despertar junto a Amicus por primera vez en meses."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3109
translate spanish end_game2_b6b7722a:

    # "Or the fact that I won't have someone to really talk to at the end of the day."
    "O el hecho de que no tendré a alguien con quien hablar de verdad al final del día."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3110
translate spanish end_game2_5dbfd66b:

    # "That I won't have someone who's just genuinely kind and loving toward me like no one ever was before."
    "Que no tendré a alguien que sea realmente amable y cariñoso conmigo como nunca lo ha sido nadie antes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3111
translate spanish end_game2_e78a2baf:

    # "I swallow the lump in my throat again."
    "Vuelvo a tragarme el nudo de la garganta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3112
translate spanish end_game2_631d7925:

    # "No, I'll have time to fall apart as soon as he leaves."
    "No, tendré tiempo de derrumbarme en cuanto se vaya."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3113
translate spanish end_game2_dd324444:

    # "I step forward and hug Amicus, burying my face in the warmth of his furry body, breathing in his scent."
    "Me acerco y abrazo a Amicus, hundiendo la cara en la calidez de su cuerpo peludo e inhalando su olor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3114
translate spanish end_game2_1e2c97cd:

    # "I'm determined to imprint this moment in my mind, something to help weather what I'm sure will be a hard eight years."
    "Estoy decidido a grabar este momento en mi mente, algo que me ayude a soportar los ocho años que estoy seguro de que serán difíciles."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3115
translate spanish end_game2_b6ad4e45:

    # "He rocks us back and forth for a moment, kissing my head like he always does."
    "Nos mece de un lado a otro un momento, besándome la cabeza como siempre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3117
translate spanish end_game2_9c4740e4:

    # a "\"You are more than prepared for this. You're strong. Why else would you have been chosen?\""
    a "\"Estás más que preparado para esto. Eres fuerte. ¿Por qué otra razón te habrían elegido?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3118
translate spanish end_game2_9dba4ef2:

    # m "\"Thanks, and you'll continue to be an amazing emperor, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Gracias, y tú seguirás siendo un emperador increíble, Amicus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3119
translate spanish end_game2_72ecb279:

    # a "\"Here's hoping.\""
    a "\"Eso espero.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3120
translate spanish end_game2_6d0db448:

    # m "\"Though I still don't even know what to do right now, to be honest. Like...do I just walk out into the street next?\""
    m "\"Aunque, sinceramente, todavía no sé ni qué hacer ahora. O sea...¿después simplemente salgo a la calle?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3121
translate spanish end_game2_0e2194aa:

    # a "\"Oh!\""
    a "\"¡Oh!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3123
translate spanish end_game2_f6ddb43f:

    # "Amicus steps back, feeling around his cape and trousers."
    "Amicus retrocede, palpándose la capa y los pantalones."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3124
translate spanish end_game2_6df13a2b:

    # a "\"I really hope I remembered...ah! Here.\""
    a "\"De verdad espero haberme acordado...¡ah! Aquí.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3126
translate spanish end_game2_52e7d62d:

    # "Amicus pulls out a slim, silver rod about a foot long."
    "Amicus saca una delgada varilla plateada de alrededor de un pie de largo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3127
translate spanish end_game2_55aa6726:

    # "It's one of those holographic tablets that I see the imperial family carrying around every now and then, aside from Amicus."
    "Es una de esas tabletas holográficas que veo llevar a la familia imperial de vez en cuando, excepto a Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3128
translate spanish end_game2_b9df3ae8:

    # "I've gotten the impression that he just isn't fond of electronics."
    "Me ha dado la impresión de que simplemente no le gustan los aparatos electrónicos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3129
translate spanish end_game2_818ead87:

    # a "\"The parents have instructed me to give you this. It will connect to your lingua which will transmit and display information that you might need.\""
    a "\"Los Padres me han indicado que te dé esto. Se conectará a tu Lingua, que transmitirá y mostrará la información que puedas necesitar.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3131
translate spanish end_game2_f2641ef5:

    # a "\"Otherwise, all communication will be through the lingua.\""
    a "\"Por lo demás, toda comunicación será a través de la Lingua.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3132
translate spanish end_game2_98848e85:

    # "I reach out, taking it, the cold metal light in my hands."
    "Extiendo la mano y la tomo; el metal frío pesa poco entre mis manos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3133
translate spanish end_game2_8017a82f:

    # m "\"You almost forgot to give it to me.\""
    m "\"Casi te olvidas de dármela.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3134
translate spanish end_game2_cb0de06e:

    # a "\"Ah yeah, well, I did remember!\""
    a "\"Ah, sí, bueno, ¡pero me he acordado!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3135
translate spanish end_game2_d2a45720:

    # "I sigh, turning the rod over in my hands."
    "Suspiro y le doy vueltas a la varilla en las manos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3136
translate spanish end_game2_f7bdbd71:

    # a "\"You turn it on by tapping the top.\""
    a "\"Se enciende tocando la parte superior.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3137
translate spanish end_game2_3df08bdd:

    # "I do as I'm told, and a blue, glowing plane slides out from the rod, like a page attached to the spine of a book."
    "Hago lo que me dice, y de la varilla sale deslizándose un plano azul y luminoso, como una página unida al lomo de un libro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3138
translate spanish end_game2_662adaae:

    # "It's blank for now, though I know what will appear soon enough."
    "Por ahora está en blanco, aunque sé lo que aparecerá dentro de poco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3139
translate spanish end_game2_acf47a32:

    # a "\"Just wait until they offer instructions.\""
    a "\"Solo espera a que ofrezcan instrucciones.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3140
translate spanish end_game2_1f228d29:

    # m "\"Okay.\""
    m "\"Vale.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3141
translate spanish end_game2_9fa62191:

    # "I tap the top of the rod again, and the hologram recedes."
    "Vuelvo a tocar la parte superior de la varilla y el holograma se retrae."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3142
translate spanish end_game2_9b5d30f2:

    # "Another awkward moment of silence, then..."
    "Otro incómodo instante de silencio, y luego..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3144
translate spanish end_game2_b8e2c1d4:

    # a "\"[mc], I am so happy to have met you, and I thank you. You have made me a better man, and though this will be painful...\""
    a "\"[mc], soy tan feliz de haberte conocido, y te doy las gracias. Me has hecho un hombre mejor, y aunque esto será doloroso...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3145
translate spanish end_game2_e85fc289:

    # "Amicus's voice cracks."
    "A Amicus se le quiebra la voz."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3146
translate spanish end_game2_3096fbf9:

    # "His resolve to remain strong finally gives in."
    "Su determinación de mantenerse fuerte acaba cediendo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3148
translate spanish end_game2_517612c7:

    # a "\"I will think of you every day, and we will meet again in eight years, no matter what might happen between now and then. I will see you again.\""
    a "\"Pensaré en ti cada día, y volveremos a vernos dentro de ocho años, pase lo que pase entre ahora y entonces. Volveré a verte.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3149
translate spanish end_game2_67d12781:

    # "His voice is strained as he struggles to get his words out."
    "Su voz suena tensa mientras se esfuerza por sacar las palabras."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3150
translate spanish end_game2_4132310d:

    # "Then the tears really begin spilling over."
    "Entonces las lágrimas empiezan a desbordarse de verdad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3151
translate spanish end_game2_b862337b:

    # a "\"Dammit...\""
    a "\"Maldita sea...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3152
translate spanish end_game2_def3bd9e:

    # "Amicus raises a paw to cover his face in frustration, like he actually planned on not crying before we parted ways."
    "Amicus levanta una pata para taparse la cara, frustrado, como si realmente hubiera planeado no llorar antes de separarnos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3153
translate spanish end_game2_8bee5b33:

    # "And I find that silly, because of course we'd cry."
    "Y eso me parece una tontería, porque por supuesto que íbamos a llorar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3154
translate spanish end_game2_86e2be74:

    # "I'm doing the same as I move forward and wrap him up in a tight, almost desperate hug."
    "Yo hago lo mismo mientras me acerco y lo envuelvo en un abrazo fuerte, casi desesperado."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3155
translate spanish end_game2_46cb2b76:

    # "He crushes me to his body, letting out a loud, gasping sob through his teeth as I feel the wetness of his tears land on my head."
    "Me aprieta contra su cuerpo y deja escapar entre los dientes un sollozo fuerte y entrecortado, mientras siento la humedad de sus lágrimas caer en mi cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3156
translate spanish end_game2_8803deb2:

    # a "\"I love you, so much, [mc].\""
    a "\"Te quiero muchísimo, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3157
translate spanish end_game2_58124b9d_1:

    # m "\"I love you, too.\""
    m "\"Yo también te amo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3158
translate spanish end_game2_508df55c:

    # a "\"Like I've said, this is simply a stone in the way of our chariot's wheel. These few years are simply the push, and we'll be on our way again.\""
    a "\"Como he dicho, esto es solo una piedra en el camino de la rueda de nuestro carro. Estos pocos años no son más que el empujón, y volveremos a ponernos en marcha.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3159
translate spanish end_game2_a60f8192:

    # m "\"And things will get easier over time.\""
    m "\"Y las cosas serán más fáciles con el tiempo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3160
translate spanish end_game2_5db79e76:

    # a "\"Without a doubt. And remember your ring. Though I might be moving away, I'm moving right toward you from the other side. We are permanently connected.\""
    a "\"Sin duda. Y recuerda tu anillo. Aunque me aleje, voy directamente hacia ti desde el otro lado. Estamos unidos para siempre.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3161
translate spanish end_game2_39466036:

    # m "\"Yeah, the universe is spherical. I don't care about the other theories.\""
    m "\"Sí, el universo es esférico. No me importan las otras teorías.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3162
translate spanish end_game2_d398dc15:

    # "We both stand there, holding each other, trembling and sobbing."
    "Nos quedamos allí abrazados, temblando y sollozando."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3163
translate spanish end_game2_a7dd8130:

    # "After a few minutes though, we both calm down a little, and eventually, I hear Com buzz faintly in Amicus's ear."
    "Sin embargo, después de unos minutos ambos nos calmamos un poco, y al final oigo el débil zumbido de Com en el oído de Amicus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3164
translate spanish end_game2_822054cf:

    # com "\"Liftoff sequence should be engaged in one minute.\""
    com "\"La secuencia de despegue debe activarse en un minuto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3165
translate spanish end_game2_0a70f745:

    # "Amicus steps back, firmly gripping my shoulders."
    "Amicus retrocede y me agarra firmemente los hombros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3166
translate spanish end_game2_6d15b3db:

    # "He's smiling through the tears."
    "Sonríe entre lágrimas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3169
translate spanish end_game2_6707c500:

    # a "\"And I think we shall see each other before then. The parents are mysterious, like I said.\""
    a "\"Y creo que nos veremos antes de entonces. Los Padres son misteriosos, como he dicho.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3170
translate spanish end_game2_259ceaf3:

    # m "\"Definitely.\""
    m "\"Seguro.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3171
translate spanish end_game2_717dc03b:

    # a "\"[mc], my lover, my partner, my future husband...I love you.\""
    a "\"[mc], mi amante, mi compañero, mi futuro marido...te quiero.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3172
translate spanish end_game2_5dc4852f:

    # m "\"And you know I love you too.\""
    m "\"Y sabes que yo también te quiero.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3173
translate spanish end_game2_65b7c8ba:

    # "Amicus pulls me against his chest again, hard, squeezing me."
    "Amicus vuelve a tirar de mí contra su pecho con fuerza, apretándome."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3174
translate spanish end_game2_36d0c4c6:

    # a "\"You will have amazing success here. And I'll see you soon, very soon.\""
    a "\"Tendrás un éxito increíble aquí. Y te veré pronto, muy pronto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3176
translate spanish end_game2_2325f10f:

    # "He plants a kiss on my mouth, and I have just enough time to kiss back before my wolf turns away and disappears out the balcony door."
    "Me besa en la boca, y apenas tengo tiempo de devolverle el beso antes de que mi lobo se dé la vuelta y desaparezca por la puerta del balcón."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3178
translate spanish end_game2_1b2fdbd5:

    # "I listen to the metallic sounds of his footsteps hurrying up the fire escape, then nothing until there's a soft hum that I can only imagine is the ship before it's silent again."
    "Escucho los sonidos metálicos de sus pasos apresurándose por la escalera de incendios, y luego nada, hasta que se oye un suave zumbido que solo puedo imaginar que es la nave, antes de volver al silencio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3179
translate spanish end_game2_ddd0176b:

    # "I stand there in the dark room, feeling a little stunned before moving to turn on the light."
    "Me quedo en la habitación oscura, un poco aturdido, antes de moverme para encender la luz."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3182
translate spanish end_game2_e065ae85:

    # "I stand there, staring, unsure of how to feel."
    "Me quedo allí mirando, sin saber cómo sentirme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3183
translate spanish end_game2_07d27da8:

    # "For the moment, it's mostly just an empty feeling, one that I'm sure will start to ache as I come to realize how lonely I actually am."
    "Por ahora es sobre todo una sensación de vacío, que estoy seguro de que empezará a doler cuando comprenda lo solo que estoy de verdad."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3184
translate spanish end_game2_daa339cf:

    # "For now though, I move to the desk, waiting, thinking."
    "Pero por el momento voy al escritorio, esperando, pensando."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3185
translate spanish end_game2_c4e50a7c:

    # "Then I set the metal rod on top of the desk and tap the top."
    "Luego pongo la varilla metálica encima del escritorio y toco la parte superior."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3186
translate spanish end_game2_c900e762:

    # "The blue plane appears again, and I stare at it."
    "El plano azul vuelve a aparecer, y lo miro fijamente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3187
translate spanish end_game2_ba915328:

    # "It's blank, and I start to wonder if I should keep it open."
    "Está en blanco, y empiezo a preguntarme si debería mantenerlo abierto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3188
translate spanish end_game2_c1cdcdec:

    # "I already know what I need to do."
    "Ya sé lo que tengo que hacer."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3189
translate spanish end_game2_05ec5fd3:

    # "Maybe I should try to get some more sleep before facing what I'm sure will be a chaotic day."
    "Quizá debería intentar dormir un poco más antes de afrontar lo que estoy seguro de que será un día caótico."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3190
translate spanish end_game2_ab563208:

    # "At that moment though, I feel a twitch in my left eyelid."
    "Pero en ese momento siento un temblor en el párpado izquierdo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3191
translate spanish end_game2_48ade3ce:

    # "Then words appear on the blue plane."
    "Entonces aparecen palabras en el plano azul."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3192
translate spanish end_game2_773f7379:

    # "\"Proceed to the European Commission offices. The committee is expecting your arrival in one hour and twenty minutes.\""
    "\"Dirígete a las oficinas de la Comisión Europea. El comité espera tu llegada dentro de una hora y veinte minutos.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3193
translate spanish end_game2_c92339e8:

    # "I read the words, knowing that the parents have already made contact here."
    "Leo las palabras, sabiendo que los Padres ya han establecido contacto aquí."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3194
translate spanish end_game2_f9b221ad:

    # "They didn't leave me alone to try and convince Earth of the {i}Galaxias{/i}."
    "No me han dejado solo para intentar convencer a la Tierra de la {i}Galaxias{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3195
translate spanish end_game2_b3e1c93d:

    # "I look around, as if I have something to take with me."
    "Miro alrededor, como si tuviera algo que llevarme."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3196
translate spanish end_game2_ded7b988:

    # "But no, I'm still in my robes."
    "Pero no, sigo con la túnica puesta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3197
translate spanish end_game2_a3c2744b:

    # "People will probably just think I'm a street performer or a crazy tourist."
    "La gente probablemente pensará que solo soy un artista callejero o un turista loco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3198
translate spanish end_game2_82a747e9:

    # "...At three in the morning."
    "...A las tres de la mañana."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3199
translate spanish end_game2_9de2bada:

    # "My eyelid twitches again and a map appears on the screen, showing me a half hour walk through various alleys and backstreets, meant to keep me out of sight, I imagine."
    "Mi párpado vuelve a temblar y aparece un mapa en la pantalla, que me muestra un paseo de media hora por varios callejones y calles secundarias, pensado para mantenerme fuera de la vista, imagino."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3200
translate spanish end_game2_26cabae0:

    # "So, with a deep breath, I pocket my alien gadget, preparing myself to begin this journey."
    "Así que respiro hondo, me guardo el aparato alienígena en el bolsillo y me preparo para comenzar este viaje."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3201
translate spanish end_game2_272486b7:

    # "I still don't trust the parents, not at all, but knowing the ultimate goal helps me stay on this path that they have me on."
    "Todavía no confío en los Padres, en absoluto, pero conocer el objetivo final me ayuda a seguir este camino en el que me han puesto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3202
translate spanish end_game2_bfee21ce:

    # "Unify Europe, Africa, Asia, and the Americas."
    "Unifica Europa, África, Asia y las Américas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3203
translate spanish end_game2_0eed1827:

    # "Keep the powers in Washington, Beijing, and Moscow in the dark until they fall in line."
    "Mantén a los poderes de Washington, Pekín y Moscú en la ignorancia hasta que se alineen."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3204
translate spanish end_game2_49809255:

    # "Then we all unify as equals..."
    "Entonces todos nos unificamos como iguales..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3205
translate spanish end_game2_7f759a42:

    # "That's it, that's how you bring Earth together as one."
    "Eso es, así es como unes a la Tierra en una sola."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3206
translate spanish end_game2_56be499c:

    # "Easy."
    "Fácil."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3207
translate spanish end_game2_6a20a80d_1:

    # "I shake my head."
    "Niego con la cabeza."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3208
translate spanish end_game2_9ecfc567:

    # "I'm scared, but also relieved that things are moving so quickly."
    "Tengo miedo, pero también me alivia que las cosas avancen tan deprisa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3209
translate spanish end_game2_15707183:

    # "I'm also relieved that this will keep my mind off the separation I'd just experienced."
    "También me alivia que esto me distraiga de la separación que acabo de vivir."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3210
translate spanish end_game2_b70bbf22:

    # "With any luck, I'll be kept busy enough that I won't have to feel the full brunt of that agony all at once."
    "Con suerte, estaré lo bastante ocupado como para no tener que sentir de golpe toda la fuerza de ese dolor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3211
translate spanish end_game2_e6636299:

    # "I look back into the room where it all started, taking a deep breath."
    "Vuelvo la vista a la habitación donde empezó todo y respiro hondo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3212
translate spanish end_game2_390b571d:

    # "I'm actually kind of excited; the thing I'd been dreading for months has now started, and that gives me a boost of adrenaline, preparing myself to face my duty."
    "En realidad estoy algo emocionado; aquello que llevaba meses temiendo acaba de comenzar, y eso me da un subidón de adrenalina mientras me preparo para afrontar mi deber."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3213
translate spanish end_game2_829b5528:

    # "Then I turn off the light, leaving the apartment behind, ready to start another new life."
    "Entonces apago la luz y dejo atrás el apartamento, listo para empezar otra nueva vida."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3228
translate spanish end_game2_0657adc1:

    # "I make my way quickly to the throne room, trying my best to contain my excitement."
    "Voy deprisa a la sala del trono, intentando contener mi emoción lo mejor posible."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3229
translate spanish end_game2_07a794d9:

    # "The most difficult part of this exciting new life I have is pretending that I'm not excited at all."
    "La parte más difícil de esta nueva y emocionante vida es fingir que no estoy emocionado en absoluto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3230
translate spanish end_game2_7b60c490:

    # "So I try to look dignified as I walk into the throne room, toward Amicus seated at the back."
    "Así que intento mostrarme digno mientras entro en la sala del trono y me dirijo a Amicus, sentado al fondo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3231
translate spanish end_game2_d2d2ee9a:

    # "I stop and bow as low as I possibly can."
    "Me detengo y hago una reverencia tan profunda como puedo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3232
translate spanish end_game2_c75f190b:

    # a "\"No need for that. What news do you have, Scipio?\""
    a "\"No hace falta. ¿Qué noticias traes, Scipio?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:3233
translate spanish end_game2_3ce20e56:

    # "Unfortunately, I can't stop the smile from spreading across my face as I hold up the message."
    "Por desgracia, no puedo evitar que la sonrisa se extienda por mi cara mientras levanto el mensaje."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3234
translate spanish end_game2_9bba03e9:

    # sc "\"The pharaoh has accepted our request. The diplomatic mission may commence as soon as you are ready, Emperor Amicus.\""
    sc "\"El faraón ha aceptado nuestra petición. La misión diplomática puede comenzar en cuanto esté preparado, emperador Amicus.\""

